window.LUMBER_NEWS_PUBLICATIONS = [{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-09-28","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/760002271496372276","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello everyone and welcome again to **The Lumber News**!! I hope everyone is having an amazing day, let’s jump right into the first news of this week! 😁\n\n-4 new journalists!! It was such a hard choice but after a lot of thinking we finally made our decision! Instead of 2 new journalists we increased it to 4! 🗞️ So everyone please welcome our 4 new Journalists @Fax, @glassywharf, @Plugbrooks and @sameliy3!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473>\nI am super happy to welcome you in the Journalist team, we are sure that all 4 of you will do an amazing job!! 🙂\n\n-Only 4 days left until October!! 😮 The new items are soooo close to being added, this is also the case with spook and sinister wood!! Grab your axes, spook hunting bases and let’s see what we can catch this year! <:Spook:628618810194264064> <:Sinister:628618786089730049> Good luck to everyone!! 💪\n\n-Ofcourse not everyone knows how to hunt for spook wood and that is why our friends from the Lumber Tycoon 2 wiki have made this page where they give amazing tips and tricks on how to hunt for the wood! <:Wiki:707740862976753755>*link down below*\n\n-Spooky October planned!! 🦇 The staff team is preparing an amazing, spooky October for us!! 🎃 To start it there is a Halloween icon contest! <:halloweenpumpkin:623631693995311106> Everyone can make an amazing Halloween themed server icon who will be the winner? <a:halloweenskull:505022295585062922>\n\n-The winners from the 7am EST Lumber Games were  @Plugbrooks and @sameliy3 the winner from the practise round was @Plugbrooks. <:LumberLogo:368134294667001856> The winners from the 4pm EST Lumber Games were @sameliy3, @Bacon and @Shurikeno <a:hooray:700211558080446473>\n\n\n**Picture of the week:**\nPicture_of_the_week_2.PNG"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-04","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/762238607921643531","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"🟥🟥🟥🟥🟥\nWelcome everybody to the first Lumber @News Ping in the Spooky Season!! 👻 We have lots of new and exciting stuff in the game and in the discord so let's get right into it!!\n\n\n-The Spooky season has started!! As you know Defaultio added 3 new items to the game!! 🎃\n\n**Ghastly pumpkin**\nThe Ghastly pumpkin is found at Bob’s Shack and can be bought for $832. It has a grey color and glow. <:GhastlyPumpkin:761224041113190402> \n\n**Purple Bag of Candy**\nThe ‘Purple Bag of Candy’ is based on the ‘Bag of Candy’ <:BagOfCandy:493605268119093249> from the 2018 Halloween. Whenever you open it there will spit out candy bars. There are 6 different candy bars with 1 of them being the Pink candy bar (which is really rare). 1 Purple Bag of Candy costs $612 and can be found in Fancy furnishings. 🛒\n\n**Candy Corn Axe**\nIt is found at the back of Wood R Us and costs $9400, it looks really good and has decent stats. 🪓 \n\n-Spook and Sinister wood can now be found around the map!! There is also a new channel opened called <#761027537790828624> where you can post your Spook and/or Sinister finds!! <:Spook:628618810194264064> <:Sinister:628618786089730049> \n\n-Lumber Games! So the 7am EST Lumber Games were actually canceled, the host had important personal stuff to do. The 4pm EST Lumber Games on the other hand went good, the winners were @Shurikeno and @NunqR won twice. <a:hooray:700211558080446473>"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-07","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/763459930841284639","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello and welcome to the first sub Lumber @News Ping!! This news will be released every Wednesday and will include the “Of The Week” stuff! ☺️\nOn sunday we will be doing all the actual news and the Lumber Games and on wednesday we will do this. 😁 🎃 \n\n-The item for the **Fun Wiki Facts** for this week  is the retirement stand located under the wood drop off at Woods R Us. During December 2015 the Alpha axe was moved to the retirement stand from under the back of Woods R Us.<:Alphabox:386393239999086593> This was because players could still interact with it if they were to glitch their camera into the wall. The Alpha axe was then removed and replaced by the Beta axe once the game was in full release in 2016.<:BetaBox:386393184118243330>  Also during 2016 the wedge blueprints were on the platform before they were fully implemented into the game. Also in June of 2016 a grey worklight was on the platform. Two days later this was replaced by a grey wire, the next day a box with the chop saw decal was there. Although nobody knows why these items were there, the retirement stand held some of the most important items in the game!! <:Axe_alpha:749018933113127043>\n\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\n*we need more pictures please submit (only 2 more in queue <:shy:688796061640425509>)*\nunknown.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-11","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/764902559378440242","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello @News Ping and welcome back to the Lumber News!! 🗞️ So we are in the middle of the spooky season and we are really excited to make some more news for you guys!! 🎃\n\n-The submissions for the Halloween Icon Contest have been closed!! 💀 Now everyone is able to vote on their favourite Halloween themed icon in <#758834430843289630>!! 🎃\n\n-Roblox hit 2 Million followers on Twitter and that is why they have released 2 new promo codes: TWEET2MIL and SPIRIT2020. Link to redeem in sources. :twitter:\n\n-Our Supervisor @Dawn just got promoted to Lead Supervisor!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> She did an amazing job as Supervisor and we are so happy to see her in the Lead Supervisor position!! <a:purpleheart:503808072943140884>\n\n-Yesterday it was @DBHMacus birthday!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> We all hope you enjoyed your day!! 🍰\n\n-Yesterday Adopt me had a new update with a live countdown, as you probably would expect millions of players wanted to see that update and roblox couldn’t handle it. 😕 Roblox had a lot of problems but in the end they got the website back up and running! :roblox:\n\n-Let’s move onto something more exciting, The Lumber Games! <:LumberLogo:368134294667001856> The winners from the 7am EST were @kapriza and itsthatguy_lewis won twice!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> The winners of the 4pm EST were @DevShurikeno and Dragnite won twice!! Congrats to all the winners! 😁\n\nAnd that was it for this week!! I hoped you enjoyed reading this news, we will see you wednesday again!! Byeeee 😁 🎃 🗞️\n\n**Sources**\nRedeem here: https://www.roblox.com/promocodes\nThe news: @Jorne and @Fax\nLumber Games:  and @DevShurikeno"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-14","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/765943161758416907","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello Lumber @News Ping!! Welcome to the Wednesday “Of The Week” news! We have lots of exciting stuff to share so lets hop right into it! 🗞️\n\n**Wiki Fun Fact**\nThis  week's Wiki Fun Fact is the Snowglow wood bin. <:Log_SnowGlow:765301489425186836> This was a bin that was next to the cabin near the ice slide in the taiga biome. <:Ice:459338798963359746> During the 2017 Winter Games event you could find Snowglow trees in the taiga biome, you would then be able to chop down these trees and put them in the bin. Once you filled up the bin to the arrow on the side you would then be awarded the Skiipack roblox accessory. 🎉 The cabin still stands there today but the bin has been moved under Woods R Us which can be seen if you glitch your camera into the ground. 📷\n\n**Picture of the week**\nunknown.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-18","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/767418059026726952","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello @News Ping and welcome back to the news! Today we will be telling you what’s been happening this past week, let’s jump right into it.\n\n-The Halloween icon submission voting has come to a close. 🎃 The server now has a new spooky icon which won first place!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> The icon with the second most votes became Lumber Fan Group bot icon! Thank you to all who submitted an icon! 💀\n\n-I am very happy to announce @Savage came out of retirement back to supervisor!! <:grin:493993229113360384> We are all very happy and excited you are back in the community! Unfortunately with one great coming back we are sad to say @JayTheMafi_a and @lolmefunnyjm have retired from their staff position.\n\n-Roblox has released another new promo code! If you type AMAZONNARWHAL2020 into the link the sources you will receive your free avatar item! 😆 On top of that 2 fall codes have been released, enter ARGOSWINGS2020 and TARGETFOX2020 to get free fall items to make your avatar more spooky!! 💀\n\n-2 days ago we hit 9,000 members! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> We are getting so close to 10,000 members and on top of that we are also about to hit 150,000 members in the Roblox Group!! 😁\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week was another batch of Halloween-themed Lumber Games! <:CursedPumpkin:493604808608055308>  \n\n-During the 7am matches, @Raw_Plays won a round, @batim_12345 won a round and a team of @kapriza, @Plugbrooks and @Raw_Plays won the hardcore round. During the 4pm matches, @Noodle won a round and @DevShurikeno won 2 rounds! GG to all of this week's winners and an extra special congratulations to all the first-time winners! <a:Clapping:716358055981219930>\n\nThank you all for reading until the end, we really do appreciate it! 😁 I hope you liked it, and we will see you guys wednesday! Byeeeee 🗞️ 🎃"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-21","author":"@glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/768550817283571722","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all to the “Of The Week” Wednesday Lumber @News Ping! I am very excited for this news so let's not waste any time and get right into it! 🗞️ 🎃\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis week's Fun Wiki Fact item is the green box! 🟩 The green box is located in the volcano where you can access it by following a small path to a cliff. You will then need long planks to cross lava to the other cliffs. It is extremely difficult to get due to many factors such as if you use any planks beside lava they will burn up and disappear within a few minutes. You are also limited on time because you will continue to lose health. Once you do reach the end a floating green box will appear and if you touch it a message saying “Your Success Has Been Noted” will come up. The green box doesn't do anything as of yet but there are easier ways of getting it such as the blueprint glitch or flying glass trick. 🙂\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nunknown.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-25","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/769935944777728030","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back to the weekly Sunday Lumber @News Ping! We are closing in on the spooky day, Halloween!! Let's waste no time and get right into it!! 🗞️ 🎃\n\n-On Halloween you will be able to get the End axe. <:Axe_endtimes:749019206170968196> To do this follow the same steps as the Ruki axe except you will get the End axe!! Stock up on your lights, worms, and sand! 💀\n\n-Also on Halloween Spook and Sinister wood hunters dreams come true!! The rate that Spook and Sinister spawn are raised for one day and one day only!! Remember to hunt! <:Spook:628618810194264064> <:Sinister:628618786089730049>\n\n-We had a double movie night this week with Carolina on Wednesday and a movie picked out by Cesar, The Point on Friday. Thank you all who joined us!! 🙂\n\nAs every week, we had the Lumber Games!! The winners of the 7am EST one were @Plasma_Pirate, @Plugbrooks and @sameliy3!! 🎉 The winners from the 4pm EST matches were dragnlte and @Noodle won twice. Congratulations to all the winners!! 🎉 😁\n\nThat's it for this week's Sunday news! Everybody have a safe and fun halloween! 🗞️ 🎃\n\n**Sources**\nActual News: @glassywharf\nLumber Games: @BelladonnaHypeTrain and @Jorne"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-10-28","author":"@glassywharf @Jorne","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/771045032870019072","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Reporting live from the Lumber @News Ping headquarters with the “Of The Week” Wednesday news. Let's waste no time and start with the Fun Wiki Fact of the week! 🎃 🗞️ \n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe place this week is located right next to the bridge, the River Tunnel. The River Tunnel first appeared in the Alpha Testing Stages and was unfinished with dead ends and void openings. During this stage it could be swam in because water did not hurt you, as there were no palm islands or the ferry. The theory of this project was a maze of some kind. This later got scrapped by the maze we all know today. It sat unfinished up until March of 2018. A memorial for Ticktatwert was created and included Yellow Fir wood, which was her favorite. Tik was very popular in the Lumber community and she will never be forgotten. 😢\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nunknown.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-11-04","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/773631456631193661","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"This is the Lumber Journalist team reporting back live from the Lumber News Headquarters! 🎙️ Today we would like to report to you the Wednesday “Of The Week” News!! Grab your popcorn and let's get right into it!🍿\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe Fun Wiki Fact place of this week is The Maze. The Maze was added in the Beta update along with the ferry and tropics. <:Hoover:769731865732579358> The main reason to go to The Maze is to get Cave Crawler Wood. There are 7 different paths that have a black wall which block 6 of the 7 off, and each week which one is open changes.⬛  Along with Cave Crawler wood there are 3 strange characters in the maze which all say different things when clicked “E” on. Are you an artist? The maze also has a Fine Arts store! Where you can purchase paintings!! <:GiraffePainting:520761670839304197> \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nwoodsaresuss.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-11-08","author":"@gravywharf, @Jorny the Turkey","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/775034736673292318","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello @News Ping and welcome back to the Lumber News!! Live reporting from the Lumber News HQ we are here to informate you about everything what happened in the past week, sit back and enjoy it cause we have a lot of news this week!! 😁 🗞️ \n\n-We start off with some good news, @Azcherry has returned to her supervisor position after having a 3 week break due personal reasons. 🎉 😁 \n\n**Breaking News**\n-This week 4 new shirts have been added to the Roblox Group, the Fire Tee <:Axe_fire:749019248520593489> and the End Times Tee <:Axe_endtimes:749019206170968196> , both are donations (5 Robux each) to The Lumber Tycoon 2 Fans group!! There are also 2 larger donation shirts, one costing 50,000 robux and the other 100,000 robux. If you buy these 2 you will get special rewards which are currently to be determined! 🙂 \n\n-Wednesday was Cesar's birthday!! We hope you had a great day and enjoyed all the cake and fan art you got from everybody!! You are such an amazing owner and I think that everyone showed that by giving you all the birthday wishes!! ❤️🍰 🥳\n\n-The Discord server is nearing 10,000 members!! 😯 Make sure to invite your friends to achieve this wonderful goal! Once we hit 10,000 members the group will then be able to become a discord partner and get some cool features!! 😁\n\n-The Lumber Tournament is back on!! Moving on to round to match 62 is @legobuildermaster12 who won against @trent_b !! The winner of match 57 is @LT2nutter! who beat @coolcamtvhihihi congratulations!! 🎉"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-11-18","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/778665256394293248","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello Lumberjacks, and welcome back to another Wednesday Lumber @News Ping! This is a very exciting news so let's waste no time and jump right into it!! 😃 🗞️\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe item of this week's Fun Wiki Fact is the toboggan that was released as a 2018 Christmas gift. <:AdventureGift:520762529249755136> This item was extremely useful as it allowed up to 3 people to sit in it and could also be used to fly around the Lumberland! 💸  This was later patched about a week after it was released. People soon found out that you could glitch it into a large truck and fly with your truck!! This was also later patched. As of now unfortunately you can't fly with it but it still is a very cool item!! 😎 \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nSubmission_2.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-11-22","author":"@gravywharf and @Jorny the Turkey","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/780157603539189820","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello @News Ping and welcome back, again by the weekly news!! We are here once again to tell you all the news from the past week!! Sit back, grab some snacks and enjoy!! This week we had less news but that’s alright!! 🍃 🗞️\n\n-We start off with some less fun news, our fellow Supervisor D0nutcrazy has decided to take a break from being a supervisor. Take care buddy!! ❤️\n\n-November 26th is here in 4 days!! You know what it is, Thanksgiving!!, the 26th of November was the day the Americans came over to the United States from England. 🇺🇸 I want to wish everybody a happy and safe Thanksgiving!! 🦃 \n\n-We also got a new Event Committee!! I would like to welcome @Forictus, @XxTurkeyGuyxX, and @Noah|#8174 to the Event Committee team!!\n\n-For the Lumber Tournament @ElectroTechnologies won the match against @ferfunkle moving him onto the semi finals!!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n-At the 7 am est match @Forictus , @Ruben_Quelcutti#5799, and @RTDev_Ronny took the victory!! At the 4 pm est match @gravywharf, @sebas9013, @Plugbrooks !! Congratulations winners!\n\n**Sources**\nNews:@gravywharf and @Jorny the Turkey\nLumber Games: @gravywharf"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-11-25","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/781221856307970061","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"This is the Lumber Journalist live back to report another Wednesday “Of The Week” Lumber @News Ping!! As Thanksgiving is only a day away let's jump right into the news!!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe item for this week’s Fun Wiki Fact is the Wobblebobble head which was a yellow noob head gift released during the 2015 Christmas. This noob head can be attached to the trailer hitch of any vehicle or trailer. For a short time there was a glitch where you could combine multiple noob heads to create a flashing noob head with different colors. As a tradition each year a new color noob head gets released!\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nnice.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-11-29","author":"@Jorne The Christmas Tree and @FrostedGlass","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/782664308928413699","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Happy Thanksgiving Lumberjacks and welcome back to another Sunday Lumber @News ping!! Let's waste no time and jump right into it starting with some very exciting news!! 🦃 🗞️ \n\n-Over the past week the Lumber Tycoon 2 Fan Group Discord has reached 10,000 members!! 🥳 I would like to thank all of you who have helped us reach this journey!! ❤️\n\n-On November 26th it was Thanksgiving!! I hope you all had a safe and fun Thanksgiving!! 🦃 \n\n-New item!! 🥲 As usual, we got a turkey this year, oh wait, do the leftovers also count?? Yes, you heard it right, last saturday the 28th the Turkey Leftovers were added, the reason for the update to take so long to release was because it were indeed, leftovers! 🦃  We finally got something different than the usual turkeys <:BlueBoneTurkey:386391509815132170> and yes, like the other turkeys you can cook it in the volcano. 🔥 \n\n-The Lumber Tournament has reached the Semi-Finals!! The four contestants in this round are @LT2nutter! vs @Nilpilt and @ElectroTechnologies vs @legobuildermaster12 congratulations for making it this far!! 🎉 \n\n-At the 7 am est Lumber Games @DevShurikeno , @Reflex, and a new winner @Saryn Snowman!! At the 4 pm est Lumber Games @Reflex and @DevShurikeno took the wins!! 🎉 \n\n**Sources**\nNews- @Jorne The Christmas Tree  and @FrostedGlass\nLumber Games- @FrostedGlass"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-05","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/784712890740637749","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back all Lumberjacks to last Wednesday @News Ping with the current Journalist team!! Lets go off with a bang and jump right into it! 😁 \n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe item of this week's Fun Wiki Fact is The Lonely Giraffe painting! <:GiraffePainting:520761670839304197> This painting design was actually made by a youtuber who does Lumber Tycoon 2 content named MumazingGaming. There was actually a glitch when the painting first came out where the painting part wasn't anchored to the frame so it just fell out when you placed it. This painting has many uses in building to get a nice white texture! ⬜ \n\n**Ranks Of The Week**\nCongratulations to these users for ranking up!! 🎉\n@Mario3_000 -Experienced LumberJack\n@BanGoodLuc BEST MAN -Lumber Merchant\n -Lumber Merchant\n@LimpGuide -Electrician\n@ollie7331 -Elite LumberJack\n -Carpenter\n -Carpenter Specialist\n@✮ 𝓟𝒆𝓹𝓲𝓼 ✮#0483 -Experienced Lumberjack and LumberJack Merchant\n -Experienced Lumberjack and LumberJack Merchant\n -Carpenter Specialist \n\n**Boosters**\nThank you to these users for boosting the server!!\n@PIP \n \n\n\n**Sources**\nLonely Giraffe Painting- https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/The_Lonely_Giraffe\nNews-\nRanks of the week-\nThe Lonely Giraffe\nThe Lonely Giraffe | Lumber Tycoon 2 Wiki | Fandom\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/The_Lonely_Giraffe"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-07","author":"@FrostedGlass and @Jorne The Christmas Tree","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/785427064789401600","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello @News Ping and welcome back to the Weekly news!! We are really excited to tell you guys everything about the past week so let’s not waste any more time!! 🎄 🗞️\n\n-We start off this week's news with some AMAZING news!! 3 gifts have been added!! 🥳 The first one is called The Spooky Deep Earth gift and can be bought at Wood R Us for just over 32 thousand dollars. The next 2 can be found at Fancy Furnishings. The Fabulous Gift, which cost 220 dollars and the Teal Gift which cost just over 7 thousand dollars!! Make sure to stock up, as these will be able to open on Christmas! 🎄\n\n-December 4th was @Santa20  birthday!! 🥳 I hope you enjoyed all of the birthday wishes and had a great day!! 😁\n\n-Applications for becoming a journalist will close soon!! We will start reviewing the applications, good luck to all who entered!! 😁 :news_paper:\n\n-At the 7 am est Lumber Games @Plugbrooks took a double win with Salooks taking the win in the third round!! At the 4 pm est games @Reflex, @FrostedGlass, and @FrostyTheAz with her first win ever!! 🎉 😁\n\n**Sources**\nNews- @FrostedGlass and @Jorne The Christmas Tree\nLumber Games- @FrostedGlass\n(sorry for the late news)"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-09","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/786275878962462753","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back all Lumberjacks 🪓 to the Wednesday Of The Week Lumber News!! I hope you guys are all enjoying the Christmas season!! With that lets hop right into the news. 🗞️ \n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis week's Fun Wiki Fact item is the Red Ball, which was a gift in the 2015 Christmas update!! <:gift_redball:752430501821939743> This was the first Ball gift and could be opened on Christmas just like any other gift. Once you opened it a red ball with a number on it. The number represents the order which the ball was opened in. Currently the Red Ball just passed the 800,000 ball number!! 🔴 \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nRobloxScreenShot20201010_172252792.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-13","author":"@FrostedGlass and @Jorne The Christmas Tree","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/787788573167452170","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hellooooo @News Ping and welcome back to the Lumber News!! You know how it goes, we will jump right into it!! 🗞️ 😁 \n\n-So we start off with some really exciting news!! We have 4 new Lumber Journalists!! 😁 🥳 Once again congratulations @Hupa, @Bobbie the dinosaur ornament, @Jonisanta65 and @LimpfulPresent!!! We are really happy to welcome you to the team!! 😁 \n\n-So this one is just a little update from the news, from now @FrostedGlass will do the Wednesday's news!! 😀 \n\n-So, we start off this week's news with some amazing news, there has been another gift added to the game!! The gift is called Gift with Green Candy Cane Stripes, it is found at Wood R Us and has a price of $128. 🎁\n\n-The icon contest has ended!! We now have a Christmas themed icon for the server!! 🎄 The icon which came second place is the profile picture from the bot. 🤖\n\n-Wednesday we had a special movie night with watching two movies!! 🎥 The first movie was Home Alone 3 in the sequel to the last 2 movie nights. The second movie was Star Wars Holiday Special!! <:StarWars:755904884812808223> Thank you all who came out and joined us! 🍿\n\n-Yesterday it was Lego's birthday!!! Enjoy your day!!! 🥳 🍰 \n\n-And guess what, another gift!! This gift is called the Gift of Good Preparedness, it costs $902 and is found in Boxed Cars! 🚙 🎁 \n\n-You know what time it is now, Lumber Games time!! At the earlier 7 am Lumber games @kapriza#8744 , @Reflex , and @Saryn_01 took the wins!! At the later 4 pm Lumber Games Dragonite, and @legobuildermaster12 won the 2 rounds! Make sure to join us next Saturday for some more log slapping fun!!  🎉 \n\n**Sources**\nNews- @FrostedGlass and @Jorne The Christmas Tree \nLumber Games- @FrostedGlass"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-16","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/788780879438282770","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"This is the Lumber News Crew reporting live from within the Lumberland!! 🎙️ We are back with  your weekly Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! Let's start like every week with the Fun Wiki Fact!! 🗞️ \n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe Fun Wiki Fact item this week is the Palm Islands!! There were 3 islands added in the Beta update with Palm wood on them. Over the years there have been many ways to get there which include flinging a car with a tree, glitching a car to you,<:Vals_AllPurpose_Hauler:386393441220952066>  and the most popular way door bridges. For a few hours a glitch happened when water didn't hurt you so people were able to drive to palm wood!! Defaultio has said the only reason he made these islands was to tease the players. <:Hoover_Troll:769731993084100608> \n\n**Building Tip Of The Week**\nThis is the first building tip of the week! We will start off with how to build bricks! 🧱 the first step is to place 2 cherry unit blueprints next to each other. Then place a birch tiny tile on each end of the 2x1 stick of units. Then put 2 more units touching the tile and repeat till you have it as long as you want. Then for your 2nd row you do the exact same thing except you offset them by 1 unit each time. If it goes off the edge of the wall then you can make the end bricks 1 unit long! You may dm  suggestions for the next building tip of the week!\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nScreen_Shot_2020-10-07_at_1.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-20","author":"@Jorne The Christmas Tree , @FrostedGlass","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/790286310337413121","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all back to the Sunday Lumber @News Ping!! As we are only a few days away from Christmas let's jump right into the news and have some fun!!\n\n**The Interview**\nAs a special thing we did this week we decided to interview the one and only Cesar for 150,000 Roblox Group members and 10,000 Discord members!! 🥳 I am making a special newsletter for it and I’ll try to get it up as fast as possible. 👍\n\n-Another new gift has arrived in the Lumber Land!! 🎁 This time it can be found at Bob’s Shack and is called “Gift Of Tremendously Important Knowledge\" 🤓 and can be found at Bob’s Shack. The price of this gift? 604 LT2 Money. Remember to stock up on gifts and that they will be able to be opened on Christmas!! 🎄\n\n-Today it’s the birthday from our amazing Co-owner, @Redguy16!! 😁 🎉 Enjoy your day!! 🍰\n\n**Lumber Games**\nIt”s that time again for Lumber Games!! At the 7 am est Lumber Games @togo1_5 and @kapriza who took double wins!!  🎉 At the later Lumber Games @DevIcykeno , @FrostedGlass , and at the Omega Hardcore round @legobuildermaster12 took the win!! 🎉 Congratulations and remember to join us next week for more log slapping fun!! <:Logo:357256036496703498>\n\n**Sources**\nInterview- @Bobby the builder , @Jorne The Christmas Tree \nNews- @Jorne The Christmas Tree , @FrostedGlass \nLumber Games- @FrostedGlass"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Interview","date":"2020-12-22","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/791062162407686154","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"@News Ping today we got something different for you guys, last friday we were able to interview our owner @CesarClaus!!\nFor this I first of all want to thank everyone who has helped to get the interview up\nAll of the journalists: Helping to get all the questions for Cesar.\nAlso thanks to @Bobby the builder for asking all of the questions.\nWhile the interview was going I written down everything and put it into a newsletter for everyone who was not able to be there. Enjoy!!"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-23","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/791333646871035935","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"It is that time of the week again where the Wednesday Lumber @News Ping gets published!! We are only 2 days away from Christmas!! <a:ChristmasTree:779558432918863873> So let's waste no time and start with the news! 🗞️ \n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe item for the Fun Wiki Fact this week is the 3 Pink Sphere’s located in the Wood R Us ceiling. 🟣 These can be seen if you enable shift lock and look into the ceiling. When going into Roblox Studio these spheres are labeled with “Playermodels” , “Logmodels” , and “Effects”. These are suspected to hold the scripts of the key functions of Lumber Tycoon 2. ⭐ \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nunknown.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-27","author":"@Jorne The Christmas Tree","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/792873407686508575","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Hello @News Ping and welcome back to the Lumber News!! Let's head right into it!! 🗞️ :Christmas_Tree: \n\n-We start off this week with 2 Roblox Promocodes: TRUASIACAT2020 and DRRABBITEARS2020. Thanks Roblox!! <:ROBLOXRED:777202404407377920>\n\n-Ofcourse not everything can be fun, earlier this week @BelladonnaHypeTrain retired from her Supervisor position, she'll be back whenever she feels like. <:Bella:767691808650035210> \n\n-Earlier this week @ElectroTechnologies hosted the Lumber Awards, you were able to vote for your favourite people in this community subdivided in categories. Meanwhile the submissions are closed. 🏆\n\n-Friday at 5 am EST you were able to open the new presents, first there were some problems but not a long time after Defaultio fixed them. 🎁 Go check what's inside of them!! 🎄\n\n-A few hours later Defaultio did a new revert batch, revert batch 39.\n\n-Friday it was also Christmas, we all hope you had a FANTASTIC day!! 🎄 Let us know what presents you got!! 🎁\n\n**Lumber Games**\nAs usual, we have the Lumber Games!! <:Logo:357256036496703498> Because of Bella's retirement we don't have Lumber Games at 7am EST but that doesn't stops the 4pm Lumber Games!! Congrats @djulzz3 and @pancake_party10 for taking the win!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> \n\n\n**Sources**\nNews- @Jorne The Christmas Tree\nLumber Games- @Jorne The Christmas Tree  and @FrostedGlass"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2020-12-30","author":"@FrostedGlass","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/793854325796765706","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back all Lumberjacks to the Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! This week we start it off with the Fun Wiki Fact so lets hop right into it!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe Fun Wiki Fact item this week are the Safari Exit holes. The main Safari Hole is located just over the bridge to the left in the rocks. 🌉  The other 2 are located in the Maze <:Log_CaveCrawler:765302171432386570> and in the End Times Biome. <:Log_Phantom:765302390991618108>  When you go through either one of those holes it will teleport you back to the Main safari hole. These can be very useful if you are stuck in the maze or bridge has gone up on you for End wood. It will teleport any items, wood, or players. 🪄 \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nRobloxScreenShot20201030_110909519.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-03","author":"@Joniboi65 and @Jorne The Christmas Tree","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/795383952986341376","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back to Lumber News, @News Ping Today we exciting News, don’t forget that we have made it through 2020 and now in 2021 happy new years to everyone but straight to the News we go! 📰 ☃️\n\n-If you got double pinged, sorry, something went wrong with the news, it is fixed now 🙂\n\n-A few weeks ago you were able to vote for people who had an impact on the LT2 community in 2020, The lumber awards winners have been announced:\nBreakout creator: @JackUK\nUpdate Ready: @BunnyFilms1\nBest Entertainer: @CodePrime8\nBest Community Supporter: @CesarGeronimo \nBest Update: Clock Logic Item\nCongrats to everyone and thing that won the lumber awards!! 🏆 <a:hooray:700211558080446473>\n\n-Last week Roblox had quite a lot of autages, it is all fixed now!! <:roblox:406637884708487198> 😁 \n\n-2021 is here!! Woohoo we all survived 2020, a lot of crazy stuff has happened, but now there is finally a new year, let’s see what this year will bring us, who knows!! 2️⃣0️⃣2️⃣1️⃣\n\n**Lumber Games**\nAs every Saturday, Lumber Games time!! <:Logo:357256036496703498> At the earlier 7 am est Lumber Games @DevShurikeno and @tags (GMDTags) who took his first win ever!! At the later 4 pm est Lumber Games only 1 round was played who @togo1_5 took the win! Congratulations to all winners!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473>\n\n**Sources**\nNews- @Joniboi65 and @Jorne The Christmas Tree \nLumber Games- @FrostedGlass"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-06","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/796398089639297047","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back all Lumberjacks to the Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! We start off this week’s Fun Wiki Fact with a pretty cool item!! So let's jump right into it and start!!\n\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis week the Fun Wiki Fact item is the Modern 06 Painting.<:GiraffePainting:520761670839304197>  This could be bought during the 2017 Christmas Event. When unwrapped and placed you can press “E” to express art onto it. 🇪 The color of the square or rectangle that appears onto the painting will be determined by the item colors surrounding it. Each time you express it makes different shapes and colors making sure that not one of each painting is the same!\n\n**Building Tip**\nThis weeks tip was suggested by ! They have suggested a wood combination. 🪵 And it is koa wood+cherry wood. These 2 can be used with white/red neon wires to create a warm atmosphere feeling in your house! Dm  to suggest a building tip!\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nScreen_Shot_2020-11-22_at_5.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-10","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/797917920700923964","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Helloooo @News Ping and WELCOME back to the Lumber News!! 🗞️ ☃️ So this news will only be about the Lumber Games because last week nothing happened at all except Lumber Games. <:Logo:357256036496703498>\n\n**The Lumber Games**\nSo in the 7am EST Lumber Games @kapriza won, there was only 1 round played, congratulations!! 🎉 In the 4pm Lumber Games @MrOliverB won twice and @togo1_5 won once!! Congratulations to all of the winners!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> <:Logo:357256036496703498>\n\nThanks for reading this super short newspaper, this is the shortest newspaper ever made!! 😁\n\n**Sources**\nLumber Games- @FrostedGlass and @Jorne"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-13","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/798963327925354577","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all back to the weekly Wednesday Lumber @News Ping! Like every other week we start off this week’s news with the Fun Wiki Fact!!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis weeks Fun Wiki Fact place is the VIP Room which was only in the game during Pre-Alpha. <:Axe_alpha:749018933113127043> In this room there were many boxes with poorly drawn images on it. There were also conveyors outside of the room. Only 4 users had access to this room one of which is Defaultio himself. <:Defaultio:386393938124341249> There are many items and things that are unknown about the room. Such as if you have those items that are no longer in the games files saved on your base, would they be deleted or converted to the newer items.❔ \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nunknown-1.png"},{"number":"21","title":"#21","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-17","author":"@Bobbi the epik airsofter","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/800394869225816094","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#21** Welcome back to the sunday news! @News Ping There aren't a lot of things to cover this week but we still have a few things! 🗞️ ☃️\n\n-We hit 11,000 members this week! 🎊 It almost feels like we hit 10,000 members just a few weeks ago! The server has been through lots of things, it's gotten new events and has just become a better and better place! Let's see what we can do else in the future!! 😁\n\n**Lumber Games**\nLike every week we have the Lumber Games report!! Starting off at the 7 am EST games @silverdragon302, @𝙩𝙖𝙜𝙨, and @jgorsc5200 took the wins!! Then at the later 4 pm est Lumber Games @togo1_5 , @MrOliverB  and Dragnlte won the rounds!! Congratulations to all winners!! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> \n\n\n**Sources**\nNews-@Bobbi the epik airsofter\nLumber Games- @FrostedGlass"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-20","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/801464346998997025","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all back to the weekly Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! Today we start off the news like every other Wednesday with the Fun WIki Fact item!! ❄️ 🗞️ \n\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe Fun Wiki Fact item this week is the Scoobis which was obtainable in the Beesmas 2018 event!! <:Scoobis:522213621749645328> First you would get a bee by chopping down a cherry tree In order to get this item you had to go around to different flowers located around Lumber Land with a bee. You would then go to a hole which the bee will pollinate a flower in the wall.There were a total of 6 flowers around the map.6️⃣ Once you collected all 6 the Scoobis would pop out of a hole, along with a 6 digit code you could enter in the Beesmas Game. 🐝  \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nunknown.png"},{"number":"22","title":"#22Welcome all back to sundays Lumber news @News Ping!! Time to get right into the news!! 🗞️ ☃️","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-24","author":"@JoniSanta65","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/803005815711203358","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#22**Welcome all back to sundays Lumber news @News Ping!! Time to get right into the news!! 🗞️ ☃️\n\nSo in these months there isn't really any news in the LT2 community which is really annoying for the Lumber News, that is why we are now introducing Base of the Week for the Sunday's news, normally we would do this on Wednesday but just because there isn't any news we are doing it on Sunday!!\nIf you have any bases you want to submit please dm about 3-4 pictures to @JoniSanta65 🏠\n\n**Lumber Games <:Logo:357256036496703498>**\nIts that time of the week once again where we announce the Lumber Games Winners!! At the earlier 7 am est games @togo1_5 took the win!! At the later 3 pm est games Dragnite took the wins for the first two rounds with tobobandM52 taking the win of the last round!! Congratulations to all winners! <a:hooray:700211558080446473>\n\n**sources**\nNews - @JoniSanta65 \nLumber games - @glassywharf"},{"number":"1, 27, 20","title":"1/27/20","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-27","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/804017598257430588","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"1/27/20\nWelcome back all Lumberman and Lumberladies back to the weekly Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! This week we start off the Fun Wiki Fact with a common item, or so it may seem common….\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis week's Fun Wiki Fact item is the glass panes which can be bought at Fancy Furnishings. 🪟 Up until the lighting and shadow update you could see each piece of glass edge. Once this update came it made glass much more pleasing to look at. There is also a glitch where if you lift the glass up while you walk on it you could use it to fly around Lumberland!! 💸 \n\n**Building Tip Of The Week**\nThis week's building tip comes from me! Today i’ll be telling all of you how to build a door bridge!🚪 🌉 To begin you will need 1 glass door, multiple doors (fat doors recommended) and I recommend having ladders as well. To begin place 1 glass door on its side so that the door knob faces up. Then open the door so that it is flat on its face. Then place a door normally 3 studs off the ground. Close the glass door, and do check, move, b on the normal door. Then once you open the glass door the normal door should come with it. Then open the normal door, it wont open so you have to do check, move, b on it again to make it open. Then place another door aligned with the other door straight above it but make sure that there is a 1 unit overlap so that they glitch into each other. Do check, move, b on the bottom lower door, then open the top door do check, move, b then place another door above the same way. And continue this as far as you need! If you have any suggestions dm !\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nunknown-10.png"},{"number":"23","title":"#23","category":"Article","date":"2021-01-31","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/805508762239762434","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#23** Helloooo there @News Ping, I hope you are doing alright, I am, so let's hop straight into the news!! 🗞️ ❄️\n\n-Sadly this week we don't have any news for you, what we do have is like we promised last week, Base of the Week!! Our first base of the week is by !! 😁\nScreenshot_20210131-171400_Samsung_Internet.jpg"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-03","author":"@spinning monke and @glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/806548308792442913","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back to the weekly lumber news! ❄️📰 @News Ping, There isn't much new but we still have the things we usually do! To start off this week's news we got the Fun Wiki Fact!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\n\nThe item for this week’s Fun Wiki Fact is the Twitter Axe!! <:Axe_bird:749019086578778202> The first thing you had todo to obtain this axe is link your twitter to your roblox account then follow defaultio on twitter. If your account was under 13 you couldn't link a twitter to it so you were not able to get this axe. 😢 Once you have done those steps you could then go place a Silver axe on a stand and talk to a bird. The bird would then bless your axe and turn it into the Twitter Axe!! 😇 A few months later the cave was covered up with rocks, but you could still glitch through the rocks and bless your silver axe. The bird later had its talking scripts removed so even if you do glitch in the bird couldn’t talk. 🔇 \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nimage0.png"},{"number":"24","title":"#24","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-07","author":"@Cookie Monster","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/808003188182745098","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#24** Welcome back to the sunday @News Ping! This week will be our second week of having a base of the week! This news we will also have the usual lumber games, aside from that there isn't much so let's get started! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> ❄️\n\n-New Server Icon!! This week we got a new server icon! It was made by !! They did a fabulous job on it! We have had the previous icon for over a year now who knows how long this one will be here? 👀\n\n**Lumber games**\nDuring yesterday's lumber games matches, there was no morning games, but during the 4 pm EST ones @togo1_5 and adamboy21754 won! <a:hooray:700211558080446473> Who will win next week's lumber games? 👀\n\n**Base of the week**\nunknown.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-10","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/809118491926855690","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back to Wednesday @News Ping! This week there is a few things we need to cover, so let's get started! :lumbernews:\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\n\nThis weeks Fun Wiki Fact item is the Many Axe!! <:Axe_many:749010212752719963> You could get this axe during the 2018 Beesmas Event by completing a maze located under the fridge in Fancy Furnishings. Once you got to the end of the maze the Boxed Many Axe as well as a code was there. The code could be entered into the Beesmas game. 🖥️ Since you had to go through a maze to get this axe it took a long time if you wanted to buy in bulk. Once the event ended the maze was taken out of the game but the Many Axe spawning wasnt. This makes it possible to this day to still get the Many Axe if you build a door bridge or another technique to get to it. One last note this is currently the strongest axe in Lumber Tycoon 2 in terms of chop power. 💪 \n\n**Picture of The Week**\nshaders4.png"},{"number":"25","title":"25","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-14","author":"@glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/810646483468419072","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**25** Welcome all Lumberjacks back to the Sunday Lumber @News Ping!! Today is  Valentines day!! So lets jump right into this news with some love! 🗞️ <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> \n\n\n-Happy Valentines Day everyone!! I hope you have a wonderful day! ❤️ A quote from Charles Schulz “All you need is love. But a little chocolate now and then doesnt hurt”.\n\n-A new rank was added!! This rank is for all of you master electricians called Elite Electrician. You can find the requirements in <#335939923028869132> . Good luck getting the role! 🍀 \n\n-Some channel reorganizing and renaming was also done!! You may have noticed that Lumber News is now in the Information category below Announcements.📰 \n\n-Time for Lumbers Games!! At the earlier 7 am est Lumber games only one round was played with Togo1_5 taking the win!! At the later 4 pm est Lumber games we had a special guest Bunny Films joining us and with a record breaker 40+ people!! Thank you all who came out! 🤯 Now to the winners! The first round Togo1_5 took the win with totobandM52 taking the wins for the other two rounds! 🎉\n\n**Sources**\nNews- @glassywharf\nLumber Games- @glassywharf"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-17","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/811632445103145053","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back to Wednesday @News Ping! :lumbernews: 📰 This week's news has a few things that have appeared on the server so let's get started!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThe item for this weeks Fun WIki Fact is the Candy Bag!! This item came out in the 2018 Halloween update! <:BagOfCandy:493605268119093249> There are over 13 different kinds of candy that you can get when unboxing a bag of candy. Most of these refer back to real life candy but with a lumber twist.🔀 There is also a rare candy with a 1 in 300 chance of getting it called the Pink Candy!! 🤯 \n\n**Building tip**\nThis weeks building tip comes from @XMasterJack#4408! They have suggested that if you have a large window to buy a lot of the larger windows and glitch them into walls to save time on buying smaller windows to make it fit perfectly, if you would like me to do a building tip on how to glitch buildings together dm  and also dm me any other building tips!\n\n**Picture of the week**\nF.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-21","author":"@YkJoniBoi65 and @jornee","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/813152553143500810","googleDocsUrl":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1RgsqCVOHfQ-69SegBqe6kP2il7zBzivHWKS6XnshxvU/edit?usp=sharing","body":"Welcome @News Ping to this week on lumber news! Today on this week we have exciting news!! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> ❄️\n\nFirst we have our second ever building competition on the server! The theme is winter ❄️ so get your ice wood and many axes ready because you're gonna need them more information in announcements where the prizes and info is listed! 🏗️ ☃️\n\nSuggestion channel, past week all of the suggestions from the suggestions channel have been reviewed, if you want to check out the staff’s reviews on them go check the link in Sources. 📘\n\nBella has returned! Last wednesday  has returned to her Supervisor position!! Welcome back!! 😁\n\n**base of the week**\nScreenshot_20210210-134549_Roblox.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-24","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/814196031243550754","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all Lumberjacks back to the weekly Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! Today we start off the news like every other Wednesday with the Fun Wiki Fact!! So lets jump right into it. 🗞️ <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> \n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\n\n\nThis weeks Fun Wiki Fact place is the Snow Cave!! ❄️ This cave is located above where the boulder entree is and its purpose is to spawn boulders then feed them to the entrance. 🪨 During the 2017 Winter event though a Scaffolding was placed above the entrance and no boulders could spawn in. \n\n**Building tip**\nThis weeks building tip comes from @CrazyMacAttack1357#9445! The way they explained it in my dms is way better than I could ever do so here it is! If you're making a wall, and your one unit short, you can fill in the spot using posts. Because they are only one unit wide they work well and they are half a wall high, much better than having a ton of small floors or tiny floors. Dm  to suggest more building tips!\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nScreen_Shot_2021-01-06_at_9.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-02-28","author":"@jornee","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/815667456663093311","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome back to the sunday @News Ping!! 🗞️ I hope all of you are having a great day so far, let’s head right into the news and look back on the past week!! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418>\n\nBirthday bot!! 🍰 We start of this week with a brand new bot added to the server, this bot is called Birthday Bot and it will give you are birthday role on your birthday with a message in <#349661340790685696>, information on how to set your birthday is here: 🥳https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/813582655819874324\n\nNew Roblox promocode!! Last wednesday Roblox added a new code which is “RIHAPPYCAT2021”, you can redeem the code in the link linked in the Sources. 🐱\n\nApplications are open!! 🗞️ The news I am most excited about this week is that we are hiring new Journalists!! If you’d like to be part of this team and help make this news then make sure to fill out the applications, you have until next week Friday to fill out the applications. <:LumberNews:806580631776657418>\n\nYesterday there was also announced that building submissions for the Winter building contest are pushed back until Monday tomorrow, good luck to everyone!! 🏗️\n\n**Lumber Games**\nAs every week we had some Lumber Games on Saturday!! <:Logo:357256036496703498> In the 7am EST games @plugbrooks took the win twice and @roblox real won the last game, in the 4pm EST games , @devshurikeno  and Ranger0283 took the win, congratulations to all of the winners!! 🎉\n\n**Base Of The Week**\nimage0.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-03","author":"@glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/816712544575160343","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome to the third month and the weekly Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! We start off the month with Fun Wiki Fact!! So let's waste no time and jump right into it! 🗞️ \n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis week’s Fun Wiki Fact place is Links Logic!! This seems like a normal store or is it? 🤔 Links logic sells all the logic components you will ever need! It's a fairly big place but if you glitch your way through the back wall there is actually an empty long hallway!! 🗃️ This room doesn't serve any purpose just yet, but who knows what the future may hold. 🤔 \n\n**Building Tip Of The Week**\nThis week we are going todo something a little different for the building tip. Grodan has created a guide on how to make one of his amazing dragons! 🐲 You can find the guide here: https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/714492073448964098/816041908170260540"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-07","author":"@glassywharf and @Jorne","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/818031771508801579","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all Lumberjacks back to the weekly Sunday Lumber @News Ping!! This week we start off with lots of exciting promotions!! So let's waste no time and jump right into the news!! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> 😁\n\nI want to give a huge congratulations to @Boop Wolf, , and @Jorne who have been chosen for the new Even Committee!! 🎉\n\nContinuing with the new promotions we have gotten a new set Lumber Journalist!! Congratulations to @xYeezy! ツ, @wall_watcher99999, @happp83, and @ReindeerJon!! These users will be helping us write the Lumber News!!\n\nSaving the best for last I want to give a HUGE congratulations to @glassywharf, @legobuildermaster12, and @The Frog Hayden on becoming full Supervisors!! 🎉\n\nEveryone did an amazing job and congratulations to everyone once again!! Other than we have some more news!! 🗞️\n\nBuilding Competition Winners!! This week the building competition and voting ended from the Winter Building Theme!! The winner of this competition is @Grodan_Kermit, second place went to @JoniBoi65 | Former Journalist and on the third place we have @RasaAZ01, thanks everyone for participating, you all did an amazing job!! 🎉\n\nThe next building theme arrived too, this month the Building Theme is **Space**! Get your wood together and show what you can build!! Good luck everyone! 🚀\n\nLast Thursday a new free item got added on Roblox, go get it here: https://www.roblox.com/catalog/6470135113/Fan-Hand-Sign-Why-Dont-We\n\n**Lumber Games**\nTo start off the 7 am est games we have PLEAR128 and 14mmm14 who took the wins!! Then at the later 4 pm est Lumber Games the first round we had a 3 way tie!! 😁\n\n**Sources**\nNews- @glassywharf and @Jorne\nLumber Games- @glassywharf\nFan Hand Sign - Why Don't We (WDW)\nCustomize your avatar with the Fan Hand Sign - Why Don't We (WDW) and millions of other items. Mix & match this back accessory with other items to create an avatar that is unique to you!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/6470135113/Fan-Hand-Sign-Why-Dont-We"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-10","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/819274941497081969","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all Lumberjacks back to another Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! Lets jump right into the news!!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis week's Fun Wiki Fact item is Cavecrawler wood!! 🟦 You can get this wood by completing the maze located over the Ferry. <:Hoover:769731865732579358> The best axe to use on this wood is actually the Cave Axe!! This axe will cut the wood better than any other axe including the many axe!! Whats interesting about bluewood is that is actually is one of the only two woods that glows!! 🔅 \n\n**Building Tip**\nThis week we have another building tip by @Grodan_Kermit!! His tutorial will show you have to build another standing dragon!! To find how to build it click this link!!https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/714492073448964098/817921656328683520\n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nimage0.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-14","author":"@happp83 and @Jorne","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/820717587792658446","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"@News Ping Welcome lumberjacks from far and wide! This week has been exciting as we have many news to share with you today. So delay no further, Let us hop right in! 🗞️ <:LumberNews:806580631776657418>\n\nToday, Sunday 14th, is Ticktatwert’s birthday, in the end of March 2018 our dear friend and Supervisor Ticktatwert passed away. She was such an amazing person, friend, supervisor, youtuber... and much more. ❤️ \nTo show our respect to her we want as many people to go to her Memorial, take a screenshot and send it in <#820344197399314442>. We do not force you to do this but it would be amazing if you would, if you have good memories with Ticktatwert feel free to send them in the channel too. If you want to leave her a gift, her favourite axe was the Rukiryaxe (shark axe). <:Axe_rukiry:749019349393604634>\n\nYesterday it was @ReindeerJon's birthday, congratulations Jon!!\n\n**Lumber Games**\nTo start off with today's news, we had 2 winners of the 7 AM EST Lumber Games! Congrats to @JordanNostalgia for winning the practice round and congrats and an applause to ewen007 and 14mmm14 for winning the real rounds! 😁\n\n**Sources**\nLumber Games- @happp83\nNews- @happp83 and @Jorne"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-17","author":"@omgitsmejon and","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/821783861629157417","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all Lumberjacks back to another Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! Lets jump right into the news!!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nThis week’s Wiki fact is the Underground Grove! This underground grove is underneath the volcano that has a pathway circling within the bottom left walls of the volcano. Though it may be possible that spook or sinister can grow on it due to the grass. It has a ring of grass which both Oak and Birch can grow and while the other side has lava. Though the majority of this ring is safe to walk on but some parts will damage you as you walk on it. There's multiple ways to access this area. You can wall glitch in there, the player can also go into the boulder cave, and locate a small hole found on the back wall of the cave, or at the top of the Volcano, the player can walk down a certain side of the walls to get in. For the last two methods here is some videos that will help you in case you get stuck!\n https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p09LaK3Vjj8  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zy5zhrflKUA  \n\n**Picture Of The Week**\nLumber Tycoon 2: Green Box Boulder Cave Path\nBoulder Cave: 0:00\nThe Underground Grove: 0:23\nBehind the Wall: 3:52\n\nPlease be aware of the risks when attempting this!\n\nRead more here: http://lumber-tycoon-2.wikia.com/wiki/Lava_Cavern:Green_Box#Underground_Grove_Pathway:\n\nCredit to ProgrammingUniverse, Jac16king, Eyezmaze, Alxice, RaptorX97, Fjalon, UnikarnzMagik, and BluWolfHD for making th...\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p09LaK3Vjj8\nJac16king\nLumber Tycoon 2: Green Box [SOLO] [UNDERGROUND GROVE]\nPoor quality, I know. \n\nThis video is to show that it's possible to get the Green Box with the Underground Grove method solo!\n\nYes, I know I managed to fail the \"Mad Games Glitch\" countless of time, lol. \n\nMad Games Glitch: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2vL16S_417Q\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zy5zhrflKUA\nJac16king\nunknown-2.png"},{"number":"30","title":"#30","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-21","author":"@ReindeerJon and @Jorne","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/823266935231873047","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#30** Welcome all Lumberjacks back to the weekly Sunday Lumber @News Ping!! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> 🗞️ \n\n@avinceyeet' birthday was on March 19th! and on March 15th it was ' birthday! Hope you had an amazing birthday and a relaxing day! <a:hooray:700211558080446473>\n\nThe Ticktatwert Memorial Channel closed at 10PM EST. This allowed players to go to the memorial, their own structures of her logo that they built, or going to fangroup lumber games by posting a photo with them in it. They could also write a small message too! Each year her channel will be open each year around her birthday! Thank you to those who participated in the channel! Thank you everyone for being an amazing community and we will always miss Ticktatwert. She will always be remembered in our amazing and lovely community!! ❤️\n\nThe Fanon Competition!! A new event has arrived, in this event you can make your own tree/wood ideas for Lumber Tycoon 2!! More info in <#332295148778029067>. 🏗️\n\n**Base Of The Week.**\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/802601214331191317/821090337384693841/unknown-2.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/802601214331191317/821090337384693841/unknown-2.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-24","author":"@omgitsmejon and","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/824316389283201047","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Welcome all Lumberjacks back to another Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! Lets jump right into the news!!\n\n**Fun Wiki Fact**\nSimilar to last week, this week is the ocean cove! It is considered as a cove of how well it is shielded from the rest of the ocean. This cove, surrounded by a set of smooth walls, the Snow Peninsula, Land Bridge and the Cliff Peninsula is particularly hidden compared to other biomes of the game. It’s circular shape highly suggests that something in the future will occupy this location. Spook and sinister can also spawn in this location! I found it one time there with Mark! -Jonbn123 \nThe Cove can be accessed from a variety of places, namely:\nTaiga Mountain Passage; go up the path, fall down a small cliff on a left turn and you'll see the cove.\nSnow Peninsula is technically the spot where the above leads to, though located on the other side of the cove.\nCliff Peninsula, being the opposite end of the Snow Peninsula, is considered the most difficult place to get to on the walls of the cove.\nVolcano; as the Volcano is the highest point in the game, the cove can be accessed by walking down from the top.\nTropics Peninsulas; the player can also access the cove from going on the opposite end of the map, as the cove takes up most of the ocean side.\n\n**Picture of the week.**\nunknown-12.png"},{"number":"31","title":"#31","category":"Article","date":"2021-03-30","author":"@glassywharf, @ReindeerJon and @wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/826325401525288990","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#31** Welcome all Lumberjacks  back to your weekly ~~Sunday~~ tuesdays Lumber @News Ping!! (Sorry for the delay) We start off the news with some new events!! So lets hop right into it! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> 🗞️ \n\nThe Winter build contest submissions are due next Wednesday, March 31st! Get them in while you can! ❄️ \n\nWe have an ongoing joint event in Fan Group right now! 🏅 LT2 Wiki: a Fanon Competition!  Participants will be able create their idea of anything that would be cool if it was in the game. Because there are so many different things that can be created, we will be focusing on the theme \"Trees and Wood”! Create your own idea for a tree for LT2. More information in <#332295148778029067>! <:CherryTree:398270553758236682> \n\n<#335939923028869132> has been updated to include the new roles!! If you would like to be reviewed for any role you can DM any Supervisor or Intern!! ⏫ \n\n**Lumber Games**\nYesterday was the Lumber Games!! So let's see who won the round! At the earlier 7 am EST games! For the two practice rounds, @OverratedRudolfs55 and @wiechor1 were the winners, congrats to them! 😁 In the 4pm Lumber Games @Jorne, DragnIte and @OverratedRudolfs55 won the games, congrats! 🥳\n\n**Sources**\nNews- @glassywharf, @ReindeerJon and @wall_watcher99999\nLumber games- @happp83"},{"number":"32","title":"#32","category":"Article","date":"2021-04-04","author":"@wall_watcher99999 and @glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/828299528179810315","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#32**Welcome all lumberjacks back at it again with another Sunday @News Ping!!! As you all have already heard, we will no longer be having Wednesday news. Some insane events happened this week so delay no further, Let us hop right in!\n\nThe winter build competition has ended and a new one is right up the corner. The theme for this month is Minigames!! The deadline is Friday, April 30th. We are excited to see what submissions we have this month!!\nOn April 1st, The lt2 server icon changed to one designed to prank members. It consisted of a ping icon attached to it. To all which got pranked, Don’t let them win next year! If you don’t want to fall victim to one of these pranksters, We got some tips to help you out. In the virtual world, Remember to check every link, member, announcement, google form, comment, server icon, and message on discord. Almost anything and everything can be an april fools prank. However, Before we go through such lengths, We must first address a major issue that will be our future. Kittens. Yes you heard me right, There has been a recent rise in the funny cat videos. We must end this endless supply. Here is a good example: <https://youtu.be/oml5cFYAlK8>\n\nWe also had some talented winners this Saturday for the lumber games! As each week, we have the Lumber Games!! In the 7am EST Lumber Games and in the 4pm EST Lumber Games, Here are our winners: In the 7am Lumber games the first round was an unexpected Tie! For the second and the third round, congrats to @inactive  for winning both rounds! 🥳 Finally, congrats to @Karimrir  for winning the practice round! 😁\n\nToday is Easter!! 🥚 The Journalist team would like to wish you all a happy and safe Easter. Enjoy the day and most importantly the food. 😋"},{"number":"33","title":"#33","category":"Article","date":"2021-04-11","author":"@happp83 and @glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/830824505336791043","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#33**Welcome all lumberjacks back at it again with another Sunday @News Ping!!! As another small reminder, we will no longer be having Wednesday news. So without further ado, let’s hop right in! \n\nApplications have opened and closed for the Daily Dose Of Lumber!! 📰 Staff will announce the people they have chosen soon, good luck to all of the people that applied!\n\nStaff members are now putting their intro into <#351104979030900736>!! Hop on over there to learn a little more about each staff member! 🧠 \n\nThe Fanon Competition closed yesterday! Thank you all who participated in it, this was by far one of the biggest turn outs for events we have had yet. 👨‍👨‍👧‍👧 Voting will be opening soon! \n\nLastly, the winners for the Space Building competition have been chosen!! Congratulations to @SourceCode_YT for coming in first place with his AMAZING robot build! 🤩 @legobuildermaster12 came in second place with his great satellite build! 🛰️ Then to round off the pack @N4thanroxx | Industry Builder came in third place with his earth build!! 🌍 Congratulations!! 🎉\n \n**Lumber Games**\nFor today’s last piece of news is the Lumber Games, at the 7am EST batch, there were 3 rounds and 3 winners, congratulations to @Plugbrooks for winning the first round, @OverratedRudolfs55 for winning the second round and Themonster_volf for winning the last round. 😁 For the 4 pm EST games, @OverratedRudolfs55 took the win for the first round with @Jorne taking the win for the second round! Rounding out the pack @Dragnlte took the win for the third round!! 🎉\n\n**Ranks Of The Week**\nCongratulations to these people for ranking up!! 🎉\n@MrNut173 -Elite Electrician\n@The imposta -Experienced Lumberjack and Lumberjack Merchant\n@Slartibartfast02 -Elite Electrician \n\n**Sources**\nNews- @happp83 and @glassywharf\nLumber Games- @happp83 and  @glassywharf"},{"number":"34","title":"#34","category":"Article","date":"2021-04-22","author":"@glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/834825402333003846","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#34**Welcome back to the Sunday Lumber @News Ping. Sorry about this new being a few days late. 😬 So without any more of a wait lets get into the news! And we have alot of it for you today!\n\nThe fanon competition voting has ended! Congratulations to @GreenBirdMusic#6533 who came in first place with Abysswood. 🏅  In second place we have @ElectroTechnologies with their vine wood!! Then to round off the pack we have @Jorne in third place with Coral wood! 🎉 \n\nI want to give a huge congratulations to @Jorne and @JordanNostalgia on becoming Supervisor Interns! 🎉 It has been wonderful that you have been part of the Lumber Community and now part of the staff team!! ❤️ \n\nLumber Tycoon 2 has had an update! Along with a new Game picture, the Metaverse Event has came!! You can find one of the chest for the event which will randomly spawn around the map! 🧰 \n\nThe four finalist in the Lumber Tournament had their final competition! You can see their builds and vote for them here. 🗳️  https://youtu.be/X8uA1EUwjIs\n\n**Lumber Games**\nNot only did we have the normal Lumber Games but we also had many practices! For the 7 am est Lumber Games @Jokis5  and @adriansn  took the wins! At the later 4 pm est games @Dragnlte took the win for all three rounds!! Congratulations!! 🎉\n\n**Sources**\nNews- @glassywharf\nLumber Games- @glassywharf\nLT2 JUDGES NEEDED Lumber Tournament Championship LT2\nLumber Tycoon 2 Fan Group empowers all of Lumber Tycoon 2 community to act as judges for the LUMBER TOURNAMENT CHAMPIONSHIP!  \n\nFOUR  FINALISTS had 3 weeks to build a championship worthy build and now request you to WATCH VOTE AND SHARE this video. Be a part of something fun and huge...\n\nWATCH this video, judge the builds, pick who you think is ...\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X8uA1EUwjIs\nItsMeGrammi"},{"number":"35","title":"#35","category":"Article","date":"2021-04-28","author":"@happp83 and @Jorne","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/836862918259638285","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#35** All Lumberjacks far and wide, welcome back to the Lumber @News Ping. We have some news to share with you today, so without any more of a wait let's get into the news! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418>\n\nIt's time for another build competition! The theme for April/May is Minigames! 🎮 Build a functional minigame that people can play in LT2! As usual, you must create a new build for the competition. 🛠️ You are allowed to be in a team with one other person if you want some help with your build. Only one build can be submitted, and to submit, DM several detailed pictures to a staff or Event Committee member. 😁 The deadline will be Monday, May 24th. Prizes are 5 million and a truck of random items for 1st, 3 million for 2nd, and 1 million for third. <:PogU:801640864572637184>\n\nAs another small reminder, Lumber Tycoon 2 has had an update! Along with a new Game picture, the Metaverse Event has come!! You can find one of the chests for the event which will randomly spawn around the map! 🧰\n\nA new event has arrived!! The avatar contest, in this contest you can make your avatar around the theme Animals, you can submit your Animal avatar in #avatar-contest!! 😁\n\n**Lumber Games**\nAt the Lumber Games, there were two batches! There was a batch at 7AM EST and one at 4PM EST! There were 3 rounds at 7AM, the winners at the Lumber games were @kapriza for winning 2 matches in a row, and valinqux for winning one round, congrats to them! 🥳 For the 4PM games, there were 2 rounds, congratulations to @wiechor1 and @OverratedRudolfs55 | tags aprove for winning! 😁\n\n**Sources**\nNews - @happp83 and @Jorne \nLumber Games - @happp83"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2021-05-02","author":"@glassywharf","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/838519040921174088","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**35**Welcome all Lumberjacks back to another Wednesday Lumber @News Ping!! Lets jump right into the news!! <:LumberNews:806580631776657418> \n\nA New role has been added! You all have been asking for it so it came, the Lumber Artist role! 🖌️ This is a role for all wire art and pixel art. \n\nA new promocode has been released. You can enter the code “WALMARTMEXEARS2021” into the link in sources to get yourself Steel Rabbit Ears!! 🐰 \n\nThe Daily Dose Of Lumber people have been chosen! Congratulations to those who got chosen. 🎉\nMeme Of The Week: @legobuildermaster12, @Berryman (Holy watah)\nPicture Of The Week: @Wwechampionman, @Lumber Tycoon 2 | IIAdapter\nBase Of The Week: @copman5425, @TheClownShanzy, @Mike\nLogic Tutorial: @Mr. Nut, @ElectroTechnologies\nLumber Tip: @El hams (gaming_sheep), @mindCraz\nWiki Fact Of The Week: @happp83, @Emerald | Daily Dose of Lumber\nBuilding Tutorial Of The Week: @Tagsboi65 | 1st active??, @Toxic_Productions\n\n**Lumber Games**\nAt the frist set of games the winners were @jonigirl65, @OverratedRudolfs55 | tags aprove, and Unknown_Aktuun took the wins. At the second set of games Desire_Tragiicz123 and Jingles71 won! Congratulations 🎉\n\n**Sources**\nRoblox Promocode- https://www.roblox.com/promocodes\nNews- @glassywharf \nLumber Games- @glassywharf\nRoblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/promocodes"},{"number":"37","title":"#37","category":"Article","date":"2021-07-25","author":"@ReindeerJon, @DevShurikeno, @fartsona, @VelhoTheVexed, and @jvpkvp101","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/868923671882895372","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#37**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back all lumberjacks to Lumber News! Oh boy is it good to be back! Lets jump right into it!\n\nSo if you haven’t been able to tell already, we’ve rebooted Lumber News! Along with the reboot of Lumber News, came eight new journalists! Please give them a warm welcome! \n\nFor those who are unaware, @TheCrimsonEvil's birthday was on friday. Happy belated birthday!\n\nCongratulations to @JordanNostalgia and @jorne for being promoted from Intern Supervisor to Supervisor!\n\nOkay so this week we did an interview with @Jonbn123 , who's one of our supervisors and the Lumber News Manager! Here are the questions we asked them:\n\n**Q:** How and when did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\n**A:** I don't know, but I found it out around the time 2014-2015.it was quite long ago. \n\n**Q:** How and when did you find out about the LT2 fan group? \n**A:** I joined it along side Lumber Chat Discord way long ago. Don't know the exact date.\n \n**Q**: What made you want to become a supervisor in the LT2 fan group? \n**A:** Before when Discord was a thing or before I even knew about it, I always wanted to be a Supervisor in the group. When I joined the Discord I soon found myself ranking up Supervisor Of The Month when that was still a thing. It's an amazing expiernece to work at The Fan Group!:)\n\n**Q:** What is your favorite thing to do in Lumber Tycoon 2? \n**A:** Car Wars:) It's fun to fling your friends into space! \n\n**Q:** What was your favorite moment from Lumber Tycoon 2? \n**A:** When Mark the Supervisor and I found spooks back to back in the same server. It \nwas awesome! Long trip though. \n\n**Q:** What was your favorite moment from the LT2 fan group? \n**A:** The time when I push Karaoke to become what it is today. I pushed for it a lot and it came out as a great success!\n\nCongratulations to these people for ranking up!\nRobloxpro0e0 - Lumberjack -> Experienced Lumberjack! \n@sneakysnakegh | mastercarbuilder - Electrician -> Elite Electrician! \n@LoganEllerbee - Lumberjack -> Experienced Lumberjack!\n\nAlso to those who didn't see or don't know, their is some promo codes in <#332295148778029067>! Scroll up in the channel to claim some items! \n\nLast but not least, thank you @rocky74427 and @IThundxr for boosting the server! It means a lot!\n\nThat’s about it for this week. Tune in next week for the next edition of Lumber News 2: Electric Boogaloo! \n\nNews: @ReindeerJon, @DevShurikeno, @fartsona, @VelhoTheVexed, and @jvpkvp101"},{"number":"38","title":"#38","category":"Article","date":"2021-08-01","author":"@ReindeerJon, @Happp83 | Youtuber, and @DevShurikeno","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/871500185908432946","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#38**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back all Lumberjacks to Lumber News!! Let's hop right into it! \n\nCongratulations to @SmartT16 | Supervisor Intern for getting Supervisor Intern! \n\nOkay so this week we did an interview with @legobuildermaster12, who's one of our Supervisors! Here are the questions we asked them:\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I think it was on my recommended games to play on the games tab on the site and this was just after Christmas in 2016\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about the LT2 fan group?\nA: How I'm not sure, I'm assuming it was on the LT2 game page like it is now and I joined the Roblox Group sometime between April - August 2017, on the other hand for the discord server, I either joined it from seeing it on the Roblox Group or from the Lumber Chat Discord Server.\n\nQ: What made you want to become a supervisor in the LT2 fan group?\nA: LT2 is one of the longest games that I've played, I like the game as well as the community. I enjoy helping the server out and by participating or hosting some of the events, similarly when I had joined the server, I would like others to have a similar experience and have fun along the way.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Probably build or think of things I can add to my projects...also go crazy when I buy a ton of wires since you buy a dozen of them, which makes you go mad already, then you go back to get a few more which you think is enough, then it isn't and the cycle repeats, lol\n\nQ: What was your favorite moment from Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I have 2 favorite moments, the first one was in January of 2017, I was playing in a server and I saw Sulihawk's Base, and as a new player at the time, it made me want to work hard, and build something breathtaking like what Sulihawk did, it was big and outstanding.\nThe second moment was later that year in October, I read on the wiki about Spook and Sinister wood spawning during that month and it was the time to hunt it. In a server, I spotted a spook tree on the rocks in front of the Land Store. As I was at my base looking for a piece of wood to make into a long plank, Dawn joined and she helped harvest the wood. it was a fun day.\n\nQ: What was your favorite moment from the LT2 fan group?\nA: Like before I have 2, the first was when I won my first official match of Lumber Games, you've finally beaten everyone and you now get the gold role...then the notification pops up and it says this was a practice round, mistakes happen and I still laugh at the incident today.\nThe second was when I first joined the discord server, before then, I was probably only in 3 other servers, and only one of them I was active in, and one thing I enjoyed about the server was how active it was, you had a game night where the owner participated in and Lumber Games, etc, Lots of nice people and you can make lots of friends from it.\n \nThese are the people that ranked up this week! Congrats!\n@lat_lego - Lumberjack -> Lumberjack Merchant\n@Lego_Laws - Lumberjack -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@ghytreio - Lumberjack -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@mysticskies (ign:filer5000) - Lumberjack -> Experienced Lumberjack and Lumberjack Merchant\n@NevermindRyker - Lumberjack -> Electrician and Carpenter\n@Jhowell07 - Carpenter -> Carpenter Specialist\n@HappyGhost🌈❤🛠 - Electrician ->  Elite Electrician\n \nThank you to @TheLuisRivera78 and @ArcanistShac for boosting the server!\n \nCongratulations to @Dragnlte for winning the first two rounds of The Lumber Games yesturday and @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro for taking the win in the third round! Also congratulations to FibonacciPlusEngima, @Dragnlte, and @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro for winning last week's Lumber Games! \n\nThat's all for this week! Check back next week for some news!\n \nNews: @ReindeerJon, @Happp83 | Youtuber, and @DevShurikeno"},{"number":"39","title":"#39","category":"Article","date":"2021-08-08","author":"@DevShurikeno @wall_watcher99999 @VelhoTheVexed","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/874042910088245268","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#39**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back lumberjacks to another week of the Lumber News! The only news channel where you get to hear about trees!\n\nIt was @HeadlessFerry ‘s birthday on the 2nd! Happy Belated Birthday Ferry!\n\nThis week we interviewed @mofmoff one of our Elite Electricians in the community!\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: found out like 4-5 years ago when it was top of the Roblox page with like 4k players 3-5 years ago i forgot\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about the LT2 fan group?\nA: i knew about it for like a year but didn't join till about 3 months ago till I needed some items XD\n\nQ: What made you want to become an elite electrician on lumber tycoon 2?\nA: well I enjoy all that mechanical stuff and using hatches for random things like elevators\n\nQ: What was your favorite moment in lumber tycoon 2?\nA: That's hard, putting a cone ontop of my tower.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in the world of lt2?\nA: Building or exploring all the hidden secrets I love them.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes lumber tycoon 2 unique from other games on roblox?\nA: How simple it is but can also be complicated it caters to everyone I think you could build a house for role playing or play with logic to be more complex the most unique part in the player interface tho.\n\nCongratulations to @monke for getting promoted into the DDOL for the job of Lumber tip of the week! \n\nGood job to these people on ranking up!\n@samidemir09 - Lumberjack -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@nadinii - Lumberjack -> Carpenter\ntronylus - Lumberjack -> Carpenter\n@ghytreio - Experienced Lumberjack -> Carpenter\n\nThanks to @TheLuisRivera78 for boosting the server this week! \n\nCongrats to @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro On winning the only round of lumber games this week! Batch 1 was unfortunately cancelled due to not enough players, make sure to compete next time because it could be YOU that wins!\n\nThat is all for the lumber news this week! See you next week on Lumber News!\n\nNews: @DevShurikeno @wall_watcher99999 @VelhoTheVexed"},{"number":"40","title":"#40","category":"Article","date":"2021-08-16","author":"@DevShurikeno @fartsona @Happp83 | Youtuber @ReindeerJon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/876618250945970207","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#40**\n\n@News Ping Welcome Lumberjacks far and wide, today we have some news that we would like to share with you on this fine Sunday!\n\nThis week we interviewed @CesarGeronimo, our group leader!\n\nQ:How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA:I joined because of the Kung Fu Panda 2 promotion. There was a Bao item you could get.\n\nQ:When did you join Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA:It was late 2015 or early 2016. I started on a different account so I don't know exactly. I created my current account in March 2016 and all I did on that account for a long time was lt2.\n\nQ:What's your favorite memory of Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA:It might be when I first promoted Donut to supervisor. The group was still super young and I was given lead supervisor and asked to hire a few people and he was the first. I was so glad I could share this experience with him. And in true \"Danger Donut\" fashion we celebrated by driving a truck up the volcano and jumping in the lava.\n\nQ:What is your favorite thing to do in the world of lt2?\nA:See new bases and meet new people. That is by far my favorite but if you mean gameplay I still like going up the mountain and getting lava wood. Or just going in the cave with people and getting lost.\n\nQ:What do you believe makes lumber tycoon 2 unique from other games on roblox?\nA:The ability to move items around at will. You really get a sense that carrying things around is a tactile thing. You don't just put things in your inventory, you stack them and move them. You build whatever you can imagine.\n\nThese are the people that ranked up this week! Great job!\n@Der_gamer6794  Lumberjack -> Lumberjack Merchant\n@Noahisboss9007 Lumberjack -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@Ux3rn4m3 Lumberjack  -> Carpenter Specialist\n@danila31222 Carpenter -> Carpenter Specialist\n\nCongratulations to @HappyGhost🌈❤🛠 for becoming Logic Tutorial Of The Week in DDOL and @sneakysnakegh | mastercarbuilder for becoming Building Tutorial For The Week in DDOL! <a:cheer:444902563461070848>\n\nBig thank you to @jjacob and @bobbi boi for boosting the server this week!\n\nFor the Lumber Games, we unfortunately only had 7 people that joined the 7 AM EST games. However, congrats to @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro for winning 2 of the practice rounds! 🥳 Make sure that you join next time, as there can be a chance that YOU (Yes you) could win!\n\nNews: @DevShurikeno @fartsona @Happp83 | Youtuber @ReindeerJon"},{"number":"41","title":"#41","category":"Article","date":"2021-08-22","author":"@Velho","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/879108646963920909","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#41**\n\n@News Ping Howdy all lumberjacks! Get ready for a NEW edition of Lumber News!\n\nThis week, we interviewed a talented builder, a talented Electrician! Give it up for @sneakysnakegh!!!\n\n**Q:** How long ago did you start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\n**A:** I joined lumber tycoon 2 about 3-2 years ago because one of my friends had told me about it at school.\n\n**Q:** What's your favorite thing to do in Lumber Tycoon 2?\n**A:** My favorite thing to do is building in lumber tycoon 2, mainly because I find it pretty fun. I also like building because at the end of my builds it makes me supersized that i really made that lol.\n\n**Q:** What's your favorite project that you've done in Lumber Tycoon 2?\n**A:** probably my big red car because it has the most detail on it and it took the longest to build. It also reminds me of how good of a friend @HappyGhost is because he got me lots of wood for the build and he did not even make me pay him\n\n**Q:** How long did it take for you to build your car?\n**A:** It took me 2 months and 25 days. I worked on it for about 3 hours every day. I skipped a few days because of vacation.\n\n**Q:** What's the biggest challenge you face while building your car?\n**A:** Probably making the tires because of how many tiny tiles and small tiles I have to use, plus they take so long to make and I use up so much wood.\n\n**Q:** Do you have any building tips for our fellow lumberjacks?\n**A:** yes, for my first tip, instead of making your building a normal square try making them more unique like an L shape or half H. My second tip is to use different colors for your build even if it takes a really long time to get. For my third tip you can use wires to add some nice details to your build.\n\nWe now have an official Lumber Tycoon 2 Subreddit! Be sure to check it out and gain some of that sweet, sweet Reddit Karma!\n<https://www.reddit.com/r/LT2OfficialReddit/>\n\nWe also had our very first game of kahoot! Congratulations to the 3 winners!\n1st - @zome\n2nd - @xShadowDevv\n3rd - @jjacob\n\nOoh? What’s this? A brand new promo item released by the roblox dev team? Sure is!\nEnter \"KROGERDAYS2021\"at https://www.roblox.com/promocodes to get the golf shades!\n\nCongrats to this week's Lumber Game Champions!\n@OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\n@djulzz3\nAnd last but not least,\nMadiaz625\n\nThank you all who boosted the server this past week! It means alot!\n\n@monke\n@Green5tar\n\nThese are the Lumberjacks that ranked up this week! Let's give them a round of applause!\n@Gameplaygang12 - Merchant\n@mysticskies (ign:filer5000) - Electrician\n@Pierce - Elite Lumberjack, and Electrician\n@Foxnarrow - Experienced Lumberjack\n\nThis week was an exciting one! Be sure to tune your discord pages for next weeks Lumber News! Remember, May the Axe be with you!\n\nNews: @Velho\nRoblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/promocodes"},{"number":"42","title":"#42","category":"Article","date":"2021-08-29","author":"@Velho and @ReindeerJon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/881641882789220374","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#42**\n\n@News Ping Hello everyone and welcome back to week 42 of Lumber News! Grab your towel, and remember, Don’t Panic!\n\nTo start off, one of our supervisors @DevShurikeno has retired from the position of Supervisor, Lumber News Journalist, and Daily Dose Of Lumber. Thank you for all that you have done for the group and we wish you the best. We all will miss you:( \n\nNext up we have a **__BRAND NEW LT2 UPDATE!__** The ferry has been fixed, and there is now multi-item purchasing. I must say this is a much needed update.\n\nThere's going to be some changes to Lumber News. We are moving interviews to Wednesdays and showing off their builds/art/circuitry! The Sunday news will still be a thing that just won’t include interviews. We’ll just have a wacky Wednesday from now on!\n\nCongratulations to @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro for winning the practice round and @The_BusinessGoose for winning round one, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro for winning round two, and @Distracted who won round three! Congratulations to our (mostly harmless) Lumber Games Champions!\n\nCongratulations to these people for ranking up! \n@sneakysnakegh - Experienced LumberJack and Elite LumberJack!\n@slammerkiller8 - Carpenter, Lumberjack Merchant, Experienced LumberJack and Lumber Artist!\n@Cloud_Razer - Carpenter Specialist, Elite LumberJack and Elite Electrician.\nIf you want to be mentioned for rank ups in Lumber News contact a staff member for a base review! \n\nBoosts this week:\nThank you to @kiIIshark, @NeyDeyBee, and @Shadowheart for boosting the server!\n\nThat’s it for this week of Lumber News! So long and thanks for all the fish!\n\nWe're going to have an anniversary celebration for the Fan Group and the Wiki on the 31st of this month! There will be more info coming soon in the announcement channel!\n\nNews: @Velho and @ReindeerJon"},{"number":"43","title":"#43","category":"Article","date":"2021-09-06","author":"@Happp83 | Youtuber, @Velho, and @BlaZe_7575","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/884235437735043092","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#43**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back y’all to another week of Lumber News! The only place that carves it's news into a blue piece of wood using an axe with too many blades!\n\nCongratulations to @DevShurikeno, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro, and @iOmegaAzure! Their odds were in their favor for the last batch of lumber games!\n\nCongrats to all of those who ranked up in the past week!\n@DOOM_a - Lumber Artist!\n@iiMiiix - Carpenter Specialist!\n@gabarugavaska - Experienced Lumberjack!\n@groundWorld - Carpenter, Lumber Artist, Electrician!\n@nadchos - Carpenter Specialist!\n\nSupervisor Intern Applications are now open! See the announcement channel for more info! <#332295148778029067> \n\nWe also got a brand new promo code! Redeem code ` CARREFOURHOED2021 ` at <https://www.roblox.com/promocodes> to get a Pasta Hat! Pretty spicy meatball if I do say so myself.\n\nThank you to all of those lumberjacks who boosted the server this past week!\n   \n\nThat’s it for this time! Cya next week! \n\nNews: @Happp83 | Youtuber, @Velho, and @BlaZe_7575"},{"number":"2","title":"Interview Wednesday #2","category":"Interview","date":"2021-09-09","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/885367479390597132","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #2__**\n\n@News Ping Howdy y'all once again for an interview Wednesday! This week, we interviewed @Dopditer | Elite Lumberjack!\n\n*Round 1, start!*\n\n**Q:** How long have you been playing lumber tycoon 2?\n**A:** I've been playing for 6 years.\n \n**Q:** What's your favorite thing to do in the game?\n**A:** I love building structures, especially mega ones.\n \n**Q:** What's your favorite project that you have worked on?\n**A:** My skyscraper base, I started work on it in the year 2015 up until very recently, where it sadly got wiped.\n \n**Q:** What's the biggest challenge you face while building?\n**A:** In the past years filling the blueprint was quite challenging. But today super blueprint exists, so now it's made me easier to build, however, I'm struggling to get the wood now. As well as building it alone at public servers.\n \n**Q:** How do you plan out your builds?\n**A:** I plan my builds with the use of roblox studio or I will draw a floor plan with elevations to get the precise measurements and the design of the build. Then, I can build it in LT2 easily.\n \n**Q:** Where do you find inspiration?\n**A:** I am inspired to make unique and different designs in an architectural context. I want to be an Architect someday.\n \n**Q:** What's a building tip that people should know?\n**A:** The very most important when you build something is to *PLAN*, Always make a plan to expect what you expect. Always determine your own style and consistency when building as well as have *PATIENCE* and *DETERMINATION* to have an amazing build. Lastly, make a story of it.\n\nAttached below are some photos of projects our friend here has worked on! Also included is a link to one of the public referenced Dop has made!\n\nhttps://www.roblox.com/games/7246949815/Modern-Mansion\n\nThat'll be it for this week! Have a fantastic evening/morning/day/afternoon/night!\n\nInterviewer:\nModern Mansion\nCheck out Modern Mansion. It’s one of the millions of unique, user-generated 3D experiences created on Roblox.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/games/7246949815/Modern-Mansion\nRobloxScreenShot20210909_102818926.png\nold_Main_base_1-3_floors.png\nRobloxScreenShot20210909_103245300.png\nRobloxScreenShot20210909_102857267.png\nRobloxScreenShot20210909_102358908.png\nRobloxScreenShot20210909_102341820.png"},{"number":"44","title":"#44","category":"Article","date":"2021-09-12","author":"@Velho","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/886708375025500170","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#44**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to another week of lumber news! The only place where you’ll break the laws of physics by giving someone an eye of a large bird!\n\nWe’ll be starting today off with a ***Brand New Update!!!***\n>Fog has been reduced to match 2015’s original fog\n>Now you can’t weld cars to terrain or to yourself. No more cyborgs 😦\n>Fixed animation with your wrist when chopping wood.\n>Fixed car spawners breaking when being activated by logic gates\n\nCongrats to all of those who ranked up in the past week!\n@Welly2 > Carpenter\n@hepaul9 > Experienced Lumberjack\n@ZONE2rt5 > Experienced Lumberjack\n@danibug1123 > Carpenter, Lumber Artist, Lumberjack Merchant\n@wilmergamingYT_TTV > Carpenter Specialist\n\nThank you @unfortunateplayer104 For boosting this server in the past week! It means a lot!\n\nBuild competitions are back! You will have until October 1st to create a build for this competition.\nThe theme is **Wild West**!  Build something based on the theme and DM a staff or Event Committee member several detailed pictures of your build to enter. Yee haw!\n\nFor Lumber games @Edicelsuper won round one! @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro won Round two and three! Congratulations!\n\nWelcome our brand new allies, The Lumber Shack! \n“I think this is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.”\n\nThat’s all for this week! Remember to keep your axe sharp! See ya next time!\n\nNews: @Velho"},{"number":"3","title":"Interview Wednesday #3","category":"Interview","date":"2021-09-16","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/888180590443122770","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #3__**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back Lumberjacks to another Wednesday Interview! (It's a day late.) This week, we interviewed @BlakeNostalgia ඞ! \n\nQ: What do you believe is the best part about the lt2 fan group server?\nA: Definitely the members, there all unique and have different things about them. It’s a joy being around them.\n\nQ: What inspired you to become a supervisor?\nA: I was a really active member and I was always in one of the chats, didn't really matter which one. I enjoyed being in the community which led me to apply for the supervisor role.\n\nQ: What is something about lumber tycoon 2 that makes it unique from other roblox games?\nA: You have full control over what you want to do, you can build a house, treehouse or store. Other games force you into following their rules and making something you don’t wanna make. In lumber you have full creative control.\n\nQ: When did you find out about the lt2 fan server?\nA: I saw the link a few times in the LT2 description but decided to not join for some reason, I saw it again and decided to go ahead and join.\n\nQ: What's your favorite thing to do in the lumber tycoon 2 game?\nA: Definitely sell my items. It’s fun to be able negotiate a price or trade with a user even though it can get frustrating when neither can agree on something.\n\nQ: Are you planning on any future builds?\nA: I really wanna expand my shop tbh, it feels mall and cramped. A lot of my items don’t fit and it is why I had to build a storage unit for them.\n\nThat is all for this week! See you again on Sunday! \n\nInterviewer: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"45","title":"#45","category":"Article","date":"2021-09-20","author":"@omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/889326956649263154","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#45**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to another Lumber News Lumberjacks! Let’s hop right into it!\n\nThere's a new Promo Code on Roblox, use code **SMYTHSCAT2021** to get the new item. Go to https://www.roblox.com/promocodes to redeem it!!\n\nCongratulations to this user on ranking up! \n@DreamyIin ‧ CDT Experienced Lumberjacks, Lumberjack Merchants, and Carpenter Specialists! \n\nThank you to  for boosting the server!\n\nApplications for Interns are now closed! Good luck to everyone that has applied! \n\nLast but not least, congratulations to @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂ for winning round one of Lumber Games and @dug for winning round two of Lumber Games!\n\nThat’s it for this week! A short News for this Sunday evening! Until next time!\n\nNews: @omgitsmejon\nRoblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/promocodes"},{"number":"4","title":"Interview Wednesday #4","category":"Interview","date":"2021-09-23","author":"@Velho","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/890432829958287401","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #4__**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back lumberjacks for a new edition of Interview Wednesday! This week, we Interviewed @Boop Wolf!\n\n**Q:** How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2 for?\n**A:** I joined late 2015/early 2016 but I really didn't play much until 2017.\n\n**Q:** What's your favorite thing to do in Lumber Tycoon 2?\n**A:** Definitely trading and collecting. It's nice to see shelves with rare items stacked on them.\n\n**Q:** As a Lumber Merchant, what's the biggest issue you face?\n**A:** The scammers and exploiters. I have a warehouse that was very organized with shelves and things neatly stacked, but one of my trusted employees was really an exploiter and messed everything up. I genuinely don't see many scammers anymore because exploiters just spawn and delete items.\n\n**Q:** How did you go about building your Warehouse? \n**A:** It is completely made of oak. I started with normal walls without the power, which was a major mistake. Eventually when the first floor was done I remembered the power existed, so I got that and built the second floor with the power, which was very easy. Yet, I did it all on my own.\n\n**Q:** How do you keep your warehouse stocked?\n**A:** Buying from other people and loading up on event items. Unfortunately I haven't been able to make any purchases or sell anything for a few months.\n\n**Q:** Do you have any tips out there for people looking to get into the Lumber Tycoon 2 Marketplace?\n**A:** Record every transaction and keep your shop stocked. Some days you will have zero sales so you will think that you don't need to restock. But, the next day rolls around and you have 10 orders to complete. Recording your transaction will give you proof if someone scams you or exploits.\n\nThat's it for this week! Keep those axes sharp!\n\nInterviewer: @Velho"},{"number":"46","title":"#46","category":"Article","date":"2021-09-27","author":"@Velho, @Happp83 | Youtuber, and @ReindeerJon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/891882025731117067","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#46**\n\n@News Ping GOOOOOD MOOOORNIING LUMBERLAAAND!!!!! Or, that is, whatever time of day it is for you. Welcome back to The Lumber News! The only place where you can have a sustainable business in the deep depths of a cave system.\n\nCongrats to all of those who ranked up in the past week!\n@Foxnarrow > Lumber Merchant.\n@danibug1123 > Carpenter Specialist.\n@connorbinder321 > Experienced Lumberjack\n\nThere were only practice matches this week for Lumber Games, so no recorded winners for this week. Thank you for playing though!\n\nOur ~~Overlords~~ Roblox Developers gave us some brand new clothing items for our digital avatars! Go check them out!\n<https://www.roblox.com/catalog/7551839048/Poppy-Braids>\n<https://www.roblox.com/catalog/7551987362/Poppy-Flux-Shirt>\n\nThat’s all for this week! In case we don’t see you, Good Afternoon, Good Evening, and Good Night!\n\nNews: @Velho, @Happp83 | Youtuber, and @ReindeerJon"},{"number":"5","title":"Interview Wednesday #5","category":"Interview","date":"2021-09-30","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/892961632240697356","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #5__**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back lumberjacks for this weeks interview! Today we are interviewing @Ackie The Snowman!\n\nQ:How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA:I’ve been playing lumber tycoon 2 for almost 6 years. I started playing in 2016.\n\nQ:How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA:I discovered Lumber Tycoon 2 by watching lots of people on YouTube recording it and uploading. I was fascinated with what I saw and thought I would give it a go. And I’m still enjoying it today.\n\nQ:What's your favorite memory of Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA:My favorite memory of Lumber Tycoon 2 was when I went to attempt getting a bold and brash. It was a fun time with lots of fails.\n\nQ:What's your favorite thing to do in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA:My favorite thing do to in LumberLand out of all things is build. I find it really relaxing.\n\nQ:How has your birthday been?\nA:My birthday has been great! Even better with all the birthday wishes.\n\nQ:How many spooks do you think you will get this year? \nA:Honestly, maybe 1. All depends on the luck that day.\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona\n\nDon't forget to wish @Ackie The Snowman a happy birthday!"},{"number":"47","title":"#47","category":"Article","date":"2021-10-03","author":"@Happp83 | Youtuber, @Le pog|Souleater, @Velho The Spooked","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/894341061550436472","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#47**\n\n@News Ping Heeeerrreee’s ~~JOHNNY~~ The Lumber News! Welcome back to the Lumber News! The only place where trees can sustain themselves on liquid rock!\n\nIt's Spooky Month! Spook trees are spawning, Bob is selling pumpkins, and Thom is selling candy! Make sure to take advantage of the update before it’s too late!\n\nIn addition to the new spooky update, we’ve added a new channel! Post your pictures of the Spook wood you find in <#893954267294089258>!\n\nCongratulations to the winner of the Lumber Games this week, @dug! Thanks to everyone who played! It was a blast!\n\nCongratulations to all of the new Supervisor Interns! Please give @archie_auss, @HappyGhost🌈❤🛠, @Velho The Spooked, @nadchos, @monke the spooke🎃, and @M23 | DMs always open a warm welcome!\n\nCongrats to those who ranked up in the past week!\n@patryk151123 -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@MrNob_8 -> Electricians\n@zome -> Electricians\n\nThank you @chasemonkey0801 for boosting the server!\n\nThat’ll be it for this week! Keep your doors locked, your lights on, and your trusty hatchet by your side! See ya! \n\nNews: @Happp83 | Youtuber, @Le pog|Souleater, @Velho The Spooked"},{"number":"6","title":"Interview Wednesday #6","category":"Interview","date":"2021-10-06","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/895458141809049622","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #6__**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to another weekly interview! This week we have interviewed @Distracted!\n \nQ: What is your favorite part of the LT2 fan server?\nA: I really like the perk of the private servers lol. I also enjoy attending game night when they have it. Also when I can attend. I also appreciate the updates on the game that they announce from time to time. It's really helpful.\n\nQ: What makes you want to become an active member?\nA: I like discussing various updates, and I like seeing the builds people make and discussing them.\n\nQ: What was your favorite overall moment you have ever had whilst playing the lumber tycoon 2 game?\nA: Probably when the 2019 gifts came out. Prior to that I hadn't really played the game and I hadn't realized that gifts were obtainable. The prospect of gifts still being obtainable was very exciting. Even since I bought my first gifts I've always collected as many and diversified items as I'm able to purchase.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: I think the major ones are being able to explore like LT2 allows and being able to hand purchase items. When I first played the game hand-buying items was revolutionary to me. The tycoon genre really has gotten stale with the same format always being implemented. And exploring, well I love exploring LT2. I still enjoy getting ice wood or venturing into the maze for a very unique experience.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to members who are also aspiring to become a lumber games champion?\nA: When I played the Lumber Games, the snow shack in the hills really helped me. Since there's an excess of wood usually, stocking up your inventory with normally useless wood and inserting them into the box really helps you gain more health, and gives you an edge in the competition.\n\nInterviewer: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"48","title":"#48","category":"Article","date":"2021-10-11","author":"@fartsona, @Velho The Spooked","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/896914918836678676","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#48**\n\n@News Ping One, Two, Hoover’s coming for you! It’s another week of the Lumber News! The only place where large sums of money can give you superpowers! \n\nDon’t forget, this month there are spook trees spawning, Thom is selling candy, and Bob is selling pumpkins! Get as much of it as you can before the month ends!\n\nCongrats to those who ranked up the past week!\n@NAMclub1 -> Lumberjack Merchant and Electrician @monke the spooke🎃 -> Electrician \n@LogicalHorizons -> Youtuber \n@haantje -> Carpenter Specialists \n@zome -> Carpenter\n\nThere is a new Promo Code on Roblox, use code ` AMAZONFRIEND2021 ` to get the Snow Friend! Go to <https://www.roblox.com/promocodes> to redeem it!\n\nToday is @BlakeNostalgia ඞ | CWG’s Birthday! Give them your best birthday wishes!\n\nThat’s about it for this week! Remember, if a clown in the sewers offers you a Rukiryaxe, take it! Nothing bad will ever happen! \nSee ya next time!\n\nNews: @fartsona, @Velho The Spooked"},{"number":"49","title":"#49","category":"Article","date":"2021-10-18","author":"@Velho | DMs Are Open","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/899454003799269417","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#49**\n\n@News Ping Welcome Back Lumberjacks! It's a new edition of the Lumber News! The only place that has you scouring the lands for trees with no leaves!\n\nCongratulations to all of those who ranked up in the past week!\n@loopdoopoo -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@halfcardinal -> Carpenter\n@KwatKing -> Electrician\n@crantwijk -> Electrician\n\nUnfortunately, it’s a short one this week. That means less reading, and more spook huntin’! Cya next week!\n\nNews: @Velho | DMs Are Open"},{"number":"50","title":"#50!","category":"Article","date":"2021-11-01","author":"@Velho","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/904583793896206406","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#50!**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back Lumberjacks! Today is the 50th edition of the Lumber News! 🎉 \nScale wise, we have been covering a year’s worth of news! As well as it being our 50th edition, it’s also (or was) Halloween! The spookiest day of them all! ||boo!||\n\nTo get things started, as you might have known, Roblox had an outage, but it’s back up again! One big scare for Halloween! \n\nWe’ve had a pretty minty Promo Code from our friends at target!\nEnter ` TARGETMINTHAT2021 ` at <https://www.roblox.com/promocodes> to redeem your hat!\n\nCongrats to those who have ranked up in the past two weeks!\n@KwatKing -> Electrician, Elite Electrician, Lumber Artist\n@halfcardinal -> Carpenter\n@loopdoopoo -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@[mommadanibug] -> Elite Lumberjack\n@NewTinyJoe -> Carpenter Specialist\n@Chem_ECH -> Elite Electrician\n@Windows7 -> Lumberjack Merchant\n@carlospug123 -> Lumberjack Merchant\n@j0rd016 -> Carpenter Specialist, Electrician\n@Toocan679 -> Elite Lumberjack\n@AngeIcheeks -> Lumberjack Merchant\n@Cra1b -> Experienced Lumberjack, Lumberjack Merchant\n@M23 | available -> Elite Electrician\n@halfcardinal -> Carpenter Specialist\n@TanPugs#3886 -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@Gamer_Boy1235 -> Experienced Lumberjack\nʷʰᵉʷ, ᵗʰᵃᵗ'ˢ ᵃˡᵒᵗ ᵖᵉᵒᵖˡᵉ\n\nThank you @Just Nerp#5500 for boosting the server! It means a lot!\n\nBecause of the infamous Roblox Outage, Defaultio has extended the end times 24 hours! The Spooky never ends!\n\nNow, Last but certainly not least, we’re doing something special to celebrate the 50th edition! Stay tuned because this is going to be a good one!\n\nNews: @Velho"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Interview","date":"2022-01-19","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/933484108628246549","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"@News Ping  Hello, welcome to this weeks Wednesday Lumber News! This week we interviewed @geeses  our birthday boy!\n\nQ: How has your birthday been?\nA: Good\n\nQ: When did you first start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I don't remember necessarily but it was around 2017 with one of my old friends.\n\nQ: Are you happy that Defaultio did the revert forms?\nA: I'm happy for the people that can get their stuff back but luckily I haven't fallen victim to a base wipe.\n\nQ: When did you find out about the lt2 fan server?\nA: I found joined in 2021 when I needed to buy some stuff. I may have been in it years ago but I don't remember really.\n\nQ: What is your favorite part of the LT2 fan server?\nA:The lumber market and the base showcase is probably my favorite\nthe moderation on the lumber market is nuts.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: Comparing it to other simulators it wins by a mile. its not one of those gamepass or pet games.\n\nQ: What was your favorite overall moment you have ever had whilst playing the lumber tycoon 2 game?\nA: In 2017 there was a horrible bug where car collisions would make your car fly away and my friend had horrible internet, so I slammed him, he did a double backflip, and he was mad.\n\nMake sure you wish @geeses  a very Happy Birthday! I am sorry for the delay, we will try and get you a Sunday news! Happy chopping!\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"11","title":"Interview Wednesday #11","category":"Interview","date":"2022-01-27","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/936051329229545474","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #11**\n\n@News Ping Today we interviewed @KwatKing! One of our Elite Electricians!\n\nQ: When did you first start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I don’t remember exactly when but it was sometime late 2015.\n\nQ: What is your favorite moment of Lumber Tycoon, or the Fan Group? \nA: My favorite moment in Lumber was when my friends and I tried getting the green box. We tried for like half an hour and never got it lol.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: I think lumber’s freedom to build anything with so many different materials and blueprints makes it one of the games with the most creative freedom on Roblox. Also there are very few games with a logic/wiring feature in them which is really cool.\n\nQ: How much practice should a person have to be a Elite Electrician? \nA: Well it really depends. If you have worked with logic gates before in real life or in other games like Minecraft, it shouldn’t be too hard to make something that’s good enough for elite electrician. But if not, it takes a quite a while to understand how the different logic gates interact with each other.\n\nQ: Are you planning any big builds?\nA: Well a while ago i had started making a calculator but i gave up on it after about a month of working on it. I think I’m going to go back to working on that soon.\n\nQ: What is the biggest thing you have built in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My friend and I spent a while on this castle base which took a long time but it was really fun to build.\n\nNext Wednesday we will have another interview! Have a great day/night! Keep chopping!\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"12","title":"Interview Wednesday #12","category":"Interview","date":"2022-02-02","author":"@fartsona - OJ !!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/938581493285003286","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #12**\n\n@News Ping  Welcome to Interview Wednesday! This week we interviewed one of our Co-Owners @Sirred90 \n\nQ: When did you first start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: May of 2016 while the game was still in beta\n\nQ: What is your favorite moment of Lumber Tycoon, or the Fan Group?\nA: I'd have to say at the recent 250k celebration watching everyone having fun and just having a blast celebrating 250k group members\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: No other game gives you the ability to build the way lt2 does, or the grind of chopping trees for money, the possibilities in this game is only limited by your imagination\n\nQ: What would you say to other people wanting to become a supervisor or intern?\nA: Be helpful to the community, show maturity and care for the community\n\nQ: When did you become a supervisor?\nA: July 15th, 2017\n\nQ: What is the biggest thing you have built in Lumber Tycoon 2\nA: Currently my slot 1, I'm not sure exactly what it's gonna be but It's still a work in progress\n\nI hope you had or have a great day! See you next week!\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona - OJ !!\nunknown.png"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Interview","date":"2022-02-10","author":"@fartsona @AstronautJaye","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/941132839154507856","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Howdy @News Ping ! Have you all been sharpening your axes? This week for Lumber News we interviewed @BanGoodLuc BEST MAN !\n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Dang. This is a trick question for me. Welp, i found out LT2 By Looking Up Games To Play Because i was bored and wanted to find a Game to play. So Then I found out about Lumber Tycoon 2. And got to work on LT2.\n\nQ: When did you start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Dang.. I forgot, when did i start playing Lumber Tycoon 2... I think it was like somewhere in either mid 2020. Or in 2021. Can't remember.\n\nQ: What's your favorite memory of Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Building my Base, Was my favorite memory of LT2. Because i built it with my love and care. 😄\n\nQ: What's the funniest moment you had on Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My funniest moment of Lumber Tycoon 2, Was when.. You know when you get flinged a little bit. While you hold modded wood. Well, Those moments we're funny.\n\nQ: What is the biggest thing you have built in Lumber Tycoon 2? \nA: Nothing... I've never built something big in Lumber Tycoon 2. \n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: What makes it more unique, Is that you can have fun, Work, Find New and interesting things in-game. Make Amazing Wire-Art and Bases! \n\nTune in for next weeks Lumber News! Keep sharpening your axes!\n\nInterviewers: @fartsona @AstronautJaye"},{"number":"14","title":"Interview Wednesday #14","category":"Interview","date":"2022-02-17","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/943662507451645972","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #14**\n\n@News Ping  Hello Lumber world! Today we interviewed one of our Carpenter Specialists @Dallinnuke!\n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Well when I joined Roblox back in 2013   I was addicted to Lumber Tycoon 1. From there I just played that till the second one came out 2015ish. I saw it on the recommend for you tab and started playing. I Played it for about 5 years then kinda took a small break 6 months or so.\n\nQ: How did you find put about the Lumber Tycoon Fan Group.\nA: Well around 2019 or so I was looking for some discord about LT2 to join and I found the Roblox group and the discord from there.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: It doesn’t suck, you get more freedom In the game unlike most  other tycoon games.\n\nQ: What is the biggest/best thing you have built in Lumber Tycoon 2? \nA: The biggest thing I’ve made was a full plot base with 3 full layers and l made a big glass box around a plot and I’m putting items inside of it. \n\nQ: Do you have any plans on any builds?\nA: Yeah I am working on making a no moving part randomizer, and a museum showing all of lumber items in a showcase based on time they where added and what update.\n\nQ: What should someone do if they wanted to become a Carpenter Specialist?\nA: Make it cleaner looking (move lose items and woods into storage) and to just be cool about it and don’t get panicky\n\nQ: What is your favorite moment of Lumber Tycoon, or the Fan Group?\nA: Its hard to say just one, But I would say we all get tougher on a game\n\nQ: Are you planning anything fun?\nA: I don't have anything planed yet since I wanna at least get on before I start planning\n\nThank you for reading this weeks Lumber News Interview! I hope you have a nice day/night!\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"51","title":"#51","category":"Article","date":"2022-02-21","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/945118085982076930","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#51**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back Lumberjacks! We got a new week of **fresh** news! I hope you enjoy this week's Lumber News!\n\nHere are the birthdays for this week!\n\n● Feb-20: NoobMaster11166, Snowy Jorne, and sxrrxd \n● Feb-21: charbel123212 \n● Feb-22: Eastren_Dev\n● Feb-23: amaryllistx#831, giantjester309, and iiyeetboii\n● Feb-25: Gamer_Boy1235\n● Feb-26: El LoCo TaCo#0420 \n● Feb-27: yolozwek \n\nWe only had one Rank-Up this week!\n\n@Euan945 -> Experienced Lumberjack\n\nWiki Fact of the week! For this week you will be getting a fact about the VIP Room! The VIP Room is a structure that may appear during server initialization. It spawns almost as soon as a server is created and is only visible for a very short period of time. As a result, it is extremely difficult to spot. The room appears as a box-like shape and is covered in crude images and signs. The VIP Room contains multiple items, including an early model of a sawmill and multiple types of conveyors.\n\nHope you had fun reading this week’s Lumber News! Make sure you keep sharpening your axes or they will be dull! We had a break, but we will be starting things back up again!\n\nNews: @fartsona"},{"number":"15","title":"Interview Wednesday #15","category":"Interview","date":"2022-02-24","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/946203580203937814","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #15**\n\n@News Ping  Howdy Lumber World! Today we interviewed @SmashFocus  one of our Carpenters! \n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: 2017, there was a botted lumber tycoon 2 on the games page, I played it, then an hour later it got shut down, so I just played the original, I clicked on it, played it for a while, quit. but in 2019 I was getting nostalgic for old games I played, I thought of lumber tycoon 2, ever since then, I haven't stopped\n\nQ: How did you find out about the Lumber Tycoon Fan Group?\nA: I was looking for lumber tycoon 2 discord servers to join, I joined this one.\n\nQ: How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: 2017 to now!\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: It's like no other, it's a buggy mess that can't be recreated, it's nostalgic, fun, and unleashes creativity!\n\nQ: What is the biggest/best thing you have built in Lumber Tycoon 2? \nA: The funny spook wood pyramid.\n\nQ: If their was a moment of Lumber Tycoon 2 or the Fan Group, what moment would you bring back?\nA: The first time I got hooked to this game, wish I could go back.\n\nQ: If you could tell Defaultio to add something to the the game what would it be?\nA: Pls Defaultio add black wood!\n\nQ: If their was a Lumber Tycoon 3, would you play it lots, and why?\nA: New version of the best game, of course that would be my life.\n\nI hope you had fun reading this, and be ready for a great Lumber News next week! Stay safe.\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"52","title":"#52","category":"Article","date":"2022-02-28","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/947828198190776343","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#52**\n\n@News Ping Howdy Lumberjacks! Welcome back to another week of Lumber News! I am your host, AstronautJaye. It's been a fair few weeks, so lets get started!\n\nWe have a lot of birthdays, lets get right into them!\n\n● Mar-01: Velho The Vexed#6901\n● Mar-02: umpireboy (Umpire#8048)\n● Mar-03: contentdeleted853#6460, foxyliker256 (Foxy#9854), Theo (thegester#5879)\n● Mar-04: Sirred90#9934, sxnsඞ ([LK] Swipz#8822)\n● Mar-05: NexaForX (RafyShafryan#4156), SimplisticJackson (.jackson#0043)\n● Mar-06: GeneralG (GenG#6969)\n● Mar-06: Shadowheart (𝓓𝓻𝓪𝓬𝓱𝓮𝓸𝓷#0001)\n● Mar-07: loopdoopoo (wickedmcc#8529)\n\nI hope you have great birthdays guys!\n\nWe have no rank-ups this week.. what a shame :(.. I hope you do some base reviews soon!\n\nLumber Tycoon 2 fact of the week!! My favorite part!\n\nThe Stone Axe was an item that could only be obtained in the early development of Lumber Tycoon 2. It was later replaced by the Basic Hatchet, due to that fact that the axe had not been re-textured in any way.\n\nWell lumberjacks, I gotta get running! fartsona is on my tail, fartsona wasnt happy I stole the news for this week! I'll try and get to you next week, but fartsona is near! Good luck guys!\n\nYour amazing reporter, @AstronautJaye"},{"number":"16","title":"Interview Wednesday #16","category":"Interview","date":"2022-03-03","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/948750979996745750","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #16**\n\n@News Ping Hello Lumberland! This week we got a interview from @janders !\n\nHow did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nI was gaming and my base got wiped 😭😭😭 and it lead me to here.\n\nHow did you find out about the Lumber Tycoon Fan Group?\nMy base got wiped and found a server that could fix it. \n\nHow long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\n2 years.\n\nWhat do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nIt’s creative and self paced.\n\nWhat is the biggest/best thing you have built in Lumber Tycoon 2? \nMinecraft Steve head base.\n\nIf their was a moment of Lumber Tycoon 2 or the Fan Group, what moment would you bring back?\nThe group event for a birthday or memorial that got bugged because of hackers it was funny. \n\nIf you could tell Defaultio to add something to the the game what would it be?\nSports  cars so people can explore and go places faster without being so long.\n\nIf their was a Lumber Tycoon 3, would you play it lots, and why?\nNope, because of the progress difference.\n\nHope you have a great day/night! Don't forget that we have applications for Lumber Journalist out!\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"53","title":"#53","category":"Article","date":"2022-03-07","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/950223116926332971","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#53**\n\n@News Ping Howdy Lumberjacks, and welcome to this week's lumber news! We have some interesting stuff today!\n\nWe have some new free clothing!\n\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/8516612751/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/7192547628/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/8516648620/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/8648389231/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/7192549218/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/8648397446/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/8648380153/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/8516609675/ https://www.roblox.com/catalog/8516638468/\n\nWe had a Co-Owner's birthday last week! Wish @Sirred90  a very happy belated birthday! His birthday was on March 4th!\n\nThis week our very special @ReindeerJon will be having a birthday this week! His birthday will be on March 13th!\n\nWe have some other special birthdays this week!\n● Mar-06: GeneralG, Shadowheart \n● Mar-07: loopdoopoo \n● Mar-08: supergoku3678#8101, wilmergamingYT_TTV \n● Mar-09: Glewable \n● Mar-11: Haadzafar2021, Jolly Jacob \n● Mar-13: Aviator | Avi \n\nWe had 2 new boosters this week they were @ayello and @sunmaster\n\nWe had a rank-up this week!\n@BaySWAT12345 -> Experienced Lumberjack and Merchant\n\nHere is the Wiki fact of the week! It will be about the Ocean Cove.\nIt is considered a cove because of how well it is shielded from the rest of the ocean. This cove, surrounded by a set of smooth walls, the Snow Peninsula, Land Bridge, and the Cliff Peninsula is particularly hidden compared to other biomes of the game. Its circular shape highly suggests that something in the future will occupy this location, but no further predictions can be made about it. \n\nBefore the well-known January Mega Update, there used to be no Tropics Biome or Cliff Peninsula. Due to these geographical features not existing at the time being, the Ocean Cove wasn’t really a cove, but was instead a bay.\nDenim Jacket - White - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/8516612751/\nCollared Leather Jacket - Brown - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/7192547628/\nBusiness Coat - Striped Gray - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/8516648620/\nZip Hoodie - Blue - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/8648389231/\nLeather Jacket - Black - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/7192549218/"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Interview","date":"2022-03-09","author":"@AstronautJaye","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/951152971721343016","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Howdy lumberjacks! Guess who's back? That's right! Me! I made it away from fartsona, but here's a interview including @Awesome Fat Cat | ProAngelus1234! I hope you enjoy reading, and I'll catch you soon! 🪓 @News Ping\n\nHow did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2? [Q]\nI was searching for a good game and i found it aha, i already knew abt it but never tried it! [A]\n\nHow long have you played Lumber Tycoon 2? [Q]\nive been playing since 2017 with some big pauses. [A]\n\nWhat is the biggest/best thing you have built in Lumber Tycoon 2? [Q]\nmy own base, i tried to make it as big as possible, the corners of the base dont even fit on it lol. Its just cubes on top of cubes that in the future ill decorate with a biome theme on each of them [A]\n\nWhat's your favorite memory of Lumber Tycoon 2? [Q]\nIts very recent but the history starts a long time ago, theres a glitch where some items can glitch out under the ground. One sign got stuck on the floor in 2018 and because i couldnt remove it i just buried it. Now in 2022 i found it and it wasnt stuck anymore. Glad that its no longer on the ground [A]\n\nWhat do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games? [Q]\nIts building system, its not like other games where u can just buy everything and place it where u want, in lt2 you need to buy em one by one and try to not loose em. Also the funny things that you can do with tnt [A]\n\nHave you ever sold anything in the Lumber Market? [Q]\nYe, i used to have a garage door business and sometimes i sell wood or axes or just anything that i have in my base lying around doing nothing [A]\n\nWell, see you soon Lumberjacks! I hope fartsona doesn't find me here in the zombie swamp!\n\nInterviewers: @AstronautJaye"},{"number":"18","title":"Interview Wednesday #18","category":"Interview","date":"2022-03-17","author":"@M23 | open DMs :D","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/953823518489972776","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #18**\n\n@News Ping This week we interviewed @Dawn one of our Lead Supervisors.\n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My daughter was building a museum on the Xbox. She asked me if I wanted to come in the game to see it in person. Once there, I decided to try it out. Loved the game from that first day.\n\nQ: How did you find out about the LT2 fan group?\nA: I met Cesar in game one day. After that we would play together once in awhile, and he told me about it. Joined that day.\n\nQ: What is the best and biggest thing you build in LT2?\nA: That's a hard one. I can't say which is the best. I think we all improve our building skills with each base we finish. I am partial to the Forest that I just completed, but my train station is a close second. The train station is close to 20 data.\n\nQ: What was the best moment you had in the fan group or in LT2?\nA: There are so many moments I won't forget in the fan group. The best moment was my first day in the server. Being included in this amazing server. Meeting so many new people through the years, finding so many amazing friends, becoming lead supervisor, karaoke and other events. How do you choose? Every day brings joy and more best moments.\n\nQ: If you could tell Defaultio something to add to LT2, what would it be?\nA: I would ask for black wood, new blueprints such as cylinders, new usable items for building, an increase in data size, and perhaps a safe trading system.\n\nQ: Do you have anything planned to build in LT2?\nA: I am currently starting a new build.\n\nQ: What would you say to people who wants to become supervisors or interns?\nA: Stay active in the server, chat, answer questions that others ask about the game. Let us see your love of the game and your knowledge of it. Come to, and participate in events. Have fun here, while following the rules.\n\nThank you for the interview Dawn!\n\nInterviewer: @M23 | open DMs :D \nEditer: @fartsona"},{"number":"54","title":"#54","category":"Article","date":"2022-03-21","author":"@M23 | intern","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/955271128883023872","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#54**\n\n@News Ping Hello Lumberjacks, welcome to today's lumber news! We have some interesting stuff today!\n\nWe have some upcoming birthdays:\n\n● Mar-15: NotLego#6433, Stef_00012 (Stef#6705)\n● Mar-16: Mr. Rose#2607\n● Mar-18: Dylan (DyIan#2083)\n● Mar-20: HappyGhostrainbowhearttools (PatsLit!#9035)\n● Mar-23: Vanya2018pro (Jllouufep#7335)\n● Mar-24: Locomotorman07 (Ronan2403#4124)\n● Mar-26: Mrswag72 (JoshC#8894)\n● Mar-27: DuckBoiPlayz on YT (Mr. DuckMan#8760)\n\nWe had an new booster this week: @Scorch\n\nSadly we didnt have an rank-up this week.\n\nAnd now an Lumber Tycoon 2 fact about The Land Sign (Sign Wood):\n\nDid you know that you can process the Land Sign to make \"Sign Wood\"? The Sign Wood has the same color as Elm wood, but it is his own wood type! if you try to sell it then you get the same amount of money as if you should sell it unprocessed. Also it has no hardness value and is invincible.\n\nThat was all for today, hope you enjoyed it!\n\nNews: @M23 | intern"},{"number":"55","title":"#55","category":"Article","date":"2022-03-21","author":"@fartsona and @cooleddie001","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/955274302998081598","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#55**\n\n@News Ping Hey Lumberjacks, I hope you had a great week! Here is a new week of news!\n\nWe have some very special birthdays this week!\n● Mar-20: HappyGhost\n● Mar-23: Vanya2018pro\n● Mar-24: Locomotorman07\n● Mar-26: Mrswag72\n● Mar-27: DuckBoiPlayz on YT\n\nWe had one rank-up this week!\n@samwrxd  -> Experienced Lumberjack\n\n**Lumber Games Winners**\n\nRound 1: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\nRound 2: MoldyAustin123456789 (not in discord)\nRound 3: @LOLmadzygotbanned \n\n**Wiki Fact of the Week**\n\nThe sign on the wood dropoff at `Wood ‘R Us` that says \"Collect ticket inside\" on the back of the sign! Its intention, however, remains a mystery.\n\nIf you want to get your base reviewed and be mentioned in Lumber News, please contact a staff member for a base review.\n\nIf you want to be pinged about Lumber News go to <#727326626336997457> and say ?rank News ping. Have a great rest of your day! See you all on Wednesday for this week’s interview!\n\nNews: @fartsona and @cooleddie001"},{"number":"19","title":"Interview Wednesday #19","category":"Interview","date":"2022-03-24","author":"@Extreme_Force1","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/956346572029960192","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #19**\n\n@News Ping Hello fellow lumberjacks! Today we are interviewing @NubC0W!\n\nQ: How did you find out about LT2?\nA: I remember going to the public library and seeing other kids playing it, so I joined the game on a guest account and Thought it was really cool.\n\nQ: How did you find about the LT2 Fan Group?\nA: I had found it through a YouTubers discord invite link for the server and decided to check it out.\n\nQ: What was your best moment in LT2 or LT2 Fan Group?\nI would say it would to be when I regularly attended karaoke back in the day.\nQ: If you could tell Defaultio to add something in LT2, what would it be?\nA: Large quantity buying (like multiple boxed items and they get delivered to your base).\n\nQ: Do you have anything you planned to build in LT2?\nA: I will build something whenever I get inspiration\n\nQ: What would you say to the people who want to be Supervisors or Interns.\nA: I’d try to get along with everyone because it can always come in handy.\n\nQ: What do you like about LT2\nA: The multiple possibilities, the creations are almost endless.\n\nThank you for reading this weeks interview. If you want to be pinged about Lumber News go to <#727326626336997457> and say ?rank News ping\n\nInterviewer: @Extreme_Force1"},{"number":"56","title":"#56","category":"Article","date":"2022-03-28","author":"@InsertBottomText and @Happp83 | Youtuber","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/957834668705730683","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#56**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back lumberjacks to another week of Lumber News! Let's continue!\n\nOur recent and upcoming birthdays:\n● Mar-27: DuckBoiPlayz on YT (Mr. DuckMan#8760)\n● Mar-30: tcmcrcw (bro#5417)\n● Apr-01: Echo † PhØenix †#9043\n● Apr-04: youngblackshark (Lil_T1PO.#3521)\n\nNo new boosts or rank-ups this week.\n\n**Lumber games winners**\n\nBatch 1: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\nBatch 2: @Dragnlte and @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\n\n\n**Wiki fact of the week**\n\nGeck is one of the 4 characters located inside the blue wood maze. In his one line of dialogue, he says, \"I know my boat shop is down here somewhere...\"; however this is a joke and not true. Boats remain as one of the most heavily requested features in the game.\n\n**Roblox Promo Codes**\n\nThere are some Roblox Promo Codes for you to redeem! The first one is “SPIDERCOLA” which when redeemed you will be given a Spider Cola Shoulder Pet. The second code is “TWEETROBLOX” which when redeemed will give you The Bird Says Shoulder Pet. That’s all the recent codes so far, make sure to redeem it before they expire!\n\nThank you for reading, have a good day! Journalist exit!\n\nNews: @InsertBottomText and @Happp83 | Youtuber"},{"number":"57","title":"#57","category":"Article","date":"2022-04-04","author":"@M23 | The tired human","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/960348155629678704","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#57**\n\n@News Ping  Welcome back lumberjacks to a new Lumber News!\n\nWe have some recent and upcoming birthdays!\n● Mar-27: DuckBoiPlayz on YT (Mr. DuckMan#8760)\n● Mar-30: tcmcrcw (bro#5417)\n● Apr-01: Echo † PhØenix †#9043\n● Apr-05: gamer (gamer2910fop#2370), UnknownWesly (Modelo#5029)\n● Apr-06: Riachu10114 (O5-X#9015)\n● Apr-10: JoniNoob65 (Joni65#8283)\n● Apr-11: ineedfriends764 (Spoob#5487)\n● Apr-15: littletimmy0519 (M!#5337)\n\nWe didn't have any new Boosts this week!\n\nWe had one rank-up this week!\n@ElectroTechnologies  -> Elite Lumberjack, Elite Electrician\n\nLumber Games Winners\n\nRound 1: @DevShurikeno \nRound 2: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro \nRound 3: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro \n\nWiki Fact of the Week\nDynamite:\n\nYou can buy Dynamite at Bob's shack for $220 Money. if unpacked you can press \"E\" on it to explode it, it will explode 5 seconds. after you pressed \"E\" you should run! because the Dynamite can damage you or even kill you! Dynamite is used to clear the path for a player or to cut wood fast. \n\nRoblox's New  Free items\nAn new item called \"Dessert Plate Hat\" is now available! you can only get it until May 1st so grab it while you can!\n\nNotes\nIf you want to get your base reviewed and be mentioned in Lumber News, please contact a Supervisor or Supervisor Intern for a base review.\n\nIf you want to be pinged about Lumber News go to bot-commands and say ?rank News ping. \n\nNews: @M23 | The tired human"},{"number":"20","title":"Interview Wednesday #20","category":"Interview","date":"2022-04-07","author":"@cooleddie001","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/961418008922845224","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #20**\n\n@News PingHowdy Lumberjacks! This week we will be interviewing@KetchupKevvy !\n\nQ - What made you interested in LT2?\nA - Trading and building bases\n\nQ - How did you find out about the LT2 Fan Group Discord?\nA - When I get interested in any game, I will always find its discord to interact and maybe learn more\n\nQ - What is your favorite moment in the LT2 community so far?\nA - I have many memories in this server and everyday is a great moment in this server but I will say movie night was the best.\n\nQ - What, in your opinion, is the best thing you built-in LT2?\nA - I haven't build much in LT2, but probably my base.\n\nQ - Is there any specific feature you want to be added to LT2?\nA - Well LT2 is almost perfect but I would say Defaultio should add another type of tree that is harder to get.\n\nQ - How long have you been playing LT2?\nA - I've been playing it with my friends since 2019!\n\nQ - What is your favorite item in LT2 and why?\nA - In my opinion the best item in LT2 is the many axe, it has good damage and good range only bad thing in it is its cooldown\n\n**__Notes:__**\nIf you want   to be pinged about   Lumber News go to <#727326626336997457>   and   say ?rank News ping. \n\nIf you can think of a better name than Interview Wednesday than please dm @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona for suggestions!\n\nInterviewer: @cooleddie001"},{"number":"58","title":"#58","category":"Article","date":"2022-04-11","author":"@InsertBottomText @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/962901839446151229","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#58**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to this Sunday’s news! Lets see what the land of lumber has to offer!\n\nHere are this week’s birthdays:\n\n● Apr-10: @JoniNoob65 \n● Apr-11: @ineedfriends764 \n ● Apr-15: @littletimmy0519 \n\nWe had two new boosters:@Avi | Emotional Support Floof  and @commandobot3  .\n\nNo recent rank-ups.\n\n[Lumber games results were not logged at the time of making] \n\nSpeaking of lumber games, today is the 3rd annual Ultimate Lumber Games, where Lumber Games champions will fight; the one and only winner will be awarded with the prestigious Ultimate Lumber Games role! Good luck to those attending!\n\nWiki fact of the week: Land Store History\n\nYes! – It's the Land Store, colloquially the Land Store, is a store located beside the Wood R Us store, within the Main Biome. It is the only store that sells Land plots and is supposedly owned by Ruhven. \n\nThe store was not the same as it is now when it was added; it had a grey, marble name plate with dull, bold-lettered text, but still keeping the original store name. The glass was not tinted blue, and it had brown, wooden chairs inside, with each wall having five chairs. Ruhven, however, did not change. On the 22nd of July, 2019 the wooden chairs were added back, this time using the same model as the buildable Mundane Chair, with only three on each wall. \n\nThank you for reading!\n\nNotes\nIf you want to get your base reviewed and be mentioned in Lumber News, please contact a Supervisor or Supervisor Intern for a base review.\n\nIf you want to be pinged about Lumber News go to bot-commands and say              ? rank News ping. \n\nApplications are still open! They end at 11:59 PDT! (about 5 - 6 hours from now)\n\nNews: @InsertBottomText    @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona"},{"number":"59","title":"#59","category":"Article","date":"2022-04-18","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/965464357741924372","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#59**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back lumberjacks from far and wide! Today, I will be taking over this week’s news.\n\n🥳 We have had two birthdays this week, let us all wish them a happy birthday!\n● April-14: \n● April-17: @Jantzen\n\nWe have also promoted two new members to the journalist team! I would like to ask that we all congratulate @Bacon and @ScottTheMerchant for becoming our newest members.\n\n**Lumber Games Winner:**\n\nRound 1: @Smart :)\n\n**Wiki Fact of the Week:**\n\nThis week, I will let you all know about Jenny. Jenny is seen as a cashier at the Boxed Cars store. She is the NPC players go to if they want to buy vehicles or trailers. The experience at the Boxed Cars store would simply be incomplete without the contribution of Jenny.\n\nThanks for reading!\n\nWe had a member who received a rank-up this week!\n@marty6254 -> Experienced Lumberjack\n\nThanks for reading today’s news!\n\nNews: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"21","title":"Interviews Wednesday #21","category":"Interview","date":"2022-04-20","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/966456625789534220","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interviews Wednesday #21**\n\n@News Ping Hello fellow lumberjacks and welcome to another week of Lumber News! Today we are interviewing @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro , a lumber games champion! \n\nHow did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nI found it on the front page back in 2016, I joined, and I really enjoyed it.\n\nWhy do you play Lumber Tycoon 2/ What makes it special?\nI play it, because of how it's like a tycoon, but different from all of the other tycoons, and I generally collect LT2 items, and I think it's fun trying to get a certain type of item/item.\n\nHow long have you been playing it?\nLike I said, I have been playing it since 2016, however I quit in 2017. (If I remember correctly, it was because I was tired of sometimes dying in the volcano when I'd try to get red wood.) And I opted for LT2 copies with lots of money, and I came back in September 2020.\n\nWhat is your favourite memory of Lumber Tycoon 2?\nI don't exactly have a favourite memory, however, one of the best ones, is when I finished helping build some guy's base, and in return I finally got the rusty axe present (and by extention, the box) and I was able to finish my all axes and their box, sometimes present collection.\n\nIf you wanted to add, delete or fix something in the game, what would it be?\nI'd personally would add in like a battery (with a button), that would be small, but would could be put on to an end/start of a colour wire, so that you wouldn't need extra wire to connect it to a button/switch."},{"number":"60","title":"#60","category":"Article","date":"2022-04-25","author":"@wall_watcher99999 and @British text","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/967938399438790746","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#60**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to our 60th Lumber News!\n\nSome interesting events occurred during the past week. To start off, the event committee has decided to extend the build contest. Votes for the build contest will close on the 26th, so keep track of the announcements! Another fascinating part about the past week was that last Sunday, during the 17th of April, it was Easter. But, did you know that the Easter Bunny came to the United States in the late 1700s? We certainly did not until today.\n\nOf course, our favorite news for this week was the new category addition to the server. This was a recently added category for LG fans to talk about the games and be given updates.\n\n**Boosts**\n\nThank you @rocket for boosting!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\n🥳 These members have had a birthday this week, so let’s all wish them a happy birthday!\nApril-18: @szczerbatek122\nApril-20: @Pharmacy ꙰\nApril-21: @busterboy4970\nApril-22: @TRUEMAVERICK10\nApril-22: @NevylKJLplayz\nApril-23: @KeyCrayfish666\nApril-23: @Wwechampionman\n\n**Lumber Games Winners**\n\nWinner of this week’s lumber games: @DevShurchickeno"},{"number":"22","title":"Interview Wednesday 22","category":"Interview","date":"2022-04-27","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/968980246281990154","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday 22**\n\n@News Ping Hello Lumberjacks! Today we interviewed @Scorch !\n\nQ: What would you say attracted you to the server?\nA: I was looking for a community to chat with people and trade with other LT2 players.\n\nQ: How long have you been playing lumber tycoon 2 for?\nA: I started playing it in 2018 and still play it nowadays.\n\nQ: What was your most memorable moment in the game?\nA: My unforgettable moment in lumber tycoon was my first time getting a many axe gifted from someone, friends told me its the best axe in the game so I was really happy to start chopping woods with it.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to new players of the game?\nA: Personally, I would recommend them to explore the map, getting different woods, buying items from players and build their dreams.\n\nQ: What do you think is something that the owner of LT2 should add?\nA: Honestly, I would like the anti-cheat to be updated, and of course, I want to meet less exploiters.\n\nQ: What future builds are you planning to build in the game?\nA: Probably a house, surrounded with walls.\n\nQ: What was your most memorable moment in the server?\nA: My most memorable moment in the server was saying \"hi\" in chat when I just joined the group, also reading its info and allied servers.\n\nInterviewer: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"61","title":"#61","category":"Article","date":"2022-05-02","author":"@M23 | Mr. logic man | Mr. logic man","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/970795140341968896","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#61**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to todays lumber news!\n\n**__Recent and upcoming birthdays:__**\n\n● Apr-25: Scorch (@Scorch)\n● Apr-26: British text (@British text), Smazttrident (@Smazt#1111)\n● Apr-27: ChasetheSavage360 (@Chase#2249), LORD FOOG the 2nd (Tryblox) (LORD FOOG THE 2nd (@TrybloX)#3579)\n● Apr-29: Boop Wolf (@wolfbloxer06#3130)\n● May-01: carlospug123 (@crackhead#7734)\n● May-02: lotosaed (@(2R-45) lotosaed#0410)\n● May-04: Abigmasivecudleybear (@Jakehboi#0088)\n● May-05: adam768adam#3033, Panda (@chris. 2825 5027 7956#9132), scpsoldierunit (@LonLon#5688)\n● May-06: eric_liau (@𝐸𝓇𝒾𝒸#8632), longingstingi (@Data#1977)\n● May-07: Hungrypartymaster11 (@spaghetti#2958)\n● May-09: Jenny000044 (@ℂ𝕠𝕞𝕖𝕥#5299), @void#5451\n● May-11: @Dawn, feedmehotdogs (@do you are have stupid#2807)\n● May-12: SuperBigMen (@JigsawLer#9004)\n● May-13: 4jGreekgamer (@4jGreek#3020), @Danial#4808, @Warp#8703\n● May-14: StateOmnia (@avc#7478)\n● May-15: (SpookyTt) (@SpookyTt#6386)\n● May-16: BraedenMichaelWitter (@ACAN#6548), ScottTheMerchant (@ScottTheMerchant)\n\n**__Lumbergames winners:__**\n\nRound 1: Henny04\nRound 2: fl1pzyy\nRound 3: trolly_face4000\n\nNo boosts this week.\n\n**__Rank-ups:__**\n\n@WilliamDelrado > Elite lumberjack\n @jailbreakking6758 𝓶𝓪𝓵𝓵 𝓣𝓪𝓼𝓽𝔂#1969 > Experienced Lumberjack\n\n**__events__**\nThe build competition has now ended! You can now vote in <#679042272704069704> for you favorite build! You have until the 8th to vote.\n\n**__affiliated/allied group events__**\n\nThe lumber shack had its first **lumber car wars** match. Here is a samll comment from @IIAdapter how it went: \"It was very fun, very interesting. First off we did have a few bugs that did occur, which is normal when releasing a game. The rounds were very smooth, with some complications on how to play the game, as to a few things I forgot to add. Overall the game went very good, and we ended up getting more suggestions for the game that could make it awesome.\"\n\n**__notes__**\nif you want your base reviewed and be mentioned in Lumber News, please contact a Supervisor or Supervisor intern for a base review.\n\nif you want to be pinged about Lumber News, go to <#727326626336997457> and say: ?rank News ping. \n\nNews: @M23 | Mr. logic man | Mr. logic man"},{"number":"23","title":"Interview Wednesday 23","category":"Interview","date":"2022-05-06","author":"@Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/971955923109171272","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday 23**\n\n@News Ping Hello and welcome to this weeks Lumber Interview! This week we are interviewing @IIAdapter \n\nQ: How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2 for?\nA: I been playing Lumber Tycoon 2 since about 2016.\n\nQ: What was your most memorable moment in the server?\nA: My most memorable moment in Lumber Tycoon 2 was when I first found out that there was more than 4 axes in the game. One guy gave me 10mil and a many axe. From there I got scammed many times, so therefore, I started to to actually make memories. The best memory I have is when I met 5431gators, (The Shack Co-Owner), I found him in a public sever and asked him to build me a wood sorter. From there we became good friends and then added each other on discord. |\n     The best memories i have in the fan group is the karaoke, and the amazing people I have met. The amount of people that i have met that have given me a chance to become a bigger part of the fan group, and believed in me.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to new players of the game?\nA: The best advice I could give to the new players of the game is to grind. Now i know many people will say that you dont need to grind, but if you play solo, and you grind anything is possible. The best thing to is not buy items right away, sell wood to other players first to buy other things. Secondly I would recommend not buying the other items in wood r us, i would save for the silver axe so that you can earn money faster.\n\nQ: What should Defaultio add to LT2 or LT3 if he ever does a update?\nA: I personally dont think he should make an LT3, I think that he should work on LT2 code. If he were to add something I think he should add corner wedges, and or add more shops. I think that he should also add a bigger truck for those that like to grind a lot of wood.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: The overall ability to build anything. It's not like one of those dumb tycoon games where you stand around and wait for the money to generate. I think that lt2 is special because you have to grind to get anything done in the game. You have to grind the woods to be able to get land to be able to build.\n\nQ: If you lost interest in LT2, what would you do? Would you play a different game? Or will you always play LT2?\nA: I personally don't see myself losing interest in the game, basically as I stated above the abilitys are endless. Sometimes I build up a base and then delete it anyways, and then later on I will build up another base. I will pretty much always plays lt2\n\nQ: What is your favorite item in LT2 and why?\nA: My most favorite item on lt2 is the duck. This is my favorite item because it was the first item I ever bought and I love ducks! I bought my first duck for 3m. Still have him in a frame to this day.\n\nQ: What is the biggest thing you built in LT2?\nA: The biggest and best think I have ever built was my “city” that my friend and I have made, it’s a data 8 base, and has been signed by 2 big youtubers. I have also made a huge alarm system on that base for those that enter when it’s activated.\n\nIf you got this far, ping @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona !\n\nInterviewer: @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona"},{"number":"62","title":"#62","category":"Article","date":"2022-05-08","author":"@British text, @wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/972968932958961824","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#62**\n\n@News Ping Bonjour everybody, welcome back to this week’s Sunday news! Have you been chopping trees in the world of lumber? I hope so! Let us continue!\n\nOur favorite news for this week is that the winners of the build contest have been announced! Congrats to @rocket for being first place! We would also like to congratulate @cesargeronimo, @MrSmart, and @legobuildermaster12 for being in the top 3!\n\n**Recent birthdays:**\n\n● May-03: @Abigmasivecudleybear\n● May-04: @adam768adam \n● May-04: @scpsoldierunit\n● May-05: @Panda\n● May-05: @eric_liau\n● May-05:@longingstingi\n● May-06: @Hungrypartymaster11\n\n**Lumber Games winners**\n\nRound 1-2: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\nRound 3: @Dragnlte\nRound 4: @Orithian\n\nNo rank ups this week.\n\n**Boosts**\n\nThank you @Coffee (Bias Jimin) ❤ for boosting!\n\n**Affiliated-allied server events**\n\nA new build competition is being held between two of our affiliated/allied servers, The Lumber Shack and LT2 Chat Discord! The theme is **summer camp**. It ends May 23, so get your axes sharpened and get building! See full announcement and rules in <#764355525101486110>.\n\n**Wiki fact of the week**\n\nThe End Times Axe is a black with a few purple spots on its head. To acquire this axe, you need to wait until October 31st. To make this axe, you need to buy these following items: A bag of sand, a lightbulb, and a can of worms. You then head to the Taiga, also called the snow biome, and create the axe inside of the hidden hatch. The swing cooldown on this axe is 0.3 seconds, so you can carry this axe around knowing that it has got your back! \n\nHave any suggestions? DM one of our journalists and we will help.\n\nAs always, stay safe and make sure to have a morning/night/rest of your day!\n\nNews: @British text, @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"24","title":"Interview Wednesday 24","category":"Interview","date":"2022-05-12","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/974115340143444089","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday 24** \n\n@News Ping Welcome to yet to another Wednesday lumber news interview! This week, we would like to honor our interview with @cedrikwood3.\n\nQ: What would you say attracted you to the fan group discord?\nA: What attracted me to the fan group discord was seeing it on the Roblox page but what made me stay was how friendly everyone is there.\n\nQ: How long have you been playing the lumber tycoon 2 game?\nA: A little over 4 years now. \n\nQ: What was your most memorable moment throughout that entire experience?\nA: How fun it is building, gathering and chopping down. But the most memorable is how many people I have met throughout the experience who were nice and super friendly.\n\nQ: What was your largest build in the game?\nA: I would say my 3 floor hive at the top of my slot.\n\nQ: What attracted you to the lumber tycoon 2 fan server?\nA: What attracted me to the lumber tycoon 2 fan server was the possibility of earning ranks and being able to have fun while getting the ranks has been what attracted me to the lumber tycoon 2 fan server when I joined.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to people who are new to the game?\nA: When you have a dream on what to build, never let that dream go. Build your dream and never give up.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes lumber tycoon 2 different from other games?\nA: I believe what makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different from other games is it’s attention to detail and design. You can create anything you want. And I feel that none of the other games have this aspect.\n\nQ: What motivated you to become a carpenter specialist?\nA: What motivated me to become a carpenter specialist was my dedication to become an elite lumberjack but it was mostly my hard work and the time I put in to get this far.\n\nInterviewer: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"63","title":"#63","category":"Article","date":"2022-05-16","author":"@British text, @wall_watcher99999 @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/975583927265812521","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#63**\n\n@News Ping  Howdy y'all! How has your week been? Hopefully it has been good!\n\nThere has been interesting news this week circulating around the lumber community. That news is the new server icon! The server icon was changed to a bluish color to commemorate the birthday of discord on the 13th.\n\nThis week, @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona  was promoted to assistant manager.\nThis week, @MMMMMMMMMMMMM23 | Mr. logic man  was promoted to Journalist.\nThis week, @Happp83 | Youtuber  retired, wish him farewell.\n\n**This week’s brilliant birthdays** 🎉\n\n● May-9: @Jenny000044  , @void\n● May-11: @Dawn , @feedmehotdogs \n● May-12: @SuperBigMen \n● May-13: @4jGreekgamer , @Danial , @Warp \n● May-14: @StateOmnia\n● May-15: @(SpookyTt), @Soviet_Fox55\n\n**Lumber Games winners**\n\nRound 1 practice: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\nRound 2 practice: @Orithian\nRound 3 practice: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\nRound 4 official: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nCongrats to @LogicalHorizons for ranking up to experienced journalist!\n\n**Boosts**\n\nThank you @Koi for boosting!\n\n**Wiki Fact of the Week**\n\nThe Lone Cave, also known as the End Times Biome, Abyss, or the Void, is a semi-biome cave consisting of a gray-slated walkway. This place is well-known by players because this is where players can chop and gather Phantom Wood.\n\nThank you for reading!\n\n**News from the Journalist Team**\n\nWe would like to thank @Happp83 | Youtuber for everything that he has done for the journalist team. This is because he has retired. If you didn’t already know, he has been a member of the journalism team here for over a year!\n\nI’d like to thank you for reaching the end of this week’s news! If you have any suggestions for next week’s news, email a journalist and we will consider your recommendation. \n\nNews: @British text, @wall_watcher99999 @Dawn's Supervisor | fartsona"},{"number":"25","title":"Interview Wednesday 25","category":"Interview","date":"2022-05-19","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/976991260290187334","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday 25**\n\n@News Ping Sorry for the 1-day delay. This week, we have interviewed @MrSmart, one of our supervisors. So without further ado, let's begin!\n\nQ: What attracted you to the lumber tycoon 2 fan group?\nA: One of my friends played it and I joined them.\n\nQ: What inspired you to become a supervisor on the fan group?\nA: I wanted to be an intern because I thought I would be a good fit/addition to the staff team.\n\nQ: How long have you been playing lumber tycoon 2?\nA: I started just after the 2020 Halloween update\n\nQ: What advice would you give to new players playing lumber tycoon 2?\nA: Keep grinding and build your dreams and DON'T exploit.\n\nQ: What are your future goals for the game?\nA: I am work on a project right now which is is gonna be my best build yet, I think.\n\nQ: If given the opportunity, what new type of biome would you add to the game?\nA: I suggested to Cesar a \"radiation biome\" where you have some light green bark and when you cut it you get neon green (like the blue wood but green)\n\nQ: What is your favorite part about lumber tycoon 2?\nA: My favorite part of lt2 is building cause you can build almost anything.\n\nQ: Who is your favorite character in the lumber tycoon 2 game?\nA: I would say the guy saying the boat stuff in the cave cause I always wanted boats.\n\nInterviewer: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"64","title":"#64","category":"Article","date":"2022-05-24","author":"@British text","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/978679549376200704","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#64**\n\n@News Ping Hello fellow lumberjacks! Here is this ~~Sunday’s~~ Tuesday’s news! Let’s see what’s happened this week!\n\nHere are the birthdays for this week:\nMay-16: @BraedenMichaelWitter , @Meno_Kowa , @ScottTheMerchant \nMay-17: @Zephyn (they/them)\nMay-18: @aloshua , @SupBoy2022\nMay-19: @Azchick , @Berryman (Holy watah) , @n3ls0nXx\nMay-20: @Defendion , @Foxy , @RG_gamerpros\nMay-21: @XxCOMMANDOARMYXx5\nMay-22: @trolololasYT \n\nNo boosts this week.\n\n**Rank-ups**\n\nCongrats to @Meno_Kowa and @dayyyzz for both achieving Carpenter Specialist and @Meno_Kowa for also achieving Electrician!\n\n**Affiliated-allied server events**\n\nThe Lumber Shack is proud to announce their addition of the Unbelievaboat bot and therefore its channel and giveaway role to the server. Have fun and compete against other players in this game where you can fight chickens, play cards and risk it all! See #work-chat in The Shack for commands, how to play and more info.\n\n**Wiki Fact of the Week: Bob’s Shack**\n\nBob's Shack is a small shack located around the Safari cliffsides, and is located a distance behind Fancy Furnishings. The store is open at all times and is managed and owned by Bob. It sells unique and limited-time items always at a low price (except for the Preserved Enlarged Ostrich Eye), such as pumpkins or presents during events that are hosted within the game, as well as some items necessary to obtain the Rukiryaxe or End Times Axe.\n\nSorry for the late news people, the journalist team have been very busy lately. See you next week!\n\nNews: @British text"},{"number":"26","title":"Interview Wednesday 26","category":"Interview","date":"2022-05-26","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/979193485615829062","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday 26**\n@News Ping Welcome everybody to yet another interview Wednesdays! This week, we interviewed @Coffee (Bias Jimin) ❤.\n\nQ: What would you say is your favorite part about the game?\nA: Tbh I miss the way where we’d didn’t have to play on vips where we’d help everyone out and do our best.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to new players of the game?\nA: It may seem pretty boring and pretty grinding at the start but give it a chance cause I did and I fell in love with it and made some amazing friends with the game.\n\nQ: What has caused you to become an active member on the server?\nA: On the server probably the karaoke nights cause I have so much fun hanging out with my friends and new people who stop by it honestly my favorite time of the week.\n\nQ: If you had the ability, what new biome would you add to the game?\nA: Honestly idk for me the game is fine how it is.\n\nQ: What are your future plans for builds in the game?\nA: Well I started this beach style house and one day I’m going to finish it. I have a great idea for what it’ll look like.\n\nQ: What would you say is the best tree in the game?\nA: The Phantom tree because it’s so hard and unique to get back yes it can be a pain in the butt but with some good friends of my. I had a blast yes even tho we lost most of the tree it was still fun.\n\nQ: Was there a moment in lumber tycoon 2 where you were surprised of its endless possibilities?\nA: Yes when I first started watching videos on it.\n\nQ: Who is your favorite lumber tycoon 2 youtuber?\nA: Um probably CodePrime8 he’s the one that got me attached to the game so much.\n\nInterviewer: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"65","title":"#65","category":"Article","date":"2022-05-29","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/980503889415634966","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#65**\n\n@News Ping Hello lumberjacks, and welcome to todays news! Hope you enjoy it!\n\n**__Birthdays for this week:__**\n\n● May-29: @Boo | Voided_Jeffo, @boomboomboy67452321, @Jokujoku5\n● May-30: @Typical the Protogen\n● May-31: @Happp83 | Youtuber\n● Jun-02: @Speedy, @xranoxxd\n● Jun-03: @Treker38\n● Jun-04: @BanGoodLuc BEST MAN\n● Jun-05: @natez200\n\nNo new  boosts this week.\n\n**__Lumber Games winners__**\n\nBatch 2:\n\nRound 1 Offical: DevShurikeno\nRound 2 Offical: YouTube_Ging\nRound 3 practice: YouTube_Ging\n\n**__Rank-Ups__**\n\n@iiCaptivity > Electrician\n@benz9410 > Carpenter specialist\n@Meno_Kowa > Elite Electrician\n\n**__Free Roblox Item__**\n\nRoblox released a new free hat. its only for sale for a limited time, so get it while you can!! **__No longer on sale__**\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/9723896690/SOFI-TUKKER-Purple-Hat?rbxp=48103520\n\n**__Affiliated-allied server events__**\n\nThe Lumber Chat Discord has extend the Summer Camp Build Competition to **June 5th at 11:59pm EST**! so if you want to enter or to complete you build for the build comp, then now its you time!\n\n**__Staff Promotion__** \n\nOur fellow Intern @BAM Smart got Promoted to **Supervisor**! \n\n**__Notes__**\nif you want your base reviewed and be mentioned in Lumber News, please contact a Supervisor or Supervisor intern for a base review.\n\nif you want to be pinged about Lumber News, go to <#727326626336997457> and say: ?rank News ping. \n\n**News:** @M23 | Mr. logic man\nSOFI TUKKER Purple Hat - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/9723896690/SOFI-TUKKER-Purple-Hat?rbxp=48103520"},{"number":"66","title":"#66","category":"Article","date":"2022-06-05","author":"@Bacon , @BottomText","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/983125367277645915","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#66**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back everybody to another Lumber News! Let's get straight into it and see what has happened in the beautiful world of Lumber this week!\n\n**Birthdays for this week:**\n\n● May-30: @Typical the Protogen\n● May-31: @Happp83 | Youtuber\n● Jun-02: @Speedy and @xranoxxd\n● Jun-03: @Treker38\n● Jun-04:@BanGoodLuc BEST MAN \n● Jun-05: @natez200\n\n**Boosts:**\n\nHuge thanks to @Foxy - XBOX , @Boo | Voided_Jeffo and @AussieGamingYT for boosting the server this week!\n\n**Lumber Games Winners:**\n\n[Batch one was not held]\n\nBatch two:\n\nRound 1 : Henny04 (Official round)\n\n**Rank-ups:**\n\nNo rank-ups this week.\n\n**Affiliated-allied server events:**\n\nOur wonderful friends down at Lumber Shack have upgraded their Booster Perks, so why not and go give them a boost? You get a surplus of things from boosting their server, such as your very own emoji, of your ROBLOX character, a special V.I.P chat for boosters only, Booster role, 3 hours of streaming, and 65,000 coins every 12 hours with UnbelievaBoat! \n\n**Wiki Fact of the Week: The Swamp**\n\nThe Swamp is a mini-biome found between the Mountainside and the Safari. Gold Wood and Zombie Wood are exclusive to this area, and other areas such as the Swamp Cavern and Swamp Rock can be found around the area. It mostly consists of brownish grass and a shallow creek that passes through it that notably does not deal damage to a player when touched. It has particles that make it hard for the player to see in the swamp. The Swamp was added on August 28, 2015.\n\n**Notes:**\n\nAs you may have noticed, many discord servers have changed their server profile picture to have a rainbow in them. This is because this month it’s Pride Month! Happy pride month to all!\n\n If you want to participate in an interview for our next up and coming Lumber Interview, please direct message a fellow Lumber Journalist! We hold these every Wednesday, so get to messaging!\n\nWe all hope that you have enjoyed this week of Lumber News, see you next week, bye!\n\nNews: @Bacon , @BottomText"},{"number":"27","title":"Interview Wednesday 27","category":"Interview","date":"2022-06-08","author":"@M23 | Soup since 07/06/2022","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/984235592537763881","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday 27**\n\n@News Ping  Hello lumberjacks! and welcome to a new Interview Wednesday! This week we interviewed @Boo | Voided_Jeffo \n\nQ: When did you start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I started playing during 2017 I believe \n\nQ: What makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different from other Tycoon games, in your opinion?\nA: I believe that Lumber Tycoon 2 is different from other tycoon games as you are given the ability to build what structure you wish from the variety of wood there are unlike other tycoon games where you are given a plot and need to earn money and then build what you have unlike lumber tycoon 2 there are infinite amount of things you may build. \n\nQ: What is in your opinion your best slot/base in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I'd say my best base on lumber tycoon 2 is my base where I build the 4 seasons and then between the four seasons just one big tree that could be a tree house but as I've lost motivation it's just dirt walls and grass on top, but someday I'll eventually finish it \n\nQ: What are your future goals for the game?\nA: I'd say probably get this 4 seasons base finished before i start off a new plot that is entirely different \n\nQ: If you could add 1 item to the game, what would it be?\nA: I would add a dart board with the darts already on the board itself for decoration \n\nQ: Do you like being in the Lumber Tycoon 2 fan group discord, and why?\nA: I enjoy being inside of the fan group discord as it has a community that is active during specific times which gives some people such as myself to just be able to talk freely within the current topic  and lets not forget you also make new friends! \n\nQ: What is your favorite content creator who makes Lumber Tycoon 2 content? (If you have one)\nA: ImaFlyNmidget\n\nHope you have a good one. Cya\n\nInterviewer: @M23 | Soup since 07/06/2022"},{"number":"67","title":"#67","category":"Article","date":"2022-06-12","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/985611190543741098","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#67**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back adventurers of lumber to yet another week of Lumber News! There are some interesting events on lumber I would like to share with you today.\n\nTo start off, yes, 4 new supervisor interns have been added to the world of lumber! These 4 interns are @KwatKing, @MrCoffeeBean2422🥰, @rocket, and @Scorch. We here on the lumber journalist team hope them the best, and would like to thank them for their commitment to the server. \n\nYet another piece of groundbreaking news is that applications for the event committee were opened on the 10th of June. If you’re interested in being a part of the team that organizes and plans events, make sure to apply. \n\nTo add on to these lumber news, applications for DDOL were closed. Keep watch of the announcements to find out who will be the new members of the team!\n\nLate in the week of June 6th, Cesar announced the addition of a Lumbergames discord server made by Rudolf. Make sure to join the server if you’re interested!\n\n**Allied Server Events**\n\nNew interns to the security team were announced in The Lumber Shack! These new interns are @Scorch, @MrCoffeeBean2422🥰, and @Smart. If you get the chance, make sure to thank them for their determination to become a part of the team! \n\n🎉 **Birthdays**\n\nWe have celebrated some big birthdays this past week. These special birthdays are from:\n● Jun-06: @omar_1983223, @SixIsAlso9\n● Jun-07: @LT2nutter!\n● Jun-09: @whoisaw\n● Jun-10: @Mark, @Grammi\n● Jun-12: @bri😻🍊\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nLet’s all appreciate the hard work of these members who have ranked up this last week!\n@ImperiousDelta -> Carpenter Specialist\n@hospitalcentre123 | Risky Shop -> Lumberjacks Merchant\n** **"},{"number":"28","title":"Interview Wednesday 28","category":"Interview","date":"2022-06-22","author":"@BottomText","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/989241245756977245","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday 28**\n\n@News Ping  Hello lumberjacks! Welcome back to a new Wednesday interview! Today we interviewed @The god Himself LawrenceJared  \n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2?\nA: I found LT2 about 3-5yr ago when i saw some friends playing it and i was like \"oh i should see what this game is\". \n\nQ: How and when did you find out about the LT2 Discord?\nA: I think i found it from just going onto the Roblox group page and joining there. \n\nQ: What is your current biggest build? \nA: My current biggest build is my chop saw and wood sorter that is being worked on then it will be hopefully a big shop. \n\nQ: If you could add a new biome and tree to the game, what would it be?\nA: I would add a Jungle biome that has Jungle trees, and new trucks as well as axes.\n\nQ: What's your favorite item in LT2?\nA: Right now i think it is the many axe because it chops wood very fast and is overall a very good axe.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to new players of LT2?\nA: What i would tell newer players is to try and avoid public servers do to exploiters, then say try and save up for a car, axes, and sawmills.\n\nNotes: We will be announcing the new journalists Sunday!\nInterviewer: @BottomText"},{"number":"68","title":"#68","category":"Article","date":"2022-06-27","author":"@BottomText, @fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/990775079057129564","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#68**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to our 68th Lumber News article! We have had a rather eventful week, so without wasting any more time, let’s get into it! @News Ping \n\nFirstly, we would like to congratulate @fartsona, @Distracted, @ImperiousDelta, and @Cr4zyCh4rlie for being accepted into the event committee team! 👏\n\nWe would also like to welcome @Azchick back from retirement. It’s a pleasure to have her as a supervisor again after all this time and we all thank you for the dedication you have decided to put in to rejoin the staff.\n\nAnother thing that has to be mentioned is that Defaultio has updated LT2 - yes, the game we all know and love - twice. Most of these updates are bug fixes (such as fixing anchored boxed tires and allowing xbox players to save to a new slot), though he has added a new way to get to the snowglow trees: by detonating a rock in the swamp. This opens a small hole in the ground which you can jump through, making what I would call an important two updates. Here is the full list what was added:\n\n- Various exploit patches\n- Loading prompt breaking (unable to hit confirm/cancel)\n- Fair sawmill text/rotation\n- The colorless patch of grass during end times\n- Safari roads (now called road instead of read) [yw spook hunters]\n- Map imperfections (missing rocks and small safari hole)\n- Weird axe images\n- Broken interaction prompts\n- Broken/bad thumbnails\n- Pine/fir leaves not dying correctly\n- Ice cube's hitbox was not melting\n- Wires not working (fix from earlier update)\n- Various exploit patches\n- Axe decals in toolbox\n- Debug data in the bottom left corner\n- Bowl gift texture fix\n- Tropics dock has ladder again\n- Wood R Us music in the corner of the store is fixed\n- Quackwart sound fixed :Duck:\n- Plots moved to not intercept with ground\n- More broken/bad thumbnails fixed\n- Killer seats bug readded and removed\n- Worklights were anchored and then not\n- Vehicle respawn labels fixed\n- Boxed Bollily Wollolily decal fixed\n- Spork interaction is correct\n- Light display in Fancy Furnishings works\nCredits: @ElectroTechnologies \n\n**Birthdays**\n\n• June-13: @Anonymous11209_new , @john712325_new \n• June-14: @Bobby , @cheetahcatgaming55yt , @MushyDarkStar2 , @SmashFocus\n• June-16: @cedrikwood3 , @stefanec101\n• June-17: @Luna\n• June-18: @Bobby , Apollo (our Fan Group pet!)\n• June-19: @devout22 , @DevShurikeno\n• June-22:  @BackyardDino , @Juan_manuel93\n• June-23: @InsaneMika\n• June-24: @FireBlaze_309 \n• June-25: @Ganker25 , @Hunter\n \n**Lumber Games Winners**\n\nRound 1 official: GingWun\nRound 2 practice: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\n\n**Rank-ups** \n\nWell done to those who ranked up!\n@funboy911124 -> Experienced Lumberjack, Lumberjack Merchant\n@InsaneMika -> Experienced Lumberjack\n@Paranoid_GUI -> Experienced Lumberjack\n\n**Boosts**\n\nLet’s appreciate how @DevShurikeno and @zoviuc have put money into boosting this server!\n\n**Wiki Fact of The Week**\n\nIf you’re an LT2 veteran, you would know that one of the three places in the Blue Wood Maze is the Fine Arts Shop, a shop with yellow-ish cobblestone flooring and standard white brick walls. This shop sells fine paintings (as the name says) such as The Lonely Giraffe, Pineapple and Arctic Light to name a few. It is owned by Timothy. \n\n**Wiki Exploit Script/Bug reporting**\n\nYou can now report bugs or exploits in the wiki discord. Wiki Discord is found in <#349665496817467392>! \nCredits: @ElectroTechnologies \n\nPhew! That was long! \n\nWe hope you enjoyed this week’s news!\n\nWe accepted @IIAdapter, @ramhorn3, and @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro to the Lumber Journalist Team!\n\nNews: @BottomText, @fartsona"},{"number":"69","title":"#69","category":"Article","date":"2022-07-04","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/993369666628112386","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#69**\n\n@News Ping Woah, we made it to our 69th weekly lumber news! If you are a new reader of the news, I would like to welcome you because there is some interesting information that is to be shared! \n\nThe most surprising part about the past week is the sheer amount of updates that have been added to the game! From axe icons, to faster logic speed, to a ton of glitch patches, I would say that this was update week! Not only has Defaultio added hold to chop, but he has also patched additional exploits. But believe it or not, this only covers the tip of the iceberg! I would think that the only thing we can do at this point is appreciate the marvel that is these updates.\n\nBut there were some people who got banned from the game as a result of high net worth and max land. For more information, make sure to go over to the announcements channel. But as of yet, most high net worth bans have been reversed. Of course, Defaultio has also made a revert this past week for bases that have been wiped. Check the pastebin in the announcements channel if you would like to know whether or not your username is on that list. If your base was wiped and you need to fill out the revert form, make sure to go to this link to submit it: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdXrFk8QGuHbN5IcPsm4qDgADnKOT5RerwZqvBXKfCMInlZKg/viewform. If you or someone is still facing either the ML or HN ban code, please remain patient and read the announcements channel for more information and updates from the game.\n\n**Allied Server Events**\n\nAn allied server, The Lumber Shack, has come out with more applications for their news team! The applications close on the 7th, so if you would like to be a part of it, be sure to head on over to The Lumber Shack and apply! We here at the journalist team of this server are certainly interested in seeing who will be selected."},{"number":"30","title":"Interview Wednesday #30","category":"Interview","date":"2022-07-07","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/994434699743199354","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #30**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to another Interview Wednesday! This week we interviewed one of our Lumberjack Merchants, @JokerBoy737Superhero.\n\nQ: What is your favorite part about the game?\nA: Cutting wood then building things with the wood.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to new players\nA: Dont spend all your money at once, spend little bits of it on things that you need not want. Be sure to start with sawmills and land so you can gain more money.\n\nQ: What is your favorite store ?\nA: Bob's shack, because he sells TNT.\n\nQ: What is your favorite wood to get in the game?\nA: Sinister, because its the rarest.\n\nQ: What are your future plans in the game?\nA: To finish my house and expand my shrine.\n\nQ: What is your favorite build in the game?\nA: If its one of mine, my shrine.\n\nQ: If there was one thing you could add to the game, what would it be?\nA: Toggleable free placement mode, so its easier to move chop saws and blueprints.\n\nQ: What was your favorite moment in the server?\nA: When rocket did QOTD ping instead of DDOL ping for my picture of the week.\n\nQ: If you could give the lumber legends role to anyone who doesn't already have it, who would it be?\nA: Tough one, but id give it to the smallest lt2 youtuber in the server so they get revenue quicker as they would get recognized.\n\nQ: What is your least favorite part of the game?\nA: The anticheat bugging out , a person I know got banned permanently because of max land bug. They havent been unbanned yet sadly.\n\nQ: If there was one final message you would give to the server, what would it be?\nA: To make me a personal rank called \"lord of cheese\".\n\nThanks for reaching the end of this Wednesday Interview! If you want to be part of an interview, be sure to reach out to any journalist.\n\nInterviewer: @wall_watcher99999"},{"number":"70","title":"#70","category":"Article","date":"2022-07-12","author":"@ramhorn3, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro, @wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/996241249361199146","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#70**\n\n@News Ping Hello and welcome to our 70th lumber news, hope you guys are having a great day and thanks for coming. \n\n__**Game Updates**__\n\nThere were quite some game updates recently! On the 10th of July, Defaultio has revealed the emergence of faster logic speeds in complex circuits, faster respawn time for store items, Q/E grab rotation mode for PC, and a ton of glitch fixes. All these updates can be found in the changelog for 10 July, 2022. If you ever want to be aware of future updates to the game, be sure to check there.\n\n__**Allied Server Events**__\n\nAn allied server, The Lumber Shack, has recently celebrated 167 members on their Roblox group. As a way to celebrate, the staff team on the server and IIAdapter has agreed to create a public VIP server. This server is available to all members of The Lumber Shack, so be sure to head on over to that server and check it out!\n\n__**Rank ups**__\n\nLet’s congratulate these members for achieving a rank up in this past week!\n@kenryu99ryu -> Experienced Lumberjacks \n@ILuvChicken4Life -> Carpenter\n@lmOuttaHere -> Experienced Lumberjack and Merchant Lumberjack\n** **"},{"number":"31","title":"Interview Wednesday #31","category":"Interview","date":"2022-07-13","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/996878831715635392","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #31**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to Interview Wednesday number 31! This week we interviewed one of our Lumber Legends, @CodePrime8.\n\nQ: To start off, is a hotdog a sandwich?\nA: Yes.\n\nQ: What inspired you to become a youtuber?\nA: Originally, started just for fun. My kids are the reason I started doing regular consistent videos.\n\nQ: What advice would you give to new youtubers?\nA: Don't spend your money. A lot of people spend a lot of money on stuff like lights, a mic, and monitor. Then they get surprised when they don't get popular. So be sure to stay consistent and you will get popular eventually.\n\nQ: What would you say is the best way to grow a youtube channel?\nA: 100% luck. I happened to hit lumber tycoon 2 at a certain period where it was getting popular. So I happened to hit at a good spot and I jumped on it as fast as I could.\n\nQ: What was your most enjoyable experience in lumber tycoon 2?\nA: That's a hard one since I spend a lot of time in lumber. I would say my most fun times were when it was just me, mummy, darkjay and digdug. Those were the most enjoyable times. Digdug was one of the first people I collaborated with but I didn't know if I would like him. So I told him to play a game with me to see if I would like him. Then we played for 5 hours. So yeah, these were my favorite moments.\n\nQ: If you could give anybody the lumber legends role who doesn't already have it, who would it be?\nA: Bunny films, 6ixPix because he was the lumber king before I was, Beefplays, I would say Intelplayz because he's a part of legend, and Bluelocus.\n** **"},{"number":"71","title":"#71","category":"Article","date":"2022-07-17","author":"@ramhorn3, @BottomText, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro, @Happp83 | Youtuber, and @wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/998285927745081505","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#71**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to lumber news number 71. We hope you are all having a great day and will enjoy this news.\n\nFor starters, a new update was released this week in the server itself: the addition of the Event Co-Host role. As it reads, the role is designed to have the permissions to host an event and to have some moderating abilities such as muting and unmuting. This will *replace* Karaoke Co-Host and will include some of our event committee members. The second part of the update is that Elite Electrician will now add the community supporter role with it. Although this is minor, it would be a bonus for anyone who is going for the role.\n\nNext up in the server is the new avatar competition for this year. Fitting into the upcoming and ongoing seasons, the theme is: Summer and Fall. Instead of being like previous competitions, the event committee has decided to merge both themes into one, meaning you can only submit an avatar once and in one of the two themes. The deadline is August 3rd, 12:00pm EST. Don’t forget to check out the announcement for all surrounding info!\n\nThe last thing that happened in the past week is that the journalist applications opened. Make sure to fill it in before the deadline of July 19th, 12:00pm PDT (two more days!) if you are willing to be a journalist! Good luck to all! Link: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSczk8vqmodKU9Kv9yIny5nlGX6fjrOH-BIUmdd5Es12j72kug/viewform\n** **"},{"number":"32","title":"Interview Wednesday #32","category":"Interview","date":"2022-07-20","author":"@OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/999361166398722198","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #32**\n\n@News Ping  Welcome to Interview Wednesday number 32! This week we interviewed a well-known and popular Youtuber, @BunnyFilms1 !\n\nQ: Is cereal a soup?\nA: Cereal is not a soup because you can eat cereal with or without milk in the bowl. If you eat soup without broth in the bowl, what is it? Just a pile of noodles, chicken, and vegetables.\n\nQ: What inspired you to make LT2 youtube videos?\nA: I initially recorded Minecraft PE videos on my iPod Touch 3 with the hopes of being like stampylonghead (popular MC creator). I was introduced into Roblox in 7th grade and remember recording my first Roblox videos around 2015. I eventually discovered Lumber Tycoon 2 when it suddenly appeared among the most popular games. I didn’t play it for a few weeks because I thought it was another cookie-cutter button tycoon game, but once I did, I was hooked. Most of my first videos in this game were me joining Defaultio or him randomly appearing in my server. Those attracted a lot of views, and I eventually began creating building tutorials because I have always had a passion for architecture and design.\n\nQ: If you could add anything to LT2 what would you add?\nA: If I could add anything, I would add a resizable glass blueprint because it’s so tedious to buy dozens of glass panes at Fancy Furnishings. It is easy when building 8x8 stud window frames, but if a player wants to design creative window frames, it will most likely require many different size panes. Those 1x1 stud glass panes are the worst.\n\nQ: What games on Roblox do you play apart from LT2?\nA: Farming and Friends is what I play mostly outside of Lumber Tycoon 2. Every few months, I play Phantom Forces, but not as often as I did in the past. Most of my time is now spent playing games on Steam and Epic Games."},{"number":"72","title":"#72","category":"Article","date":"2022-07-24","author":"@ramhorn3, @BottomText, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro, and @wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1000829544514723872","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#72**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to lumber news number 72. We hope this news will interest you and that you will tune in again next time.\n\nRecently, the prize pool for the avatar competition was changed to have 1 truckload of ice wood and a log of end times wood added to the original 150k money and the truck of assorted gifts. See the announcement for more.    \n\nSecondly, the Journalist applications closed this week. Let's all congratulate @Mrkillu0106 and @Hamyster on their acceptance to the team!\n\n__**Game Updates**__\n\nThere has been a major piece of information regarding game updates this past week! And yes, we are talking about the new menu. With this new menu, new options have come up and it has a nicer design. You now possess the ability to block all from entering your base (without having to manually blacklist) and grant specific users only the ability to interact with objects on your base. However, there were also some more new settings added.  Be sure to check it out when you have the time!\n\n__**Allied Server Events**__\n\nIn an allied server, The Lumber Shack, IIAdapter has announced the arrival of the newest security intern. That new security intern is @Orithian and he was promoted on the 18th.\n\nOf course, the build contest is still ongoing in The Lumber Shack. Head on over to that server if you are interested in finding out when it ends!\n\n__**Lumber Games Winners**__  \n\nThis week the lumber games unfortunately had no batch one, although it did luckily get batch two (with a little special surprise! (Hint, bunny.)) This week there were two officials and one practice. For the first official, @Orithian came out on top and then @Bacon took the second official win! And then @Orithian won again.\n** **"},{"number":"33","title":"Interview Wednesday #33","category":"Interview","date":"2022-07-27","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1001991111302201357","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #33**\n\n@News Ping Welcome lumberjacks from far and wide! This week we interviewed @BelladonnaHypeTrain, an ex-staff member and lumber games champion.\n\nQ: What was your favorite moment as a staff member of the server?\nA: There would be a lot but gonna be honest.. I loved doing base reviews most of the time, seeing how far each players have built from nothing to something grand and gorgeous, to how far also simple logic would be so useful and fun.. aside base reviews, talking with the community and getting to know the members and aiding them through the game was also fun.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in the lt2 fan group discord?\nA: Since I just returned not too long ago, probably just chatting around mostly, catching up on updates around the server.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in your free time?\nA: I would be... looking around the internet for inspirations for my next build in LT2, watching random videos on yt, sometimes creating models in roblox studio, other days im just around roblox playing games.\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: LT2 is an endless tycoon.. other tycoon games are easy to grind and finishes fast but you cant even put much of your skills and talent on easy to grind tycoons.. unlike LT2, your imagination goes beyond the limits of building.. from a simple house with fences to a grand mansion or castle, even a millenium falcon if you really want to take things to a whole new level in terms of building.. you may be bored in a few days playing LT2 but you'll keep coming back to it and continue building, collecting items or selling items.\n** **"},{"number":"73","title":"#73","category":"Article","date":"2022-07-31","author":"@wall_watcher99999, @Happp83 | Youtuber @Mrkillu0106, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1003421205031833734","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#73**\n\n@News Ping Welcome lumberjacks from far and wide! This is lumber news number 73 and hopefully you read to the end!\n\nTo start off with this week’s lumber news, a new batch of Daily Dose of Lumber people have just been accepted last week! We would like to congratulate @ElectroTechnologies for being part of the Logic Tutorial team, @Distracted for being accepted into working on the picture of the week, and finally @Riachu10114 for getting the Base of the Week. When you get the chance, be sure to thank them for being willing to put in their time into DDOL.\n\nThe deadline for the Avatar Competition is near!  Because the deadline is on August the 3rd at 12AM EST, this is a reminder that the voting will also be available once the submission deadline has passed! Make sure to vote on your favorite avatars in both contests, both of which are Fall and Summer. The avatar with the most votes shall win the holy prize 150k in-game money, assorted gifts, ice wood, end times wood and many other more prizes! Good luck to all who have entered into the competition.\n\n__** Allied Server Events**__\n\nAn allied server, The Lumber Shack has announced that their news team has been closed. But there is no need not worry because IIAdapter has added a channel named #server-updates. This channel was added to replace the news team. Although currently staff handles server-updates, in the future they may have a few helpers to help them out. If you have any questions, please head over to The Lumber Shack to find out more! \n** **"},{"number":"34","title":"Interview Wednesday #34","category":"Interview","date":"2022-08-03","author":"@BottomText","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1004474768776507453","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #34**\n\n@News Ping Welcome lumberjacks from the world of lumber! This Wednesday we interviewed the one and only Supervisor @Ender!\n\nQ: First, does pineapple belong on pizza?\nA: Absolutely not! Pineapple does not deserve to be ANYWHERE near a pizza. Anyone who says they like pineapple on pizza is obviously lying to you.\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about the LT2 Discord?\nA: If you are referring to the Fan Group server, I was invited to the server through Jac16king on the LT2 Wiki's chatroom (rest in piece) before it went public, so mid-2017. The fan group staff were inviting staff from the affiliated groups, the LT2 Wiki and Lumber Chat and they for some reason forgot to invite me, so he invited me to the server. And if you're asking, my favorite part about the server is the relatively active community that it has, and that it keeps people active through activities.\n\nQ: What do you play outside of LT2?\nA: Nothing on Roblox, that's for sure. Every game looks and acts the same and are just money grabbers. Sometimes I might be playing Minecraft or some other game on my Nintendo Switch. Anything that is open-world, sandbox, and/or adventerous is pretty good if you ask me (That isn't Roblox, ofc).\n\nQ: What is your favorite item/structure you own?\nA: I can't tell you my favorite item. But I CAN tell you my favorite structure I've built is my main slot. I have built one part of the exterior to be much like my college's engineering building. I come back to the build everyone in a while to add windows but it's just become tedious to complete. I've been working on a new slot that I dont want to show off yet.\n** **"},{"number":"74","title":"#74","category":"Article","date":"2022-08-08","author":"@wall_watcher99999, @ramhorn3, @Hamyster, @IIAdapter, @BottomText, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1006350274710995076","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#74**\n\n@News Ping Welcome all to news article number 74! There is some interesting news to be shared this week, so we hope that you read to the end.\n\nTo start off, the news team on this server is merging with the news team on The Lumber Shack. Applications have been opened for anyone interested in being part of this newly-merged team. The applications, which close on the 11th, can be found in the announcement channels of both servers. If you are interested in writing news for both servers, then be sure to apply!\n\nThe avatar contest for this server has closed! The contest has closed on the 3rd and the deadline for voting has been announced. The deadline is on the 13th at 12 am est, so be sure to submit your vote before then. The two winners for this contest will be decided depending on what the votes are. So vote away!\n\n__**Allied Server Events**__\n\nThe Lumber Shack, an allied server, has announced the arrival of event council applications. This was announced on the 2nd and applications will close on the 14th. Although they close in 8 days, apply if you are interested!\n\n__**Lumber Games Winners**__\n\nThis week we unfortunately didn’t get a batch 1. But despite this, we luckily got a batch 2. In this batch, there was first a practice match where @Foxnarow won! Then the real official matches came, where @freanlits16 won, and with another official, @Foxnarow won again!\n\n__**Boosts**__\n\nThis week, we would like to thank @Macixxo, @Rafael89653 and @onii for boosting the server !\n** **"},{"number":"35","title":"Interview Wednesday #35","category":"Interview","date":"2022-08-11","author":"@ramhorn3","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1007135459606007890","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #35**\n\n@News Ping Hello and welcome lumberjacks far and wide, today we interviewed the amazing @wall_watcher99999\n\nQ: What was the original reason you started playing lumber tycoon 2?\nA: The original reason I started playing lumber tycoon 2 was because I saw it on the front of page of roblox in 2016. When I started playing it, I didn't know how good of a game it was. That was until I met a random player in the game. Although I'm not in contact with him, he showed me how to play the game. He even gave me some free lava wood to help aid me. But little would I have known, I would still be playing for the next following years.\n\nQ: How did you find out about the lumber tycoon 2 discord server?\nA: I was in the roblox group but I ignored the button that contained the discord invite. I ended up clicking that button in 2019, and I honestly forget why I joined it. Because I joined it so long ago, I don't remember. But the reason I started sending messages was because of one Halloween. I wanted to know what others thought about the game changes that happen every Halloween so I took a peek into the fan group server.\n\nQ: What keeps you coming back to lumber tycoon 2?\nA: The best part of the game is that you can build and explore. If even one of those two things weren't a big part of the game, I don't think I would still be playing it. But the very rare updates are nice as well.\n\nQ: What is your favorite area in the game?\nA: That is a hard question since there are multiple. But if I had to narrow it down, it would be link's logics and the maze. The reason I would include link's logics is because of the endless possibilities you can create using the various gates and signals. I would include the maze as well because of the amount that there is to explore. In there contains a shop and even one of the most valuable trees in the game. The maze also contains some more hidden gems so it is always fun to explore that area.\n\nQ: What do you think the best update/event was in the game?\nA: I would say the most recent \"auto-blacklist\" update. This is very helpful in being in \"build mode\" where nobody can really interrupt you. This used to be a huge issue because of the various glitchers who try to fling items around in your base and try to make it harder to keep focused on one task.\n\nQ: What is the best build/machine you've ever made?\nA: Not exactly sure. But I would say my favorite ones would be my \"escape room\" maze and 4 button combination lock keypad.\n\nQ: What is one update/addition you would love to see in lumber tycoon 2?\nA: More new biomes to explore. New biomes would be interesting because it adds onto the \"explore\" aspect of the game I talked about earlier.\n\nQ: What is your favorite item/group of items? (function or look based)\nA: I would say the gate hatchet. There is a lot of cool builds you can make with this. From elevators, to doors, to areas where you may unexpectedly drop due to a laser signal, I would say this is a pretty cool item\n\nQ: Who is your favorite lumber tycoon 2 community member?\nA: Cesar because of the amount he does for the community.\n\nQ: What is the coolest thing you've ever experienced in lumber tycoon 2 or the lumber tycoon 2 discord?\nA: In the lumber tycoon 2 game, the \"strange man\" was honestly one of the best additions to the game. Power build opened up a world of endless possibilities.\n\nInterviewer: @ramhorn3"},{"number":"75","title":"#75","category":"Article","date":"2022-08-14","author":"@wall_watcher99999 & @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1008441282613489714","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#75**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to this week’s lumber news article! Thank you for being a consistent reader of the news and be sure to read to the end.\n\nIncredibly, the avatar contest has ended! The contest ended on the 13th, and the results were announced on that same day. There were two themes that competitors could have chosen to compete in, with one being fall and the other being summer. The winner of the fall theme is @xChaplain with 37 votes, and the winner of the summer theme is @Jorne with a staggering 43 votes! Be sure to congratulate these server members when you get the chance. \n\nYet another shocking news from the past week was the arrival of a rare type of Lumber Games. What made this special edition unique from most other lumber games is that lumber games champions weren’t allowed. Because of this, new lumber games champions were guaranteed. Read on through if you want to find out who the champions are!\n\n__**Affiliated Server **__\n\nThe Lumber Shack, an affiliated server, has announced the results for their build competition! The top three have been announced, and the three lucky people will get prizes from either @rocket or @IIAdapter. The top three were @Delmonte_Ryder, @Orithian, and @LORD FOOG the 2nd (Tryblox). If you are interested in finding out any more details, head on over to The Lumber Shack!\n** **"},{"number":"36","title":"Interview Wednesday #36","category":"Interview","date":"2022-08-17","author":"@Hamyster","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1009558536264626218","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #36**\n\n@News Ping Hello all lumberjacks across the world, today we interviewed Lumber Journalist @ramhorn3!\n\nQ: How did you find out about LT2?\nA: I found out about Lumber Tycoon 2 by seeing my dad play it a few years ago, I didn't have anything that I needed to do so I decided to play, I absolutely loved the game as well.\n\nQ: Who do you look up to in LT2?\nA: I personally have looked up to a few people in lt2, originally it was my dad, but I feel like it's gotta be some of the master builders, electricians, and youtubers that I look up to most.\n\nQ: When did you start playing LT2?\nA: I started playing lt2 around 2019 I believe, it was such a great experience that I kept playing.\n\nQ: What is your favourite part of the game?\nA: My favorite part of the game is mainly the events and mysterious man, the events are great and so is the building power.\n\nQ: Who is your favourite NPC?\nA: I personally really like the mysterious man more than all other npcs, he's hard to get to and is really cool for the few moments you end up seeing him.\n\nQ: How did you find the LT2 Fan Group Discord?\nA: I found the lt2 fan group after encountering a issue I had in the game, after looking up a discord for it (what i do every time I have a game based issue) I joined and have been in it basically ever since.\n\nQ: What is your favourite thing to do in LT2?\nA: My favorite thing to do in the entire game is probably building, I personally made a hall of fame for every event item and have been working on making 2 platforms over my base for storage and a shop.\n\nQ: Why did you become a Lumber Journalist?\nA: I became a journalist mainly because it sounded fun and I like writing, it was actually unexpected for me to be accepted though.\n** **"},{"number":"76","title":"#76","category":"Article","date":"2022-08-22","author":"@Hamyster ඞ & @wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1011287339324149811","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#76**\n\n@News Ping Welcome lumberjacks to a brand new Lumber News article! We have some news to get going with, so let’s jump into it! \n\nTo start off this week’s news, two journalists have joined the team! After reviewing applications, we have concluded that two members are worthy to be newly-appointed journalists. These two members are @Tiger and @Lt2AmazingHelper. When you get the chance, be sure to congratulate them.\n\n__**Lumber Games Winners**__\n\nThis week, two practice matches for lumber games were hosted. These matches were won by DarkDragonFuture and @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro.\n\n__**Boosts**__\n\nLet’s thank @bruhcord & @Booino for boosting in the past week!\n\n__**Birthdays**__\n\nLet’s wish these members a happy birthday!\n● `Aug-15`: @wall_watcher99999\n● `Aug-16`: @mikvandon100 \n● `Aug-17`: @ghdskftrf, @Kevvy:) \n● `Aug-18`: @fruitfugitive1\n● `Aug-19`: @Sephirox\n● `Aug-20`: @bassen007, @bennoob4532,\n@Ra1ph_YT \n● `Aug-21`: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro\n** **"},{"number":"77","title":"#77","category":"Article","date":"2022-08-29","author":"@Happp83 | Youtuber, @ramhorn3, @Sophie <3","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1013660882217214062","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#77**\n\n@News Ping Welcome lumberjacks to a brand new Lumber News article! We have some news to get going with, so let’s jump into it! \n\n__**Lumber Games Winners**__\n\nUnfortunately, we didn’t have Lumber Games this weekend:( \n\n\n__**Boosts**__\n\nFor this week, we would like to thank @IPWhisper for generously boosting our server!\n\n\n__**Birthdays**__\n\n●`Aug-22`: @TrainerTsunami\n●`Aug-26`: @nightjack450 \n● `Aug-28`: @JazzyCarols\n\n\n__**Rank-Ups**__\n\nUnfortunately, there are no rank ups this week.\n\n__**Wiki Fact of the Week**__\n\nA big yellow head, with two dots and a smile. Who could it be? If you guessed the Wobblebobble then you’re correct! It is an item that could be obtained from opening the Wobbly Gift of Uncertainty, it was a gift that you could buy at Fancy Furnishings for $220 Money, and it was part of the 2015 Christmas Event. The Wobblebobble is based on the Roblox hat called “Bighead”. One of the most interesting aspects of this item is that it has different coloured variations that have different names. Which includes Red, Purple, Green, Teal, Purple, and Orange.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Wobblebobble\n\n**__Side Note:__** Make sure to dm a Supervisor Intern+ for a base review to be mention in our articles!\n\nThat concludes this week’s news! Thank you for reading to the end and hopefully you read to the end of week as well.\n\nNews - @Happp83 | Youtuber, @ramhorn3, @Sophie <3\nWobblebobble\nThe Wobblebobble is an item that can be unwrapped from the Wobbly Gift of Uncertainty, a gift that was purchasable at Fancy Furnishings for $220 Money, as a part of the 2015 Christmas Event. Aside from its color, the Wobblebobble is identical to its counterparts. The box has a slightly darker shade of yellow, with the Wobblebobble's decal on the...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Wobblebobble"},{"number":"78","title":"#78","category":"Article","date":"2022-09-08","author":"@FestiveText🎄, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂ 🎄, and @Charva","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1017489389275848824","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#78** \n\n@News Ping Hello and welcome to another - yes, you guessed it - Lumber News article! Sorry on our end for being a little late on posting! I hope you enjoy reading this week’s news and, as always, make sure to tune in next week. \n\n__**Allied Server Events**__\n\nFor starters, The Lumber Shack have decided upon their new Event Council members. Those members are: @Chef Koop , @commandobot3 , Murderous_Fizzy and @BanGoodLuc BEST MAN . Congrats! \n\nNext, we have the Lumber Tycoon 2 Wiki announcing their 7 year anniversary 🎉 ! Following this, they hosted a build competition with the theme of spook bases. This competition is an ongoing event, meaning you can join it right now! Check out the LT2 Wiki server if you want to have a go at winning that 1st place prize!\n\n__**Lumber Games Winners**__\n\nThis week, we unfortunately didn’t have a batch 1 again, but we luckily got a batch 2, for it, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂ 🎄 won the first practice match.\n\n__**Birthdays**__\n\nWe would like to wish a happy birthday to the following people,\n\n● `Aug-28`: @JazzyCarols\n● `Aug-29`: @FierySol\n● `Aug-30`: @Beasertame\n● `Aug-31`: @Devil's Christmas,@stanleyrekt\n● `Sep-01`: @buddy43877\n● `Sep-02`: @IIAdapter 🎄\n● `Sep-03`: @stony_timber,@Tiger\n\n__**Boosts**__\n\nThis week, we had two boosters! Let’s thank  and  for generously donating their boosts!\n** **\n__**Rank-Ups**__\n\nThis week, we would like to congratulate the following people for ranking up.\n -> Lumber merchant, Elite lumberjack\n@Nikolajs9 -> Lumber artist\n@samidemir09 -> Lumber merchant \n -> Lumber merchant,Elite lumberjack\n@Nikolajs9 -> Lumber artist\n@samidemir09 -> Lumber merchant \n\n__**Wiki Fact of The Week**__\n\nLocated in the rocks adjacent to the Taiga biome, the Lone Cave is a network of intricate caves and tunnels that are home to the Strange Man, who has the ability to give players Easy Building (also known as Power) at the cost of $10,009,000. Additionally being home to the Skeleton and the Pink Block - something used to hold scripts, this cave can be accessed through detonating a rock similar to one in the Swamp area. It is advised that players bring along a worklight and another player to help them traverse the difficult terrain.\nSources: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lost_Cave\n\nThank you for reading this week’s news. I hope you liked this article and that you join us next time for another exciting post.\n \nNews - @FestiveText🎄, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂ 🎄, and @Charva\nLost Cave\nThe Lost Cave is an underground network of caverns under the Snow Peninsula. The cave was added as a semi-secret update in the evening of September 23, 2017, likely as a prelude to the 2017 Halloween Event. It has two main anomalies; the Skeleton and the Strange Man, who can give players Easy Building for $10,009,000. It can only be traversed wi...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lost_Cave"},{"number":"79","title":"#79","category":"Article","date":"2022-09-11","author":"@ramhorn3, @BottomText, @Hamyster ඞ, and @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1018580687663681536","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#79** \n\n@News Ping Hello and welcome to another Lumber News article. We would like to thank you for joining us this week!\n\n__**Allied Server Events**__\n\nThis week, our friends over at The Lumber Shack have decided to make a sale on their Shack Shirt by lowering the price down to 15 robux, as a celebration for hitting 200 members on their Roblox group. Check it out if you’re into some fine fashion!\n\n__**Lumber Games Winners**__\n\nUnfortunately, there was not a lumber games event for this week. Tune in for next week!\n\n__**Birthdays**__\n\nWe would like to wish a happy birthday to the following people:\n● Sep-5: @sneakysnakegh\n● Sep-7: @Server Elder\n● Sep-8: @God1_m, @God1_m\n● Sep-9: @AquadianGuard\n● Sep-10: @Eduardo6776\n● Sep-11: @SeIfrontier\n\n__**Boosts**__\n\nWe would like to thank @MattGuwap and @POOPASSASSlN for boosting this week!\n** **"},{"number":"80","title":"#80","category":"Article","date":"2022-09-25","author":"@wall_watcher99999","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1023717563676508262","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#80**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to yet another Lumber News! Because there wasn't any publishing last week, this news article will cover the events that have occurred within the last 2 weeks. I will be taking over this week's news, so hopefully you read to the end!\n\nTo start off, the fan group and wiki server has had a celebration at The Lumber HQ! This event, occurring on the 17th for the Lumber Fans HQ and the 18th for the Lumber Headquarters, celebrated the achievements the game has earned. Some of these achievements include:\n- 286k members in the Roblox group.\n- 7th anniversary of the server.\n- 16k members in the discord server.\n\nBut the server also went through a key technical change. It was announced on the 14th, by @Sirred90, that the server would change its ticket system. The old system, which relied on ModMail, has been moved to a channel that you can access in <#1018664888152903803>. This channel grants you the ability to contact supervisor interns or above for server-related concerns, or lead moderators and above for issues with staff. The channel also answers some FAQs, so be sure to check it out if you have any questions!\n\nOn the 21st, it was announced that the event committee would be organizing a banner and icon contest. The theme is Halloween, and the pixel requirements are 128 x 128 for server icons and 600 x 240 for banners. The deadline for submissions is on October 15th, so be sure to enter the contest if you are interested! More information can be found at <#332295148778029067>.\n** **"},{"number":"81","title":"#81","category":"Article","date":"2022-10-12","author":"@Halloween Hamyster, @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro, @HalloweenText","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1029854160172109936","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#81**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to another week's news. Today we have a lot of news to cover so let’s begin! \n\nPotentially the most exciting thing that’s happened in these past two weeks are the new Halloween items that have been added to LT2. As always, there are pumpkins and candy bags being sold at Bob’s Shack and Woods R Us for $622 and $800. Additionally, spook and sinister trees are spawning very commonly during this period. So remember, next time you play LT2 this month, stock up on these limited-time items and start spook hunting! \n\nAnother interesting event is the new *build competition*! Themed around harvest, this event runs until November 5th 12am EST and is a joint competition between both the Lumber Shack and the LT2 Fan Group Discord. Prizes are as follows:\n1st - 2 Pieces of Sinister + 2 Pieces of Cavecrawler  + Big Gift Present + 2.5 million + Event Winner Role\n2nd - 2 Pieces of Sinister + 1 Piece of Cavecrawler + 1.5 million + Event Winner Role \n3rd - 1 Piece of Sinister + 1 Piece of Cavecrawler + 500k + Event Winner Role\nUnlike other build competitions in the past, you are not allowed to team with someone this time but they can provide you with the wood for the entry. Finally, you may not submit any previous builds, and builds must be your own and cannot be off of someone's base or someone else's build. If you want to enter this competition, submit your build to an Event Committee or an intern and above and make sure you include a minimum of 5 pictures. Good luck!\n\n**Lumber Games Winners**\n\nLet’s congratulate these members who have won the most recent lumber games !\nPractice Match: @Orithian\nOfficial Match: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro \nUnfortunately there wasn’t a second match this week .\n\n**Boosts**\n\nThis week, we would like to thank @Livex03 for boosting!\n** **"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Interview","date":"2022-11-09","author":"@HalloweenText","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1040015360948179024","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"@News Ping  Hello and welcome back to yet another Interview Wednesday! I'm your host, BottomText, and today we interviewed the one and only journalist @Halloween Hamyster  ! Thank you for reading and without further ado, let's jump into it!\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2? \nA: I found out about LT2 when I was looking for a tycoon game that you didn’t just play once, beat the game then leave. I found LT2 around 2019 and decided to play it for more than a day and discovered I liked it.\n\nQ: What makes LT2 different from other tycoon games on Roblox? \nA: What made LT2 stand out to me is that there isn’t really an end, you can play LT2 continuously until you think you have reached your goal. In most tycoons you just play for like 30-60 minutes then leave because you beat the game where as LT2 is completely different. I think LT2 adds a new level to tycoons.\n\nQ: Why did you become a Lumber Journalist? \nA: I became a Lumber Journalist because at the time I wanted to do something in the server, DDOL didn’t stand out to me but when the Lumber journalist applications came out it stood out to me. I also like writing a lot and that also helped a lot to me becoming a journalist.\n\nQ: What do you think is the best item in the game?\nA: I think the best item in the game has to be the duck. The duck is so amazing because it quacks and is good for decoration. I would of picked the scoob but it’s kind of ugly. \n\nQ: If you could add anything to LT2, what would it be?\nA: If I could add something to the game, I think I would choose to add new wood. Perhaps black or grey because it would be so helpful for building. I also think they should add new paintings to the game.\n\nQ: What do you do in your free time?\nA: In my free time I’m most likely deleting blueprints or tiding my base as it’s always messy and I don’t really have a solution to it."},{"number":"82","title":"#82","category":"Article","date":"2022-11-14","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1041549772693196881","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#82**\n\n@News Ping We took a break! We are finally back with this week’s news! It is the end of Spook Season as well! I hope your spook hunting went well; as you will have to wait another year for Spook Wood and Sinister.\n\nWe will start with the news since the last time we had news. \n@s.olz won the Icon Category he/she was voted 48 times!\n@randomflowz won the Banner Category with 108 votes!\n\n@jshel  ran a base revert! Also, Karaoke and Movie night has been running strong you should try and enjoy them yourself! If you want to know how to enjoy them, go to <#727326626336997457> and check the pins it will be four pins down. \n\nThere are 4 active Promo Codes as of today. You can claim them at: \nhttp://roblox.com/redeem\nThey are \nFREETARGETSANTA2022\nFREEAMAZONFOX2022\nSPIDERCOLA\nTWEETROBLOX\n\nThere was also a new free item added you can find it at:  https://www.roblox.com/catalog/10607480911/Paranormal-Party-Starter\n\nWe had some birthdays!\nNov-04: @CesarGeronimo  \nNov-06: @Hayden \nNov-07: , @vanpratt \nNov-08: @GantengZoneTeam2 ,@notmyname_FOOL@superdaniel8544\nNov-09: @crantwijk ,  , @Jaden 🎄  \nNov-12:   \nNov-13: @connorbinder321 \nPlease wish all these people a happy birthday!\n\nWe had a special birthday last week as it was our Group Leader! Please wish @CesarGeronimo another happy birthday!\n\nOne of our Supervisors also had a birthday this week! Please wish @Jaden 🎄 a happy birthday!\n\nThere were no Rank-ups!\n\nWe had 3 new boosters! @feq0a , @mcdaggitt .\nRoblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttp://roblox.com/redeem\nParanormal Party Starter - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/10607480911/Paranormal-Party-Starter"},{"number":"38","title":"Wednesday Interview #38","category":"Interview","date":"2023-02-23","author":"@BottomText","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1078130930100736060","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"__**Wednesday Interview #38**__\n\n@News Ping   Hello and welcome back to Wednesday Interview #38! This week, we interviewed the amazing builder and elite lumberjack @Smazt🔱 ! \n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2? \nA: I was in an Xbox party with one of my good friends from school and they asked if I wanted to play a game on ROBLOX called Lumber Tycoon 2. This was back in 2016 and I didn’t even have ROBLOX downloaded at the time so I said no but I ended up checking it out like a week later.\n\nQ: Do you have anything you are planning to build? \nA: I had just finished a very long term build about two weeks ago so I’m kind of taking a break from building for a while but I've got a few ideas for when I return.\n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in LT2? \nA: I have a lot of memorable moments in Lumber but one that definitely stands out would be when I first learned about wedges and how well you can glitch them inside of each other to make wild designs to be used in your builds. I stayed up all night trying to make a nice wall design to go around my first base, good times.\n\nQ: Which one of your builds are you most proud of?\nA: My favorite build is my castle base, it took 3 years of on and off building but it just shows how in-depth someone can go if they really put their time into something, you can check it out here:\nImage"},{"number":"39","title":"Interview Wednesday #39","category":"Interview","date":"2023-03-02","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1080643222281396324","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #39**\n\n@News Ping Hello! This week we interviewed one of our Boosterjack's! @ryan Please read!\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2? \nA: I came across lumber tycoon 2 by a youtuber codeprime8 back in 2017, always watched his lumber tycoon videos till this day and where I am now it wouldn’t be without watching him and getting tips i needed of his videos! \n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in LT2? \nA: Meeting Aptyn and being in one of his videos\n\nQ: What makes LT2 different from other tycoon games on Roblox? \nA: it’s a different game compared to many other tycoons, you can do a lot more on LT2 compared to other tycoons. \n\nQ: What do you think is the best item in the game?\nA: My opinion limited time items, cause every year they will get more value and more og within the community! \n\nQ: Do you have any future ambitions for LT2 or real life that you would like to share?\nA: Main goal is to complete my base in LT2 I’ve posted pictures in <#349664584631844886> and will keep posting.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing in the LT2 Fan Group Server?\nA: Got to be the staff, super friendly, Hella chill, always there for people, they’re just legends! \n\nQ: If you could add anything to LT2, what would it be?\nA: Some more blueprints, would be amazing if we had some turns in slopes for making roofs and stuff.\n\nQ: Any interesting facts about yourself?\nA: I’m obsessed with cartoons. \n\nQ: Do you have any future ambitions for LT2 or real life that you would like to share?\nA: My end goal for everything is to complete everything I want to do in life.\n\nQ: Is there anything else you would like to say to everyone reading?\nA: Keep your heads up and overcome fears you have that’s stopping you from doing things you can do!\n\nSee you next week!\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"82","title":"#82","category":"Article","date":"2023-04-03","author":"@BottomText","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1092337212047233054","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"#82\n\n|| Oh . . hello! I didn't realise you were . . right behind me! Well, um, welcome back to another Lumber News . . . I guess? I- uhm, Welcome to Lumber News 82 - or did I just say that? Anyways, I mean, uh, let's just jump into it, eh? @News Ping ||  \n\nFirst, we have the new Easter banner/icon competition! It is open until the 4th of this month (in 2 days time) and there will be 2 winners overall: one for the banner, one for the icon. Make sure to check the post in <#332295148778029067> if you are interested in this particular event.\n\nAnother piece of news this week is that the game we all know and love, Lumber Tycoon 2, has achieved the amazing milestone of 1,000,000,000 visits! Yes, you heard that right, a number with 9 zeros! Well done Defaultio for this accomplishment!\n\nBirthdays\n\nHappy birthday to these people 🎉:\n● Mar-26: @Mrswag72\n● Mar-27: @PopKieThaCat\n● Mar-30: @tcmcrcw\n● Mar-31: @xZenoWrld\n● Apr-01: @JshuaPlayz, @JustLxvish  \n\nRank-ups\n\nLet’s congratulate the following members for ranking up:\n@HalloweenIsTopTier → Electrician\n@Utility Vehicle XL Cat → Electrician\n\nBoosts\n\nThank you @thatoldbanana for boosting the server!\n\nWiki fact of the Week: Chilly Gift of Deep Cold\n\nIf you have been playing LT2 recently, there’s a chance you know about the Christmas gift known as the Chilly Gift of Deep Cold. It is a gift with a light blue wrap with 4 snowflakes on each face, tied together with an iconic, shiny blue ribbon that is seen on many of the game’s presents. When opened, it reveals a boxed Frost Axe, which, unsurprisingly, specialises in cutting Frost Wood from the Taiga Biome.  \n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Chilly_Gift_of_Deep_Cold\n\nThat marks the end of this article. I hope you have a brilliant rest of your day and I hope to see you next time in our next Lumber News.\n\nNews - @BottomText\nChilly Gift of Deep Cold\nThe Chilly Gift of Deep Cold is a gift that could be purchased at Wood R Us for $48,080 Money, as part of the 2022 Christmas event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Frost Axe. The gift was added on the 6th of December, making it the first gift of the season to be added. This item was made by Roblox user TC1010tiago as the winner of 2022 LWD Gift ...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Chilly_Gift_of_Deep_Cold"},{"number":"83","title":"#83","category":"Article","date":"2023-04-10","author":"@Hamyster","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1095105444374118490","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#83**\n\n@News Ping Welcome lumberjacks to this weeks news\n\nThis week, voting has ended and the winners were @OutGazing#4084 with 31 votes for the banner contest and @oliver for the icon contest\n\n**Rank-Ups**\n\n@💮 Meno-chan 💮#6992 ——> Experienced lumberjack \n\n@💮 Meno-chan 💮#6992 ——> Elite lumberjack \n\n@Flapy#3873 ——>Experienced lumberjack  \n\n\n@Flapy#3873 ——> Electrician \n\nThe_Manager roblox ——> Experienced lumberjack \n\ncjoel06 ——> Carpenter Specialist\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nWe wish a happy birthday to the following members ! 🎉\n\n● `Apr-03`: @Pixeluted\n● `Apr-04`: @youngblackshark\n● `Apr-05`: **gamer**, @UnknownWesly\n● `Apr-06`: @Ruby\n\n**Lumber Games Winners**\n\nUnfortunately, there were no Lumber Games this week.\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThank you to @thatoldbanana\nFor boosting this week !\n\n**Wiki Fact of the Week**\n\nThe Spicy Turkey was a limited time event item released for the 2021 Thanksgiving event . It could be found in the back of the main store (Wood R Us), haphazardly placed on the shelf, floor, and pole. It was originally meant to be for the 2020 Thanksgiving event, however Defaultio forgot to add it on Thanksgiving, thus giving players Turkey Leftovers . The Spicy Turkey was released on the 24th of November.This item was made by wiki user SMALLSOPE42 . The Spicy Turkey shares the same design as the other turkeys, with the meat being colored crimson instead. It shares a similar box model with the previous Thanksgiving items, the only difference being that the image is smaller and flipped in the opposite direction.Similar to its counterparts (including Turkey Leftovers), it is able to be cooked in the Volcano, getting darker over time. The minimum cooking time is 5 minutes, and the most cooked stage takes 20 minutes. There are 14 different stages to the turkey, ranging from raw to burnt. <https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Spicy_Turkey>\n\nNews:@Hamyster"},{"number":"85","title":"#85","category":"Article","date":"2023-11-13","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1173431546531819580","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#85**\n\n@News Ping  Ah, hello there fellow lumberjacks! We are back with some news. Sorry for the pause in news! This is a long news so get ready!\n\nThis week, Lumber journalist applications opened so good luck to anyone who applied !\n\n**Game Events** \n\nHalloween happened! There were some great Halloween items so hopefully y'all didn’t miss out on them!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nThere were tons of rank ups so here you go!\n\n**Experienced Lumberjacks**\n\n@Kaz ඞ\n\n@Kingboo (It's Haunting Season)\n\n@TheFinnator_1\n\n@Sam\n\n@i hate halloween and i hate this\n\n\n\n@clauszie\n\n**Elite Lumberjacks**\n@🫧 Dreamylin\n\n@iizzmmrr\n\n@IamALFAARTS\n\n\n**Merchants**\n@miggyitsme\n\n@On1ty\n\n@Kaz ඞ\n\n\n\n@Kingboo (It's Haunting Season)\n\n@pigeon ඞ\n\n@TheFinnator_1\n\n@robloxcommunity4321\n\n\n\n**Electricians**\n@On1ty\n\n@Kaz ඞ\n\n\n\n@dayyyzz\n\n@Sam\n\n@i hate halloween and i hate this\n\n@Nelex\n\n@Lonmower ❂ \n\n**Elite Electricians**\n\n@DOOM (Xbox Player)\n\n@Adam_5291\n\n**Carpenters**\n\n@i hate halloween and i hate this\n\n@XxYeeet_ManxX\n\nCongrats to all who got ranked up since our last news!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nNovember 12th @DANBATMAN123321 , @jadeite420\n\nNovember 13th @connorbinder321\n\nNovember 15th @br0ken_micr0wave , @samman69 \n\nNovember 16th @6rnu , @friedonl \n\nNovember 19th @cars95mate\n\nHappy birthday to all!\n\n**Boosters**\n\n@ramhorn3 \n\n@dawidzmoltajn \n\n@khalid10987_yt  \n\n@Scorch \n\n@themasterforrow \n\n@libengt \n\n@jakobplayzroblox1 \n\n@6ixpix \n\n@lawrencejared \n\nThank you for boosting!"},{"number":"40","title":"Interview Wednesday #40","category":"Interview","date":"2023-11-16","author":"@sophieqt","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1174620481157075046","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #40__**\n\n@News Ping Hello!! Welcome back to another week of lumber interviews! This week we interviewed one of our community member's @o7_9!! Please read, his interview was awesome!!\n\nQ: How did you first discover Lumber Tycoon 2 on Roblox, and what intrigued you about the game?\nA: I found this game in 2018 because i was looking for a game about being a lumberjack, and i liked the game because it seemed unique with all the items and such, no game compared to it for me\n\nQ: Can you share your experience in finding and joining the LT2 community on Discord? What role has it played in your enjoyment of the game?\nA: i found the LT2 discord after trying to find if there was a roblox group for the game, in turn, finding the server. the discord server played a big role because it opened up trading and buying items a lot easier and finding a couple people to play the game with\n\nQ: Reflecting on your time playing LT2, what stands out as your most unforgettable in-game moment or achievement?\nA: it has got to be the first time getting cave crawler, it stood out a lot because i was with my brother and we kept getting stuck and we didnt have a map and it was overall just a lot of fun\n\nQ: In your opinion, what sets Lumber Tycoon 2 apart from other games on Roblox? What makes it unique or special to you?\nA: to me it is the open sandbox type how its almost limitless with building and all of the different items i try to collect and all the different things i can build, and overall just a different feel to this game from any other\n\nQ: Out of all the items you've acquired in LT2, which one do you consider the most valuable, and how did you obtain it?\nA: For me id say my ducks they are my favorite items and i simply got them by buying them from other players over the years\n\nQ: What current goals or projects are you actively working on within the Lumber Tycoon 2 world? Any particular milestones you're striving to achieve?\nA: currently im working on a bridge that will take me to palm wood and it will take me to the other island hopefully and i have no particular mile stones\n\nQ: Within the LT2 Fan Group Server, what aspect or feature do you appreciate the most, and how has it contributed to your overall experience with the game?\nA: i appreciate the lumber market the most because it helps me a lot for selling and buying items, and it contributed to my game experience because it allows me to make money easier and find items i really want a lot easier\n\nQ: If you had the opportunity to introduce a new element or feature to LT2, what would it be and how do you think it would enhance the gameplay?\nA: if i were to introduce a new element to the game it would probably be boats and another island you have to take the boat to, i think it'd be awesome\n\nQ: Beyond the virtual world of Lumber Tycoon 2, do you have any interesting facts or stories about yourself that you'd like to share with the community?\nA: i love working on cars and currently own two trucks, one is more of a project though, constantly being worked on, almost ready for the road\n\nQ: As a player deeply involved in LT2, is there anything you'd like to convey or express to everyone reading, whether it's a piece of advice, a shoutout, or a general message about your experience in the game?\nA: dont exploits, dont abuse glitches (makes the game boring fast) and be careful who you give certain permissions 👍\n\nSee you all next!<3\n\nInterviewer: @sophieqt"},{"number":"","title":"","category":"Article","date":"2023-11-20","author":"@sophieqt","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1176016036181586041","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"@News Ping HELLO LUMBERJACKS! Welcome back to another week of lumber news! We got some eventful stuff going on this week, so let’s get chopping away!\n\nThis week, the Journalist applications are closed and being reviewed! Thank you to those that applied, and best of luck! Didnt have a chance to submit an application or just now interested? Dm me! We still have a few slots out there:) \n\n**Events**\n\nThe Lumber Tycoon 2 fan group event committee has teamed up with Codeprime8’s, The Lumbershack, and the Lumber chat discord to do a joint Christmas event. Each one will be different.\n\nFor the codeprime8 server, they are doing a karaoke caroling! Also, Christmas caroling is on December 15th at 8 PM EST!\n\nLumber Shack’s server is Doing Christmas karaoke, and guess what song! Time is TBA\n\nLumber Chat is doing a one-plot challenge, bringing one of my personal favorites back. It starts on the 24th and ends on December 23rd. \n\nFor the Fan Group, we are doing a CHRISTMAS MOVIE EVENT MARATHON!!!! TBA\n\nPlease see the official announcement for further information: \nhttps://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1175598754699673620  \n\n\n**Lumber games**\n\nIt looks like an official match has been hosted! The winner on Saturday was @Mystical_Nick  and the practice round goes to @Mikro58  !!!\n\n**Rankups**\n\n**Electricans**\n@TellRice\n@RyanM265\n\n**Carpenter**\n@haantje\n@AngeIcheeks \n@Risk_Poker\n@Adam_5291\n@American_breadstick \n\n**Carpenter specialist** \n@Smazt👻\n@Adam_5291\n\n**Experienced lumberjacks**\n@RyanM265\n@DraC01202 \n\n**Merchant**\n@DraC01202 \n\n**Lumber Artist**\n@AngeIcheeks \n@Smazt👻\n\n**Elite Lumberjack**\n@Smazt👻\n@ScrapBuilds \n\nCongratulations to those who have ranked up in our group! Please request a base review to get a higher builder role or other roles within our lumber community. Go here and make a ticket now! You, of course, will be mentioned if you get a role! https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1018664888152903803/1161927205014753350  \n\n**Birthdays**\n\nNov-19:  @cars95mate \nNov-20: @1v1meinfortezclap @michal57012 @On1ty \nNov-21:  @sledge | make rukiryaxe better \nNov-23: @xx2UniQue2xx \nNov-25: @🫧 Dreamylin \n\nHappy birthday to all!!! \n\n**Wiki fact of the week** \n\nWithin the game files, you'll come across the Lumberman character equipped with an axe that differs slightly from the Steel Axe featured in the thumbnail but closely resembles the Hardened Axe. This particular axe is identified as the Lumberman's Axe.\n\n**Closing**\n\nThank you all for reading this week's news! This has been such an eventful week! As always, lumberjacks keep on chopping! See you at Wednesday's interview!! \n\nNews: @sophieqt"},{"number":"41","title":"Interview Wednesday #41","category":"Interview","date":"2023-11-23","author":"@Dallinz but Turkey🦃","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1177088384854917161","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #41__**\n\n@News Ping Hello Lumberjacks! Welcome back to another amazing interview Wednesday!! Let's get right into it!! @Dallinz but Turkey🦃 has interviewed @Adam_5291 which is one of our base reviewers! So, be sure to check this one out!!\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2? \nA: I originally found my older sister playing the game one night before school in late 2017. I tried playing it the next day since we ended up having a snow day, we went to school just to find out it was canceled that day. When I came home me and my sister played LT2 pretty much the whole day together.\n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in LT2? \nA: My most memorable moment in LT2 was when me and my dad would build together. My dad was pretty new to LT2 and Roblox in general, so me and my sister got to teach him. We spent a lot of time getting wood to build his base on lt2.\n\nQ: What makes LT2 different from other tycoon games on Roblox? \nA: What really peaked my interest in LT2 was how slow paced and relaxing it was compared to some of the other popular games on Roblox at the time. There was so much you could do with creativity and having an open mind. I also found a fascination in putting items in a truck and being able to drive it around.\n\nQ: What do you think is the best item in the game?\nA: From a personal perspective I like the Orange bags of candy,. I've always had an obsession of collecting candy in LT2. From a general perspective, I think the best item would have to be the Many Axe. The Many Axe has the best damage of all axes in LT2 and is overall the best axe to carry with you.\n\nQ: Do you have any future ambitions for LT2 or real life that you would like to share?\nA: Playing LT2 has made me really realize that there are so many things you can achieve if you put in the work for it. For example I decided one day I wanted to learn logic to fix my 1x1 unit cutter. I have done extremely well on my journey of learning logic. and I found an interest in electrical maintenance in real life. I am hoping to do some work in the electrical field when I become an adult.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing in the LT2 Fan Group Server?\nA: My favorite thing in the LT2 Fan Group Server is having the ability to achieve different\nroles for the hard work you put into LT2. Having a supportive community is an absolute blessing along side of this.\n\nQ: If you could add anything to LT2, what would it be?\nA: If I could add anything to LT2, It would be a type of black wood. The black wood would be called something like \"Burnt Bark\" and it would be placed somewhere inside of the volcano. Having a type of black wood in the game would allow for players to be more creative with their builds, and have more detail in them.\n\nQ: Any interesting facts about yourself?\nA: An interesting fact about myself is that I like to roller skate as a hobby. I have been skating for about 1 1/2 years and have come a long ways on getting better at it. Being at my rink is like being home, I know everyone there and they are like family to me.\n\nQ: Is there anything else you would like to say to everyone reading?\nA: If you put in the work for something you may not always be rewarded right away, you will think back and be glad that you did what you did in the long run.\n\nInterviewer: @Dallinz but Turkey🦃"},{"number":"87","title":"#87","category":"Article","date":"2023-11-26","author":"@omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1178422894125129750","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#87**\n\n@News Ping HELLO LUMBERJACKS! Welcome back to another weekly news!! Let’s get RIGHTT into it!! \n\n**New Journalist**\nHello! After reviewing the applications, we have accepted @Mrkillu0106 and @bent1133 To the Journalist Team! Congratulations!! \n\nPlease welcome back @Gomi🎄 to the Journalist team after taking a break! Glad to have you back:) \n\n**Updates**\n\nWe had a Thanksgiving update for Lumber Tycoon 2! It included Orange Bone Turkey, Pie Axe, Pumpkin Pie, Can of Stuffing, and a cornucopia. All are at different places refer to this announcement for prices and locations! https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1176675389595189278 \n\n**Staff Birthday**\n\nWe had a staff birthday yesterday! Happy birthday @🫧 Dreamylin!! \n\n**Discord Events** \nOur group leader @CesarGeronimo Will be hosting a christmas movie showing 1-2 movies being shown. 7PM EST is the estimated time it would be hosted. Please refer to this announcement for more information: https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1177837462295425166\n\n**Lumber games** \nAnother lumber games match was hosted and the first match and only match that was hosted goes to @maresatko Congratulations!!! \n\n**Boosts**\nThank you to the following members that have boosted our discord! If you do decide to boost, it does give you some sweet benefits:) \n@szczerbatek122\n@poopsnooter7\n@7Vx0 \n@Gomi🎄 \n\n**Rankups**\n\nCongratulations to all these people ranking up in our group! Remember you can always request a base review from one of the base reviewers or staff members! Create a ticket located in this channel here: https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1018664888152903803/1161927205014753350 \n\n**Elite Lumberjack**\n@Ashleychick86\n\n**Elite Electrician**\n@Gomi🎄\n\n**Electrician**\n@649MrCheesePuff843 \n@mootburrito1238\n\n**Lumber Artist**\n@mootburrito1238 \n\n**Wiki fact of the week**\nThe Safari Hole is an interesting teleportation device. If you in the cave crawler maze and stumble upon this, you can climb your way up and walk in and then you get teleported back to the main island right by fancy furnishing! It can also be used to get items back from the maze! \n\n**Closing**\nThank you so much Lumberjacks for reading this weeks news! As always, we will see you in the next wednesday Interview!!!! \n\nNews: @omgitsmejon"},{"number":"88","title":"#88","category":"Article","date":"2023-12-04","author":"@Mrkillu0106@omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1181074319028265002","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#88**\n\n@News Ping  Hello fellow Lumberjacks! Welcome back to our weekly news; we hope you enjoyed our last week's news. Let's not waste time and see what this week has for us!\n\n\n**Updates**\n\nLumber Tycoon has finally finished their Thanksgiving feast, but do not worry, soon enough we will have our merry and joy spread around the Lumber map, and we will all give gifts and cherish each other for December! Psst- gifts will be arriving soon..\n\n**Discord Updates**\n\nThe Lumber Tycoon 2 fan group has added a new channel! This channel allows you to find players that want to play with others. You can simply put in what time you are available so the others know not to ask you if you want to play while you’re not ready.\n\nOn a side note, the end times axe will now be an item you can sell in the market!! Please note that there will still be moderation for all items, but especially anyone selling this axe as it is still an in-game cheated item. Refer to this announcement made by @❄ Festive Dreams  \nhttps://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1180940882032205934\n\n**Events**\n\nHello! The Christmas banner/icon contest has an 8-day deadline before the submissions are closed. If you feel like you can contribute to the server by making a creative banner or icon, we suggest you participate in this event before it is too late! We always want to look at the cool designs you guys have to give us.\n\n**Lumber games**\n\nToday in the Lumber games, we had two matches this time! For our first match, we had a little problem with the system, and we could not get the first winner, we are sorry to whoever it was. And for our second match winner, it was, @1zeII! We appreciate everyone who joined this weekend's lumber games!\n\n**Rankups**\n\nLet’s all congratulate the members below who have been ranked and recognized for their work this week!\n\n**Electrician**\n@tijger1350\n\n**Carpenter**\n@aaronlt25, @Gerard, @tijger1350\n\n**Carpenter Specialist**\n@ApolloTakeFlight\n\n**Merchant**\n@aaronlt25, @shyslen\n\n**Lumber Artist**\n@1zeII, @Chase 🎄\n\n**Former Supervisor’s Birthday**\nToday is @kieramariee Birthday! She is a known and respected soul and was a supervisor in the server before, respect her and wish her a Happy Birthday in general chat!\n\n**Birthdays**\n \nNov-27 @TheFinnator_1\nNov-29 @JaapandAjit12\nDec-1 @trimpire\nDec-2 @exayixconner2\n\nHappy Birthday!\n\n**Wiki fact of the week** \n\nGreen Box\n\nDid you know? The Green Box is quite literally not green. The “Green Box” is a gray block, but due to the green lighting and green sparkles, it reflects off the box, making it look green. The green block has no textures and no game-changing benefits. To get to the green box, you must glitch inside the volcano and do a series of parkour with a long plank. It is a hard challenge, as the extreme heat may kill you if you are not cautious. It is currently one of the hardest challenges in the game.\n\n**Closing**\nAs we wrap up this week's news, we hope you enjoyed and learned something new and exciting! Have a blessed day, and stay safe out in the cold times. Stay tuned for this week's Interview on Wednesday and next week's news too!\n\n\nNews: @Mrkillu0106@omgitsmejon"},{"number":"42","title":"Interview Wednesday #42","category":"Interview","date":"2023-12-05","author":"@Gomi🎄","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1181700832912220291","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #42**\n\n@News Ping Hello everyone! We’re back with another interview this wednesday! This interview was conducted by @Gomi🎄 and he interviewed @DOOM (Xbox Player)! Hope you all enjoy it!\n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: That is a question idk since I played a bit on pc during the very early days but I transferred to play exclusively on Xbox in 2016 (I just don't trust cross platform at all which is why I'm exclusively on Xbox servers)\n\nQ: What got you into being a logicist?\nA: I always understood basics to logic however I got more  in depth because of a sliding door (In short the door I was working with had a sliding door yet the base owner had an issue where it was easy to mess up so I added a \"safety door\" on top of the sliding door that followed a particular behavior relative to the open/close and direction of sliding)\n\nQ: What's your favorite memory of playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: The first \"memory\" I can think of is back in 2020 when I was working on my \"Reaper's Fortress\"; I was on the top when I saw someone with a trailer wiper walking halfway across the map and sent him a screenshot halfway asking him, what he thinks he's going to do when I can see him, otherwise I don't have any particular memory that was my \"favorite\"\n\nQ: How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Hard to tell when exactly I started, all ik is my oldest Xbox screenshot is from 2016 and I played on pc for a while before it was on xbox\n\nQ: What's your favorite build/project you have made in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My top 3 non-mega base builds are my Shrine, DOOM sign, and my Death Ray.\n\nQ: What compels you to play Lumber Tycoon 2 instead of other games?\nA: I think building in LT2 is far more impressive than any other game due to how long it takes to make anything of decent size as I demonstrated while making my Parkour (which i only host on Xbox exclusive servers)\n\nQ: Out of all Lumber Tycoon 2 updates or time periods, which one would you like to bring back most and why?\nA: I'd bring back the time when you could make blue prints invisible while sending money or when you can clip your cameras through walls\n\nInterviewer: @Gomi🎄"},{"number":"89","title":"#89","category":"Article","date":"2023-12-11","author":"@Mrkillu0106, @Gomi🎄","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1183630984353161267","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#89**\n\n@News Ping Hi there LumberJacks! We’re back with some more awesome news for you! Let's get right into it and see what’s happening this week!\n\n**Cross Events**\n\nThe Lumber Shack is hosting an event for Christmas; during this event, banners and icons will be created for the server. You can either create a banner icon, or both! Submissions should be sent to any Event Council team member or Admin members. Check more information out on their server!\n\n**Updates**\n\nDefault has finally released a new axe! The Blue Steel Axe costs $18300! But is this a Christmas item or an actual axe that will stay? This axe is not wrapped, and you can obtain this item and use it right now. But if this is a Christmas item, Christmas has arrived in Lumber Tycoon 2. So look out for future gifts coming to the game!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nToday in Lumber Games, two official matches were hosted, and one practice match was hosted. The champion for our first round was @Lonmower ❂, and surprisingly, he was also the winner for the second round! Congratulations to the winner!\n\n**Staff Birthday**\n\nWe had a staff birthday a few days ago! Happy birthday to the former supervisor @kieramariee!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nDec-4 @KEN_35142\nDec-7 @dauntingzebra\nDec-9 @Windows7\nDec-10 @ethanthebest97\n\nHappy birthday!\n\n**Wiki fact of the week**\n\nLump of Coal\n\nThe lump of Coal was a Christmas item back in 2015. It went for a solid 10,000 cash. The gift was wrapped poorly by bob; the color was black with spots of gray, with a slate texture and a silver ribbon. There was nothing to do with the Lump of Coal, though. If you place a piece of coal in the volcano for 10-15 minutes, it will ignite and have flames. The color would change to orange to make it look molten. That is its only special hidden secret.\n\n**Closing**\n\nWith this week's news ending, we are glad to share everything on the server, though the news this week was shorter than usual. Stay tuned for next week's news, and as always, stay safe. Have a blessed weekend!\n\nNews: @Mrkillu0106, @Gomi🎄"},{"number":"43","title":"Interview Wednesday #43","category":"Interview","date":"2023-12-21","author":"@Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1187236629820227684","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #43**\n\n@News Ping Hi Lumberjacks! This interview was done by @Gomi and he interviewed @Plnksiko! Hope you all enjoy it!\n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Well, at first lumber was a game I saw via codeprime8 video on youtube and I joined during the beta time of the game early 2016. Of course back then it took 10 minutes to get ingame, but things have changed now..\n\nQ: What's your favorite memory of playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: It would be my first time reaching the top of the volcano. It felt like such an achievement and was the first step to becoming a wealthy lumber player.\n\nQ: If you had to choose a specific event in LT2, which would be your favorite?\nA: The winter event from 2017 with the snowglow trees, by far it also got me into lumber again. I still have the event items today!\n\nQ: How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2, and if you know specifically (or have a ballpark), how many hours?\nA: Hmm tough question, it's been a long time but I started in 2016 in the \"BETA\" era, but as of now I'd say I've accumulated 500 to 600 + hours. I even went to my brother who also joined at the same time as me. We both agree that'd be as accurate considering it's been 8 years.\n\nQ: What compels you to play Lumber Tycoon 2 instead of other games?\nA: It'd have to be the building aspect of the game, it's always so intriguing as it is a sandbox afterall, I do also love the spook hunting season and return every year for another hunt.\n\nQ: How many spook trees would you say you have gathered in total?\nA: Considering I've done it on 3 accounts I'd say about 50 over the years, never a sinister. Still trying till this day, and I did spot one on the palm islands but it was claimed at the time. I'd say my most notable spook was in the volcano itself, which I recruited a supervisor for help to claim.\n\nQ: Have you done any builds, and of which, what would be your favorite?\nA: Helping my brother build his super mansion with a sawmill and a big warehouse was my favorite.\n\nQ: Out of all Lumber Tycoon 2 updates or time periods, which one would you like to bring back most and why?\nA: It'd have to be the early era of lumber 2016 2015 as the game was still being updated, I'd wish the game had more content, I enjoyed the updates as the game was new and full of discoveries.\n\nQ: What is your favorite item or location in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: It'd have to be the tropical land bridge or mountains for location, such a good view and remote, for item i'd say the chicken axe!\n\nInterviewer: @Gomi\noqKKFEX.png\nj8d6GSm.png"},{"number":"91","title":"#91","category":"Article","date":"2023-12-25","author":"@Gomi🎄, @Mrkillu0106","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1188646019358003200","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#91**\n\n@News Ping Hello again! Welcome back to another weekly news. Let's see what this week has for us.\n\n\n**Updates**\n\n\nAs if we thought the presents and the axe was it, Defaultio has added a new type of tree. The Blue Spruce tree. This tree works just like Sinister or Spook, as it has a cooldown before being able to grow in new servers and only grows during an event. The best way to obtain this tree is to go anywhere with snow and use the Blue steel axe. Thank you, Defaultio!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nOn Saturday, two official Lumber Games matches were held. The first match was won by community member bluestarblue1, and the second was won by community member cuteroanwithfriends.\n\n**Rankups**\n\nCongratulations to all the below members for ranking up this week!\n\nCarpenter Specialists: @Boy Grandma, @Sir_Pumpk1n\n\nExperienced Lumberjacks: @Boy Grandma, @owe_f, @Kit_4848Gaming, @Chase 🎄, @Slurical\n\nLumber Artist: @Boy Grandma\n\nCarpenter: @owe_f, @Kit_4848Gaming, @aiphra, @Slurical\n\nLumber merchant: @owe_f, @Kit_4848Gaming, @Slurical\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nDec-18: @Rizzard\nDec-20: @PandaBowl™\nDec-22: @PRO16328\nDec-23: @ImNotNick 🧩\nDec-24: @karemsibai10\nWe hope you guys had or are having a good Birthday!\n\n**Wiki fact of the week**\n\nGloomy Pumpkin\n\nThe Gloomy Pumpkin was sold for 808 lumber cash at Bob’s Shack during the 2023 Halloween event. It has a notable blue and black coloration and a blue outer glow. This item was made by community member and contributor ElectroTechnologies.\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks a ton for reading this week’s news! We will see you all next week with some more interesting news, and merry christmas!\n\nNews: @Gomi🎄, @Mrkillu0106"},{"number":"44","title":"Interview Wednesday #44","category":"Interview","date":"2023-12-27","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1189709915405688924","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #44__**\n\n@News Ping Afternoon Lumberjacks! We have another interview conducted by @Dallinz but fireworks 🎆  and he interviewed @TTVNot_Roach🎄! Hope you enjoy our 44th interview:) \n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2?\nA: In 2017, while scrolling through tycoon games, I came across Lumber Tycoon 2. It stood out from all the other tycoons.\n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in LT2?\nA: The first time I went through the maze. I was excited because I had accomplished something.\n\nQ: What makes LT2 different from other tycoon games on Roblox?\nA: In other tycoons, you just sit and wait to collect money. In Lumber Tycoon, you have to actively earn money to purchase more items.\n\nQ: What do you think is the best item in the game?\nA: Cars are the best item. They make it easier to get around.\n\nQ: Do you have any future ambitions for LT2 or real life that you would like to share?\nA: Currently, nothing specific is on my horizon. However, I'm hopeful that the new items and the tree released will inspire something interesting.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing in the LT2 Fan Group Server?\nA: The community. Most people will help you if you ask for it.\n\nQ: If you could add anything to LT2, what would it be?\nA: I would add boats to make it easier to get to Palm Island.\n\nQ: Any interesting facts about yourself?\nA: I absolutely love photography! It's more than a hobby; it's a way for me to capture beautiful moments and express my creativity.\n\nQ: Is there anything else you would like to say to everyone reading?\nA: Success is not final, failure is not fatal: It is the courage to continue that counts.\n\nInterview Conducted by: @Dallinz but fireworks 🎆"},{"number":"92","title":"#92","category":"Article","date":"2024-01-01","author":"@Gomi🎄","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1191440776744402944","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#92**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back everyone! Today we have a good bit of news for you all, so enjoy! \n\n**Updates**\n\nEvent items were removed by Defaultio, and the pixelated painting with two question marks in the description now spawns with distorted colors. \n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis Saturday, two official matches of the Lumber Games were held. One match was won by community member nixonnoonoo, and the other was won by community member santostheshark.\n\n**Rankups**\nIf you ever want to get some roles and think you are eligible, check out <#1018664888152903803>  and click the base review button!\n\nYoutuber: @LegoAustinFriendTwo\n\nCarpenter: @nikanari222\n\nExperienced lumberjack: @juanirt51, @djtibe\n\nCarpenter specialist: @juanirt51\n\nCongrats to all of the folks who ranked up!\n\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nDec-27: @iWorldDominate , @MrEspresso385 🎄  \nDec-28: @Cody_alt03\nDec-30: @bigbcnews \nDec-31: @PolygonGuy  , @STRIKE_GAMING2010  \n\nHappy birthday to you all!\n\n**Boosters**\nA big thanks to @Snippki, @fourteencurve75, @Archie_auss, @ydid, @BeeSwarmGod, and @Gomi🎄 for boosting!\n\n\n**Wiki fact of the week**"},{"number":"43","title":"Interview Wednesday #43","category":"Interview","date":"2024-01-04","author":"@Gomi🎄","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1192352518697656432","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #43**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back, lumberjacks! This interview was conducted by @Gomi🎄 and he interviewed @santa billy [009]! Hope you all enjoy this one!\n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: i was watching video on youtube back in 2017, and then i found video from a small youtuber and he was playing lumber tycoon 2, so i searched for it on roblox and i liked it\n\nQ: What's your favorite memory of playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: i remember i worked for some guy and got him wood and then he paid me 6 million lumber tycoon 2 doubloon bucks😎\n\nQ: If you had to choose a specific event in lt2, what would be your favorite?\nA: i think i'm gonna go with thanksgiving because i like turkey\n\nQ: How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2, and if you know specifically, how many hours?\nA: i think all my time on it is around 75 hours\n\nQ: What compels you to play Lumber Tycoon 2 instead of other games?\nA: it has replayable mechanic, you can build whatever you want and do logic, as well as all the events that add stuff to the game\n\nQ: How many blue spruce trees would you say you have gathered in total?\nA: i’ve found 5 blue spruces in total\n\nQ: Have you done any builds, and of which, what would be your favorite?\nA: my favorite build is my house because of all the food\n\nQ: Out of all Lumber Tycoon 2 updates or time periods, which one would you like to bring back most and why?\nA: i want to bring time when i was beginner, when i was happy about every new tree i found or every new axe i bought. Everything was new to me\n\nQ: What is your favorite item or location in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: my fav item is rubber duck because of the sound it makes and how funny it is. My favorite location would be the taiga because it reminds me of siberia\n\nQ: who is your best friend in all of lt2?\nA: blue lumber noob is one of my best friends\n\nInterviewer: @Gomi🎄"},{"number":"93","title":"93","category":"Article","date":"2024-01-08","author":"@⚡Gomi⚡","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1193784963556982814","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**93**\n\n@News Ping This week’s news is here! Hope you enjoy, and have a great day!\n\n**Updates**\n\nDefaultio recently removed all snow and remnants of the winter event, such as the ice surrounding the water and the spawn chance for blue spruce.\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nBoth pratice rounds was hosted, and @Izzy won both rounds!\n\n**Rankups**\n\nElectrician: @juanirt51\n\nCarpenter: @OCTAV24_YT\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @OCTAV24_YT\n\nLumberjack Merchant: @OCTAV24_YT\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJan-1: @PolygonGuy, @STRIKE_GAMING2010\nJan-3: @knightmarium\nJan-4: @sir1008, @xmasterjack\nJan-6: @BeeSwarmGod\nJan-7: @MrCat16PlaysElectricGuitar, @MrSmart\n\n**Boosters**\n\nBig thanks to all of our boosters!\n\n@Vapxrised_Light, @osh9112, @DakingFr18\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Silly Gift Of Six Sides\n\nThe silly gift of six sides was created by players and contributors to electrotechnologies and tri_angulum. This gift was released in the 2023 Christmas event and was able to be opened into an item called “die”, which is unique as the only item of that type. It cost 210 cash while in store and acts as a standard six-sided die.\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for reading, everyone! Have a great rest of your week and happy New Year!\n\nNews: @⚡Gomi⚡"},{"number":"44","title":"Interview Wednesday (oopsies it's Thursday) #44","category":"Interview","date":"2024-01-11","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1195122068828737626","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday (oopsies it's Thursday) #44**\n\n@News Ping Howdy lumberjacks! This interview was conducted by @Dallinz but New Year 🗓 and he interviewed @Marl3yys! Let's get right into it!!\n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2? \nA: I found out about LT2 somewhere around 2019. I was watching a YouTuber’s videos and came across a LT2 video of her getting lava wood. It caught my attention so I decided to check the game out.\n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in LT2? \nA: The most memorable moment in LT2 was when I was driving recklessly while my friend was scared for their dear life. (Drive safely guys😄) \n\nQ: What makes LT2 different from other tycoon games on Roblox? \nA: LT2 is way different from other tycoon games because before, LT2 tycoon games were those boring afk tycoons where you’d just step into buttons and earn money easily. In LT2, you get to experience different things like selling, building, buying, trading and much more. \n\nQ: What do you think is the best item in the game? \nA: I think the best item in the game is the duck gift. They’re so adorable and could be a pet. \n\nQ: Do you have any future ambitions for LT2 or real life that you would like to share? \nA: What I’d like to achieve for the future is to make a few more friends, become an author, a tattoo artist and be apart of the US Customs and Border Protection Homeland security.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing in the LT2 Fan Group Server? \nA: My favorite thing in the LT2 Fan Group Server is that there are friendly and funny people who I can get along with and enjoy interacting with. \n\nQ: If you could add anything to LT2, what would it be?\nA: If I could add anything into LT2, I’d add a setting that would allow us to choose a time of day we’d like for our screen only. I’d also add corner wedges since they are useful for builders and others. \n\nQ: Any interesting facts about yourself? \nA: I enjoy making different genres of stories and I am currently working on one. \n\nQ: Is there anything else you would like to say to everyone reading? \nA: I’d love to give a special thanks to Gomi and Harukii for helping me out and convincing me into trying out to be a journalist.\n\nInterview Conducted by: @Dallinz but New Year 🗓"},{"number":"94","title":"94","category":"Article","date":"2024-01-15","author":"@BeeSwarmGod, @⚡Gomi⚡","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1196260435452776550","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**94**\n\n@News Ping Hello everyone! Welcome back to week 94 of the news! Let's hop in and see what this week has brought to us.\n\n**Applications**\nPlease welcome @Penqui281 and @TTVNot_ROACH to the Journalist team. Good luck next time to those who did not make it.\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nTwo lg practice matches were hosted. The winners were @Isabella and @Lonmower ❂\n\n**Rankups**\n\nCarpenter: @joshuaThe5th\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @robloxcommunity4321, @oldguy5678, @Blue_LumberNoob, @enxvy\n\nElite Electrician: @juanirt51\n\nLumberjack Merchant: @eman, @Forever_T0gether, @enxvy\n\nCarpenter Specialist: @enxvy\n\nLumber Artist: @enxvy\n\n\n**Staff Birthday**\n\n\nOn January 12th, one of the Supervisors had their Birthday. That SPECIAL Supervisor was… @swartz_duckwhisperer! Thank you for protecting the server! And we hope you had an amazing Birthday!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJan-8: @Dark_DataBase @OwlXw\nJan-9: @youtubelol2468xxx\nJan-11: @KBab @Zero\nJan-12: @Alovelybone\nHappy Birthday! We hope you enjoyed it!\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nWobbly Gift of Uncertainty \n\nThe Wobbly Gift of Uncertainty was a Christmas item bought in the 2015 Christmas Event. The amount of money you had to pay for this gift was 220 dollars. It was wrapped in yellow paper, the shape was a cube, and even had a purple tie for it. The actual gift inside was a Wobbly head that was yellow with a smiley face on it. A special secret that most Wobbly Heads have are, they can hitch to a truck or trailer. \n\n**Closing**\n\nThe news team hopes we brought in the best of the news this week and brought you all up to date on what is going on this week! Thank you and see you next week!\n\nNews: @BeeSwarmGod, @⚡Gomi⚡"},{"number":"45","title":"Interview Wednesday #45","category":"Interview","date":"2024-01-18","author":"@Sam","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1197356208839995524","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #45**\n\n@News Ping   Hi, and welcome back to the weekly interview! This week we interviewed @donut_2  a Lumber Games Champion!\n\nQ : What was your most memorable spook tree, or have you ever found one?\nA : Unfortunately I've never found a spook tree, looked for years but never had any luck.\n\nQ : What is your favorite tree generation in the game?\nA : Easily lava wood, comes in big chunks of and its good for everything.\n\nQ : Do you like logic? if yes, how good are you at a scale of 1 to 10?\nA : Logic is great edition to the game for bases but I'd say I'm a solid 2 out of 10.\n\nQ : What wood combo for building do you think is the best?\nA : Cherry wood and regular oak wood it's simple, but looks awesome when a base is built out of it.\n\nQ : What is your favorite season of LT2 events? \nA : Christmas, with the white snow covering the map and the unique gifts added every year.\n\nInterviewer : @Sam"},{"number":"95","title":"#95","category":"Article","date":"2024-01-22","author":"@Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1198837753983533148","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#95**\n\n@News Ping Hi and welcome to week 95! We’ve got some good stuff this week that we hope you will enjoy!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nWe had four rounds of LG this week! Three of which were practice and one was no reward, two of the practice rounds were won by @Lonmower ❂, and the other was won by @M23, as well as the no reward match being won by @On1ty\n\n**Rankups**\n\nElectrician: @OwenL1230\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJan-15: , <@>413382378904354816\nJan-16: @deevf\nJan-17: @Alex\nJan-19: \nJan-20: @MinnyBrisk\n\nHappy birthday, everyone!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nLumbkin\n\nThe Lumbkin was an item available in the 2019 Halloween event at Bob’s Shack. This item costed 620 cash and was made by player and contributor mahbucketeer. The item has a close to gray wood texturing on the outside and a close to beige wood texturing on the inside, as well, it is the only pumpkin that does not emit any light, and has a small cartoon leaf on top of it. It is the only in-game pumpkin to not have pumpkin in its name.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lumbkin\n\n**Closing**\n\nWe hope we had some great news for you all this week! Thanks for reading and see you soon!\n\nNews: @Gomi\nLumbkin\nThe Lumbkin is a decorative Loose Item that could be purchased from Bob's Shack for $620 Money. It was added on October 2nd, 2019, as a part of the 2019 Halloween Event. This item was made by wiki...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lumbkin"},{"number":"46","title":"Interview Wednesday #46","category":"Interview","date":"2024-01-24","author":"@BeeSwarmGod","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1199836158683783278","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #46**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to the weekly interview! This week we have decided to interview… @Kamel_Lewandowski ! Thank you for letting yourself use a bit of time for this interview. Let's get started!\n\nQ: How did you come across Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I was looking for a co-operative game to play with my Friend (He's my neighbor) and I came across LT2!\n\nQ: The times you played LT2, were there any memories you may have enjoyed? Could you elaborate?\nA: When I played for the first time with my Friend, It was an amazing and unforgettable time, Cannot forget how reckless we were as drivers after we bought the Utility Vehicle 😂\n\nQ: What event do you think is the best? Ranging from Halloween, Christmas, Thanksgiving or any other event you can think of.\nA: Christmas, It's just full of Content and surprises, Which makes it better than the others!\n\nQ: What is the max amount of money you have obtained just from selling your own stuff without others help? (Can be an estimate)\nA: 100,000$ after someone told me to buy him 20 wires, That was the first and last time I did a job for somebody!\n\nQ: Is there a update you would like, Defaultio to add? Could be from bug fixes or just items.\nA: Probably some Optimization, Due to the massive amount of lag in Public servers, If he managed to optimize it very well, Maybe increase Max Players in each server to like 8 probably, Would be great!\n\nQ: Do you think the 20 Million cash limit is fair?\nA: Yes and No at the same time, It changes depending on the perspective, Since there are lots of Duplicators and Exploiters, It's fair, otherwise they would have had about 2 Trillion now, But for other hard-working players, That might not be fair."},{"number":"96","title":"#96","category":"Article","date":"2024-01-29","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1201379046714507285","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#96**\n\n@News Ping Hello, and welcome back to week 96 of the weekly news! We hope this week's news covers everything most of you look for!\n\n**Events**\n\nSoon, the Lumber Tycoon 2 Fan Group Discord will be hosting a map-building contest for their specially made game, The Lumber Games. There is no concrete start or end date, but anyone can submit their map and possibly have it added to LG!\n\nApplications for Daily Dose Of Lumber are also open. Check out the announcements channel if you wish to apply!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nWe had four no-reward matches this week! @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂ had one win, @Lonmower ❂ had one win, and @Inkio had two wins!\n\n**Rankups**\n\nDue to base review tickets being closed, we have no rankups, but keep an eye out shortly!\n\n\nBut sometimes, that rule doesn't apply to everything. Today, somebody has earned themselves the Youtuber role; this person was @Creeper_2224!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJan-22: @fartsona\nJan-24: @Bru_Mi, @Mistaken, @Noah 😍\nJan-25: @cheemo_inf\nJan-26: @MakesMeRage,@Cookies\nJan-27:@TheodoreTheDuck,,@gotdwq,@jakobplayzroblox1,@justnerp\nWow! Tons of birthdays this week! We hope everyone had the best birthday, including @fartsona, our Assistant Manager! 🎊 🍰 \n\n**Server Boosters**\n\nThe server was boosted by @bdon1356, @davislaud2, @ihatesimps,  and @Jayzrll this week! Thanks a ton!\n\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nGift of Snow\n\nThe Gift of Snow present was a gift from the 2022 Christmas event in Lumber Tycoon 2. This gift, when unboxed, revealed a new vehicle that most would have not thought about. This vehicle was the snowmobile. This vehicle best responds to the snow as it moves faster than being on the grass itself. The shape of the gift was a cube, half blue on the bottom and half gray on the top. It included a gray ribbon as well. \n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_of_Snow\n\n**Closing**\nThis is all of this week's news! We hope everything was brought to your attention. We will see you guys next week.\n\nNews:\nGift of Snow\nThe Gift of Snow is a gift that could be purchased from Boxed Cars for $130,600 Money as part of the 2022 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Snowmobile. This item was created by wiki...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_of_Snow"},{"number":"47","title":"Interview Wednesday #47","category":"Interview","date":"2024-02-01","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1202442086620725268","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #47**\n\n@News Ping Hello! Today we interviewed @Esky !\n\nQ: How did you come across Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: One of my mates was playing it and i joined him randomly, Ended up joining by myself again and again.\n\nQ: The times you played LT2, were there any memories you may have enjoyed? Could you elaborate?\nA: Heaps to pick from, my favorites would probably have to be finally finding the cave crawler biome or finding my first spook tree.\n\nQ:  Is there a update you would like, Defaultio to add? Could be from bug fixes or just items.\nA:It would be really nice if defaultio added some sort of piston like Minecraft, I reckon people would have a bit of fun with that.\n\nQ: What Pumpkin do you think is the best from the Halloween events?\nA: My favorite is the rosa `a pumpkin.\n\nQ: What was your most memorable spook tree, or have you ever found one?\nA: I found a spook tree bright as day in the taiga biome, then disconnected.\n\nQ: What is your favorite tree generation in the game?\nA: I love Koa and pine wood\n\nQ: What wood combo for building do you think is the best?\nA: Koa and walnut wood.\n\nQ: What is your favorite item or location in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My favorite item would have to be dynamite and my favorite location would have to be bobs shack\n\nQ: Have you done any builds, and of which, what would be your favorite?\nA: Yes. I built Kowloon walled city and bunnings warehouse but i cant decide what one i like more.\n\nQ: What makes LT2 different from other tycoon games on Roblox?\nA: Its more or less a sandbox game;  you build what you want instead of standing on buttons for half an hour; Allows for more variety in gameplay\n\nThank you!\n\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"97","title":"#97","category":"Article","date":"2024-02-05","author":"@Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1203908352808063006","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#97**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to week 97! We hope today’s news will satisfy you, so let’s get right into it!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week in The Lumber Games we had two matches. The first of which was a no rewards match won by @GDTMartins, and the second match was an official match won by @bluestarblue1\n\n**Rankups**\n\nThis week we don’t have any  as base reviewer tickets are still closed. In the coming weeks we should have some, though!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJan-29: @fourteencurve75, @Simply-OJ!!!\nJan-30: @CATERV2, @Love200812, \nJan-31: @FestiveChristmasTree\nFeb-1: @TheodoreTheDuck\nFeb-2: @perpar6668, @ProLover_750\nFeb4: @ZONE2rt5\nQuite a few birthdays this week, hope you all enjoyed them!\n\n**Server Boosters**\n\nThis week the server was boosted by @zulfikar_alii, and @Edge_Trader. Thanks a ton for the boosts!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nPumpkin\n\nThe Pumpkin was available for the duration of the halloween event in 2015. It was purchased at Bob’s shack for 360 cash, the cheapest of any pumpkin in the game. This was also the first pumpkin added, and also had the lighting effect that is common among the pumpkins in Lumber Tycoon 2. Its design is made up of a bright yellowish orange on the outside, and a bright yellow on the inside and a supposed burn mark on the side.\n\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Pumpkin\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for reading this week's news! We’ll be back next week with more, so keep your eye out!\n\nNews: @Gomi\nPumpkin\nThe Pumpkin is an item that was only available during the 2015 Halloween Event and could be purchased from Bob's Shack, for $360 Money. It was the first pumpkin to be added to the game. Players...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Pumpkin"},{"number":"48","title":"Interview Wednesday #48","category":"Interview","date":"2024-02-08","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1205031243796717619","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"***Interview Wednesday #48***\n\n@News Ping Hello and welcome back to the weekly interview! today we will be interviewing an Event Committee That goes by the name of @Lonmower ❂\n\nQ : Do you like the events that are being hosted in the fan-group discord?\nA : Yes i like the events as i like interacting with others!\n\nQ : What are your opinions on the End Times that happen on the 31st of october?\nA : I think its a good idea, and a good incentive for people to hunt for spooky and sinister trees more! (Personally i never do it though.)\n\nQ : Do you play Lumber Tycoon 2 alot or no?\nA : Not much, sometimes i can play alot for a month or so, but then never play for like 8 months.\n\nQ : Do you think some of the gifts in Lumber Tycoon 2 are overpriced?\nA : Only some of them, such as the snow mobile gift, it was like 300 Thousand for a single vehicle.\n\nQ : Do you enjoy making complicated wiring in your projects?\nA : Very much so, im a logician after all!\n\nQ : Do you have any large projects? if yes, do you plan on making them soon?\nA : I have an unfinished coded lock that i will probably not finish due to my lack of motivation.\n\nQ : Do you enjoy events hosted on the affiliated servers of the official fangroup? \nA : Yes, I enjoy the gamenights (that i can attend to) in the Lumber Shack, especially because im a staff member (intern) there.\n\nInterview Conducted By: @Sam"},{"number":"98","title":"#98","category":"Article","date":"2024-02-11","author":"@BeeSwarmGod, @⚡Gomi⚡","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1206355152685240350","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#98***\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to the weekly news! We are glad that we can share some information that has happened in the server this week, let's get started.\n\n**Discord Updates**\n\nWe finally set up the new roles which you can check out in <#1204866496627613766>\n\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no matches of The Lumber Games hosted this week!\n\n**Rankups**\n\nExperienced LumberJack: \nElectrician Specialist: @GamingJacobJunior\n\n**Birthdays**\n\n\nFeb-5: @intothedarkness45,@lucius756area\nFeb-7: @Snowy,@THE_BEAST2110\nFeb-8: @ImprovedSquid\nFeb-10: @ez_Scoob,@gabarugavaska,@❄King Saquon # 26 ❄, @bluishcandy5584\nFeb-11: @juncster123,@rocket211\nThere were so many birthdays this week!! We hope you guys enjoyed/are enjoying them!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks a ton to  for boosting this week!\n\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nCandy Cane Axe\n\nThe Candy Cane Axe was a special axe brought into the game during the 2016 Christmas Event. This axe would cost you 6000 dollars. The design of this axe is self explanatory, but, it has striped lines of the color red, like a candy cane would have and has a base surface of white. A feature that only this axe has that others don't is that it cannot chop any trees down. If you were to use the axe on the tree, it would drop from the player's inventory making it the worst axe in the game.\n\nSource: Candy Cane Axe | Lumber Tycoon 2 Wiki | Fandom\n\nNews: @BeeSwarmGod, @⚡Gomi⚡"},{"number":"49","title":"Interview Wednesday #49","category":"Interview","date":"2024-02-16","author":"@⚡Gomi⚡","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1207843673384165406","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #49**\n\n@News Ping Today we have an interview done by @⚡Gomi⚡ who interviewed @Ghost ‧ GMT. Hope you enjoy!\n\nQ: How did you find out about LT2?\nA: I found Lumber Tycoon 2 several years ago when I first found Roblox. This was also the time when I found out that my favorite type of games were tycoons. I would come home and play tycoon games with my friends.\n\nQ: What is your favorite memory from playing LT2?\nA: There is no specific favorite memory from playing Lumber Tycoon 2 for me. My favorite experiences while playing on Lumber Tycoon 2 is when I spend it playing with my friends, stealing each others vehicles and just having a laugh with each other.\n\nQ: How long have you been playing LT2?\nA: I have been playing Lumber Tycoon 2 for several years, I think it was around 2018 when I first started playing. Over the years I have been able to meet awesome people, collect items and share awesome memories with people.\n\nQ: What feature of LT2 keeps you coming back?\nA: Back then I liked to chop down trees and put it through the sawmill to be able to create my bases. Now I like to join and collect the new items and wood, as I like to collect items, achievements and badges in games. I keep coming back to Lumber Tycoon 2 as I have a large amount of progress with me having one of every event item in-game.\n\nQ: What is your favorite item and place in LT2?\nA: My favorite items would be the traffic cone and the duck. My favorite place would be the Ticktatwert Memorial.\n\nQ: What is your favorite wood in LT2?\nA: My favorite wood is the Sinister wood and the walnut wood.\n\nInterviewer: @⚡Gomi⚡"},{"number":"99","title":"#99","category":"Article","date":"2024-02-19","author":"@bent1133, @Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1208998614404308993","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#99**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to another week of the news! Hope you enjoy!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week we had two practice matches! First round going to @Jordan 🌈 - OJ!! and second one going to @BornWings3013 \n\n**Rankups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @funkids155, @Gomi, , @jakobplayzroblox1\nElectrician Specialist: , \nElectrician: @Reflux_0, ,\n, @Trakie, @Tommydewompie\nCarpenter Specialist: @Tommydewompie, @jakobplayzroblox1\nCarpenter: , @Zjikavunohu Haku \"Reasonal\", @jakobplayzroblox1\nLumberjack Merchant: , @123Will890, \nLumber Artist: , @Adam_5291⚡- OJ!!!!!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nFeb-12: \nFeb-13: \nFeb-14: @Flabblegats, @LawrenceJared\nFeb-16: @SteveIndustries | Director\nFeb-17: @Gregarious_Egg, @klecik2 | #1 ATV hater\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to  For Boosting The Server!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nEerie Skull\n\nThe Eerie Skull, more commonly known as the skull was an obtainable item scheduled to release as a part of the 2016 halloween event, in company with the Dark Pumpkin, and The preserved Ostrich Eye.\n\nThe Skull was inserted early into the game files, which was a larger mistake on Defaultio’s part, as this allowed players to exploit the Eerie skull into the game. The Eerie skull was removed permanently.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Eerie_Skull\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for tuning in this week! See you next time for another lumber news!\n\nNews: @bent1133, @Gomi, ,\n@omgitsmejon\nEerie Skull\nThe Eerie Skull, often called simply the Skull, was an in-game item that was going to be released as a part of the 2016 Halloween Event, along with the Dark Pumpkin and the Preserved Enlarged...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Eerie_Skull"},{"number":"50","title":"Interview Wednesday  #50","category":"Interview","date":"2024-02-22","author":"@Dallinz but New Year 🗓","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1210114048608309380","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday  #50__**\n\n@News Ping Hello Lumberjacks! Today we had a interview conducted by @Dallinz but New Year 🗓 who interviewed @Speedy ! How you enjoy !! \n\nQ: How and when did you find out about LT2?\nA: the way I found LT2 was when me and a couple old mates were game hopping and stumbled onto LT2, and I've been playing ever since. I started back in June 2017 I believe so almost 7 years. \n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in LT2?\nA: I think my most memorable moment was finishing my gold bridge. I remember lobby hopping letting anyone use it to get the wood they needed which was pretty fun and created some fun moments.\nBuilding my Ticktatwert base is a close 2nd.\n\nQ: What makes LT2 different from other tycoon games on Roblox?\nA: The thing that Made LT2 stand out from other games is that LT2 is a full sandbox building game. There is 0 limit to what you can build and no other games from my knowledge had or still has the same freedom that LT2 has.\n\nQ: What do you think is the best item in the game?\nA: The best item in the would obviously be the basic hatchet ofc.\n\nQ: Do you have any future ambitions for LT2 or real life that you would like to share?\nA: My ambition for LT2 is to finish my Ticktatwert base but I have got zero time to do so. My IRL ambition is to finish off my mechanics course and get set up doing anything around that.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing in the LT2 Fan Group Server?\nA:  My favourite thing about the LT2 server is still feeling welcomed even after being in the server for 6+ years I can come back after months and talk to people i spoke to when I left.\n\nQ: If you could add anything to LT2, what would it be?\nA: If I could add anything to LT2 it would probably be more detailed vehicles as they are lacking detail nowadays.\n\nQ: Any interesting facts about yourself?\nA:I almost wrote off my uncles car when I was 16 if that's interesting lol\n\nInterviewer: @Dallinz but New Year 🗓"},{"number":"100","title":"#100","category":"Article","date":"2024-02-26","author":"@Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1211484170329526284","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#100**\n\n@News Ping Hello and welcome to week 100 of the news! Thanks for tuning in to our articles the past 100 times and we hope you’ll enjoy this one!\n\n**Events**\n\nThe Fan Group is hosting a logic competition! Check out more information in <#332295148778029067> and join with your build at <#679042272704069704>.\n\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week we had two no-rewards matches! One was won by @Lonmower ❂, and the other by @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂.\n\n**Rankups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @GVXKY\nCarpenter Specialist: @FederalLaw, @Acidk10\nElectrician Specialist: @Happygamer1983\n\n\n**Birthdays**\nFeb-19: @CaptainCruiser8  , @Jimmy \nFeb-20: @NoobMaster11166, @Totally not Jorne the Spy🎄\nFeb-22: @Eastren_Dev\nFeb-23: @giantjester309, @Vextrv\nFeb-25: @Gamer_Boy1235 , @JugeeA  \nWe hope every one of you guys have an amazing Birthday!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks a ton to @BelowHanded for boosting the server this week!"},{"number":"51","title":"Interview Wednesday #51","category":"Interview","date":"2024-02-28","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1212483993166159872","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #51__**\n\n@News Ping Thank you for checking in for entire 51 weeks of the interview!\nToday we have a special guest that is an owner of the affiliated server of the fan-group! Today we are interviewing : @Mr. iiadapter!\n\nQ : Do you enjoy being an affiliated server owner of the official lumber tycoon 2 server?\nA : Yes, I love it actually. I love having the opportunity to spread the shack out, and also have a great relationship with our brothering server. I enjoy it because it has taught me a lot, and I still have lots to learn. I enjoy being able to share my experiences, and my passion for the shack, and working beside the fan group. I love our community events, when we team up, and have an event together. I could go on and on, but yes, I love it! \n\nQ : Are you famous in the official fan-group because you are an owner of the lumber-shack?\nA : Kind of, not entirely, however The Shack has a big part of it. I was known in the community before the shack, so having the shack adds to it, so I’d say part of it yes. \n\nQ : Are you good at building or logic in lumber tycoon 2?\nA : not really, my most complex thing I’ve made was an alarm with Cesar. \n\nQ : If you have ever spook-hunted, did you enjoy it? and what is the best spooky tree you have found if you did?\nA : I have, but I don’t have my pictures anymore. The best one I found grew in the volcano road, it was so hard to get lol! I enjoy the challenge of spooky hunting. \n\nQ : Do the people of your server enjoy event's in-game and hosted by the supervisors?\nA : Not entirely sure what you mean, but I’m sure they enjoy spooky hunting and other game events. I don’t attend much of fan groups events due to being busy irl, so I’m not sure if my server members attend. \n\nQ : Are you actually good at knowledge in lumber tycoon two?\nA :  yea, I been playing for a good couple years, since 2015 about. Knowledge in knowing about the game yes. \n\nInterview Conducted By: @Sam - CCST"},{"number":"101","title":"#101","category":"Article","date":"2024-03-04","author":"@Kingboo, @Sam - CCST : OJ!, @⚡Gomi⚡, @BeeSwarmGod","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1214049599354834994","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#101**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome back to the weekly lumber-news!\n\n**Highlights**\nThis is a new section we are testing out for the news. It is supposed to let people with not much time read the news!\nThis week we ended up having 6 LG matches, 1 Rankup, 5 Birthdays, 5 Boosters, and the Wiki Fact was about spook and sinister leaves.\n\n**Lumber Games**\nA test match of the Lumber Games was hosted this week, And new game modes, items, and swords were tested. This was hosted to test out the new items and find and fix any bugs in the systems. Anyways, this week had no real matches sadly. It contained 3 practice matches. For the first match, OverratedRudolfs55 won, for the second match, PandaHDT won and last but not least… Inkio04 won the last practice match! Congratulations!\n\n**Rankups**\nExperienced Lumberjack : @Panda\nElectrician Specialist : @kiera - oj!!\nRemember that you can also apply for roles in <#1018664888152903803> with the base review ticket.\n\n\n**Birthdays**\nFeb-28: @LT2_Hamel2007, @smellman12346 \nMar-2: @Pluto\nMar-3: @contentdeleted853, @foxyliker256\nHappy Birthday to all of you and we wish you the best!\n\n**Boosters**\nThanks to @broLook_itsBred, @Panda, @⚡Gomi⚡, @gdsjhddhsj, and @Roach - OJ !! for boosting the server!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week!**\n\nHalloween Tree Leaves\n\nSpooky, Sinister, and Zombie Trees are actually loosely related to one another! \nThere are no visible leaves on spooky or sinister trees, which is caused by their leaf size being set to 0, making the trees appear leafless. Zombie, Sinister, and Spooky trees also use the same material for their leaves, spooky and sinister, although not having leaves, do still require a material for them, which in the game code is coded to be the granite texture, the one you see on the zombie tree! \nThis was revealed by one of the administrators of Lumber Tycoon 2 Wiki, that being Electro Tech!\nSource : https://youtu.be/qsn711Vkl4I?si=WLmnQgmOsQt1rQQY fact #11 (Made by Electro Tech)\n\nClosing\n\nThank you for tuning in to this week's Lumber News! Bye and see you next week!\n\nNews By: @Kingboo, @Sam - CCST : OJ!, @⚡Gomi⚡, @BeeSwarmGod\n30 Things You Didn't Know About Lumber Tycoon 2\nIn this video I explain 30 facts that you probably didn’t know about Lumber Tycoon 2, ranging from the actual names of trees to the history of the game’s thumbnails. These facts are interesting, so buckle up and enjoy the video!\n\nPART 2: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcBrLjnI9kI&t\r\n==============================\r\nMY LINKS:\r\n\r\nDiscord | https:/...\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qsn711Vkl4I\nElectro Tech"},{"number":"102","title":"#102","category":"Article","date":"2024-03-11","author":"@BeeSwarmGod, @⚡Gomi⚡ - OJ, @Marl3yys, @Sam - CCST : OJ! , @Kingboo","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1216580294493212672","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#102**\n\nWelcome back to the news, @News Ping! Hope you enjoy what we have in store this week!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week we had three practice LG matches! Congratulations to our winners, being @Panda, @bluestarblue1, and @Aria!\n\n**Rank Ups**\nCarpenter Specialist : @UnvoicedMercy.\nElite Carpenter : @Aria\n Lumberjack Merchant : @UnvoicedMercy.\nElectrician : @UnvoicedMercy.\nExperienced Lumberjack : @RatTrucks , @Aria, @mootburrito1238\nLumberjack Artist : @Aria\n\n\n**Birthdays**\nMar-4: @24k_Sxns  , @Sirred90\nMar-5: @Jackson\nMar-6:  @Shadowheart  \nMar-7: @loopdoopoo  \nMar-8: @supergoku3678 , @Marianneczek  , @wilmergamingYT_TTV  \nMar-11: @Haadzafar2021\nHappy Birthday to all of you and we wish you the best!\n\n**Boosters**\nThank you to @Roach - OJ !!, @lawrencejared, and @itsdarkpr for boosting the server.\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week** \n\nGift of Tremendously Important Knowledge\n\nThe Gift of Tremendously Important Knowledge was a gift which was stored in Bobs shack. It was a Christmas event from 2020. The original price of this gift was 604 dollars. It contained a red box, white snowflakes all around it and a green bow on top of it. What was in the gift was a book named the Hatchet which stored all tons of knowledge.\nSource: Gift of Tremendously Important Knowledge | Lumber Tycoon 2 Wiki | Fandom\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for reading the news this week! See you next time!\n\nNews By: @BeeSwarmGod, @⚡Gomi⚡ - OJ, @Marl3yys, @Sam - CCST : OJ! , @Kingboo"},{"number":"52","title":"Interview Wednesday #52","category":"Interview","date":"2024-03-14","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1217638426946310154","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #52**\n\n@News Ping Welcome back to week 52, where we post interviews every Wednesday! This week, we have decided to interview @mootburrito1238! \n\nQ: What is one of the best memories you've had playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: back in the day when the first events were made. i loved having them\n\nQ: What is a update or game content update you would want Defaultio to work on?\nA: A new biome/area to bring the game back \n\nQ: what even do you prefer, Halloween, Thanksgiving or Christmas events?\nA: its a mix between the Christmas and Halloween, but id say the Halloween events are.\n\nQ: What is the most amount of money you have obtained just from yourself, no one else giving you it.\nA: I've gotten about 5 mil \n\nQ: What kind of axe would you like to see in the near future? What could it be used for?\nA: i feel like there should be a new axe for a new permanent wood \n\nQ: How many hours do you think you have played Lumber Tycoon 2 for?\nA: about 10+ hours a week \n\nQ: What is the best function or item in the game that changes how the game works, in your opinion?\nA: i think the logic items because you can make some really good electric systems\nInterview Conducted By: @Mrkillu0106"},{"number":"103","title":"#103","category":"Article","date":"2024-03-18","author":"@⚡Gomi⚡ - OJ, @Marl3yys, @Kingboo, @Mrkillu0106","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1219110219221827594","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#103**\n\nWelcome to this week's news, @News Ping! We’ve got some exciting news this week!\n\n**News Manager Birthday**\nThis week the news team manager @omgitsmejon 🎄 had his birthday! We at the news team hope it was a great one and are very thankful for the work he has done!\n\n**Updates**\nEarlier this week, a new indent was found on one of the rocks in the mainland. This indent could be entered via use of the blueprint glitch (rotating a blueprint on your truck) and led to a cave with a rig of Defaultio inside, with a name tag saying rig. The cave was opened soon after, without the rig of Defaultio.\n\nFrom what we've heard, Defaultio has made the decision to close the new found cave, and delete the strange legs and rig, or atleast move them to an unforeseen location.\n\nAs of now, the update for LT2 has officially been released! This update was for The Hunt and introduced (update spoilers) ||a bird creature||. To complete the hunt update and get the ||egg|| you must ||put a small piece of wood on the pedestal in front of the bird, and then get the egg from behind it’s legs, and bring it to the counter at wood r us, then talk to thom. You can also save the egg to your base.||\n\n**Rankups**\n\nElite Carpenter: @Bagel\nCarpenter: @xb0y_416, @superman4money3\nElectrician: @xb0y_416, @rep\nExperienced Lumberjack: @xb0y_416,\n@superman4money3, @yamaharider17,\n@ashtoonthebaboon\nLumberjack Merchant: @xb0y_416\n\nCongrats on ranking up!\n**Birthdays**\nMar-13: @Avi Polaris , @omgitsmejon 🎄\nMar-15: @Leah. Goddess Of Nothing. , @legomaniac0010\nMar-16: @legoxbric\nHappy Birthday to all of you and we wish you the best!\n**Boosters**\n\nThank you to @BetterThanU_IR for boosting the server.\n**Lumber Games**\nThis week we had 2 no rewards LG matches. The winner of the first match was won by @Dallinz but New Year 🗓 and the second game was won by @jgorsc5200. Good job to both of the winners!\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nWobbly Gift of High Confidence\n\nThe Wobbly Gift of High Confidence was a Christmas item that was brought into 2017 as a Christmas event item. The original price was 470 dollars. What was inside the box was a Wobbly Head that was also Purple. The shape of the Box was a box that was also green and had a purple ribbon. \n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for reading the news this week! See you next time!\n\n\nNews: @⚡Gomi⚡ - OJ, @Marl3yys, @Kingboo, @Mrkillu0106"},{"number":"53","title":"Interview Wednesday (woopsies) #53","category":"Interview","date":"2024-03-21","author":"@⚡Gomi⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1220433872072999014","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday (woopsies) #53__**\n\n@News Ping! Thanks for coming to our 53rd week of interviews! This week we had @⚡Gomi⚡ - OJ interview @drmackattack!\n\nQ: When did you first start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I started playing shortly after the game came out, so around December 2015 and January 2016.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My favorite thing about Lumber Tycoon 2 is probably building and is something really enjoyable and something I feel I am good at, but wood gathering is also quite soothing.\n\nQ: What, if given the chance, would you add to Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My personal favorite idea for something to be added is allowing players to buy a computer from Wood R Us and allowing them to then order bulk items with it, as well, I think that adding more non-limited axes would be nice.\n\nQ: What is your biggest project in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My biggest projects would honestly be my pixel art bases (which I no longer have), but I also spend a lot of time on themed bases, such as my city build which has a lot of shops and stuff that you would otherwise find in a city.\n\nQ: Do you prefer building or logic?\nA: I prefer building over logic, mainly because I am not the greatest at logic, even despite my ability to make some simple mechanisms, but I feel like my skill at building far outweighs my skill and expertise with logic, as well as when it comes to consistent enjoyment.\n\nQ: What is your favorite wood/item/location in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: My favorite wood is Cavecrawler, and the reason I like it so much is because it is a harder wood to get and it's a fun experience to go and get. I also personally like the tropics region, and for items I think all of the presents would have to constitute for my answer.\n\nQ: What makes Lumber Tycoon 2 stand out to you over other games?\nA: Lumber Tycoon 2 really has no limitations to what I can do, having no prebuilt stuff and having some great tools for playing sandbox. \n\nInterview by: @⚡Gomi⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"104","title":"104","category":"Article","date":"2024-03-25","author":"@Marley🍓 | CST, @KingBoo - OJ!, and @Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1221624163001962536","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**104**\n\nWelcome to this week's news, @News Ping!\n\n**Rankups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack:\n@henry3, @ChetosDoritosZambos, @cherrry123456, @gaglele, @YourRoxDev, @Cookies\nCarpenter: @YourRoxDev\nLumber Merchant: @YourRoxDev, @Cookies\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nMarch-18: @10Xtrixy, \nMarch-20: @HappyGhost🌈:D \nMarch-21: @bent1133\nMarch-23: @Lolxdidkjustaname\nMarch-24: @ironronan2403\nHappy Birthday to all of you! We all wish you the best!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to  for boosting!\n\n**Lumber Games**\nThis week we had 2 practice matches. The winner for the first match was @ChetosDoritosZambos!\nCongratulations to the winner for winning!\n\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nDark Pumpkin\n\nThe Dark Pumpkin was an item released in 2016 for Halloween. It was sold for 500 cash at Bob’s Shack and was based on the Roblox item named “Darkseed The Fallen”. This item’s coloration is jet black and a purple/magenta gradient, and it emits a purple glow. This item was sold in its box and can be unboxed. Its description is “You feel this pumpkin calling you from deep within.”, which was originally able to be seen when checking the box before it could be opened and can now be seen by checking the pumpkin itself.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Pumpkin\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for reading the news this week! See you next time!\n\n\nNews: @Marley🍓 | CST, @KingBoo - OJ!, and @Gomi\nDark Pumpkin\nThe Dark Pumpkin is an item that was on sale at Bob's Shack for $500 Money during the 2016 Halloween Event. The Dark Pumpkin seems to have a similar appearance to the Pumpkin, disregarding color...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Pumpkin"},{"number":"105","title":"105","category":"Article","date":"2024-04-01","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1224182051033317457","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**105**\n\n\nThanks for coming and welcome to this week’s news @News Ping!\n\n**Updates**\n\nThis week Defaulio removed all functionality from the hunt event, including the cave, creature, and access to the egg and badge associated. The eggs still save to the plots of users and can be transferred among plots, but they are now considered a limited event item with no current method of acquiring them. \n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nCarpenter : @nearepick\nExperienced Lumberjack : @kaikaithecableguy,@Happygamer1983 \nLumberjack Merchant : @Happygamer1983\n\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nMarch-26: @Mrswag72\nMarch-27: @Faceless 🎄, @PopKieThaCat\nMarch-28: @Boy Grandma, @ItzCuantikoX\nMarch-30: \nMarch-31: \nHappy Birthday to all of you! We wish you the best!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nEgg\n\nThe Egg was added as a part of the [The Hunt: First Edition](https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/The_Hunt:_First_Edition) event. Players had to obtain this egg in order to obtain Egg Acquired: [The Hunt](https://www.roblox.com/badges/1491637208006345/Egg-Acquired-The-Hunt), the LT2 hunt badge, which shows a red egg and has the hunt badge border. The Egg itself is a yellowish white color and has a sort of grainy texture. It is currently able to be saved to your base (with the implication that it will be this way forever), and has the description “An egg!”. The obtaining of the egg involved entering a new cave that had the “creature” inside of it, and placing a small piece of wood on the stone pedestal in front of it, then prompting it to destroy (or eat?) the wood, and lay an egg, which can be picked up by anyone until someone interacts with it.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Egg\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for reading! We hope we see you all next Sunday!\n\nNews by : , @bent1133, @KingBoo - OJ!, @Gomi\nThe Hunt: First Edition\nSee The Hunt To do The Hunt in Lumber Tycoon 2, see Egg\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/The_Hunt:_First_Edition\nEgg Acquired: The Hunt - Roblox\nRoblox is a global platform that brings people together through play.\nhttps://www.roblox.com/badges/1491637208006345/Egg-Acquired-The-Hunt),\nEgg\nThe Egg is an item that was introduced as part of the 2024 The Hunt: First Edition event and was required to obtain the badge Egg Acquired: The Hunt. To obtain the Egg, the player had to place a...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Egg"},{"number":"54","title":"Interview Wednesday #54","category":"Interview","date":"2024-04-03","author":"@KingBoo - AJ!!!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1225218524692349018","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #54__**\n\nHello @News Ping and thanks for tuning into our 54th week of interviews! This week @KingBoo - AJ!!! interviewed .\n\nQ: When did you start playing LT2 and how did you find it? \n\nA: I started playing in 2016 and I found it scrolling through Roblox. \n\nQ: What made you stick with playing LT2 instead of other games? \n\nA: It was fun and it wasn't like any other tycoon games. \n\nQ: What was your greatest accomplishment in LT2? \n\nA: I would probably say getting a slot with data size 20 and getting banned for it, High Net worth. \n\nQ: What is one update you'd like to see in the game? \n\nA: I’d love to see an update that involves Asia. I think it should include new wood types (like some sort of jungle wood), and a bamboo axe. I would also like to see more blueprints added to the game. \n\nQ: What's one piece of advice for all the new players joining because of the hunt? \n\nA: I would suggest that new players should get ice wood, get 10m, buy golden blueprint, get data size 20, then get more wood until 20M, then follow your dreams in the game, or quit.\n\n\nInterview by: @KingBoo - AJ!!!"},{"number":"106","title":"#106","category":"Article","date":"2024-04-08","author":"@Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui, @Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1226712201474080819","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#106**\n\nWelcome back and welcome to this week's news, @News Ping!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @DJ_Jaex,@eGsneaks,@pargreensalt and @Kyetsu69\nLumberjack Mechant : @pargreensalt \nElite Carpenter : @Acidk10\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nApril-1: , @jshuaplayz, \nApril-4: \nApril-5: @gamer2910fop  , @velo.cit.y\nApril-6: @Yiridium\nHappy Birthday to all of you! We wish you the best!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks a ton to @regeliator, @Wobble Goddess, and @Linopro for boosting the server!\n\n**Wiki Fact of The Week**\n\nThe Weighted Gift of Immense Friendship\n\nThe Weighted Gift of Immense Friendship was introduced into Bob's Shack on December 16, 2022, but was later removed during a server shutdown. Any remaining gifts were transformed into the Wide Gift of Stone upon joining a new server. The reason behind the removal of this gift remains unclear.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Unused_Content#:~:text=The%20Weighted%20Gift%20of%20Immense,for%20this%20gift%20is%20unknown.\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for coming by for week 106! We hope to see you next time!\nNews by: @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui, , @Gomi\nUnused Content\nUnused Content or Removed Content are things in Lumber Tycoon 2 that were planned to be released but were never added or released for a short period of time, then removed later on. Some of these...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Unused_Content"},{"number":"55","title":"Interview Wednesday #55","category":"Interview","date":"2024-04-12","author":"@⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1228428093618913291","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #55__**\n(sorry for being late)\nHello @News Ping and thanks for coming by for week 55! This time @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ interviewed @superman4money3.\n\nQ: What are your favorite builders or the builders you hold in highest regard?\nA: M23, to make a computer inside of lumber is crazy and the fact it has several functions is awesome.\n\nQ: What is the best biome in LT2?\nA: Tropics because it has the cave with my favorite wood, cave crawler, and it has the logic store.\n\nQ: What is your favorite of your builds in LT2? (attach picture if possible)\nA: Technically it is not complete yet but my favorite build would be battleship. I have learned so much about logic in the process of this build.\n\nQ: What is the best thing about LT2 and what keeps you coming back?\nA: The ability to create almost anything if you put your mind to it.\n\nQ: When did you first start playing LT2?\nA: 2019, it was actually the first game I ever played on Roblox.\n\nQ: Would you add anything to LT2, and if so, what would it be?\nA: Not really an item but a revamped logic system, the current system is really laggy and it needs some love.\n\nQ: Do you like to incorporate any logic in your builds?\nA: Yes, I like to make my builds functional which usually requires logic.\n\nQ: Do you have any building tips for beginners?\nA: It may take a few tries before you get it right.\n\nInterview by: @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"107","title":"#107","category":"Article","date":"2024-04-15","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1229238442437771275","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#107**\n\nHello, and welcome back to edition 107 of the weekly lumber news, @News Ping!\n\n**Events**\n\nBlake extended the logic competition until <t:1713326400>! Submit an entry with any event committee member and check out the rules at https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1190462440341782528/1207432315525922816!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: , \n\n**Staff Birthdays**\n\nWe would like to wish a happy birthday to two of our amazing supervisors! On 4/12, we had the birthday of @Archie -🌈, and on 4/13, we had the birthday of ! We hope you both had amazing birthdays!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nApr-8: @KingNubTheGreat\n\nApr-10: @703ender, @YkJoniBoi65\n\nApr-12: @Archie -🌈, \n\nApr-13: \n\nApr-15: @xb0y_416\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThis week we had two boosters! Thanks a ton to @nearepick and @eGsneaks for boosting this week!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week due to the Lumber Games being canceled.\n\n **Wiki Fact of The Week**\n\nThe End Times axes box \n\nThe End Times Axes box was never meant to be obtained legitimately. It was only acquired when hackers discovered and manipulated it into the game, then duplicating it, and creating a large circulation of them. Defaultio, the game developer, soon became aware of this and deleted all copies of the boxes other than the end times axe, as it was the most highly populated. Additionally, he changed the box's texture to a plain gray with red text stating \"I cheated for this box\" on all sides except for the top and bottom, a design which remains unchanged to this day. Similar designs can be found on the boxes of the Rukiryaxe, Beesaxe, and Twitter Axe. While the End Times box continues to circulate among players, the other boxes are still unobtainable.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/End_Times_Axe\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for checking into this week’s lumber news! We hope to see you next week!\n\nNews: , @Marley🍓 | CST, @Gomi, @KingBoo - OJ!, @penqui\nDiscord - A New Way to Chat with Friends & Communities\nDiscord is the easiest way to communicate over voice, video, and text.  Chat, hang out, and stay close with your friends and communities.\nhttps://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1190462440341782528/1207432315525922816!\nEnd Times Axe\nThe End Times Axe is one of two craftable axes in-game, the other being the Rukiryaxe, having the same process needed, with the exception being that it must be crafted on Halloween Day. It has a...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/End_Times_Axe"},{"number":"56","title":"Interview Wednesday #56","category":"Interview","date":"2024-04-24","author":"@Sam - CCST : OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1232832718585200650","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #56**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome back to the weekly interview! For today’s interview we have: @rassmus1212, interviewed by @Sam - CCST : OJ!!\n\nQ : Do you enjoy hunting spook trees? If so, how many have you hunted and have you seen any sinister trees?\nA : Yes, I enjoy spook hunting, it is my favorite thing to do in LT2. I have hunted spook since 2021, and found 328 spook trees total, and 5 sinister trees total.\n\nQ : What is the best wood combination in your opinion?\nA : Birch and blue spruce is the newest combination, and it looks really cool, but the OG wood combination is walnut and koa. \n\nQ : What is the biggest build you have made in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA : I once built a vault for storing my things. I built a huge half circle that was roughly 60 - 70 studs tall. it took up too much data size, so I replaced it with a smaller design.\n\nQ : Do you understand logic well? If so, what is your most complicated logic build?\nA : I am not the best with logic, my most complicated thing was probably some flickering lights.\n\nQ : What wood do you think is the hardest to obtain?\nA : Sinister. You have to be really lucky to find one, and when you do you also have to bring it back and sawmill it.\n\nInterview by: @Sam - CCST : OJ!"},{"number":"108","title":"#108","category":"Article","date":"2024-04-26","author":"@Marley🍓 | CST, @Gomi, @penqui, @KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1233275773817716756","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#108**\n\nHi and welcome to this week's news, @News Ping! We hope you enjoy what we have for you this week!\n\n**Events**\n\nThis week we had the voting for the logic competition start! We have a lot of great submissions from some new and known logicists! Check out the voting in <#679042272704069704>, and remember to check out all the submissions, as there are a lot of great ones!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack : , \nLumber Merchant : @Janjiaxian2011\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThere were no boosters this week.\n\n**Lumber Games** \n\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week due to the Lumber Games being canceled.\n\n**Birthdays**\nApril-15: @xb0y_416\nApril-18: @7Vx0, @TicTac\nApril-19: @szczerbatek122\nApril-20: @DingusDod, @EvanBeebs2008\nApril-21: @TheyBewareRom, @TheP800\nHappy Birthday to all of you and we wish you the best!\n\n **Wiki Fact of The Week**\n\nCooking Food in the Volcano\n\nIf you place any food item inside the volcano, it will slowly cook. This applies to bread, turkeys, and pies. They will need to be unboxed to cook; otherwise, nothing will happen. The food item must be within the damage zone of the volcano for it to cook. You can tell if the item is in the damage zone by standing where it is; if it is you will take damage. During the cooking process, the item will catch on fire and gradually darken in color. It takes roughly 25 minutes to fully cook. When fully cooked, the item will turn black, with varying colors of brown and black during other sections of the process.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Turkey \n\nNews: @Marley🍓 | CST, @Gomi, @penqui, , @KingBoo - OJ!\nTurkey\nThe Turkey is a limited-time item that was released as part of the 2016 Thanksgiving Event. It was found covering an entire shelf at Wood R Us for $200 Money. It is only used for decoration or for...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Turkey"},{"number":"109","title":"#109","category":"Article","date":"2024-04-29","author":"@Marl3yys, @KingBoo - AJ!!!, @Sam - CCST : OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1234337354697674885","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#109**\n\nHello and welcome to another week of lumber news, @News Ping! \n\n**Rankups**\n\nThere were no rankups this week.\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThere were no boosters this week.\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no players that participated in Lumber Games, Causing the Lumber Games to be Canceled.\n\n**Staff Birthday**\n\nThis week on 4/25, our supervisor @Scorch had his birthday! We’d like to wish him a happy birthday and hope he had a great one! We’re grateful for all of his hard work that’s been done for the server.\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nApril-22: @busterboy4970\n\nApril-24: @ChampFrom2005, @Gumez👺\n\nApril-25: @Newlumber35, @Scorch\n\nApril-26: @Bottom Text, @Smazt 🍀\n\nApril-27: @bryce36a, @ChasetheSavage360, @DomasHS, @LORD FOOG the 2nd (Tryblox)\n\nApril-28: @EnergeticTobias123\n\nHappy Birthday to all of you and we wish you the best!\n\n**Wiki Fact of The Week**\n\nCan of Cranberry Sauce\n\nIt is similar in shape and size to the Can of Worms, but has a different texture. It has a gray top and bottom and a maroon background with an image of a cranberry on opposite sides. Its box sports a white background with its decal on both sides. This item appears to currently have no use, other than for decoration or showcasing purposes. It can also be put together with a turkey to make a meal.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Can_of_Cranberry_Sauce\n\n**Closing**\n\nThanks for reading and we hope to see you next time!\n\nNews: @Marl3yys, @KingBoo - AJ!!!, @Sam - CCST : OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ\nCan of Cranberry Sauce\nThe Can of Cranberry Sauce is a loose item that could be purchased at Bob's Shack for $2,800 Money, as a part of the 2018 Thanksgiving Event. Despite its description, this item cannot be opened...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Can_of_Cranberry_Sauce"},{"number":"57","title":"Interview Wednesday #57","category":"Interview","date":"2024-05-01","author":"@KingBoo (@KingBoo - AJ!!!).","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1235319585583005730","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #57__**\n\nHello @News Ping , and thanks for coming by for week 57 of interviews! This time, @iOmega I was interviewed by @KingBoo - AJ!!! Without further ado, let’s get right into it!\n\nQ: When did you start LT2 and how did you come across it?\n\nA: I started playing LT2 in early 2016 and I got into it because the original Lumber Tycoon was one of my favorite games back in the day.\n\nQ: When did you first discover logic in LT2?\n\nA: I probably discovered logic around the time I first plucked up the courage to confront Hoover and go to the Tropics. So probably around late 2016.\n\nQ: What was your first logic project/build and how did it turn out?\n\nA: My first logic 'build' was an automatic log shortener that I built because I got so tired of shortening logs down to below 10 studs (then the maximum length a sawmill could process), I ended up getting rid of it because it barely worked.\n\nQ: Who do you think are the top 3 best people at logic? (Not including yourself)\nA: In my opinion and of who I'm aware of, in no particular order:\n\n@⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ - some of the projects he takes on are just ridiculous and very impressive\n@M23- for his Lumcuper build\n@Adam_5291 - OJ!! 🤓 - he just has an excellent grasp on logic and some cool logic builds as well :p\n\nDo you have any advice for the new people that are just experimenting with logic?\n\nA: Rather than going straight to youtube or a guide to find out how you make a logic build, try to figure it out for yourself. Also experiment with as many simple logic builds as you can to build your knowledge and confidence.\n\nIf you want an interview, DM any journalist, and I'll put you in a queue!\n\n Interview by: @KingBoo (@KingBoo - AJ!!!)."},{"number":"110","title":"#110","category":"Article","date":"2024-05-05","author":"@Marl3yys, @Sam - CCST : OJ!, @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @Penqui281","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1236701791614144622","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#110**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome to this week's news!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @fire_fire-ARJ, @funwithhugo223, @Janjiaxian2011\nElectrician: @bkhjeerfbj\nLumber Artist: @Marl3yys\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks a lot to @doombadz and @Alovelybone for boosting the server!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nApril-29: @Boop Wolf, @ScrapBlox\nApril-30: @dantdmfan345677\nMay-1: @carlospug123, @chriss7561\nMay-2: @lotosaed\nMay-5: @better Adam, @Panda, @theexplodedguys\n\nHappy Birthday to all of you and we wish you the best!\n\n**Wiki Fact of The Week**\n\nTurkey Leftovers\n\nThe Turkey Leftovers were released for a limited time between November 28th and December 2nd, 2020. This marked the first time in four years that a recolored turkey wasn't added. The Turkey Leftovers consisted of a turkey leg with a bite taken out of one side, and it also shared a similar color to the normal turkey. The leftovers were added two days after Thanksgiving 2020. Defaultio forgot to add the turkey on Thanksgiving, so he gave us the Turkey Leftovers instead, after being reminded to add the Thanksgiving update by the Turkey Song made by ItsMeGrammi.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Turkey_Leftovers\n\n\nNews: @Marl3yys, @Sam - CCST : OJ!,  @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @Penqui281\nTurkey Leftovers\nTurkey Leftovers was a limited-time item released for the 2020 Thanksgiving Event, available between November 28th and December 2nd. It was found beside Bob in Bob's Shack, in a row of three...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Turkey_Leftovers"},{"number":"58","title":"Interview Wednesday #58","category":"Interview","date":"2024-05-08","author":"@Penqui281","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1237806947667804170","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #58__**\n\n\n@News Ping Hello, Lumberjacks! Welcome back to another weekly interview. Today, @Penqui281  has interviewed Iam_leo12309 on Roblox in game. However, the user isn't on Discord\n\n**__Q. When did you discover lt2, and how did you discover it?__**\nA: My brother showed it to me around 2019 and I've been playing it ever since.\n\n**__Q. What is your favorite aspect of the game and why?__**\nA: The ducks because they make a quack noise, and it is funny.\n\n**__Q. What is your favorite project you have done?__**\nA: My duck temple, because I made it with my friend, and it is a funny concept\n\n**__Q. Would you say you’ve made a lot of new friends on LT2, and how?__**\nA. I would say I’ve made a lot of friends; I’ve mainly made friends by buying off people \nand helping people out for free.\n\n**__Q. How have you made your money?__**\nA. Buying stuff cheap and then selling it for a slightly increased amount made me most of my money. And grinding wood gathering made me the rest of it.\n\n**__Q. What motivated you to make your base?__**\nA. My brother cheggars123 gave me most of my motivation, but my friends made me more motivated. It also motivated me just by knowing that one day I'll be finished, and I'll be able to look back and enjoy the memories of building it.\n\n**__Q. What is your favorite lt2 event and why?__**\nA. The hunt event this Easter because I enjoyed the new event instead of the regular events.\n\n**__Q. What is your favorite item in lt2__**\nA. Ducks. I enjoy collecting them and giving them a new home in my duck rescue shelter/temple.\n\n**__Q. If you had the chance to add anything to lt2 what would you add and why?__**\nA. I would add a dog because it would be cool to make a dog rescue shelter like my duck rescue shelter.\n\n**__Q. What made LT2 stand out from the rest of the games on Roblox to you?__**\nA. The building mechanics are pretty unique and fun to mess around with. I also like the mixture of sandbox gameplay with grinding and collecting gameplay, it makes for a fun combination.\n\n\nInterview by: @Penqui281"},{"number":"111","title":"#111","category":"Article","date":"2024-05-13","author":"@Marley🍓 | CST, @KingBoo - OJ!, @penqui, @Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1239411089125408780","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#111**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome back to another week of lumber news! \n\n**Cross Events**\n\nThe Lumber Tycoon 2 Fan Group has now collaborated with Adapter/The Lumber Shack to bring ShackCraft (The Lumber Shack’s Minecraft server) to the Fan Group. Anybody on Bedrock or Java can play on this server and more information regarding it can be found in <#1235762636189335562>\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week there were 3 matches of the Lumber Games. Both the first and second matches were won by @Lonmower ❂, and the match was won by @UrGettingAimb0tted! Good job to the both of you.\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nLumber Merchant: @Kyetsu69 @CEO_Beastie\nCarpenter: @Kyetsu69\nElite Electrician: @Trakie\nExperienced Lumberjack: @Axpxr_xy, @CEO_Beastie, @1100 CE DragonNamedToothless-Kat\nElite Carpenter: @CEO_Beastie\nElectrician: @CEO_Beastie\nLumberjack Artist: @CEO_Beastie\n\n\n**Staff Birthdays**\n\nWe would all like to wish a very happy birthday to our Lead Supervisor, Dawn! On 5/11, @Dawn🩴  had her birthday! We wish you the best and hope you have a fun day.\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nMay-6: @eric_liau\nMay-7: , @FlakeyBoots, \nMay-8:@redcameron8595, @tanqr1stplayer\nMay-9:\nMay-10:\nMay-11:@Dawn🩴, @feedmehotdogs\nMay-12:@SuperBigMen\n\nHappy Birthday to all of you and we wish you the best!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks a lot to  and @Gomi for boosting the server! \n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Gift of Plump Appetites\n\nThe Gift of Plump Appetites, available for purchase at Bob's Shack for $681 Money during the 2021 Christmas Event, unveils a boxed Ham when opened. This item was made by Electrotech. The gift has swirling salmon wrapping, with curving white lines and a yellow ribbon and bow, and the Ham's boxed variant is white with an image of the Ham on both sides, typical of boxed items. The Ham itself resembles a ham with a bone, with a dark brown exterior and a meaty interior. When placed inside the Volcano, the Ham slowly cooks until it turns completely black. This cooking mechanic is the same as that of turkeys and a few other items in the game.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_of_Plump_Appetites\n\nNews By : @Marley🍓 | CST, @KingBoo - OJ!, , @penqui, @Gomi\nGift of Plump Appetites\nThe Gift of Plump Appetites is a gift that was purchasable from Bob's Shack for $681 Money as part of the 2021 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Ham. This item was created by wiki...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_of_Plump_Appetites"},{"number":"59","title":"Interview Wednesday #59","category":"Interview","date":"2024-05-17","author":"@Marl3yys","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1241056705979088950","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #59__** \n(sorry for being a little late)\nHello @News Ping and welcome to another interview! This week we had @Marl3yys interview @Fire_Fire™©!\n\nQ - What is your favorite biome in LT2?\n\nA - The taiga biome.\n\nQ - When did you start playing LT2 and how did you discover it?\n\nA - I started playing around late 2016, I wanted to branch out of Pokémon Brick \nBronze and wished to try different games. \n\nQ - What was your first ever logic build?\n\nA - A firework system that I built in a competition for my friend.\n\nQ - Do you have a favorite update?. If so, what is it?\n\nA - Yes, it has to be the 2023 hw event not due to the content tho, it was rather due to the much fun I happened to have whilst hunting with my friends.\n\nQ - What was your best moment in LT2?\n\nA - Probably when I treefetti’d bunnyfilms and he happened to sign my treefetti.\n\nQ - If you could add anything into LT2, what would it be?\n\nA - It would likely be an axe that outclasses the many axe and is obtainable throughout the year as it makes minuscule sense for the best axe to be a seasonal axe.\n\nQ - What was the hardest logic project/build you’ve ever made?\n\nA - I barely build logic, if I had to choose from the handful of logics that I have built, probably has to be the 5 input code door that I built.\n\nQ - When you first started LT2, what did you first do to get money?\n\nA - I used to be a not so bright lad back then, I grinded birch wood till someone gave me 100k.\n\nQ - Do you think there shouldn’t be a money limit?\n\nA - No, I strongly disagree with the following statement as I believe that that has the potential to create an infinite economy, with the current state of lt2, would just crash the entire market of lt2 and would ruin the game’s economy further.\n\nInterview by- @Marl3yys"},{"number":"112","title":"#112","category":"Article","date":"2024-05-20","author":"@Penqui281, @Marl3yys, @Sam - CCST : OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1241941805797216326","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#112**\n\nHello @News Ping, welcome back to the weekly news!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week we had no lumber games matches.\n\n**Staff Birthday**\n\nWe would all like to wish @Azchick a very happy birthday! Thank you for your service!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nMay-13: @4jGreekgamer, @danial_313, @gerda_jan, @warp9000\nMay-15: @Soviet_Fox55, @.spookyfr\nMay-16: @Meno_Kowa, @ScottTheMerchant\nMay-17: @ClassD_9019, @Zephyn\nMay-18: @aloshua, @SupBoy2022\nMay-19: @Azchick, @Berryman (Holy watah), @director_dylan2\n\nHappy Birthday to all of you, we wish you all the best!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @fuzzy710, @ToothlessNotKat\nElite Electrician: @iOmega\nCarpenter: @eGsneaks\n\n**Boosters**\n \nThanks a lot to @ItzCuantikoX and @Marl3yys for boosting the server!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Gift of Unhealthy Diets\n\nThe Gift of Unhealthy Diets was available for purchase from Bob's Shack for $390 during the 2019 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Burger Cola. This item was created by the wiki user Jac16king. The gift is shaped like a soda can, wrapped in patchy yellow paper with various holes and dots scattered across it, and topped with a small ribbon. It is a retexture of the Opened Gift of the All Seeing Eyes, a Roblox accessory. The box for the Burger Cola is white, featuring an image of the Burger Cola on both sides, similar to most other boxed items. The Burger Cola itself is designed to resemble a can of Robloxian soda, with numerous references to the Roblox Cheezburger. The Burger Cola serves purely as a decorative item.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_of_Unhealthy_Diets\n\nNews By: @Penqui281, @Marl3yys, @Sam - CCST : OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @KingBoo - OJ!\nGift of Unhealthy Diets\nThe Gift of Unhealthy Diets is a gift that was purchasable from Bob's Shack for $390 Money as a part of the 2019 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Burger Cola. This item was created...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_of_Unhealthy_Diets"},{"number":"60","title":"Interview Wednesday #60","category":"Interview","date":"2024-05-22","author":"@Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1242947093912485930","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #60__**\nHello @News Ping and welcome to this week’s interview! This week @Gomi interviewed @Wilhelm_, a retired supervisor intern and previous journalist!\n\nQ: When did you first start playing LT2?\n\nA: Way back in 2016, I'm pretty sure. I remember it was right before the game left beta\n\nQ: Why do you continue to play LT2 rather than the other games that have similar systems?\n\nA: To be quite frank, I haven't played LT2 in two or so years after personal issues with the game platform itself. I've returned recently for the nostalgia factor. The game's building mechanic is a great way to space out and listen to a podcast, and I've recently found a void for that kind of game recently. That's not to say I've made my full return, however. But It's still a game that I hold in my library and in my heart.\n\nQ: If you could add anything into or change anything in LT2 what would it be?\n\nA: Being in it for the nostalgia factor, I find the game to be perfect as it is. I'm of course biased, and have not really been super in touch with what the players would want from the game. I see the game as a perfect sandbox game. Endless content can spur from that fact alone.\n\nQ: Have you ever tried to do logic?\n\nA: Yes, I remember going for the experienced electrician role, but I could never figure out a way to get around the issues lag would induce on any of the circuits I made that should've worked theoretically.\n\nQ: What build got you carpenter specialist?\n\nA: That would probably be my dystopian warehouse build. I used truck spawners to get a plank texture for the majority of the walls, and the bottom a wood sweeper to get a metallic texture on the top. I think that creativity got me the role. That said, I got the role almost three years ago, so I do not remember if the wood sweepers were part of it at the time.\n\nQ: What are the most beautiful places in LT2?\n\nA: I'd say the most beautiful place in LT2 Is Tick's memorial. It was nice to see her memorial as her passing was so devastating. Other than the memorial, I'd say the endtimes area is the prettiest to my designer mind. I love the idea of this tree of crystal from an ethereal plane, shimmering and making light out of the void it resides. Only able to be cut by an axe made from the metal made from the echoes from a plane of the lost. I'm going overboard, but that idea just encapsulates me.\n\nQ: Is there anything or anyone that motivates you to play lt2?\n\nA: Just nostalgia and a current situation that sees me having too much freetime on my hands.\n\nInterview by: @Gomi\nyG0fNvG.png"},{"number":"113","title":"#113","category":"Article","date":"2024-05-27","author":"@mɒƧ - CCST : OJ!, @Marl3yys, @Penqui281, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1244490306083225643","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#113**\n\nHello and welcome back to the weekly news, let’s see what happened this week!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were 7 Lumber Games matches this week! There was one practice match, won by @✧ Ghost ‧ BST, whilst there were 6 no rewards matches, one won by @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂ and five won by @bluestarblue1.\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nCarpenter: @HiroyukiiSan\nExperienced Lumberjack: @HiroyukiiSan\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nMay-20 : @defendion, @Foxy ඞ, @Newsletterfarm, @kermit, @RG_gamerpros\nMay-21 : @Bitz\nMay-22 : @2wuuz, @Autumn_dog2\nMay-23 : @bekaberua, @marinomali,@max29099\nMay-24 :@minershooter78\nMay-25 : @mootburrito1238\nMay-26 : @stevenwilliumjanse1\n\nHappy birthday to all of you!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks a lot to @UmoPog1 for boosting the server!\n\n**Wiki fact of the week**\n\nThe Very Cold Gift\n\nThe Very Cold Gift was available for purchase at the Fine Arts Shop for $721 during the 2021 Christmas Event. When unwrapped, it contains a boxed Block of Ice. This item was designed by wiki user Tri_angulum and was notable for being the first gift to modify the shop's lyout by adding a new column.The gift features light blue wrapping with scattered white snowflakes and is adorned with a matching light blue ribbon and bow. Its design was taken from The Snowpacalypse Gift, a Roblox accessory. The Block of Ice's box is white with images of the Block of Ice on two sides, similar to other boxed items. The Block of Ice itself is a beveled cube with an icy texture. When placed inside the Volcano, the Block of Ice gradually shrinks until it completely disappears. Unlike the Lump of Coal, it does not revert to its original size once removed from the Volcano, maintaining its reduced size when saved on one's plot.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Very_Cold_Gift\n\nThank you all for reading and we hope to see you next time!\n\nNews By: @mɒƧ - CCST : OJ!, @Marl3yys, @Penqui281, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ\nVery Cold Gift\nThe Very Cold Gift is a gift that was purchasable from the Fine Arts Shop for $721 Money as part of the 2021 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Block of Ice. This item was created by...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Very_Cold_Gift"},{"number":"61","title":"Interview Wednesday #61","category":"Interview","date":"2024-05-30","author":"@mɒƧ - CCST : OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1245605902149615647","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #61__**\nHello, @News Ping and welcome back to the weekly interview! This week @mɒƧ - CCST : OJ! interviewed @Koiliferopni from the lumber-shack! (His favorite interviewer is me, personal request from him to add this)\n\nQ: What is your favorite season in lumber tycoon 2?\n\nA: Winter, because of the gifts and the blue spruce wood.\n\nQ: Did you find any spook trees last October?\n\nA: I never got a chance to go and hunt any, but I’ve seen other people get them.\n\nQ: How much do you enjoy building or working with logic?\n\nA: I like working with logic but it gets a little overwhelming sometimes. Though building has to be my favorite because you can build anything you want, unlike some tycoons.\n\nQ: What are your favorite trees in LT2?\n\nA: Oak, walnut, and cherry.\n\nQ: What is the hardest tree to get in your opinion?\n\nA: Lava and ice wood because you have to have skill to get to lava and it takes a while to get ice wood.\n\nQ: Do you enjoy playing the Shackcraft minecraft server?\n\nA: I love it. I’ve built a huge house and I have lots of pets.\n\nInterview by: @mɒƧ - CCST : OJ!"},{"number":"114","title":"#114","category":"Article","date":"2024-06-03","author":"@penqui, @Gomi, @Marley🍓 | CST","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1247019451887386735","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#114**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome to another week of news!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nUnfortunately we had no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n**Rank ups**\n\nThis week we did not have any rank ups.\n\n**Birthdays**\nMay-28: , @LumberTo20Mil, @thatfarhan\nMay-29: @biohazardv2.0, @itz.boo, @Jokujoku5, @Naattan7\nMay-30: @JustWannaBeGrandma\nJun-02: @Speedy, @unoski1667, @xranoxxd\nWe wish you all a happy birthday!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to  for boosting the server! \n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Strange Pumpkin\n\nThe Strange Pumpkin is a 2017 Halloween item introduced on October 4th, 2017, as part of the event. It was available for purchase at Bob's Shack for $510 and serves as a decoration. Created by the wiki user UnikarnzMagik, the Green Pumpkin closely resembles the standard Pumpkin but features a jet black and dark green exterior, a gradient of green inside, and emits a green glow, with a small streak of color on the stem. Its design is inspired by the Roblox hat \"Eerie Pumpkin Head.\"\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Strange_Pumpkin\n\nThanks a ton for reading, and we hope to see you in the next one!\n\nNews By: @penqui, @Gomi, @Marley🍓 | CST\nStrange Pumpkin\nThe Strange Pumpkin is an item added on October 4th, 2017, that was purchasable at Bob's Shack for $510 Money as part of the 2017 Halloween Event. This item was made by wiki user UnikarnzMagik...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Strange_Pumpkin"},{"number":"62","title":"Interview Wednesday #62","category":"Interview","date":"2024-06-06","author":"@⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1248101043309641730","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #62__**\n\nHello, @News Ping and welcome back to the weekly interview! This week @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ interviewed @huge09090909090!\n\nQ: When did you start playing LT2?\n\nA: I started playing around when the initial beta ended.\n\nQ: What is the thing you are best at in LT2?\n\nA: Everything.\n\nQ: Why do you play LT2 instead of other games?\n\nA: LT2 is the best.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in LT2?\n\nA: I really enjoy building and doing logic.\n\nQ: What is your favorite wood in LT2?\n\nA: Walnut.\n\nInterviewer: @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"63","title":"Interview Wednesday #63","category":"Interview","date":"2024-06-13","author":"@⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1250630748730429550","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #63__**\n\nWelcome to this interview Wednesday, @News Ping! This week @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ interviewed our beloved supervisor and founder @grammi_itsme!\n\nQ: When did you start playing LT2?\n\nA: Around August of 2016.\n\nQ: What is one of the funniest experiences you have had in LT2?\n\nA: I remember that I couldn't connect a trailer to vehicles for a good while. I also really enjoyed when i worked on the turkey song which reminded Defaultio to add the thanksgiving update which got us the leftover turkey.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in LT2?\n\nA: I just love playing lt2 in general and I have a ton of fun just hanging out with friends, and there are even some fun mini games we would play like car wars.\n\nQ: What makes LT2 so magical?\n\nA: There is a great community and a lot of stuff to do in the game that keeps me and so many others returning and loving the game. People make great things with building, logic, and other artistic elements in the game.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to teach in LT2?\n\nA: I have taught all kinds of things in LT2, such as logic and building, and I generally loved teaching in general.\n\nQ: What types of projects have you done in LT2?\n\nA: I have done quite a few build projects, including my interview stage and my main base which had some logic tidbits for processing wood.\n\nInterviewer: @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"116","title":"#116","category":"Article","date":"2024-06-17","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Gomi, @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1252375931805237409","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#116** (sorry for being late)\n\nWelcome, @News Ping, to another week of the lumber news!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week there were 3 matches of the lumber games. The first match was a juggernaut round, the winner was the juggernaut, @kain. The second match was a staff vs regular people round, in which the regular people team won, and that team consisted of @kain, , and roblox user XxreallythoxX. The third match was a normal round, and the winner was @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂.\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nLumber Merchant: @flintyguy2\nExperienced Lumberjack: @smellyIanBom, @flintyguy2, \n\nCongrats to all of you for ranking up!\n\n**Staff Birthday**\n\nHappy birthday and a special thanks to our supervisor and founder @Grammi! She is a very kind soul, especially so within the server, and we are so lucky to have her!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJun-10: @Grammi\nJun-13: @john712325_new\nJun-14: , @1100 CE DragonNamedToothless-Kat, @MushyDarkStar2\nJun-16: @cedrikwood3, @stefanec101\n\nWe wish you all a happy birthday!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nUnfortunately, No one has boosted this week.\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Round and Flat Gift is circular, wrapped in light beige paper covered with various holiday-themed decals, and finished with a red, circular ribbon. It, along with the Duck Shaped Gift and the Orange Gift of Traffic Control and Corporate Power, were among the first gifts to feature a non-quadrilateral design. This gift is a retexture of the Opened Janitorial Gift of Taking Out the Trash, a Roblox accessory. The Plate's packaging is round and beige, displaying an image of the Plate on both sides, similar to other boxed items. The Plate itself is a beige cylinder with a beveled edge, closely resembling its real-life counterparts. The Plate serves purely as a decorative item, having been seen in the Den as a loose item prior to its release.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Round_and_Flat_Gift\n\nThanks for reading and we hope to see you next time!\n\nNews by: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Gomi, @Marley🍓 | CST,, @penqui\nRound and Flat Gift\nThe Round and Flat Gift is a gift that was purchasable from Bob's Shack for $20,000 Money as a part of the 2018 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Plate. This item was created by the...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Round_and_Flat_Gift"},{"number":"117","title":"#117","category":"Article","date":"2024-06-24","author":"@Sam - CCST, @Penqui281, @Marl3yys, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1254620851299422261","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#117**\n\nHello, @News Ping and welcome back the weekly lumber news!!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nThere were no rank ups this week.\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJun-16: @cedrikwood3, @stefanec101 \nJun-18: @babyNathaniel101\nJun-19: @123Will890, @devout22, @devshurikeno\nJun-20: @aming_od\nJun-22: @Juan_manuel93\nJun-23:@LumberFan13, @Mika\n\n**Boosters**\n\nA big thanks to @myusernameLv3 for boosting this week!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Skeleton\n\nThe Skeleton is a character located in the Lost Cave. You can find it lying parallel to a wall on a raised platform at the end of the left cavern inside the cave. Unlike other in-game characters, the Skeleton does not wear any clothing. It is composed of welds and basic bricks, created by the well-known Roblox player \"Are92\" in October, 2007. The Skeleton has no dialogue, distinguishing it from other in-game characters. It cannot be interacted with in any way, as there are no scripted components associated with it.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Skeleton\n\nThanks for reading and we wish you the best!\n\nNews By: @Sam - CCST, @Penqui281, @Marl3yys, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ\nSkeleton\nThe Skeleton is a character that can be found in the Lost Cave. It can be found lying parallel to a wall on a raised platform at the end of the left cavern inside of the cave. Unlike other in-game...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Skeleton"},{"number":"64","title":"Interview Wednesday #64","category":"Interview","date":"2024-06-28","author":"@Penqui281","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1256299594606706804","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #64__** (sorry for being late)\n\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to another interview! This week @Penqui281 interviewed 1v_4 (user is not in the Fan Group server). \n\nQ: When did you first play Lumber Tycoon 2?\n\nA: I don't really remember, I do remember playing it very early on though, maybe like 2016 or 2018\n\nQ: Why did you play Lumber Tycoon 2?\n\nA: I started playing it because it was getting pretty popular and I wanted to check it out\n\nQ: What is your favorite feature of the game?\n\nA: My favorite feature in the game would probably be the electricity bit. \n\nQ: Would you say Lumber Tycoon 2 is a good game for socializing?\n\nA: I wouldn't say it's the best game for socializing, but you can meet some interesting people.\n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in Lumber Tycoon 2?\n\nA: My most memorable moment in LT2 would probably be getting my first millions, I remember back when I first started on Lumber Tycoon somebody that had a name like trucks gave me 10s of millions of cash.\n\nQ: If you could add one thing to the game, what would that be?\n\nA: If I could add anything, I'd add more functionality for the electricity stuff.\n\nInterviewer: @Penqui281"},{"number":"118","title":"#118","category":"Article","date":"2024-07-01","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui, @Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1257164505054445629","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#118**\n\nHello, @News Ping, and welcome back to another great week of lumber news!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week there was only 1 lumber game match. The match was a standard round, the winner for the match was @bluestarblue1, and it was actually ’s first time hosting LG alone!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nCarpenter: , @flintyguy2, @PoweringBemis\nLumberjack Merchant: \nExperienced Lumberjack: @PoweringBemis\nCarpenter Specialist: @PoweringBemis\nLumber Artist: @PoweringBemis\n\n**Staff Birthday**\n\nHappy birthday to our lovely supervisor, @Hunter, who had their birthday on 6/25!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJun-25: , @Ganker25, @Hunter, @kain\nJun-26: @GURKE_FLEX\nJun-27: @FwoofieFurry\nJun-28: @Jayy\nJun-29: @Marley🍓 | CST (ooh a journalist), \nJun-30: @n3dearb\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks a ton to @Stxujay for boosting this week!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Basic Hatchet\n\nThe Basic Hatchet is an entry-level axe available for purchase at Wood R Us for $12. It is the least expensive axe in the game and essential for beginners, with the tutorial leading users to buy it to progress. It features a dull brown handle with a dark yellow strap near its base, and its yellow box resembles the plank form of Snowglow Wood or the boxed Wobblebobble, displaying an image of the axe on its largest sides. Found on the shelf closest to the counter in Wood R Us, it has a range of 4.8 units, deals 0.2 damage per hit with a damage per second of 0.3, and a swing cooldown of 0.65 seconds. With it being the weakest axe in terms of damage, range, and damage per second—only surpassed by the Candy Cane Axe, which deals no damage—new players are recommended to upgrade to a different axe as soon as possible for better performance.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Basic_Hatchet\n\nWe greatly appreciate you all for reading this week’s lumber news!\n\nNews By: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui, @Gomi\nBasic Hatchet\nThe Basic Hatchet is an axe that can be purchased for $12 Money from Wood R Us. It is currently the cheapest axe in the game and serves as the first and only axe affordable to players who are just...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Basic_Hatchet"},{"number":"65","title":"Interview Wednesday #65","category":"Interview","date":"2024-07-04","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1258439680500961411","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #65__**\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to another interview! This week @KingBoo - OJ! interviewed @PS99ACCOUNT.\n\nQ: When did you first start LT2?\n\nA: Around 2015. That's when I made my first roblox account, bubbyl4321. I played with my sister.\n\nQ: How did you come across LT2?\n\nA: I.. have no idea. I know that my mother played roblox and my sister did. I bet LT2 was on the front page back then.\n\nQ: What’s your favorite thing to do in LT2?\n\nA: I really enjoy connecting a trailer to another trailer to another trail-.. you get the point. I had 50 of them connected together like a giant snake at one point.\n\nQ: What’s your proudest accomplishment in LT2?\n\nA: I haven't really done a lot in the game, but I know I spent a long time getting a car ramp to work (the trucks kept getting stuck and I had to find the right angles)\n\nQ: What is your most memorable moment in LT2?\n\nA: Well probably my first memory of the game, which was my sister unboxing a Fire Axe and giving it to my mom. It's still on her account, untouched.\n\nInterviewed by: @KingBoo - OJ!"},{"number":"119","title":"#119","category":"Article","date":"2024-07-08","author":"@penqui, @KingBoo - OJ!, @Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1259897599834591275","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#119**\n\nWelcome back to another week of the news, @News Ping!\n\n**Applications**\n\nThis week, Lumber Journalist applications were released! If you are interested, check out <#332295148778029067>!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nSadly, there were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nCarpenter: @Simply-OJ!!!\nExperienced Lumberjack: @Simply-OJ!!!\nLumberjack Merchant:  @PS99ACCOUNT, @JIRONMAN718\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJul-02 : @anonymous_girl1,@noeliacs21\nJul-04 : \nJul-05 : @_bbb1_\nJul-06 : @jailbreakking6758,@Offbeatamoaba37,@StormLovesBeans🫘\nJul-08 : @Janjiaxian2011\n\n**Boosters**\n\nUnfortunately, nobody boosted this week.\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nPlanks\n\nPlanks represent an upgraded form of wood, derived from processing logs. They can be sold at the Wood Dropoff for roughly eight times the value of the original logs, based on findings from VPS experiments conducted in late 2015, although further experimentation is recommended. To create planks, logs are fed through a sawmill which strips off the bark and reshapes the wood according to the dimensions specified by the Plank Cross Section setting on the sawmill. This setting is adjustable, as long as the chosen size can pass through the sawmill's unloading hole at the back. Planks are primarily used to complete blueprints, which allow players to construct structures on their bases. Each blueprint requires a specific amount of wood planks. Once the required amount is added, a solid structure is formed, matching the colour and material of the predominant wood plank type used. Additionally, planks can be reprocessed through the sawmill multiple times without any material loss, adapting to the sawmill's current Plank Cross Section setting. However, like logs, planks cannot be processed if they exceed 10.9 units in length, except for with the Sawmax 02L model which can handle planks up to 18.9 units. If a plank is reshaped to exceed these length limits, it must be cut into shorter sections before further processing.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Planks\n\nThanks for reading and we hope to see you next week!\n\nNews By: @penqui, , @KingBoo - OJ!, @Gomi\nPlanks\nPlanks are the higher tier of Wood, created by processing Logs. They can be sold at the Wood Dropoff for approximately eight times the amount of Money that the logs would sell for (this is based...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Planks"},{"number":"66","title":"Interview Wednesday #66","category":"Interview","date":"2024-07-11","author":"@⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1260788602095534201","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #66__**\n\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to a new interview! This week @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ interviewed @zsn0.\n\nQ: How did you find LT2?\n\nA: It was on the front page, I was like “meh, let’s play”.\n\nQ: Why do you play LT2 instead of other games?\n\nA: LT2 is a very unique game. I like playing other roblox/steam games but I always come back to LT2 for its unique building style and its unique play style. Everything about this game is unique\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in LT2?\n\nA: Build, even tho it’s not the best, being creative and coming up with new things is the best in LT2.\n\nQ: When did you start playing LT2?\n\nA: 2017, I never thought I’d be playing it 7 years later, though.\n\nQ: What is your favorite place in LT2?\n\nA: The fine arts shop is chillllll.\n\nInterviewed by: @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"120","title":"#120","category":"Article","date":"2024-07-14","author":"@Marley🍓, @Penqui281, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1262192949056372757","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#120**\n\nHi, and thanks for coming to this week’s news, @News Ping! We hope you enjoy!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week there were 2 standard LG matches. The first match was won by @bluestarblue1. The second match was won by @Aria. Good job to the both of you and everyone else!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nCarpenter: @Premium121709, @JaxyPaxy9\nExperienced Lumberjack: @konad3602\nLumberjack Merchant: @JaxyPaxy9\n\n**Staff Birthdays**\n\nWe wish a very happy birthday to our amazing supervisors @thewunderbar, and @endervene!\n\n**Birthdays** (we are now doing birthdays a week in advance)\n\nHappy birthday to the following users!\n\nJul-8: @Janjiaxian2011\nJul-9: @Charlie67611, @Happygamer1983, @lynxxie, @thatpengiunlit\nJul-10: @endervene\nJul-11: @girard07112003\nJul-13: @papuszka5537, @TheBlusteryBearGames, @thegoatedcat, @thewunderbar\nJul-14: @freak5275, @Honey, @starbass12\nJul-15: @creeplord476, @dog_atack, @p4rc.com\nJul-16: @FaceOfDeath0\nJul-17: @LoadFunction, @M4_SOPM0DII\nJul-18: @iconixau, @Quacky\nJul-20: @Kye235\n\n**Boosters**\n\nUnfortunately nobody boosted the server this week.\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nPoorly Wrapped Gift From Bob\n\nThe Poorly Wrapped Gift from Bob, a 2015 Christmas gift purchasable from Bob's Shack for $10,000 Money, contains a Lump of Coal. The gift, wrapped in dark-grey paper with a slate-like texture and a silver ribbon, is small and suffers from texture-loading bugs. Inside, the boxed Lump of Coal, featuring a dark grey pebble-like texture and images of the coal on both sides, resembles the Roblox Sparkle Time Lump of Coal. When placed inside the Volcano, the Lump of Coal ignites after 10-15 minutes, turning hot orange with yellow highlights and emitting flame particles like the Fire Axe. The longer it stays in the Volcano, the longer it remains ignited after removal, and it can be saved to one's plot while retaining its burning state.\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Poorly_Wrapped_Gift_from_Bob\n\nThanks for reading and we hope to see you next week!\n\nNews: @Marley🍓, @Penqui281, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ\nPoorly Wrapped Gift from Bob\nThe Poorly Wrapped Gift from Bob is a gift that was purchasable from Bob's Shack for $10,000 Money as part of the 2015 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Lump of Coal.  The gift has...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Poorly_Wrapped_Gift_from_Bob"},{"number":"121","title":"#121","category":"Article","date":"2024-07-22","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui, @Gomi","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1265004263982104658","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#121**\n\nHi, and welcome to the news, @News Ping! We hope you enjoy!\n\n**Applications**\n\nJournalist applications have closed! Thank you to everyone who applied, and results will be released soon!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week there were 4 standard matches. The first 3 were won by @Jordan 🌈 - OJ!!, while the fourth match was won by @bluestarblue1. Good job to everyone who participated!\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nLumberjack Merchant: @thohen, \nExperienced Lumberjack: @Foxy ඞ, @dayrising8\nElite Electrician: \nCarpenter: @thohen\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJul-15: @creeplord476, @dog_atack, \nJul-16: @FaceOfDeath0\nJul-17: @LoadFunction, @M4_SOPM0DII\nJul-18: @iconixau, @Stuxfian\nJul-20: @Kye235\nJul-22 : @ITSIDIOLOGY\nJul-24 : @2nd_skelly,\n@monke,@Skeleton_Willy\nJul-26 : @cantoptas,@Travis/Boss/Unseen Icon 👻\nJul-27 :\n@Iconeous,@jgorsc5200,@KingBoo - OJ!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @bastyelpro1 and @thohen for boosting the server this week!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nSorcus\n\nSorcus is an Easter egg found beneath the Bridge, where it connects to the ground on the Main Biome side, modeled after the Roblox administrator Sorcus. He appears to be lying down, relaxing and sleeping on the grass with his hat tipped down to cover his eyes. Sorcus wears Sorcus's Lightning Fedora, a Feed Me shirt, and black pants, and his avatar uses the Robloxian 1.0 package with the Stare face. His location may reference the fairy tale \"Three Billy Goats Gruff,\" where a troll lives under a bridge, aligning with Sorcus's reputation as a metaphorical \"troll\" on Roblox. This could also be inspired by Roblox's 2013 Egg Hunt, where players had to feed seven spams to the Sorcus Egg under a bridge to obtain it.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Sorcus\n\nWe hope to see you next time!\n\nNews By: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui, @Gomi\nSorcus\nSorcus is an easter egg located underneath the Bridge (where it still connects to the ground), on the Main Biome side. He is based on the Roblox administrator Sorcus. He is seen lying down; as it...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Sorcus"},{"number":"122","title":"#122","category":"Article","date":"2024-07-29","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!,@Sam - CCST, @Penqui281, @Marley🍓, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1267506437739774019","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#122**\n\nHi, and thanks for reading this week’s lumber news, @News Ping! We hope you enjoy!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no lumber games this week.\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @Koi, @PeepsPoison, and @superman4money3 for boosting this week!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJul-30 : @djgurmanthebesteverr,@west\nJul-31 : @benz9410,@lc_highlighter\nAug-01 : @Catzzie,@josephpham08,@mattjohn1232\nAug-02 : @banwandern,@Penguin,@queezem\nAug-03 : @csjmgss\nAug-04 : @APeterDev,@Sara_Aisling\nAug-05 : @Inkio,@kingber11\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nThere were no rank ups this week.\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nYes! – It's the Land Store\n\nYes! – It's the Land Store, which is situated next to the Wood R Us store in the Main Biome. It is the exclusive vendor of Land plots and is reportedly owned by Ruhven. The store features a striking nameplate with three distinct colours, boldly displaying the store's name in large letters, highlighted by the iconic hot pink \"Yes!\". The exterior is constructed with grey concrete walls and blue-tinted windows, and the entrance is doorless. Inside, the store continues the grey concrete wall theme, with a spacious room containing six chairs. At the far end, there's an enclosed section where Ruhven can be found, along with several wooden crates and boxes, and a Rukiryaxe Poster. Unlike the other windows, the glass of this enclosed section is not tinted blue. When buying land, the first section costs 100, the second 3,000, and then it increases by 3,000 for each subsequent section, reaching 72,000 for the 35th plot of land.\n\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Yes!_%E2%80%93_it%2527s_the_Land_Store\n\nThanks for reading and we will see you next week!\n\nNews By: @KingBoo - OJ!,@Sam - CCST, @Penqui281, @Marley🍓, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"123","title":"#123","category":"Article","date":"2024-08-05","author":"@Sam - CCST, @Marley🍓, @Penqui281, @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1270036005151441030","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#123** (one day late <:blakesagony:1139265997275156503>)\n\nHi, and thanks for reading this week’s lumber news, @News Ping! We hope you enjoy!\n\n**Applications**\n\nMassive congratulations to @IIPhaxx57 and @ImperialVenue for being accepted to the journalist team! We are glad to have you!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nSadly there was no LG this week.\n\n**Rank Ups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @JTrixky\n\nCongrats to all who ranked up!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nJul-30: @djgurmanthebesteverr, @west\nJul-31: @benz9410, @lc_highlighter, @proprooyncutep\nAug-01: @Catzzie, @josephpham08, @mattjohn1232\nAug-02: @banwandern, @Penguin, \nAug-03: @csjmgss\nAug-04: @APeterDev, @Sara_Aisling\nAug-05: @Inkio, @The Ghost Of KINGBER11\nAug-07: @MeAsh163\nAug-08: @Lemonlime\nAug-10: @ImperiousDelta, @LTMonies76\nAug-11: @IcyyBlockz\n\n**Boosters**\n\n@west boosted this week! Thanks a ton!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Duck Shaped Gift\n\nThe Duck Shaped Gift, purchasable from Fancy Furnishings for $620 during the 2018 Christmas Event, reveals a boxed Quackert when opened, created by the wiki user EwncewlEthel. Designed to resemble a rubber duck, the gift features icy blue wrapping with small rubber duck images and an icy blue ribbon. It was one of the first gifts, along with the Orange Gift of Traffic Control and Corporate Power and the Round and Flat Gift, to have a non-quadrilateral shape. The Quackert's box is white with images of the Quackert on both sides, similar to other boxed items, and the Quackert itself is modelled after a rubber duck with a yellow and orange colour scheme and black eyes, identical to the Rubber Duckie accessory in Roblox. When interacted with, the Quackert emits a quacking sound, serving no purpose beyond decoration.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Duck_Shaped_Gift\n\nThanks a ton for reading and we hope to see you next time!\n\nNews By: @Sam - CCST, @Marley🍓, @Penqui281, @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ\nDuck Shaped Gift\nThe Duck Shaped Gift is a gift that was purchasable from Fancy Furnishings for $620 Money as a part of the 2018 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Quackert. This item was created by...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Duck_Shaped_Gift"},{"number":"65","title":"Interview Wednesday #65","category":"Interview","date":"2024-08-08","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1271071241675083827","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #65__**\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to another interview! This week @KingBoo - OJ! interviewed @chronos2584_official.\n\n\nQ: When did you first start playing LT2?\n\nA: I touched the game a few years ago, but only began really playing it since last week. Though, admittedly, my game knowledge betrays the seemingly little playtime.\n\nQ: How did you stumble across LT2?\n\nA: Originally I found it whilst searching for tycoon games, but got back into it thanks to a friend of mine.\n\nQ: What’s your favorite place to visit in LT2?\n\nA: Going off aesthetics, it's tied between the River Tunnel and the Cavecrawler Cave. The overall ambience and unique trees in each is quite beautiful. \n-# The Lone Cave has been excluded because of how much Phantom Wood I have lost to the Void. It knows what it did to me.\n\nQ: What’s your biggest/proudest accomplishment in LT2?\n\nA: It's a rather in-progress feat, but it has to be the base I'm building. Specifically the outer wall, because it uses Phantom Wood. Realizing that neon wires are actually neon changed my life, too.\n\nQ: What’s your most memorable moment in LT2?\n\nA: Discovering what's inside the River Tunnel. It was pure curiosity that made me drive in, only to discover a new wood type. But that paled in comparison to the memorial for Rebecca. Learning about all she did for the community and how she's been forever immortalised within the game, surrounded by Snowglow Trees, was a pretty unforgettable experience.\n-# And to think, this is Roblox we're talking about.\n\nQ: What aspect of the game makes LT2 different from other games?\n\nA: The creative freedom in base-building. The only game I know that's similar is Miner's Haven, but LT2 goes way further into detail with what you can do. But, at the same time, there's an outstanding simplicity to the game which perfectly wraps up the intricate nature of what's truly capable. You wanna build a machine that mills, cuts, and sorts your logs automatically? Go ahead. You wanna build a mansion? Sure. It's peak gameplay.\n\nInterviewed by: @KingBoo - OJ!"},{"number":"124","title":"#124","category":"Article","date":"2024-08-12","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1272385591304257632","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#124**\n\nWelcome to another week of the news, @News Ping!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n**Rankups**\n\nThere were no rankups this week.\n\n**Staff Birthdays**\n\nWe wish a very happy birthday to our amazing supervisor, @_iOmega_!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nAug-04: @APeterDev, @Sara_Aisling\nAug-05: @Inkio, @The Ghost Of KINGBER11\nAug-07: @MeAsh163\nAug-08: @Lemonlime\nAug-10: , @LTMonies76\nAug-11: @IcyyBlockz\nAug-12: @dreamingtechhd, @_iOmega_\nAug-13: @gianpisellofind, @Kit_4848Gaming, @uebejrhy\nAug-15: , @wall_watcher99999\nAug-16: @mikvandon100\nAug-17: @ghdskftrf, @Kev, @Furgo by my feggo | ST\nAug-18: @fruitfugitive1\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @YGucciPopSmoke for boosting this week!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nGeck\n\nGeck, one of the four characters found in the Maze and modelled after the Roblox user Geckoco, humorously claims to have a hidden boat shop within the Maze, though this is false. This joke plays on the high demand for boats in LT2, especially in 2016. Like the other Maze characters, except for Timothy, Geck has only one line of dialogue. He is dressed in a ripped jacket, Quenty's Pants, the -_- face, Andrew's Beard, and the Robloxian 2.0 package.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Geck\n\nThanks a ton for reading and we hope to see you next time! Have a great week!\n\nNews: , @KingBoo - OJ!, @penqui, @Marley🍓 | CST\nGeck\nI know my boat shop is down here somewhere...Geck Geck is one of four characters that can be found within Maze. Modeled after the Roblox user, Geckoco, he claims to have a boat shop hidden...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Geck"},{"number":"68","title":"Interview Wednesday #68","category":"Interview","date":"2024-08-14","author":"@Penqui281","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1273323278940897322","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #68__**\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to a new interview! This week @Penqui281 interviewed @uegwdecrc\n\nQ. When did you first play lt2?\n\nA. Around mid July this year. Not sure exactly when.\n\nQ. How did you find lt2?\n\nA. Through my friend begging me to get on it and then I eventually got addicted.\n\nQ. What is your favourite thing you built?\n\nA. I haven't really built anything yet but I'm planning out a house.\n\nQ. What is your favourite thing to do in lt2?\n\nA. Getting cave crawler wood or frost wood but in general just grind money.\n\nQ. What is your best memory?\n\nA. Probably using the axe fling glitch to fling people—not flinging them myself, but explaining it and watching my friends get flung—a few days ago.\n\nQ. If you could add anything to the game what would you add?\n\nA. Boats.\n\nInterviewed by: @Penqui281"},{"number":"125","title":"#125","category":"Article","date":"2024-08-18","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @Sam - CCST","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1274707117562921061","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#125**\nWelcome to another week of the news, @News Ping!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nUnfortunately, we had no lumber games matches this week.\n\n**Rankups**\n\nThere were no rank ups this week. \n\n**Birthdays**\n\nAug-12: @dreamingtechhd, @iOmega\nAug-13: @gianpisellofind, @Kit_4848Gaming, @uebejrhy\nAug-15: @Noxinixe, @wall_watcher99999\nAug-16: @mikvandon100\nAug-17: @ghdskftrf, @Kev, @koioxi\nAug-18: @fruitfugitive1\nAug-19 : @Scorpion,@seph1rox,@TwistGamerYT\nAug-20 : @bassen007\nAug-21 : @kingbossen12,@OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂\nAug-22 : @Obsessedfnplayer,@TrainerTsunami\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @Faze Agoat, @endervene for boosting this week!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Cursed Pumpkin\n\nThe Cursed Pumpkin was an item made available for 524 cash at Bob’s Shack in 2018. Its color theme was a dark red exterior, red glow, and bright red interior. It was created by UNKNOWN and originally was priced at 24 cash, but that was likely a mistake, as it was later updated to 524 cash.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Cursed_Pumpkin\n\nThanks a ton for reading and we’ll be back next week!\n\nNews: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @Sam - CCST\nCursed Pumpkin\nThe Cursed Pumpkin is an item that could be purchased from Bob's Shack for $524 Money. It was released on September 26th, 2018, as a part of the 2018 Halloween Event. This item was made by...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Cursed_Pumpkin"},{"number":"69","title":"Interview Wednesday #69","category":"Interview","date":"2024-08-21","author":"@⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1275962517281177731","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #69**\n\nHi and welcome back to another interview, @News Ping! This week @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ interviewed @Xtrakie!\n\nQ: When did you first start playing LT2?\n\nA: I first started playing LT2 in July of the previous year.\n\nQ: What led you to play LT2 instead of other, similar games?\n\nA: The game is interactive and a lot could be learned and achieved through hard work and determination unlike other games.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in LT2?\n\nA: My favorite thing to do in Lt2 is messing around with logic and creating some complex and yet beautiful logic builds.\n\nQ: What do you think is the most impressive thing you have ever done in LT2?\n\nA: The most impressive thing I have ever done in LT2 is learning about logic taking inspiration from a few logic experts like Gomi and Adam and implementing it and building some complex logic builds.\n\nQ: If there was a game with better features, would you play it instead? Why or why not?\n\nA: If there was a game with better features I would try it but I wouldn't play it a lot and would still stick to LT2 because of this game I met new people, learned new things and I am grateful for everything this game gave me the opportunity to achieve.\n\nQ: What is your favorite memory from playing LT2?\n\nA: My favorite memory from playing LT2 is getting a chance to see various awesome builds from building experts like Smazt, Doom, Scrap and one of my friends named Chris.\n\nInterviewed by: @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"126","title":"#126","category":"Article","date":"2024-08-26","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281, @Marley🍓 | CST, @Sam - CCST, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1277671918996295752","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#126**\n\nWelcome to another week of the news, @News Ping!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere was no LG this week.\n\n**Rankups**\n\nThere were no rank ups this week.\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nAug-19: @Scorpion,@seph1rox,@TwistGamerYT\nAug-20: @bassen007\nAug-21: @kingbossen12,@OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂\nAug-22: @Obsessedfnplayer,@TrainerTsunami\nAug-26: @nightjack450, @PST | ROACH ඞ -OJ !!, @StarCode30071\nAug-27: @koioxi\nAug-28: @JazzyCarols, @❄ Avalanche ❄\nAug-29: @DouglasxDAlv_02, @fierysol, @Redballrafas\nAug-30: @Beasertame, @CalmFoxx\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @broLook_itsBred, @Sam - CCST, and @PST | ROACH ඞ -OJ !! for boosting!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Fiery Gift of Lumber\n\nThe Fiery Gift of Lumber, available for $14,000 in-game currency during the 2015 Christmas Event at Wood R Us, contained a boxed Fire Axe when opened. The gift had a flame-patterned design with a glossy white ribbon and was the same size and shape as other axe-containing gifts that followed. Initially intended to have a more extravagant texture, it was changed for unknown reasons and suffered from texture-loading issues like other 2015 Christmas gifts. The Fire Axe's box was dark reddish-brown with images of the axe on both sides, while the axe itself featured a bright maroon head, a subtle reddish-brown handle, and a vivid red strap. The axe emitted fiery particles similar to those produced when objects catch fire in the Volcano and was particularly effective for chopping Lava Wood, capable of felling a full-grown tree in six swings, though it performed similarly to the Plain Axe on other tree types.\n\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Fiery_Gift_of_Lumber\n\nNews by: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281, @Marley🍓 | CST, @Sam - CCST, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ\nFiery Gift of Lumber\nThe Fiery Gift of Lumber is a gift that could be purchased from Wood R Us for $14,000 Money as a part of the 2015 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Fire Axe.  The gift sports a...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Fiery_Gift_of_Lumber"},{"number":"127","title":"#127","category":"Article","date":"2024-09-02","author":"@Penqui281, @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @Marley🍓 | CST, @Sam - CCST","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1279982906714099783","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#127**\n\nWelcome to another week of the news, @News Ping!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week there were 7 matches. The first (Standard) and third match (Standard) were won by @furanky192. The second match (Standard) was won by @ImMrJakobylin, and the fourth match (Juggernaut) was a team match won by @ImMrJakobylin, @firemoon399, and Roblox user MiroBestie. The fifth match (Standard) was also won by Roblox user MiroBestie, with the sixth match (Standard) being won by @firemoon399, and the seventh (Juggernaut) won by @Dime. Congrats to all winners and thanks to everyone that participated\n\n**Rankups**\n\nElectrician : @Dime\nExperienced Lumberjack : @Dime,@ZeroLiberalism,@iii_Toughjim,@corn_lilhub\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nAug-26: @nightjack450, @PST | ROACH ඞ -OJ !!, @StarCode30071\nAug-27: @koioxi\nAug-28: @JazzyCarols, @❄ Avalanche ❄\nAug-29: @DouglasxDAlv_02, @fierysol, @Redballrafas\nAug-30: @Beasertame, @CalmFoxx\nAug-31: @stanleyrekt\nSep-1: @buddy43877\nSep-2: @IIAdapter\nSep-3: @p0mp0mpur_1nn, @stony_timber\nSep-5: @sneakysnakegh\nSep-6: @mm2909\nSep-7: @HaterOfThings\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @Bitz, @earlyturnip448 and @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ for boosting!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Beesaxe\n\nThe Beesaxe is a unique axe that was exclusively awarded on December 9th, 2017, to players who completed Day 2 of Mah Bucket's Beesmas 2017 Event: Nuts N' Bolts. The axe features a striped pattern of muted black and yellow with faint bee images on its head, a greyish-brown handle with a bright yellow strap, and emits bee particles when chopping wood, with a chance of playing a \"BEES\" audio clip. Its box is golden-orange with bold red text reading \"I CHEATED FOR THIS BOX,\" though the box was never obtainable in-game. To acquire the Beesaxe, players had to solve Day 2 of the event by decoding the Honeycomb and entering the code 6573542 to the Jester. However, many players faced glitches, as the pop-up to claim the axe often disappeared quickly, especially on smaller bases, and did not reappear for some after rejoining. Now, the Beesaxe can only be obtained through trading or purchasing from other players. Owning the item in its boxed form is rumured to result in an automatic ban from Lumber Tycoon 2.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Beesaxe\n\nNews by: @Penqui281, @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ, @Marley🍓 | CST, @Sam - CCST\nBeesaxe\nThe Beesaxe is an axe that could only be received on December 9th, 2017, to players who solved and finished Day 2 of Mah Bucket's Beesmas 2017 Event: Nuts N' Bolts. It is now only obtainable...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Beesaxe"},{"number":"70","title":"Interview Wednesday #70","category":"Interview","date":"2024-09-06","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1281404950404136970","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #70**\n\n\nHi and welcome back to another interview @News Ping. This week @KingBoo - OJ! interviewed @agoat!\n\nQ: When did you first start playing LT2?\n\nA: I started playing in around 2017-2018.\n\nQ: How did you stumble across LT2?\n\nA: One of my friends got me into the game a while ago and I couldn't put the game down.\n\nQ: What’s your favourite place to visit in LT2?\n\nA: Probably the fine arts shop. I feel like it's fun and enjoyable to go through the cave to get the paintings.\n\nQ: What’s your biggest/proudest accomplishment in LT2?\n\nA: Probably making my door bridge that felt like it took years to make (not literally) but I thought I would never finish it.\n\nQ: What’s your most memorable moment in LT2?\n\nA: When I had to fight my friend for a spook tree in the back of my truck during a Halloween event like 2 or 3 years ago.\n\nQ: What aspect of the game makes LT2 different from other games?\n\nA: The feeling of being able to make literally anything you want. It's really a defining type of sandbox game. I've never played anything like it and it's just so addicting at times.\n\nInterviewed by: @KingBoo - OJ!"},{"number":"128","title":"#128","category":"Article","date":"2024-09-10","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1282862667123396711","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#128**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome to another great week of Lumber News!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThis week there were six standard matches. The first five rounds were won by @Frank. The sixth round was won by @oskar26378. Good job to the winners and everyone who participated!\n\n**Rank-Ups**\n\nCarpenter: @1100 CE DragonNamedToothless-Kat\nElectrician: @SirFated\nExperienced Lumberjack: @djqwerty456\nLumberjack Merchant: @djqwerty456\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nSep-2: @IIAdapter\nSep-3: , \nSep-5: @sneakysnakegh\nSep-6: @mm2909\nSep-7: @HaterOfThings\nSep-8: @God1_m, @god1_m\nSep-10: @keeqo_, @Enrico_rbx321\nSep-11: @lat_lego, @SeIfrontier\nSep-12: @Aiden\nSep-14: \nSep-15: @PIP\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @KarimNahas, , and  for boosting!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Orange Bone Turkey\n\nThe Orange Bone Turkey is a limited-time item from the 2023 Thanksgiving Event, available for $303 at Wood R Us, located on the shelf next to the Silver Axe, with 8 in stock. Its design is similar to previous turkeys, except for its distinctive orange bone, and its box model remains the same as most other turkeys, apart from the Spicy Turkey and Turkey Leftovers. Like its counterparts, including Turkey Leftovers, it can be cooked in the volcano, where it darkens gradually until it turns pitch black. Cooking time ranges from a minimum of 5 minutes to a maximum of 20 minutes, with 14 possible cooking stages.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Orange_Bone_Turkey\n\nThanks for reading and we hope to see you next time!\n\nNews by: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST, @penqui, ,\nOrange Bone Turkey\nThe Orange Bone Turkey is an event item that can be purchased at Wood R Us for $303 Money, as a part of the 2023 Thanksgiving Event. It is located on the shelf next to the Silver Axe (8 in total...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Orange_Bone_Turkey"},{"number":"71","title":"Interview Wednesday #71","category":"Interview","date":"2024-09-11","author":"@Marley🍓 | CST","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1283561788381593736","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #71__**\n\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to another interview week! This week @Marley🍓 | CST interviewed @KarimNahas.\n\nQ: When did you first start playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\n\nA: Around 2016 - 2017\n\nQ: What made you interested in LT2?\n\nA: The logical components within it, and the ability to build pretty much whatever comes to your mind.\n\nQ: What is your favorite feature of the game?\n\nA: The electrical logics, which enables complex builds and automation.\n\nQ: Do you think there shouldn’t be a money limit? Why or why not?\n\nA: No, I think having a money limit is a good idea, since it makes it harder to store a lot of money which saves the economy. Without a limit, the money would be worthless due to severe inflation.\n\nQ: Would you say LT2 is a good game for socializing?\n\nA: Yes, since you can build, gather wood and go on adventures together.\n\nQ: What was your most memorable moment in LT2?\n\nA: Finding spook tree!\n\nQ: What’s your favorite biome in LT2?\n\nA: The swamp, because of the trees it has.\n\nInterviewer: @Marley🍓 | CST"},{"number":"129","title":"#129","category":"Article","date":"2024-09-16","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @penqui","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1285048060820459573","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#129**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome to another great week of Lumber News!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @B3AT_MAST3R45 for boosting this week!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nUnfortunately there was no lg this week.\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nSep-10: @keeqo_, @Enrico_rbx321\nSep-11: @lat_lego, @SeIfrontier\nSep-12: @Aiden\nSep-14: \nSep-15: @PIP\nSep-17: @Dopditer | Elite Lumberjack, @LookForMister, @PiggyMooshie0, @Trey, @[SCP EXPERT]\nSep-18: @alodroix, @💵Jackson27- OJ!!💵, , @Zelcerious\nSep-20: @talihelios\nSep-22: @andrzejp2223\nSep-25: @AlphaY7, , @PoppaFamz\n\n**Rankups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack : @AmlEtIkYoutuber\nLumberjack Merchant : @AmlEtIkYoutuber\nCarpenter : @ZeroLiberalism\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Safari Hole\n\nThe Safari Hole is a one-way teleportation gateway that connects the Maze or the Lone Cave to a cliffside opening in the Safari, allowing players and loose items to pass through to the Safari but not return. It serves as a faster way to retrieve items from the Maze and offers a more reliable exit from the Lone Cave. Designed to blend seamlessly with the surrounding brown, rocky cliffside, the hole is large enough for a player to pass through with extra headroom and is positioned vertically, unlike the hole found in the Lone Cave.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Safari_Hole\n\nNews by: @KingBoo - OJ!,, @penqui,\nSafari Hole\nThe Safari Hole is a teleportation passage leading from the Maze or the Lone Cave into a cliffside hole in the Safari. The hole is a one-way teleportation to the Safari, which means that the hole...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Safari_Hole"},{"number":"72","title":"Interview Wednesday #72","category":"Interview","date":"2024-09-19","author":"@⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1286120936172552284","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Interview Wednesday #72__**\n\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to another interview week! This week @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ interviewed @SirFated.\n\nQ: When did you first play LT2?\n\nA: I started playing lumber tycoon in 2018 shortly after I joined Roblox.\n\nQ: Why did you first play LT2?\n\nA: I first played because I wanted a unique tycoon game.\n\nQ: Why do you still play LT2?\n\nA: I still play lumber tycoon because it’s easy to pick up, easy to put down, and I'm able to express my creativity.\n\nQ: What is the best thing about LT2, for you?\n\nA: I really like building and cutting trees, and seeing logic contraptions work is fun too.\n\nInterviewer: @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ"},{"number":"130","title":"#130","category":"Article","date":"2024-09-23","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1287873525272674424","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#130**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome to another great week of Lumber News!\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThere were no boosters this week.\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThe first match, which was Standard, was won by @duckboy ඞ, with the second match, also being Standard, was won by @superman4money3.\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nSep-17: @Dopditer | Elite Lumberjack, @LookForMister, @PiggyMooshie0, @Trey, @[SCP EXPERT]\nSep-18: @alodroix, @Jack-O'-Lantern, @nickname, @Zelcerious\nSep-20: @TaliHelios\nSep-22: @andrzejp2223\nSep-25: @AlphaY7, @Dime, @PoppaFamz\nSep-26: \nSep-27: \nSep-28: \nSep-29: @Lark The Snowman\n\n**Rankups**\n\nCarpenter: @Whenthepizzarollhits, @SirFated\nLumberjack Merchant: @SirFated\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe End Times Axe \n\nThe End Times Axe is one of two craftable axes in the game, alongside the Rukiryaxe, and is crafted using the same process, but only on Halloween. It has a slower cooldown than the Rukiryaxe but delivers higher damage and is the only axe capable of chopping Phantom Wood. Introduced during the End Times Update on September 24, 2016, the axe has no legitimately obtainable box, which originally appeared on Defaultio's land but became accessible to players due to a bug, leading to a redesign with bold red text stating, \"I CHEATED FOR THIS BOX.\" To obtain the axe, players must collect a Bag of Sand, Lightbulb, Can of Worms, and pay to lower a bridge, then proceed to the Taiga, find a hidden hatch, and place the items on specific plates corresponding to different characters. After doing so, the axe descends onto a table with music playing, but this can only be done during the Halloween event; otherwise, players receive the Rukiryaxe.\n\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/End_Times_Axe\n\nNews By: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281, @⚡ eggomi (eg-go-me)⚡ - OJ\nEnd Times Axe\nThe End Times Axe is one of two craftable axes in-game, the other being the Rukiryaxe, having the same process needed, with the exception being that it must be crafted on Halloween Day. It has a...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/End_Times_Axe"},{"number":"131, 132","title":"#131 & 132","category":"Article","date":"2024-10-07","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281, @omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1292693496599281747","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#131 & 132**\n\nHello @News Ping ! Back with another news article, sorry for missing last week, crazy with midterms! Enough of that, we have an interesting article today so we hittin yall with a two hit combo! Enjoy:)\n\n**Game Announcements**\n\nSpook season has officially landed! Did you know that 1/100 servers will spawn a spook tree. While the sinister tree has a 1/1000 chance of spawning! Very rare in both situations but I wish you all good luck!\n\nIn awareness of the spooky season, the game has been seeing an influx of people hacking. Please report any video evidence to this link: https://forms.gle/73Ne3Z3DPLAdScJS6 (Credit to @slEnderman, https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1292267071941509140) \n\n**__Discord Announcements__**\n\nThis is an absolute crazy week(s)! We had so many members that got promoted to Interns for The Fan Group, sorry for the delayed congratulations but @HalloweenLonDecoration ❂, , @ScottTheMerchant, @Fire_Fire™ © but spooky, @SimplySpookyPR🎃ඞ  - OJ!!!!, @CursedCurve🌀, @Nonstop_Cookies, @⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ, Congratulations and welcome to the Staff Team!\n\n**__Journalist Announcements__**\n\n@⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ has recently taken place as an assistant Manager here in the Journalist team, congratulations to him and his accomplishments!\n\n@fartsona - OJ !!  Has returned as Manager in the meantime. Welcome back!\n\n*Stay tuned for more, new stuff is cooking up!*\n\n**__Boosters__**\n\nOnly one booster this week Lumberjacks! Thank you to these following member(s) for boosting the server:\n@Jack-O'-Lantern \n\nThat’s all the boosters we have for these two past weeks!\n\n**__Lumber Games__**\n\nTwo matches was hosted on the September 22nd! Congratulations to masters_backup for winning round one, and for round two, superman4money3! Congratulations! \n\n**__Double Wiki Fact Of The Week__**\n\n__The Gift with Yellow Candy Cane Stripes__\n\nThe Gift with Yellow Candy Cane Stripes was available for $129 Money at Wood R Us during the 2021 Christmas Event and, when unwrapped, contained a boxed item called \"Just a Yellow Candy Cane,\" created by wiki user ElectroTechnologies. The gift’s wrapping featured diagonal yellow stripes resembling a candy cane, with a small red bow, and was a retexture of the Self-Referential Gift of Referring, a Roblox accessory. On its release day, December 9th, the preview image initially displayed \"SUB 2 ELECTRO TECH\" on the wrapper, which was later removed. The Just a Yellow Candy Cane came in a yellow box with an image of the candy cane on both sides, like other boxed items. The candy cane itself was yellow and white with a bow on the side, serving no purpose beyond decoration and, unlike regular candy, could not be consumed.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_with_Yellow_Candy_Cane_Stripes\n\n__The Wobbly Gift of Most Confusion__\n\nThe Wobbly Gift of Most Confusion was available for $330 Money at Fancy Furnishings during the 2022 Christmas Event and, when opened, revealed a boxed Woarble Bærble designed by Roblox user Axivele, the runner-up of the 2022 Wiki Gift Competition. The gift featured dusted white wrapping with dark grey ribbons, and the Bærble's box displayed images of the item on both sides. The Woarble Bærble itself, a grey head with a confused face, was a retextured version of the Roblox BiggerHead. It had a unique function where it could be attached to vehicles, bobbling as the vehicle moved, though rumors that it improved stability were false. The Woarble Bærble was also useful in creative character designs.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Wobbly_Gift_of_Most_Confusion\n\n**__Closing__**\n\nThat's all for this week Lumberjacks! We do appreciate you guys reading this. Have any ideas or want to become a part of the team? dm @omgitsmejon, @⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ, or @fartsona - OJ !! \n\nNews by: @KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281, @omgitsmejon\nLT2 Report Form (Discord)\nUse this form to report users directly to the moderators of Lumber Tycoon 2. \n\nPlease be a member of the Lumber Tycoon 2 Wiki Discord server and allow direct messages from it. You may be contacted regarding the report.\n\nReport each user separately, even if their evidence is shared.\n\nCurrently, you may only report the following:\nActive Exploiting...\nhttps://forms.gle/73Ne3Z3DPLAdScJS6\nGift with Yellow Candy Cane Stripes\nThe Gift with Yellow Candy Cane Stripes is a gift that was purchasable from Wood R Us for $129 Money as part of the 2021 Christmas Event. When unwrapped, it reveals a boxed Just a Yellow Candy...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gift_with_Yellow_Candy_Cane_Stripes\nWobbly Gift of Most Confusion\nThe Wobbly Gift of Most Confusion is a gift that could be purchased from Fancy Furnishings for $330 Money as a part of the 2022 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a boxed Woarble Bærble...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Wobbly_Gift_of_Most_Confusion"},{"number":"133","title":"#133","category":"Article","date":"2024-10-15","author":"@penqui, @KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1295834835486769173","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#133** (a tiny bit late.. my bad)\n\nWelcome to another week of the lumber news, @News Ping, and we hope you enjoy!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no LG matches this week.\n\n**Rankups**\n\nThere were no rankups this week.\n\n**Boosters**\n\nNo one boosted this week.\n\n**Staff Birthdays**\n\nWe have both the birthdays of the supervisor intern @Lonmower ❂ and the supervisor @BlakeSquarePants! Congrats and have a great birthday!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nOct-07: @Adam_5291⚡- OJ!!!!!, @NeyDeyBee\nOct-09: @UnoTesoro09\nOct-10: @BlakeSquarePants, @Mario3_000\nOct-11: @riotheinvader, @spetnazxrusia\nOct-16: @Lonmower ❂\nOct-17: @marcusvinicius17, @SkiH1gh\nOct-19: @SnekScope\nOct-20: @Bradjames54321, @Jonathan\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Fire Axe\n\nThe Fire Axe is a unique tool that can be acquired from the Fiery Gift of Lumber and is highly efficient at chopping Lava Wood, dealing 6.25 damage, while performing similarly to the Chicken Axe (0.6 damage) on other wood types. Its design features a bright maroon head, a reddish-brown handle, and a vibrant red strap near the base. Upon unboxing, it emits fire particles and is roughly the same size as the Basic Hatchet, making it one of the smallest axes in the game, slightly smaller than the Candy Cane Axe. The axe was originally obtainable by unboxing the Fiery Gift of Lumber, which was sold for $14,400 during the 2015 Christmas Event, but can now only be acquired through trading.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Fire_Axe\n\nThanks for reading and see you all next week!\n\nNews by: @penqui, @KingBoo - OJ!,\nFire Axe\nThe Fire Axe is an axe that can be obtained from the Fiery Gift of Lumber and chops most efficient on Lava Wood, dealing 6.25 damage. When used on other wood types, it deals damage equivalent to...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Fire_Axe"},{"number":"73","title":"Interview Wednesday #73","category":"Interview","date":"2024-10-24","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1298859532830638184","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #73**\n\nHello, @News Ping  and welcome to another week of interviewing people! This time, @KingBoo - OJ!  interviewed @2_buckets\n\n[Q] When did you first start playing LT2?\n\n[A]  Somewhere around 2017-2018, im not really sure.\n\n[Q] How did you stumble across LT2?\n\n[A]  A friend introduced me to it while playing games on Xbox one\n\n[Q] What’s your favorite place to visit in LT2?\n\n[A] Blue wood cave, something about it is so peaceful to me\n\n[Q] What’s your biggest/proudest accomplishment in LT2?\n\n[A] Completing my gold wood bridge.\n\n[Q] What’s your most memorable moment in LT2?\n\n[A] Truck fights with friends in 2020 when the pandemic first started.\n\n[Q] What aspect of the game makes LT2 different from other games?\n\n[A] It's not a traditional \"tycoon\" game, its more of a sandbox game because you can do just about anything in the game given enough time\n\n Interviewed by: @KingBoo - OJ!"},{"number":"134","title":"#134","category":"Article","date":"2024-10-28","author":"@penqui, @KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1300295211586551850","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#134**\n\nHello Lumberjacks @News Ping and welcome back to another week of the lumber news!!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nOct-16: @Lonmower ❂\nOct-17: @marcusvinicius17, @SkiH1gh\nOct-19: @SnekScope\nOct-20: @Bradjames54321, @Jonathan\nOct-26: @copman54253776\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no lumber games this week. \n\n**Rank ups**\n\nExperienced Lumberjack: @AKL_078, @robloxcode741, @MeVeryNoob8120, @sledge, @The Santa\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to  and  for boosting last week.\nThanks to @The Santa and @\"Henry\" The Original for boosting this week!\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\n*The Ordinary Pumpkin*\n\nThe Ordinary Pumpkin, introduced on October 15th as part of the 2024 Halloween Event, can be purchased for $500 at Bob's Shack and was created by wiki contributors Trainsparency and Randomflowz. Unlike previous pumpkins, it has no carvings and resembles a natural pumpkin with an orange colour and brown stem. When unboxed, its size varies randomly, making it unique among other decorative items. It’s exact size limits are unknown, but exceptionally small or large pumpkins are rare and valuable. Additionally, it can be cooked by placing it in a health-damaging area in the Volcano, where it darkens the longer it stays, with the process taking between 5 and 20 minutes to reach the most burnt stage. The Ordinary Pumpkin is the second pumpkin with a unique model, following the Lumbkin, and the first to feature no embedded carvings.\n\n*The Crimson Bag of Candy*\n\nThe Crimson Bag of Candy, available for 2,040 Money at Wood R Us, was introduced on October 15th as part of the 2024 Halloween Event. When opened, it releases various candies with a unique sound effect that overlays faint laughter onto the standard opening noise. Created by wiki contributors ElectroTechnologies and Randomflowz, the Crimson Bag resembles previous versions, though it stands out with its crimson color and black string. The bag contains up to 12 unique candy bars, including the rare crimson candy bar, which adds a red effect when eaten.\n\n\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Ordinary_Pumpkin\n\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Crimson_Bag_of_Candy\n\nNews by: @penqui, @KingBoo - OJ!, @Marley🍓 | CST,\nOrdinary Pumpkin\nThe Ordinary Pumpkin, or simply the Pumpkin is an item that is available for purchase in Bob's Shack for $500 Money. It was added as part of 2024 Halloween Event on October 15th. This item was...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Ordinary_Pumpkin\nCrimson Bag of Candy\nThe Crimson Bag Of Candy is an item that can be purchased from Wood R Us for $2040 Money. It was added on October 15th as a part of the 2024 Halloween Event. When opened, different types of Candy...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Crimson_Bag_of_Candy"},{"number":"135","title":"#135","category":"Article","date":"2024-11-04","author":"@Penqui281, @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1303041867285528701","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#135**\n\nWelcome to this week’s news @News Ping, we hope you enjoy!\n\n**Rankups**\n\nCarpenter: @bxnoora, @TheSuperPowerCoder, @1googuy1\nLumberjack Merchant: @Time9578\nExperienced Lumberjack: @bxnoora, @Mr_Kn1ght1, @RyzTheUnc, @Loki_dog001\nCarpenter Specialist: @Mr_Kn1ght1\nElectrician Specialist: @TellRice\n\n**Staff Birthdays**\n\nThis week (and upcoming week), we have the birthday of 1 staff member. Happy birthday to our amazing group leader @Big Honcho Turkey (Cesar)!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nOct-28: @Dead\nOct-29: @30DEEPJAYDENNN, @pargreensalt\nOct-30: @BaconIsADogger, @minkiemoo\nOct-31: @Gradyer1, @ayoleslie, @timksyt\nNov-1: @AlterAqua, @bilalwacky2\nNov-2: @ard.33, @brando0359447\nNov-3: @MaskBonnieTheMaster\nNov-4: @Big Honcho Turkey (Cesar), @Zizo\nNov-6: @darkphoenix2732, @Hayden\nNov-7: @vanpratt\nNov-8: @GantengZoneTeam2, @ImperialVenue, @KarimNahas, @LunarrEcho, @notmyname_FOOL, @superdaniel8544, @TheNJKid\nNov-9: @Hunter | Nuhter100\nNov-10: @weepercreep8\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @87hpyy, @Lotaiu,  and@Loki_dog001 for boosting this week.\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nThe Pumpkin\n\nThe Pumpkin is a collectible item that was exclusively available for $360 during the 2015 Halloween Event at Bob's Shack, making it the first pumpkin added to the game. It serves as a decorative item, a display piece, and a light source, with a range similar to the Worklight, casting a warm glow around itself. Its design features a bright reddish-orange colour, with yellow light radiating from its eyes and mouth, and a slight scorch mark on one side, inspired by the Roblox \"Classic ROBLOX Pumpkin Head\" hat. The packaging is a dark grey box with a decal on one side. At one point, the Pumpkin's mesh appeared distorted, creating a plaid-like orange and black ball due to changes in Roblox's mesh handling, which Defaultio, the game’s creator, addressed on Twitter; this glitch was later fixed.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Pumpkin\n\nThanks for reading! We will see you all again next week!\n\nNews: @Penqui281, @KingBoo - OJ!, @⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ\nPumpkin\nThe Pumpkin is an item that was only available during the 2015 Halloween Event and could be purchased from Bob's Shack, for $360 Money. It was the first pumpkin to be added to the game. Players...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Pumpkin"},{"number":"136","title":"#136","category":"Article","date":"2024-11-11","author":"@⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ, @KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1305380449450725450","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**#136**\n\nWelcome back to the news @News Ping, we hope you enjoy!\n\n**Lumber Games**\n\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n**Rankups**\n\nThere were no rankups this week.\n\n**Staff Birthdays**\n\nThis week (and upcoming week), we have the birthdays of 3 staff members. Happy birthday to the supervisor intern @⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ (ooh that’s me!), the supervisor @Dallinz but turkey Year 🗓, and our amazing group leader @Big Honcho Turkey (Cesar)!\n\n**Birthdays**\n\nNov-4: @Big Honcho Turkey (Cesar), @Zizo\nNov-6: @darkphoenix2732, @Hayden\nNov-7: @vanpratt\nNov-8: @GantengZoneTeam2, @ImperialVenue, @KarimNahas, @LunarrEcho, @notmyname_FOOL, @superdaniel8544, @TheNJKid\nNov-9: @Hunter | Nuhter100\nNov-10: @weepercreep8\nNov-11: @sUpErbOy_pRO1566\nNov-12: @DANBATMAN123321\nNov-13: @connorbinder321, @egehankralby, @Dallinz but turkey Year 🗓\nNov-15: @br0ken_micr0wave, @samman69, @TheWeirdoPlayer\nNov-16: @6rnu7736, @friedonl\nNov-17: @⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ\n\n\n**Boosters**\n\nThanks to @scissors_6868alt and @therealsaten for boosting this week.\n\n**Wiki Fact Of The Week**\n\nElm Wood\n\nElm Wood, called Oak Wood in-game, is a widely available and commonly used type of wood. It can be cut by most axes, except the Candy Cane Axe, and is often harvested and sold at the Wood Dropoff as a quick way for new players to earn money. It’s also used as a versatile material for making long planks or filling Blueprints. Despite its large size, Elm has the lowest value among all trees in the game, even lower than Oak. Elm trees resemble Oak in growth pattern but are taller with more intricate branches and dark to bright green, grassy-textured leaves. The wood itself has a light tan interior, and its thick logs resemble those of Fir Wood, although they are closer in size to Lava Wood, yet thinner than Koa Wood. Elm is moderately uncommon in the Main Biome and Tropics but more prevalent in the Safari. For efficient harvesting, a Rukiryaxe or stronger is recommended, and for milling, a Sawmax 01 or better due to the wood's large, thick logs. Using a vehicle is also advisable when transporting large quantities of Elm Wood.\n\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Elm_Wood\n\nThank you for reading and have a nice week!\n\nNews: @⚡ Ghoulmi 👻⚡ - OJ, @KingBoo - OJ!, @Penqui281\nElm Wood\nElm Wood (known in-game as Oak Wood) is an abundant and widely used species of Wood. It can be cut by most axes except the Candy Cane Axe. This type of wood is often cut up and sold in the Wood...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Elm_Wood"},{"number":"74","title":"Interview Wednesday #74","category":"Interview","date":"2024-11-21","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1309014506093150208","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #74**\n\nHello, @News Ping  and welcome to another week of interviewing people! This time, @KingBoo - OJ!  interviewed @SimplyTheTurkeyPR - OJ!!!! \n\n[Q] When did you first start playing LT2?\n\n[A] I started playing lt2 it at the end of 2018.\n\n[Q] How did you stumble across LT2?\n\n[A] I was looking for games on my xbox and the game caught my eye. \n\n[Q] What’s your favorite place to visit in LT2?\n\n[A]My favorite place would be the ticktatwert memorial. \n\n[Q] What’s your biggest/proudest accomplishment in LT2?\n\n[A]Well, i dont have a biggest accomplishment, but i would have to say the moment i started playing\n\n[Q] What’s your most memorable moment in LT2?\n\n[A]would have to be the first time i visited the ticktatwert memorial, it took me 2 hours to get there for the first time and the reward on seeing the memorial was worth it. \n\n[Q] What aspect of the game makes LT2 different from other games?\n\n[A] I would say on how you can be creative in the game, how ppl can make so much with so little in the game.\n\n Interviewed by: @KingBoo - OJ!"},{"number":"75","title":"Interview Wednesday #75","category":"Interview","date":"2025-01-11","author":"@penqui","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1327451894230290534","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #75**(It's Friday btw)\n\nHello, @News Ping and welcome to another week of interviewing people! This time, @penqui interviewed @Aptyn!\n\nQ. What is your favorite item in Lumber Tycoon 2 (LT2), and why?\nA. My favorite item is the BLUESTEEL AXE!! So good in fact, that you can buy it right here on Roblox! https://www.roblox.com/catalog/80155541594194/Bluesteel-Axe\n\nQ. Could you share your favorite build, whether created by you or someone else, and explain what makes it stand out to you?\nA. Quite frankly, any build that involves blue spruce wood is a good build to me, the Bluesteel axe is the best axe to cut it with!\n\nQ. What would you consider your proudest moment related to Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA. My proudest moment was when I submitted the BLUESTEEL AXE! to lumber tycoon 2! You can buy it on the Aptyn Merch Store ™️ !! \n\nQ. What advice would you offer to individuals aspiring to build at your level?\nA. My advice is to utilize the Bluesteel axe in lumber tycoon 2 to harvest Bluespruce wood because it is the best wood to build with!! Make sure to pick up the Bluesteel axe UGC \n\nQ. How do you maintain viewer engagement throughout your videos?\nA. I maintain viewer engagement by having a Bluesteel axe on my back on Roblox.\n\nQ. What inspired you to start creating content focused on Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA. When I started playing lumber tycoon 2, I realized that there was no Bluesteel axe in the game. That inspired me to start creating content to eventually get to the point that I could influence the developer of lumber tycoon 2 to add one to lt2. Now, it is not only in the game, but also can be purchased on the Aptyn Merch Store ™️ ! \n\nQ. How did you first discover Lumber Tycoon 2, and what drew you to it?\nA. I was searching up games about \"Bluesteel axe\" but found no results. The closest result was lumber tycoon 2, so I started focusing on it so I could get the Bluesteel axe added. \n\nInterviewed by:@penqui\nBluesteel Axe\nCustomize your avatar with the Bluesteel Axe and millions of other items. Mix & match this back accessory with other items to create an avatar that is unique to you!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/catalog/80155541594194/Bluesteel-Axe"},{"number":"76","title":"Interview Wednesday #76","category":"Interview","date":"2025-02-20","author":"@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1341940431465746502","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #76**\n\n@News Ping  \nIt's been a awhile but we're back! Today I interviewed @2016 Ender ! \n\n[Q] Tell us about yourself\n[A] I’m Ender, I’m a structural engineer, and I've been a supervisor since, err, forever... though took a break for a year but that was a while back.\n\n[Q] How did you first discover Lumber Tycoon 2, and what drew you to it?\n[A] It's been so long since I started playing, I start sometime in 2015 (and do remember a time before the tropics biome). What drawn me to it was it gave me something much like Minecraft; harvest trees and make cool builds.\n\n[Q] What made you want to become a Supervisor?\n[A] I became a supervisor here to some capacity act as a liaison between the fan group and the the wiki, although it became more to serve the members of the community. Although I’m not as active as I used to be, I do pop in to stir up conversation and check up on the other members.\n\n[Q] What's your favorite food?\n[A] There's a lot of good foods, though honestly pizza or a steak are super good as well!\n\n[Q] Have you ever had a moment in the fan group that you wished you could do again?\n[A] There have been some moments in here I wish I could do again, or pick a different route, but it is what it is.\n\n[Q] About 3 years ago you were asked if Pineapple belonged on pizza. Have you changed your mind yet?\n[A] Hell no. Do not ever add pineapples to pizza, and if you do you're absolutely crazy.\n\nHappy chopping! Have a great day or night.\nInterviewer: @fartsona"},{"number":"77","title":"Interview Wednesday #77","category":"Interview","date":"2025-03-07","author":"@CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1347398623545135237","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Interview Wednesday #77**\n\n@News Ping  Hi. Today's Interviewee is our Electrician Specialist @Susmcsusysus  who had a long journey making his own building company and now he's training people to become builder/electricians.\n\nQ:When did you first start playing Lumber tycoon 2 and what made you like the game?\nA:i first started playing in 2017, what made me like the game was the community, and most importantly the logic\n\nQ:What made Lumber tycoon 2 in your opinion different from the other tycoons or minigames?\nA:it wasn't any generic tycoon where u just collected money to build and have the same base as everyone else, you could build your own base and make deals, build stores, and run businesses, which is one thing I've been doing since 2018\n\nQ:What's your favorite item in the game and your favorite activity that you like to do?\nA:favorite item in the game is the AND gate!!!!! best item in the game, i like building buildings and logic machines for people \n\nQ:Building and logics are really fun tho. So, have you felt like the game lost favour and it got bored, or your favorite activity's didn't seem fun anymore and if yes, how did you manage to keep have fun playing?\nA:one way that i keep having fun playing lt2 is expanding my horizons and talking to new people in the community, i have experienced I-Omegas wisdom and grammis support for my logic company in the lt2 community so it pushed me to make far greater things, now i make builds for cheap, have workers, and have made far more advanced machines i did about a year ago\n\nQ:Really great story and motivational. But what motivated you to keep working and not give up?\nA:my friend voodooworm, he always made me, always see his things and i wanted to be just like him logic wise, not only that grammi helped me out in bad times"},{"number":"138","title":"#138","category":"Article","date":"2025-03-10","author":"@CyZozz and @omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1348519104897617920","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__#138__**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to this week's News. We hope you all enjoy!!\n\n**__Staff Birthdays__**\nThis week (and upcoming) we had the birthday of our hard working and great Co-Owner @sirred90 . We really appreciate all your hard work that you put in, and the rest of the staff members too. Let's wish them all a happy birthday and much more.\n\n**__Lumber Games__**\nThere was one Lumber game this week and the winner was TheDuckGoesWOOF101 which won all the 4 standard matches.\n\n**__Boosters__**\nThank to @BlueAxo989 for boosting the server this week.\n\n**__Rankups__**\n\nCongratulations to the following people who made it into Event Committe! \n@💵Jackson27- OJ!!💵, @Ariana, @ImMrJakob ,@Blue_LumberNoob @2015 boingyunicorn - OJ!!!!, and @Bentley - OJ!!!\n\n**__Birthdays__**\nRecent and upcoming birthdays:\n\n● Mar-03: @parker_1752, @mohamedkvm, @Stojaa111, @The_NormalPerson1 \n● Mar-04: @24k_Sxns, @sirred90 \n● Mar-05: @Jackson \n● Mar-06: @Shadowheart \n● Mar-07: @loopdoopoo \n● Mar-08: @Gokukiller6342, @Marianneczek, @wilmergamingYT_TTV \n● Mar-11: @Haadzafar2021\n● Mar-12: 2015 @2015 boingyunicorn - OJ!!!! \n● Mar-13: @Avi Polaris, @omgitsmejon \n● Mar-14: @bokchoyboyyyy \n● Mar-15: @GmdTanker , @legomaniac0010 \n● Mar-18: @10Xtrixy, @samman69, @Sam, The Bloodstained \n● Mar-20: @HappyGhost🌈:D \n● Mar-21: @Calebd_999 \n● Mar-22: @CyZozz\n● Mar-23: @Lolxdidkjustaname \n\n**__Wiki Fact of the week__**\n\nChicken axe\n\nIt is based on a Roblox model created by Unikarnz and Jac16king called \"Gift of Feathery Fury / Poultryaxe\". The reason why Defaultio added this axe is unknown, but it is very likely that Defaultio saw the model, liked it, and thought it would be funny to implement it into the game.\nDespite that its release date is unknown, it is known that the axe used to be called \"Chicken Axe\", without all the text being capitalized. The axe was once hoarded and exploited in the game and sold for ridiculously high amounts of money by many exploiters and duplicators.\nHowever, because of the axe being well-known and being pleaded by many to be added to the game, the axe can now be obtained through unboxing The Gift of Great Times that was added during the Christmas 2017 Event and was renamed to \"CHICKEN AXE\", with all the text being capitalized. The image of the chicken has also changed position, from the long sides to the small sides of the box.\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/CHICKEN_AXE\n\n**__Closing__**\n\nThank you for tuning into Lumber News this week! We hope to see you again this upcoming Wednesday for the next interview! Have a great day alll!:) \n\nNews by: @CyZozz and @omgitsmejon\nCHICKEN AXE\nThe CHICKEN AXE is an Axe that can be unwrapped from the Gift of Great Times, a gift that was purchasable at Wood R Us for $12,000 Money, as part of the 2017 Christmas Event. The damage of this...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/CHICKEN_AXE"},{"number":"78","title":"Wednesday Interview #78","category":"Interview","date":"2025-03-12","author":"@CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1349494862419857499","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**Wednesday Interview #78**\n@News Ping Today's Interviewee it's the well known @KevinAlvesYT which I had the best experience interviewing and his quotes and answers left me speechless😄. I really enjoyed the interview and I hope you guys enjoy the interview as much as I did xD.\n\n\nQ: So first, tell us about yourself.\nA:Well where do I start? My name is Kevin. Some of you may know me  as a Base Reviewer for the Fan Group or even from previous appearances with Heath Haskins (CodePrime) LT2 Videos. But there is more than just that, I have been running a loving community that I call Tesco Community for the last 6 years, Since Summer 2018.\n\nQ:How do you manage to run the Tesco Community as well with the other staff, and how hard is it for you and the staff to maintain it everyday? \nA:Well people think it's hard, well it is. But over the last 6 years I have built such an amazing team around me, Without them I wouldn't be in the position today with Tesco Community. Yes we have had our highs and lows but we take it day to day and strive forward to the best of our ability. There was a time in our Community where it was stone quiet where things didn't happen but we sparked, we made change and we took it bit by bit to get to where we have Tesco now. it has been very tricky for me to run Tesco over the few years, It came to conversations of me not continuing it but I have found ways to manage Tesco Community to strive to success and ensure that Lumber Tycoon 2 Community is heard and has a place where they feel welcomed. Our biggest turnout point was 2022 where things just miraculously happened and with our great Management Team and our great Lumber Tycoon 2 teams who aid and assist us in every goal we set to succeed, They are there for the fun and we reward them with fair LT2 Pay-outs but some refuse as they are just there to support our amazing Community. It's been a hell of a journey.. A journey that has just started for us."},{"number":"139","title":"Lumber News #139","category":"Article","date":"2025-03-17","author":"@CyZozz, @KingBoo - OJ!, and @omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1351030578719363124","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Lumber News #139__**\n\n@News Ping Welcome to this week’s edition of Lumber News! We've got exciting updates, events, and community highlights. Let's dive in! \n\n**__Staff Birthday Spotlight __**\n\nThis week, we’re celebrating the birthday of our amazing Supervisor and Journalist Manager — @omgitsmejon! Thank you for all your dedication and hard work! Everyone, make sure to wish them a Happy Birthday and many more to come! \n\n**__Lumber Games Recap__**\n\n We didn't have any Lumber Games this week, we're hoping there will be a Lumber Game next week.\n\n**__Server Boosters Appreciation__**\n\nSpecial thanks to our awesome booster this week: @yeetboy990875 — Thank you for supporting the server! Boosters help keep this community thriving — we appreciate you! \n\n**__New RankUps__**\n\nCongratulate the following member on his new role: @CyZozz Which obtained the Electrician rank (Oh, that's me xD).\n\n **__Community Birthday List __**\n\n Let’s wish a Happy Birthday to these amazing members: \n● Mar-24: @HIIIIIIIIICCFC, @ironronan2403 \n● Mar-25: @ok32514 \n● Mar-26: @Mrswag72\n● Mar-27: @Faceless 🎄 , @PopKieThaCat \n● Mar-28: @Boy Grandma, @ItzCuantikoX \n● Mar-29: @DeputyRBLX\n\n**__Wiki Fact of the Week — The Maze Edition!__**\n\nDid you know? Here's a cool fact about The Maze: People usually heard of it from the blue wood which is called Cavecrawler, but there much more to explore, like the Fine arts shop where you can find different paintings and there are events where you could even find gifts or items. Have you ever heard of the lost people? Yeah there 3 people that got lost in the Maze, there isn't really a context, but people say that they might be explorers that tried to explore the Maze. If you explore the Maze enough you could find some black looking walls, which are designed there to keep a third of the cave which connects it to the cavecrawler cavern. For more information and interesting things there's a link\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Maze\n\n\n**__Closing__**\n\nThank you for reading this week’s Lumber News! We’ll be back next Sunday with more updates, fun, and awesome community moments. Stay creative, keep building, and have a great week! \n\nWritten by: @CyZozz, @KingBoo - OJ!, and @omgitsmejon\nMaze\nThe Maze is a complex tunneling system located underneath the Tropics and the Ocean. The entrance to this semi-biome is located at the back end of the Tropics and, depending on where the player...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Maze"},{"number":"140","title":"Lumber News #140 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-03-24","author":"@CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1353594972833583215","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Lumber News #140 — Weekly Recap! \n\n@News Ping \nWelcome back to this week’s edition of Lumber News! We've got exciting updates, events, and community highlights this week as well!\n\n**__Lumber Games Recap__**\n\nThis week we had 1 Lumber game, it was a standard on the main map and the winner was @BoxxxyBoo . Let's congratulate him on winning!\n\n**__Server Boosters__**\n\nSpecial thanks to our awesome booster this week: @SmalIPie\nThank you for supporting the server! Boosters help keep this community thriving — we appreciate you! \n\n**__Rank Ups__**\n\nThere were no rankups this week. If you'd like to have your name a different color or a cool role, make a base review ticket in the <#1350790386926485514> channel. I challenge you guys to claim all those obtainable roles, I bet you won't be able to xD\n\n**__Upcoming Member's Birthdays__**\n\nLet’s wish a Happy Birthday to:\n\nMarch -31: \nApril -1: @jshuaplayz, @justlxvish\nApril -5: @sire.sight, @gamer2910fop\nApril -6: @Yiridium\n\nHappy Birthday to everyone!\n\n**__Wiki Fact of the Week — The Gold Axe Mystery Edition!__**\n\nThe Gold Axe Mystery: The Gold Axe once existed in the game but was removed by the developer, Defaultio, to prevent exploiting. If someone claims to have seen or owns a Gold Axe, it's likely untrue, as this item is no longer available. If you'd like to find more information about the gold axe, check the link below.\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gold_Axe\n\n**__Closing__**\n\nAppreciate you for reading this week’s Lumber News! We’ll be back next Sunday with more updates. Stay creative and have a great week!\n\nWritten by: @CyZozz\nGold Axe\nThe Gold Axe was the best tool for chopping wood in the game. The axe had the highest hit damage to trees, equivalent to 5 chops from The Many Axe, and was capable of chopping down almost any tree...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gold_Axe"},{"number":"78","title":"Wednesday Interview #78","category":"Interview","date":"2025-03-27","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1354664490880466956","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Wednesday Interview #78__**\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome back to our weekly interview. Today @KingBoo - OJ! interviewed @Ariana! Anyway without further ado, let’s get right intoit!\n\nQ: Tell us a little about yourself!\nA: I'm Ari (not real name but whatever)\nI play lots of games on roblox with the LT2 HOOLIGANS YEAAAHHH\nI'm bisexual and very supportive of the LGBTQ+ Community:D\nI'm good with communicating with others and helping them so that's why I also applied for the EC role, thanks for the staff for letting me have this opportunity:3\nI do some animating and voice acting too I guess\n\n\nQ: When did you first start playing Lumber tycoon 2 and what made you like the game?\nA: This may sound really weird but thank the Lord the hunt existed. Because when I joined I felt a sense of comfort and it just told me; now this is my game. And there's so much more to do other than just chopping wood like other tycoons.\n\nQ: What’s your most memorable moment in LT2?\nA: Hm, tough question, it comes down to meeting my good friends like; Kit, frank, mikey whom are all in this server and they've been such good friends, like the best ever especially on roblox. We are the epico LT2 Hooligans >:P (edited)\n\n\nQ: What’s your favorite place to visit in LT2?\nA: Honestly it's so fun to go to the volcano and take a bluesteel axe, and fly into oblivion. But then again the amount of rage and laughter me and my friends made just trying to get to frost wood was probably the most memorable place to visit.\n\n\nQ: What’s your biggest/proudest accomplishment in LT2?\nA: My biggest, probably my shop, it's massive… But all jokes aside my proudest achievement would probably me making a trailer snake more than 50 trailers wide, it was so silly xD. (I'm gonna get that green box soon mueheheheh)\n\nQ: Over your past journey and experience playing lt2, what would be a piece of advice you would give to the people reading?\nA: Overall stay positive with everyone you meet in the game, let's keep it chill  And for the love of Christ don't be like me, keep visits off from your base, this is coming from someone that got base flung 27 times (ps a base fling is when an exploiter spins at uncontrollable speeds and makes your loose items go flying into narnia) and also DONT BEG FOR MONEY. But seriously just have fun in the game, it's where the fun is at. Enjoy it.\n\nInterviewed by: @KingBoo - OJ!"},{"number":"141","title":"Lumber News #141","category":"Article","date":"2025-04-01","author":"@CyZozz, @KingBoo - OJ!,@Bentley - OJ!!, and @omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1356456757890908222","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #141__**\n\n@News Ping \n\nWelcome to this week's Lumber News edition, we're glad to have you guys here. We've got existing updates this week as well!\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\n\nThis week we did not have any lumber games due to the games being cancelled.\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\n\nWe did not have any boosters this week. As always, thank you everyone that is currently boosting the server.\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\n\nPlease congratulate the following members on their new roles:\n\n@789TKO Who received the role Elite. And @rileymstone1 that received the role Experienced Lumberjack.\n\nWe can’t wait to see what you'll do in your new role!\n\n** __Community Birthday List__ **\n\nThis week and upcoming week we have the birthdays of:\nApril-8: @KingNubTheGreat\nApril-10: @703ender, @Kjsuazoispro, @YkJoniBoi65\nApril-12: @Fire_Fire™ © but is in 2025\n\nLet's wish them all a happy birthday and a beautiful week!\n\n**__Wiki Fact of the Week__**\n\nThe Test Wood\n\nThe Test Wood is an unreleased wood type accessible only in the game files, classified as \"Test.\" It grows exclusively in the \"Test Region,\" a zone automatically removed whenever the server starts. Likely used during the game's testing phase, Test Wood served as a model for Fir Wood, Pine Wood, and the leaves of Phantom Wood, seemingly derived from Oak Wood. Unlike Pine and Fir, Test Wood lacks a \"test branch\" subclass, suggesting it was Defaultio’s initial attempt at creating Pine Wood before opting for a separate tree class for branches. Test Wood shares the same color for wood, bark, and leaves as Oak Wood and grows to a similar height, although it rarely features split branches. Its branches resemble those of Pine and Fir trees, while the leaves match the trunk's width and height, similar to Phantom Wood. Notably, Test Wood has distinct pricing: the log price per unit is $3.0, higher than the $1.5 log price of Oak Wood, but its plank price per unit is $5.8, slightly lower than Elm Wood by $0.2, with Oak Wood valued at $10 per unit.\n\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Test_Wood\n\n** __Closing__ **\n\nThanks for reading this week's Lumber News as well and we wish you guys a beautiful week. We'll be back next Sunday. Have fun and goodluck on building!\n\nWritten by: @CyZozz, @KingBoo - OJ!,@Bentley - OJ!!, and @omgitsmejon\nTest Wood\nTest Wood is an unreleased Wood type that can only be found in the game files. It is classified as \"Test\" and would grow only in the \"Test Region\", which is a region automatically removed whenever...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Test_Wood"},{"number":"79","title":"Wednesday Interview #79","category":"Interview","date":"2025-04-03","author":"@bentley05965","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1357232858795868231","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Wednesday Interview #79__**\n\n\n@News Ping Today's interview will be @2_Buckets, which is a really funny guy to talk to and just chill. 🙂 All of his answers were very surprising. I hope you guys find the same to!\n\nQ: How did you stumble upon Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I stumbled upon Lumber by a friend on Xbox introducing me to it.\n\nQ: How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Since late 2016 - early 2017.\n\nQ: What is your favorite item in the game?\nA: The Bold and Brash, Simply because it has a cool interaction.\n\nQ: What is your least favorite item in the game?\nA: Scoobis. So many people have annoyed me with it I'm tired of hearing it.\n\nQ: What is the most money you have had in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: 20M (Max). Obtained from selling all my items before starting on an empty plot.\n\nQ: Do you like the ATV, Utility hauler, Utility hauler XL, or the snowmobile and why?\nA:  I like the ATV Because it allows for getting ice wood to be a little easier.\n\nQ: What is your favorite axe in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Either the Many axe or the End axe, Both I really like.\n\nQ: What is your favorite biome in Lumber Tycoon 2 and why?\nA: The Volcano because of the music.\n\nQ: What is your favorite thing to do in Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: I love building and looking at others bases to see what creative ideas people can come up with.\n\nThank you guys for reading and see you next week! \n\nInterviewer: @bentley05965"},{"number":"79","title":"Wednesday Interview #79","category":"Interview","date":"2025-04-17","author":"@KingBoo - OJ!","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1362219479433482363","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"*Wednesday Interview #79*\n\nHello @News Ping and welcome back to our weekly interview. Today @KingBoo - OJ! interviewed @2015 boingyunicorn - OJ!!!!! Anyway without further ado, let’s get right into it!\n\nQ: Tell us a little about yourself\nA: I’m Ella, I play lots of games on roblox such as blox fruits, lt2 and welcome to bloxburg. I like reading, singing and drawing. I like helping people and I'm good at communicating with people. That's why I applied for the EC role, and someday I wish to become a supervisor for this awesome server.\n\nQ: What’s your biggest/proudest accomplishment in LT2?\nA:My biggest accomplishment in lt2 would be building an up and down elevator with my friend adam \n\nQ: What’s your favorite place to visit in LT2?\nA: my favourite place to visit would be the taiga slopes\n\nQ: What’s your most memorable moment in LT2?\nA: Probably playing with my 2 friends, we were all in cars and we were driving into each other trying to flip them over.\n\nQ:When did you first start playing Lumber tycoon 2 and what made you like the game?\nA: I started playing lt2 4 or 5 years ago, i liked the game because you could build whatever you wanted and there was always something to do\n\nQ:Over your past journey and experience playing lt2, what would be a piece of advice you would give to the people reading?\nA: Be nice to everyone you meet ingame, keep visits off from your base, or your items will get flung, and do not beg for money."},{"number":"142","title":"Lumber News #142","category":"Article","date":"2025-04-17","author":"@CyZozz, @KingBoo - OJ!, and @omgitsmejon","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1362219482906366075","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #142__ **\n\n@News Ping Welcome to this week’s edition of Lumber News!\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight __ **\n\nThis week, we’re celebrating the birthday of the Supervisor — @Archie -🌈 and @Kledrax! Thank you for all your hard work! Everyone, make sure to wish him a Happy Birthday.\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\n\n We didn't have any Lumber Games this week, we're hoping there will be a Lumber Game next week.\n \n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\n\nWe didn’t have any new boosters this week.\n\n** __New RankUps__ **\n\nLet's congratulate the following members on their new roles which both obtained the Experienced Lumberjack role, @TheOnlyDuckPilot and @Arioso\n\n ** __Community Birthday List __ **\n\n Let’s wish a Happy Birthday to these amazing members: \n● April-13: @Kledrax\n● April-15: @xb0y_416 \n● April-18: @7Vx0, @TicTac\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — The Shrine of Sight!__ **\n\nThe Shrine of the Sight is a secret underground area in Lumber Tycoon 2, hidden behind the Rock Bridge Cave. If you blow up a specific wall using dynamite, it opens a path that leads to this shrine, and any vehicle can fit through it.\nInside the shrine is a big stone door and two lava-filled holes. To open the door, players used to need two rare items — Cube 12 and Cube 13 — both had to be opened many times until they turned light gray. You’d drop each cube into the correct hole, and if done right, the shrine door would slowly open with a grinding noise. Behind the door is a glowing cavern called the Cavern of the Sight, where you’ll find a huge painting called Bold and Brash, which is a fun reference to SpongeBob. For a while, during the Ready Player One event, the item requirement was easier — you could use almost anything — but in June 2019, it changed back to needing the cubes.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Shrine_of_the_Sight\n\n** __Closing__ **\n\nThanks to you guys for reading this week's article and we'll be back next week with a new article, until then we wish you all fun and goodluck!\n\nWritten by: @CyZozz, @KingBoo - OJ!, and @omgitsmejon\nShrine of the Sight\nThe Shrine of the Sight is located deep underground, behind the Rock Bridge Cave. This shrine consists of a large cut into a stone wall with two holes on the sides, that drop into lava. The cut in...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Shrine_of_the_Sight"},{"number":"81","title":"Wednesday Interview #81","category":"Interview","date":"2025-04-23","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1364640251188089023","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Wednesday Interview #81__**\n\n@News Ping Hey everyone! Today's interview will be @DaOnly_Unknown, who is a new member of our community!\n\nQ: How did you find out about Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Heard Defaultio dropped lumber tycoon 2\n\nQ: What's your favorite memory of Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: When i was hangin' wit a bunch of friends building random things\n\nQ: How long have you been playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Since it came out basically\n\nQ: What's the funniest moment you have playing Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Being trapped in a cell 💀\n\nQ: What do you believe makes Lumber Tycoon 2 different/unique from other games?\nA: I used to think the way its set up. But then it got old. Alot of people don't play anymore due to lack of updates. Sawmill is officially to small for some wood. No new stores, no new axes, nun is new anymore.\n\nQ: What new update would you suggest for Lumber Tycoon 2?\nA: Everything. Add stores, axes, a boat shop, new wood, new blueprints. Circular blueprints, rounded out blueprints. Make it like real life. I have construction certifications. And it'd be nice to make lumber like a real life design table.\n\nThanks for reading, see you next week!\n\nInterview conducted & written by: @Fated"},{"number":"82","title":"Wednesday Interview #82","category":"Interview","date":"2025-05-01","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1367362575058206782","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Wednesday Interview #82__**\n\n@News Ping  Hey Everyone! Today, @CyZozz is going to interview @Cheese! Enjoy!\n\nQ:What did made you play lumber tycoon 2, and what made you keep playing it until this day? If you could elaborate it, would be great\n\nA:I think a friend first introduced it to me a couple years ago. I continued playing it because we started building a base together, we were building a kind of city that had different buildings for different items.\n\nQ:Really great story and I can feel the nostalgia. What's a moment while you played lumber tycoon 2 that you can't forget until this day, and remained a great memory?\n\nA:One moment that I won’t forget, I think it’s probably when my base got flung. I was just moving stuff around in my storage and I had some stuff in trucks. While I was looking something up for my base (I think it was wood colors) I came back to most of my trucks and items being spread across the map.\n\nQ:From this experience, what have you learned that was useful in life?\n\nA:I’ve learned that you have to work if you want to see results, and that sometimes when you fall you have to get back up.\n\nQ:Really great lessons. From your first time playing, and until this day, what's your biggest achievement and the biggest dream you plan to achieve?\n\nA:I think it’s probably been to create a store with every item in it. I have a good amount of them but not quite all of them. For my biggest achievement it’s probably getting 3rd place in the Christmas tree contest\nQ:When in your Lumber tycoon 2 journey have you felt like giving up and nothing worths anymore? What made you still continue and not give up on it?\n\nA:That would be when I had to restart building my base because I placed it a couple studs off. I continued because my friends encouraged me to keep playing.\nQ:From your experience and your journeys past. How you could motivate people that confront hard times or just started playing and doesn't have a road to follow? What's an advice you would give to the people reading this?\n\nA:I’d say that the end result is always worth the struggles and hard times. If you don’t have a road to follow I suggest you buy land, buy a car, and buy a sawmill, then keep upgrading those and building structures on your plot. My advice to the people reading this is to sell items to players to make the most money."},{"number":"145","title":"Lumber News #145 — Week Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-05-05","author":"@Darth Jar Jar @CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1368779942749278270","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Lumber News #145 — Week Recap!\n\n@News Ping \n\n\nWelcome to this week’s edition of Lumber News! We've got exciting updates, and interesting community highlights.\n\n\n**__Lumber Games Recap__**\nUnfortunately there were no Lumber Games.\n\n\n**__Server Boosters Appreciation__**\nThank you to @Wobble Goddess for boosting!\n\n\n**__New Rank Ups__**\n\nCongratulations to the following member for achieving the following roles:\n\n@GodTierPsycho who achieved the Experienced Lumberjack, Carpenter, Electrician, Lumberjack Merchant and Lumberjack Artist roles.\n\nRoles give you cool colored name, so if you'd like to have a nickname color you can go to # fan-group-ranks and there you'll see more information.\n\n**__Community Birthday List!__**\n\nApril 29th\n@Boop Wolf\n@ScrapBlox\nApril 30th\n@dantdmfan345677\nMay 1st\n@chriss7561\n@videogameplayer032\n@zackafleabag\nMay 2nd\n@lotosaed\nMay 5th\n@adam768adam\n@chris.9132\n@theexplodedguys\nMay 6th\n@eric_liau\nMay 7th\n@chonk2.0\n\nHappy Birthday to Everyone! 🎂 🥳\n\n\n\n **__Wiki Fact of the Week — Rukiryaxe!__**\n\nThe Rukiryaxe, also known as the Shark Axe, is considered one of the best axes in the game. It is the second-best axe for chopping nearly every wood type, surpassed only by the Many Axe. However, the Rukiryaxe is more accessible, as it can be obtained year-round, except on Halloween.\nOn Halloween, the Rukiryaxe is temporarily replaced by the End Times Axe, which is the only axe capable of chopping Phantom Wood. \nIn summary, while the Many Axe holds the top spot for raw power, the Rukiryaxe is a close second and is more readily available, making it a popular choice among players.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Rukiryaxe?\n\n**__Closing__**\n\nThank you for reading this week’s Lumber News!\nWe’ll be back next Sunday.\n\nStay creative, and wish all of you a great weekend. \nWritten by: @Darth Jar Jar @CyZozz\nRukiryaxe\nThe Rukiryaxe, also commonly referred to as the Shark Axe, is one of the best axes in the game. It is the second best axe for chopping nearly every wood type, except for specialty axes on their...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Rukiryaxe?"},{"number":"83","title":"Wednesday Interview #83","category":"Interview","date":"2025-05-08","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1369928483517628437","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"Wednesday Interview #83\n@News Ping Hey Everyone! Today, @Traffic Cone collecter (Bentley) is interviewing @GRIPPERS_922 enjoy!\n\n\nQ1: What made you start playing \nLumber Tycoon 2?\n\nA1: Uhm I don't really know I just started clicking, and the tree fell! 🙂\n\nQ2: What was your first thought when you joined Lumber Tycoon 2?\n\nA2: My first thought was what in the world was this it's going to be boring, but it wasn't\n\nQ3: What is one memory you will vividly remember?\n\nA3: Me playing with Bentley and building one of my shops and building my whole base for me.\n\nQ4: What was your first ever build?\n\nA4: A box to store axes!\n\nQ5: Do you like to still play Lumber Tycoon 2 if not why?\n\nA5: I still play lumber tycoon 2.\n\nQ6: Where do you always go as a happy spot in Lumber Tycoon 2. Volcano, TickTatTwert's memorial, etc. and why?\n\nA6: My happy spot is palm island!\n\nQ7: What is your favorite axe?\n\nA7: My favorite axe is the Many Axe, it is the best and it looks cool!\n\n\nQ8: What is the slot you load the most, and why?\n\nA8: Slot one because that's my main base at the moment. That I am grinding on!"},{"number":"146","title":"Lumber News #146 — Week Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-05-11","author":"@SirFated","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1371264619213226086","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Lumber News #146 — Week Recap!__**\n\n@News Ping, Welcome to this week’s edition of Lumber News!\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nUnfortunately there were no Lumber Games.\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nThank you to @XanderZepher for boosting!\n\n\n** __New Rank Ups__ **\nCongratulations to the following member for achieving the following roles:\n@marktheturd3 Carpenter\n@Gracerrific Carpenter, Experienced Lumberjack\n\n\n**__Staff Birthday!__**\n\nWe would all like to wish a very happy birthday to our Lead Supervisor, @Dawn🌼! We wish you the best and hope you had a great day!\n\n__**Community Birthday List**__\n\n**__May 8th__**\n@redcameron8595\n@tanqr1stplayer\n\n**__May 9th__**\n@Jay\n**__May 11th__**\n@Dawn🌼 \n@feedmehotdogs\n**__May 12th__**\n@SuperBigMen\n**__May 13th__**\n@4jGreekgamer\n@danial_313\n@gerda_jan\n@superman4money3\n@warp9000\n\nMay 15th\n@Soviet_Fox55\n@Spooky\n\nHappy Birthday to Everyone! 🎂 🥳\n\n# ** __Wiki Fact of the Week__ **\nWiki Fact of the Week\nZolarKeth is one of the three characters in the Den, sitting at what appears to be the head of the table. He is based off of the Roblox game developer, ZolarKeth, known for co-founding Apocalypse Rising, creating Urbis and Starscape. He does not have any scripted components in the game.\nThe only information the player is given about Zolarketh is from one of the Rukiryaxe Posters, which reads \"'Is too kind to not offer other people the restroom before him even if he really has to go, and also eats sand\". From this information, the player is informed of a crucial role!\nSource:https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/ZolarKeth\n\n\n\n** __Final Words__ **\n\nThank you for reading this week’s edition of Lumber News!\nSee you next Sunday!\n\nWritten by: \n@SirFated \n@CyZozz \n and @omgitsmejon\nZolarKeth\nZolarKeth is one of the three characters in the Den, sitting at what appears to be the head of the table. He is based off of the Roblox game developer, ZolarKeth, known for co-founding Apocalypse...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/ZolarKeth"},{"number":"147","title":"Lumber News #147 — Week Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-06-16","author":"@SirFated, @KingBoo - OJ! @CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1383988896425312278","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"# **__Lumber News #147 — Week Recap!__**\n\n@News Ping\n\n\nAfter a short hiatus, we welcome you back to Lumber News!\n\n\n## ** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThis week there were 3 rounds of lumber games played. The first round was a standard game and it was won by @M23. The second round was a 2 team game and it was won by @M23 and @Jordan 🌈 - OJ!!. The third round was a juggernaut round and it was won by @Jordan 🌈 - OJ!!.\n\n## ** __New Rank Ups__ **\nThis week we're no rank obtained\n\n\n## __**Community Birthday List**__\nLet's wish the following members a happy birthday\nJune-3: @CharacterDevelopment\nJune-4: @BanGoodLuc BEST MAN , @fafcru12\nJune-5: @AlonePlayer78 , @natez200\nJune-6: @JCBunss , @sixisalso9\n\n\n\n__Wiki Fact of the Week - Scoobis__\n\nScoobis was the reward for the hard gift quest of ''Mah Bucket's'' Beesmas 2018 Event: The Gift of Bees day 4, which took place in the game.It is primarily a tan, head-like object with a large smile displayed on its \"face\". At first, it was relatively small. The only interaction scripted in is \"Scoob\", which makes it inflate, emitting a \"Scoob\" sound, then deflate moments shortly after. Because of this function, it can be useful to push movable structures, such as the Rock Bridge.\n\nYou can find the source & read more here: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Scoobis\n\n\n\n## ** __Final Words__ **\nThank you for reading the Lumber News! Return next week for more.\n\nWritten by: \n@SirFated, @KingBoo - OJ! @CyZozz\nScoobis\nScoobis was the reward for the hard gift quest of ''Mah Bucket's'' Beesmas 2018 Event: The Gift of Bees day 4, which took place in the game. The model for Scoobis was created by the Roblox user...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Scoobis"},{"number":"148","title":"Lumber News #148— Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-06-23","author":"@CyZozz @fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1386584010553167882","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #148— Weekly Recap!__ **\n\n@News Ping\nGreat to have you back to a new Lumber News, we have new updates and nice moments this week as well!\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\n\nThis week, we’re celebrating the birthday of our amazing Fan Group Founder, and currently retired — @Grammi!\nThank you for all your dedication and hard work!\n\nEveryone, make sure to wish them a Happy Birthday and many more to come!\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\n\nWe hosted one Lumber Game this week, and here are the winners:\n\nMatch 1 — winner: Maxeltek_HD \nMatch 2 — winners: Maxeltek_HD and Jordan_Nostalgia\nMatch 3 – winner: Jordan_Nostalgia\n\nCongrats to all winners for showing great skill!\\\n\n** __New Rank Ups__ **\n\nPlease congratulate the following members on their new roles:\n\n@ImAFoodGoblin received the roles Experienced Lumberjack and Carpenter\n@76MacMiller84 received the role Carpenter\n@ryans4051  received the role Experienced Lumberjack\n@Inkio received the roles Experienced Lumberjack, Lumberjack Artist, Lumberjack Merchant and Electrician\n@Sam received Experienced Lumberjack and Lumberjack Merchant \n\nWe can’t wait to see what you'll do in your new role!\n\n** __Community Birthday List__ **\n\nLet’s wish a Happy Birthday to these amazing members:\n\nJune 7th: @ms.cher4911\nJune 10th: @Grammi\nJune 16th@cedrikwood3  , @stefanec101  \nJune 17th@civil_the \nJune 18th: @babyNathaniel101 \nJune 19th:@123Will890  , @devout22   @devshurikeno \nJune 22nd:: @Juan_manuel93  \n\n\nHappy Birthday to everyone!"},{"number":"149","title":"Lumber News #149 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-06-30","author":"@CyZozz @fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1389102131012829185","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"__** Lumber News #149 — Weekly Recap! **__\n\n@News Ping\nWelcome back to a new Lumber News, we have new information and community highlights this week as well!\n\n\n__** Lumber Games Recap **__\n\nThere was no Lumber Game this week.\n\n\n__** Server Boosters Appreciation **__\n\nThis week we had the upcoming members supporting our community\n@DashinKing and @hayatk\nWe are Thankful for boosting the server!\n\n\n __** Rank Ups**__\n\nThis week we had the upcoming members achieving they're nice roles\n\n@Catz_member achieved Lumberjack Merchant\n@MatiasNacib achieved Artist\n@Dominanxce achieved Merchant\n\nCongratulations to all of you!\n\n\n __** Community Birthday List **__\n\nThis week we are celebrating the following members\n\nJune 23: @LumberFan13 , @Mikamali \nJune 24: @maokku28 \nJune 25: @Darylbaydid23434 , @Ganker25 , @Hunter, @kain \nJune 26: @GURKE_FLEX\nJune 27: @FwoofieFurry\nJune 28: @Jayy\nJune 29: @Marley🍓 | CST\n\nHappy Birthday to everyone!\n\n\n __** Wiki Fact of the Week — Gold Wood Edition **__\nGold wood was added on August 28, 2015 and it is located in the swamp, gold wood doesn't grow any leaves; it has some narrow dark brown branches and when fully grown it can be easily mistaken to be a dead tree.\nWhen harvesting it is recommended an Overgrown axe, Rukiryaxe, Blue steel or Many Axe.\nYou can get to the Gold wood by the rock bridge, you need to have a dynamite with you at least, or you can use the Safari mountain passage as well.\n\nSource: Gold Wood | Lumber Tycoon 2 Wiki | Fandom https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gold_Wood\n\n\n __** Final Words  **__\nThank you all for reading this Lumber news week, we'll be back next week with another lumber new edition!\n\nWritten by: @CyZozz @fartsona\nGold Wood\nGold Wood (known in game as Gold Swampy Wood) is a common wood type that was added on August 28, 2015. It is located exclusively within the Swamp, along with Zombie Wood. Gold wood is worth...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gold_Wood"},{"number":"150","title":"Lumber News #150 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-07-07","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1391650565875830925","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"__**Lumber News #150 — Weekly Recap!**__\n\n@News Ping\nWelcome back fellas! Glad to have you all back to a new Lumber News. New community highlights this week as well.\n\n Auctioning!  Auctioning is now allowed in Lt2 Fan Group as well, it was added yesterday(July 6) at 11:50 am. Now all of you can have fun auctioning, but don't forget to follow the rules.\n\n\n\n __**Lumber Games Recap**__ \nThere were no Lumber Games this week unfortunately.\n\n\n __**New Rank Ups**__ \n\nPlease congratulate the following member on obtaining his new roles!\n\n@HowietzerH obtained the Carpenter and Experienced Lumberjack roles\n\n\n __**Community Birthday List**__ \n\nLet’s wish a Happy Birthday to these amazing members:\n\nJune 30: @Ayla\nJuly 2: @anonymous_girl1, @noeliacs21 \nJuly 3: @ZeziC5  \nJuly 4: @Henry the second, @mizuki’` \nJuly 5: @_bbb1_, @lukas_gamer1122\nJuly 6: @jailbreakking6758\n\nHappy Birthday to everyone!\n\n\n\n __**Wiki Fact of the Week — Rugged Gift!**__ \n\nDid you know? Here's a cool fact about Rugged Gift: The Rugged Gift is the second most expensive gift in the game with the price of 148.003.\n\nWhen unwrapped, it reveals a boxed atv. The atv has the same sounds as the snowmobile even though the atv is faster and has the best turning than most vehicles in the game. It can be used to climb the Taiga mountains easily and it's very fun driving it.\n\nThe Rugged Gift was part of the Christmas 2024 event and could be bought from Boxed Cars, the Rugged Gift has a similar look to Gift Of Good Preparedness, its bow is slightly lighter.\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Rugged_Gift\n\n\n __**Final Words**__ \n\nHappy July 4 Fellas! We'll be back next Saturday, till then wish all of you a happy week! \nLumber Tycoon 2 Wiki\n\nCredit: @CyZozz\nRugged Gift\nThe Rugged Gift is a gift that could be purchased from Boxed Cars for $148,002 Money as part of the 2024 Christmas Event. This is currently the most expensive gift in the game, beating out the...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Rugged_Gift"},{"number":"151","title":"Lumber News #151 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-07-14","author":"@CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1394153837790756984","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #151 — Weekly Recap!__ **\n@News Ping\nGreat to have you all back! New week, new Lumber News, so let's start off with this week's news and highlights.\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\nLet's all wish a Happy Birthday to these amazing and beloved staff: @Can of Ender Pie, @Jolly Hunter, and @M23.\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nLet's congratulate the following member on obtaining their roles:\n\n@pintujelek90 achieved Lumberjack Merchant and Experienced Lumberjack!\n\n** __Community Birthday List__ **\nLet's wish a Happy Birthday to the following members:\nJuly 8: @Janjiaxian2011\nJuly 9: @Santa Claws Charlie67611, @Happygamer1983, @lynxxie, and @thatpengiunlit\nJuly 10: @Can of Ender Pie, and @Jolly Hunter\nJuly 11: @girard0711\nJuly 13: @M23\n\nHappy birthday to all of you!\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — ? ? ? Edition!__ **\nThe ? ? ?, also known as the Void Entity, was added to the game on the 17th of October, 2022 and was found at Fancy Furnishings on the shelf behind the armchair, it was sold at the price $60606 without any description and, if opened in daylight, nothing would happen, but if opened during nighttime a black shadow entity will float around your base, flinging items and damaging players.\n\nThe Void Entity's price is also interesting because, if the zeros are removed, it is the same as the number 666, which is sometimes considered unlucky or demonic.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThanks for reading this week's news article, we'll be back next weekend with new highlights, and until then, we hope you have a great week!\n\nWritten by: @CyZozz\n? ? ?\nThe ? ? ? (also referred to as the Void Entity) was an item available for purchase at Fancy Furnishings for a cost of $60606 Money. It was part of the 2022 Halloween Event, and may be related to...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F"},{"number":"152","title":"Lumber News #152 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-07-21","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1396646124663734405","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #152 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nWelcome back to the news this week, @News Ping! We hope you enjoy the recaps and new bits, and maybe even get inspired to partake in our competitions!\n\n**__Events__**\nRecently, a few new competitions have come out in our beautiful server. All of the competitions will run until <t:1755576000>, and the following competitions are running:\nDiscord banner creation competition\nDiscord server icon creation competition\n3x3 Lumber Tycoon 2 building (and wire art, for the first time!) competition\n\nFor all of these competitions, you can find relevant information, including the amazing prize pools, in <#1190462440341782528>, the event announcements channel, or through this link to the original announcement: https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1190462440341782528/1386779368751366248\n\nThe actual ending time of these competitions is as stated above, despite the message saying they end July 31st.\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nThis week, community members @StormLovesBeans🫘, @sirred90, and @Travis/Boss/Unseen Icon 👻 boosted the server. Thanks a ton!\n\n** __New Rank Ups__ **\nCongratulations to @ATC2500 for achieving Lumberjack Merchant, and to @Tiagoolas for achieving Experienced Lumberjack, Lumberjack Artist, and Carpenter!"},{"number":"153","title":"Lumber News #153 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-07-28","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1399197896624046110","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #153 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nGood to have you back, @News Ping. We hope all of you are doing great!\n\n** __Boosters Appreciation__ **\nThanks, , for boosting the server!\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThere were no Lumber Games matches held this week.\n\n** __New Rank Ups__ **\nCongratulations to @EdTheGam3r11 for achieving Experienced Lumberjack!\n\n** __Community Birthday List__ **\nLet’s wish the following members a happy birthday!\nJuly 24: @2nd_skelly, @monke, @Skeleton_Willy\nJuly 26: @cantoptas, @Travis/Boss/Unseen Icon 👻\nJuly 27: @Iconeous, @jgorsc5200, @KingBoo - OJ!, @Lotaiu\n\n** __Wiki fact of the week –  Frost Wood Edition__ **\nFrost Wood, also known as Ice Wood, is the only wood that grows at the Taiga Peak and spawns exclusively there. It was added on May 13th, 2018.\n\nThe exterior of the log is smooth white bark, while the interior has a pastel blue-green color with the Roblox ice texture. The leaves use the Roblox glass texture, and therefore cannot be seen through each other.\n\nUsers will find a bridge-like structure on the way to the Taiga Peak, which is relatively difficult to pass with vehicles, but is not impossible, especially with smaller vehicles.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Frost_Wood\n\n** __Final words__ **\nAppreciate your attention, fellas! Wish you all a lovely rest of your summer.\n\nThis article was written by @CyZozz, and @Gomi.\nFrost Wood\nFrost Wood, commonly referred to as Ice Wood, is the only type of wood that grows at the Taiga Peak. It was added to the game on May 13th, 2018, finally making use of the Taiga Mountain Passage...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Frost_Wood"},{"number":"154","title":"Lumber News #154 – Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-08-04","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1401747135317413969","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #154 – Weekly Recap!__ **\nGreetings! Great to have you back again, @News Ping. \n\n** __Boosters Appreciation__ **\nMuch appreciation to @Gomi for boosting the server!\n\n**__Lumber Games Recap__**\nThis week, there were no Lumber Games matches held.\n\n**__New Rank Ups__**\nHuge congrats to @Goldendoodle95 for achieving the Carpenter role!\n\n**__Community Birthdays__**\nJuly - 29: @hjae2010, @Xx1WHAT1_xX\nJuly - 30: @djgurmanthebesteverr, @west\nJuly - 31: @benz9410, @lc_highlighter, @proprooyncutep\nAugust - 1: @Catzzie, @josephpham08, @mattjohn1232\nAugust - 2: @banwandern, @Yaykob2, @Penguin\n\nHappy birthday to all of you!\n\n**__Wiki Fact of the Week - Eerie Skull Edition__**\nEerie Skull was planned to be added in the 2016 Halloween event but Defaultio cancelled it due to exploiters spawning it before it was released officially in-game.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Eerie_Skull\n\n**__Final Words__**\nThanks so much for reading this week! We hope to see you again next time, with even better news for you!\n\nThis article was written by @CyZozz, and @Gomi.\nEerie Skull\nThe Eerie Skull, often called simply the Skull, was an in-game item that was going to be released as a part of the 2016 Halloween Event, along with the Dark Pumpkin and the Preserved Enlarged...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Eerie_Skull"},{"number":"155","title":"Lumber News #155— Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-08-11","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1404535113747796032","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #155— Weekly Recap!__ **\nGlad to have you back, @News Ping!\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThere were no Lumber games this week!\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nMany thanks to @commandobot3 for boosting the server this week!\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nSadly, there were no rank-ups this week; we'd be very thankful if you guys would consider applying for roles!\n\n** __Community Birthday List__ **\nLet's all wish a Happy birthday to these amazing people's:\nAugust - 3: @csjmgss\nAugust - 4: @APeterDev, \nAugust - 5: @Stocking Stuffer Inkio, @The Ghost Of KINGBER11\nAugust - 7: @MeAsh163\nAugust - 8: @Lemonlime\n\nHappy birthday to all of you!\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — 1 Billion Visits Edition!__ **\nLumber Tycoon 2 reached 1 Billion visits on March 26th 2023 with an approval rating of 87% and 4.2 million favorites.\nCurrently Lumber Tycoon 2 has 1.2 billion visits, 4.5 million favorites and an approval rating of 87.7%, Lumber tycoon 2 statistics kept growing proudly even without major changes\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lumber_Tycoon_2\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThank you all for reading this week's Lumber News, have a nice week and have fun playing Lumber Tycoon 2!\n\nThis article was written by @CyZozz, and @Gomi\nLumber Tycoon 2\nLumber Tycoon 2 is a Roblox game created by Defaultio. It is the sequel to the 2008 classic Lumber Tycoon. It had 10,000 online players on the first day of release for several hours. It is one of...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lumber_Tycoon_2"},{"number":"156","title":"Lumber News #156 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-08-18","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1406817714101555230","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #156 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nGood to have you back, @News Ping. We bring new community highlights for this week!\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\nLet us all wish a Happy birthday to our master lurker and lovely staff member, @iOmega! We hope you had a super happy birthday, iOmega!\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nWe are extremely thankful to both @WhalesMW and  for boosting the server this week!\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nHeavy congrats to @God of Masquerades for achieving Experienced Lumberjack this week!\n\n** __Community Birthday List__ **\nLet's all wish a happy birthday from this past week to the following members:\n\nAugust - 11: @IcyyBlockz\nAugust - 12: @dreamingtechhd, and @iOmega\nAugust - 13: @gianpisellofind, @Kit_4848Gaming, and @uebejrhy\nAugust - 15: @CatFish™, @then9311, and @wall_watcher99999\nAugust - 16: @mikvandon100\n\nAnd, here are our birthday people for the upcoming week:\nAugust - 17: @ghdskftrf, and @Kev \nAugust - 19: @Scorpion, and @seph1rox\nAugust - 20: @bassen007, and @Rx1ix\nAugust - 21: @OverratedRudolfs55 | lg pro ❂\nAugust - 22: @Obsessedfnplayer, and @TrainerTsunami\nAugust - 23: @DziadRoku2986\n\nHappy birthday to all of you guys!\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Big Gift Edition!__ **\n\nBack in the 2016 Christmas Event, players could buy something called the BIG GIFT at Wood R Us for just $1,006. When you opened it, it gave you a Numbered Cube, which came in different colors and had its own number. What made it special is that there were 25 different versions to start with, and each cube could be opened up to 79 more times before it disappeared.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/BIG_GIFT\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nWe appreciate you guys for reading this lumber news article, and for being in our community!\n\nThis article was written by @CyZozz, and @Gomi.\nBIG GIFT\nThe BIG GIFT is a gift that could be purchased from Wood R Us for $1,006 Money as a part of the 2016 Christmas Event. When opened, it reveals a Numbered Cube. The gift has a silver-white wrapping...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/BIG_GIFT"},{"number":"157","title":"Lumber News #157 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-08-25","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1409480293198331967","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #157 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nWelcome back to the Lumber News, @News Ping, here are our new highlights!\n\n**Before moving forward, I’d like to let you all know that you can now claim a special role: “10 Year Event”! This role was created to celebrate the 10th anniversary of LT2 and will only be available until August 29th. Don’t miss it, check https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1408265525745946704 for details on how to claim yours!**\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThere were no Lumber Games matches this week.\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nLet's all give a huge thanks to @Travis/Boss/Unseen Icon 👻 for saving the server boosting levels and boosting the server 5 times!! Because of him we can now continue to enjoy the Level 3 perks, so please make sure to show him some love and gratitude.\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nLet's congratulate these amazing members for achieving Experienced Lumberjack:\n\nCongratulations to @Doomvict, @𝚔𝚍𝚛〤𝚋𝚕𝚘𝕩𝟺, and @God of Masquerades\n\n** __Community Upcoming Birthday List__ **\nLet's all wish a happy birthday to these awesome community members:\n\nAugust - 26: @AKL_078, @nightjack450, @TheOnlyDuckPilot\nAugust - 27: @Furgo by my feggo | ST\nAugust - 28: @JazzyCarols, , @❄ Avalanche ❄\nAugust - 29: @DouglasxDAlv_02, @fierysol, @Redballrafas\nAugust - 30: @Beasertame, @CalmFoxx\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — LumberLand Edition!__ **\nLumberLand is full of mysteries and challenges, it has many biomes, minor-biomes, semi-biomes and anomalies.\n\nIt is said that Lumberland was shaped by volcanic rocks born from ancient lava, waterfalls that carved mountains, and ice that smoothed the Taiga peaks. Some say that Ocean Cove was once a mighty volcano, and the Tropics Bay a lost land swallowed by the sea. The Volcano may be slowly collapsing, and the Swamp was once towering cliffs, eroded by time. Some say Metalworks Sandbox is what remains of Lumberland after a great catastrophe.\n\nThere are a lot of tales about Lumberland, they say the waters of Lumber Tycoon 2 are no ordinary sea. It looks normal but there lies something far more dangerous, it is said that the ocean has traces of iridium, a metal so rare and unstable that it burns anything living that dares to touch it. No one knows who or what poisoned the waters. The ocean takes its toll on anyone who tries to cross it.\n\nThere're many anomalies about LumberLand. The anomalies are more than bugs, or so the tale goes. Some believe they’re clues, mysteries hidden in the Lumberlands areas that don’t quite match, borders that lead nowhere, things that seem too unnatural. \n\nThere are a lot of mysteries hidden in Lumberland, caves that lead to death or perhaps even worse. It is said that somewhere in LumberLand once upon a time people went missing in a strange cave, the tales says that cave is haunted, protecting it or maybe something deep into the cave.\n\n__Maybe I made it sound a little too dramatic so make sure you check the wiki site for more details__\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lumberland\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThank you all so much for reading! We’ll make sure to bring some more news for you next week.\n\nThis article was written by @CyZozz, and @Gomi\nLumberland\nLumberland is all the land that is in the game Lumber Tycoon 2, created by Defaultio. One side of the map borders the Ocean, while the other borders nothing. The exact name of the ocean is...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Lumberland"},{"number":"158","title":"Lumber News #158 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-09-01","author":"@CyZozz@fartsona","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1411973960005976145","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"__**Lumber News #158 — Weekly Recap!**__ \n\nGlad to have you all back guys! @News Ping hope you all enjoy this week's Lumber News.\n\n\n **Staff Birthday Spotlight **\n\nThis week we had the birthday of our amazing staff member @RANCH-OJ, I hope yall wished him a happy birthday!\nAnd soon we'll have the birthday of @IIAdapter, a great staff member and also the owner of one amazing partner server\n\n\n **Lumber Games Recap **\n\nThere were no Lumber games this week.\n\n\n Server Boosters Appreciation \n\nLet's show some gratitude to these amazing members @WhalesMW and @Ashle for boosting the server this week!\n\n\n **New Rank Ups! **\n\nLet's congratulate the following members on achieving their new amazing role:\n\n@76MacMiller84 achieved Merchant\n@CyZozz achieved Carpenter Specialist (lol that's me)\n\n\n **Upcoming Community Birthday List **\n\nLet's all wish these awesome members a happy birthday!\n\nAugust - 31: @stanleyrekt , @TheRealDavGaming345 \nSeptember - 1: @buddy43877\nSeptember - 2: @IIAdapter, @lynsrr \nSeptember - 3: @loXXi84 , @tigerpizza7100 , @Voidsend17\nSeptember - 5: @sneakysnakegh \nSeptember - 6: @HaterOfThings \n\nHappy birthday to all of you guys!"},{"number":"159","title":"Lumber News #159 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-09-08","author":"@CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1414482127566802976","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Lumber News #159 — Weekly Recap! __**\n\nWelcome back all of you guys! @News Ping glad to have you back to a new Lumber News article.\n\n\n**__ New Merch Release __**\n\nWe’re excited to announce the launch of our latest community merchandise, it is available in <#332295148778029067>. By purchasing, you’re not only getting a fresh new look, but also directly supporting the growth of our community. Don’t miss out and be among the first to represent and support our community!\n\n\n **__Lumber Games Recap __**\n\nThere were no Lumber games this week.\n\n\n **__Server Boosters Appreciation __**\n\nLet's all show some gratitude to @Neptune 🪐 for boosting the server this week!\n\n\n **__New Rank Ups! __**\n\nLet's all congratulate @BoxxxyBoo on achieving the Carpenter role and @rodrigoterror3 achieving the amazing role of Electrician Specialist!\n\nCongratulations guys!\n\n\n**__ Upcoming Community Birthday List __**\n\nWe shall all wish a happy birthday to the upcoming community members:\nSeptember - 8: @God1_m , @god1_m\nSeptember - 9: @sevonji \nSeptember - 10: @Enrico_rbx321 , @keeqo_ \nSeptember - 11: @SeIfrontier , @Woolfy (123willi12) \nSeptember - 12: @Aiden \nSeptember - 13: @playr0obl0xboii"},{"number":"86","title":"Wednesday Interview #86","category":"Interview","date":"2025-09-10","author":"@CyZozz","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1415429124423553035","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Wednesday Interview #86__**\n\n@News Ping This week we have the interview of the member @Bentley ඞ! I hope you guys enjoy the interview.\n\nQ1: Tell us about yourself\n\nA1: Hello Lumber Fan Group Community, I am Bentley formal Journalist, and Event Committee. I currently do QOTD, and I started Lt2 in 2017-2018. I saw the game and it looked appealing. With my Lumber Journey I played with friends, and I remembered the days staying up 24 hours a night just to grind. Now in 2025 I still play a little and am currently building the Cyber Series by Aptyn and Jab. But if you want to play or need help DM me!\n\nQ2: How did you come across LT2?\n\nA2: ERROR911 and CorrupedKey12 introduced me to the game, they were rich and one wanted to help me. Both of these boys are now in their 20s and we all wish we weren't this old because the good times. Although, we still talk and laugh no more Roblox.\n\nQ3: What's your favorite memory in LT2?\n\nA3: Favorite memory, mhm that's a hard one I would have to say that playing with ERROR911 and CorruptedKey12. But just the memory's we made laughing, chatting, and having fun. Unforntely I have lost contact with them. They have deleted their account or something. But 2 months ago we could talk but not no more.\n\nHanging with cesargeronimo is fun to!! I love to hear what he has to say, always joking and having fun in his private server in Lt2. But it's fun when we just all hop in a VC Inkio, dawn, and many more come! They all have assisted in my online life in some way or another.\n\nQ4: What's your biggest goal in LT2 and why?\n\nA4: My biggest goal is to just help players, I have always been negative in Fan Group and I want to change that. Trying to work my way back up slowly. But If you ever need help DM me or something and I would love to help you.\n\nQ5:  If LT2 would ever have a big update, what would you want to see added? \n\nA5: If Lt2 had a BIG update I would want something as in a Map revamp. Defaultio is not ready for a new biome etc. but something small then we can go big. Everyone wants the game to advance but the game is more fun easy and classic style!\n\nQ6: What made you continue playing LT2? \n\nA6: Fan Group, if it wasn't for this server I would have left the game for life. A little motivation to finsh my builds, make shops, and just chat in the community made me feel welcome and happy no matter what mood I was in. If I had a bad day I knew I could depend on FG because I trusted them most on my online world!\n\nQ7: Could you give an advice for the new LT2 players?\n\nA7: Hold on to your builds, before they get massed dupe and make sure you impact those who impacted you. Don't give up, stress, or quit sometimes things can be hard but never give up is the key to unlock your Lt2 success.\n\nInterviewer: @CyZozz"},{"number":"160","title":"Lumber News #160 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-09-16","author":"@CyZozz and @hayatk","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1417316556949422130","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #160 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nWelcome back to the Lumber News, @News Ping! We do so hope you enjoy this week's article!\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\nThere were no Lumber Games this week.\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nLet's all show some gratitude to @BuggedGoat, and @yeetboy990875 for boosting the server this week!\n\nThank you fellas a lot for supporting our community!\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nCongratulations to @syn for achieving the Experienced Lumberjack role!\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nLet's all wish a upcoming birthdays to the following amazing members: \n\nSeptember – 16:  @najiejrjifsj12\nSeptember – 17: @LookForMister, @PiggyMooshie0, @Trey and @[SCP EXPERT]\nSeptember – 18: @alodroix, @Zelcerious, @syn and @💵Jackson27- OJ!!💵\nSeptember - 20: @kicka12 and @talihelios\n\nHappy birthday to all of you guys!\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Bob Edition!__ **\nBob is known as the owner of the Bob's Shack. Bob usually sells miscellaneous items such as dynamite, cans of worms, pumpkins, and eyes. Bob wears the Clockworks Shades, a black Floral-Print Tee, and Pants for Haiti. He has the robloxian 1.0 package with Brown hair and the Grr! face.\n\nThere's a chance that if an item is positioned on the counter in a specific way Bob will say that he cannot find the item.\n\nCompared to most shops, Bob sells \"odd\" items. However, a lot of these items are integral to certain parts of the game, making him and his shop extremely important.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Bob\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThanks for reading this week's article; we Lumber Journalists hope you have a great week!\n\nWritten by: @CyZozz and @hayatk\nBob\nBob is an NPC who owns Bob's Shack, a store for miscellaneous items. He is based on the Roblox player Bob. Bob wears Clockwork's Shades, Black Floral-Print Tee, and Pants For Haiti. He also has...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Bob"},{"number":"161","title":"Lumber News #161 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-09-21","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1419460554321563671","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #161 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nWelcome to another article, @News Ping! We’re super glad to have you reading again!\n\n**__Server Events__**\nThe Event Committee has developed another competition! We now have a Halloween competition running, restricted to a 1x1 plot space. There are some awesome prizes available, so check it out at https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1190462440341782528/1418309395854655699.\n\n** __Server Booster Appreciation__ **\nShow some gratitude to @n3dearb for boosting the server this week!\n\n** __Rank Ups__ **\nThere were no rank ups this week. However, we have our dedicated Base Reviewer team willing to check out some bases and give out some roles. If you are interested in leveling up your profile, check out our roles in <#1380964694424158288> and make a base review ticket in <#1350790386926485514>.\n\n** __Upcoming Birthdays__**\nSuper happy birthday to the following community members:\nSeptember 22th: \nSeptember 25th: @AlphaY7, and @PoppaFamz\nSeptember 26th: @coolcoop421, and @l00Hz\nSeptember 27th: @2_CandyCanes (2_Buckets)\nSeptember 28th: @UwUlSarahlUwU\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Delicious Pink Present of Bubbly Fun Edition!__ **\nThe Delicious Pink Present of Bubbly Fun was added as part of the 2024 Christmas Event and was purchasable at Fancy Furnishings.\nIt's the second gift to use “Present” in the name instead of “Gift”, after the Delightful Lime Present of Excellent Endearance.\n\nThe gift has a pink ribbon wrapped around it, a bow on top, and white wrapping with bright pink polka dots. When unwrapped, it reveals a pink box with a grey ball on the front, although the unboxed ball is not grey and the bug is most likely related to incorrect texture rendering.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Delicious_Pink_Present_of_Bubbly_Fun\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThanks a ton for reading! We make every article with love and hope that you all get something good out of the news. See you next week.\n\nWritten by @CyZozz and @Gomi\nDelicious Pink Present of Bubbly Fun\nThe Delicious Pink Present of Bubbly Fun is a gift that could be purchased from Fancy Furnishings for $4,328 Money as part of the 2024 Christmas Event. It is the second gift, after the Delightful...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Delicious_Pink_Present_of_Bubbly_Fun"},{"number":"162","title":"Lumber News #162 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-09-30","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1422399572327534592","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #162 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nWelcome to a new Lumber article, @News Ping! We hope all of you enjoy what we have for you this week!\n\n**__Applications__**\nThis week, we have DDOL applications out again. DDOL is a department where you can let your creativity shine or help to show off community creations, and if that sounds good to you, apply here: https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1421595618295676970\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nLet's congratulate the following members on achieving their new, awesome roles!\n\n@someone1_235 on achieving Experienced Lumberjack, and @Gomi on achieving Carpenter.\n\nGreat job to both of you guys!\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nLet's all be grateful to @n3dearb for boosting the server this week. Boosting helps the community a lot, so we are greatly thankful to all of our remarkable boosters!\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nComing up, we are wishing a happy birthday to these members:\nSeptember 29th: @Lark The Snowman\nOctober 1st: @JaLubiePlacki1231\nOctober 2nd: @dunnoson\nOctober 3rd: @gxldybubble\nOctober 5th: @uros4943 \n\nHappy birthday to you lot!\n\n** __Wiki Topic of the Week — Avoiding Scams!__ **\nScamming is a major issue in Lumber Tycoon 2. There's no safe way to trade in LT2, since the game was not designed to deal with trading.\n\nScamming is common as we lack a proper system for players to make trades, which creates a vulnerability for dishonest trading.\n\n** Precautions **\nTo reduce the risk of being scammed when trading, try to keep these tips in mind:\n\n__Avoid known scammers.__ \nEven if they claim to have changed or offer good deals, do not trade with them unless they let you take every precaution for your safety. Never take your eye off of them, and don't let them catch you off guard.\n\n__Watch for suspicious behavior.__ \nIf someone constantly changes the trade or gives confusing offers, refuse the trade. Trying to give better-than-real deals might indicate bad nature, and changing up the price might be them trying to upsell you.\n\n__Secure items first.__ \nAsk the other player to place their items on your base before sending money, to prevent scams. Scammers won't typically just be out to get you, so they won't scam you if their items are at risk.\n\n__Use whitelist and blacklist.__\nIf unsure about a player, have them bring the items, then give them the needed perms whilst removing their ability to be on your base. Scammers that can't go onto your base can't steal from you, or take their items back before leaving.\n\nNote: if you are scammed, there is no official way to return your items.\n\n> ** Guys, Lumber Tycoon 2 is really just a bunch of economics and behavior experiments, sorry. **\n***— Defaultio***\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Avoiding_Scams\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThank you all for reading this week's article, we'll be back next week with new highlights!\n\nWritten by @CyZozz, and@Gomi\nAvoiding Scams\nScamming has been a prevalent issue in Lumber Tycoon 2 since its creation. This is due to the loose (and for the most part, unintentional) ability to trade in the game. Scamming is possible as...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Avoiding_Scams"},{"number":"163, 164","title":"Lumber News #163 & #164 — Weeks Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-10-12","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1427081567209263166","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #163 & #164 — Weeks Recap!__ **\nWelcome to a new Lumber News article, @News Ping! We were super sorry for missing the post last week, so we combined the most recent two articles.\n\n** __Staff Promotion__ **\nThis week marks an amazing moment for our community, we have important updates to share.\n\nFirst thing, we're proud to congratulate @Spooky_fire, @Bewitching Biscuits 🪄, and @SpookyScarySimply👻-OJ!!! on their promotions to Supervisors. Secondly, with them being promoted to Supervisors, there will soon be applications to fill the empty Supervisor Intern positions.\n\n** __Upcoming Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\nRight now, we can celebrate the birthdays of the following amazing staff members:\n@2077 BlitzenBlake ඞ 🌈🎅🎃- OJ ! just had his birthday on October 10th, and we get to celebrate @Lonmower ❂'s birthday on October 16th!\n\nWe're wishing both of you a super happy birthday!\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nWe're happy to announce all the boosters in these last weeks:\n\n@RANCH-OJ, @Valxxell, and @mooneverest all contributed one boost each, with two boosts each from @Forever_T0gether, @ChrisTheBarkerX3, and @AshTheGreat55.\n\nAll these boosts help the community a ton! We are very grateful for all the support!\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nCongratulations to , @djtibe, and @MatiasNacib for achieving the Carpenter role! We also saw @ChrisTheBarkerX3 and @Harryj38 🎄☃❄ achieve Experienced Lumberjack. Finally, @vl4si promoted from Carpenter to Carpenter Specialist with an amazing building.\n\nCongratulations to everyone that got a new role! If you want to try getting a role yourself, open a ticket in <#1350790386926485514>!\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nThe following people have just had or are having their birthdays soon, wish them a good one:\n\nOctober–7: @Adam_5291⚡- OJ!!!!!, and @certifiedlosergirI\nOctober–8: @Ibeling1\nOctober–9: @UnoTesoro09\nOctober–10: @2077 BlitzenBlake ඞ 🌈🎅🎃- OJ !, @Horror_Bro1083, and @Mario3_000\nOctober–11: @riotheinvader, and @spetnazxrusia\nOctober–14: @PimenPom2020\nOctober–15: @Good4YouBruhXMasTime\nOctober–16: @Lonmower ❂\nOctober–17: @marcusvinicius17, and @SkiH1gh\n\nHappy birthday!\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Mountain Character Edition!__ **\nMountain Character (aka Mountain Man) was an NPC on the cliffside between the Taiga and the Volcano. He was removed in an update, likely because Defaultio no longer needed him as a scale while creating terrain.\n\nMountain Character was anchored to the ground in later versions including him, but he could originally be moved. When he could move, he was prone to walking into the ocean or void.\n\nMountain Man Wore the same outfit as Ruhven, the owner of Land Store. Rumors say he might actually be Ruhven because of his knowledge about “Gus”, which is solidified by the Land Store having a Poster about Gusmanak.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Mountain_Character \n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Jack-O'Melon Release!__ **\nThis year, for Halloween, we got the **Jack-O'-Melon**! Sold at **Bob's Shack** at the price of $728 since October 7th, this item was made by **ElectroTechnologies**, and **Mahbucketeer**.\n\nTheJack-O'-Melon is very similar in design and idea to the Lumbkin, a previous Halloween item. However, this item does not glow, and is modelled after a watermelon.\n\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Jack-O%27-Melon \n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThanks for reading! We'll be back next week with community highlights and updates.\n\nThis article was written by @CyZozz, and @Gomi.\nMountain Character\nThe Mountain Character, also known as Mountain Man, was an anonymous NPC that could be found on the cliffside in between the Taiga and the Volcano. He was later removed in a previous update...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Mountain_Character\nJack-O'-Melon\nThe Jack-O'-Melon is an item sold for $728 Money in Bob's Shack. It has been on sale since October 7th, and it's a part of the 2025 Halloween Event. This item was created by wiki users...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Jack-O%27-Melon"},{"number":"165","title":"Lumber News #165 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-10-20","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1429642171920809984","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #165 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nHey there, @News Ping! Welcome back to another Lumber News article, we sure do hope that you enjoy!\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ ***\nAs of this past week, we had the super special birthday of @Lonmower ❂! Happy birthday to our beloved Supervisor Intern!\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nThis week, we got boosted by @ayla 🩷🦄🧁🍭🥞! Boosting helps the server a ton. Thanks so much!\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nSuper big congratulations to @JJPERWS for ranking up to Experienced Lumberjack, and both @xShadowLN and @karolwojtczak for achieving Experienced Lumberjack and Carpenter!\n\nIf you'd like to get a new role or obtain an awesome new role as well, you can apply for a base review in <#1350790386926485514>.\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nOur upcoming members with birthdays are the following:\nOctober 20th: @Bradjames54321, @Jonathan\nOctober 26th: @copman54253776\n\nWish those members a super happy birthday!\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Plain Bag of Candy Edition!__ **\nThe Plain Bag of Candy released in the Halloween event of 2025, costing 3,674 LumberBucks at Wood R Us. It has a brown box, following the design of previous Candy Bags, as well as pictures of the candy bag itself on either side, which is white in color! What is interesting about the bag, however, is that it includes a unique sound when being opened, which is an overlay of faint laughter.\n\nThe bag, made by ElectroTech and Aptyn, includes 9 unique candy bars, including a rare white candy bar. The rare candy of this bag, like previous rare candy bars, provides players with an effect on their head of the same color as the candy itself. The description of the bag is \"Pretty sure... its CANDY!!! YAAAAAAY!!!!\".\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Plain_Bag_of_Candy\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThanks so much for reading! We hope that all of our readers have a good upcoming week!\n\nWritten by @Gomi, and @CyZozz\nPlain Bag of Candy\nThe Plain Bag Of Candy is an item that can be purchased from Wood R Us for $3674 Money. It was added on October 8th as a part of the 2025 Halloween Event. When opened, different types of Candy...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Plain_Bag_of_Candy"},{"number":"166","title":"Lumber News #166 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-10-27","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1432494916369649757","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #166 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nWelcome back, @News Ping! We hope you all enjoy this article.\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nCongratulations to @Voidsend17 for achieving Carpenter this week!\n\nIf you would like to obtain a new role, you can make a base review ticket in <#1350790386926485514> and apply!\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nLets wish happy birthdays to the following members:\n\nOctober 29th: @ParGreench\nOctober 30st: @BaconIsADogger, @minkiemoo\nOctober 31st: @Gradyer1, @ayoleslie, @pintujelek90, @timksyt\nNovember 1st: @AlternateAquaS2\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Blueprint Manager Edition!__ **\nThe Blueprint Manager stores all the blueprints purchased by the player. The player receives the Blueprint Manager after buying their first Blueprint, and cannot be dropped.\n\nBlueprint Manager resembles a rolled-up blue sheet of paper, similar to what may be seen in real life. When opened, players can view all of the blueprints they have purchased and opened. \n\nIf the player owns the Easy Building power, their Blueprint Manager menu and paper sheet will turn gold, allowing players to fill any blueprints with only 1 wood unit per. The Easy Building power can be obtained from the **Strange Man** in the lost cave at the price of **10,009,000**.\n\nWhen placing blueprints, players can have a maximum of **51 unfilled blueprints** at once, placing more will cause the oldest ones to disappear and be replaced by the newest placed.\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Blueprint_Manager\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThank you all so much for reading! Come back next week for more!\n\nWritten by @CyZozz, and @Gomi\nBlueprint Manager\nThe Blueprint Manager is an item that can be found in a player's inventory which contains all of the blueprints purchased by the player. The player receives this item after they have bought their...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Blueprint_Manager"},{"number":"167","title":"Lumber News #167 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2025-11-04","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1435061634606436524","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #167 — Weekly Recap!__ **\nHey there, @News Ping! Good to see you back for the news this week. We hope that you enjoy!\n(Sorry for being a day late)\n\n** __Bob the Builder role__ **\nThere's a new amazing role that was added just recently, on the 27th of October.\n\nThe server has introduced the Bob the Builder role!\nThe role is awarded to people that show at least a moderate skill in a real-life craft or trade.\n\nThis role was inspired by , and was suggested by AzChick. The staff team noticed Bobby the Dinosaur's creation, a pinball machine, and decided to add the Bob the Builder role. He was also given the Bob the Builder nickname, along with the role before it was announced and available for the community.\n\nSince the role was added, the following community members have received it:\n@The Actual DJ, @furgo my feggo | Koioxi | ST, @HTTT4132, @Aethelvok_eterna (i_loveu899), @bullterrier2, and @Kin_Animates2\n\nLet’s all congratulate them for showcasing their creativity and craftsmanship not only in Lumber Tycoon 2, but in real life as well!\nMore information about this role can be found at https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1380964694424158288/1381001844314079253.\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\nTomorrow, we are celebrating the birthday of our long-time and amazing group leader, @Jolly Saint Nickname. Cesar is a pillar of light in the community and an amazingly helpful person that cares deeply for the people in the Fan Group, which makes it very clear that he deserves to be where he is. We, this week, thank him for another year of great leadership and friendship, and celebrate the great man that he is!\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nWe are grateful for the contributions of @Neptune ❄, and @Henry, who have boosted the community. Thanks so much!\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nNew roles show great accomplishments, and the following members have achieved them:\n\nFirst is @relyT_22 who achieved Experienced Lumberjack, Carpenter, and Electrician Specialist. We also have @karolwojtczak who achieved Carpenter, and Experienced Lumberjack. Last, but not least, there are @Voidsend17 and @The Actual DJ, who both achieved the Carpenter role.\n\nCongratulations to all of you on showing your skill, and getting recognized for it!\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nLet's all wish a happy birthday to the following members:\n\nNovember 3rd: @MaskBonnieTheMaster\nNovember 4th: @Jolly Saint Nickname\nNovember 6th: @darkphoenix2732, @Hayden\nNovember 7th: @vanpratt\nNovember 8th: @GantengZoneTeam2, @ImperialVenue, @KarimNahas, @LunarrEcho, @notmyname_FOOL, @superdaniel8544, @TheNJKid\nNovember 9th: @Hunter | Nuhter100, @Jaden 🎄, @Kenuosyy\n\n** __Wiki Fact of the Week — Cherry Pie Edition!__ **\nThe Cherry Pie was an item added to Lumber Tycoon 2 in the 2024 Thanksgiving event, being sold at Fancy Furnishings for $3,141. The item has a light brown outer color, with a red inner color, representing a cherry-filled pie, although players can burn the pie in a volcano to make the crust and inside much darker.\n\nThe pie has a similar design to previous pies, although it has a diamond lattice pattern with visible filling, unlike the Apple or Pumpkin Pies. The item was created by RandomFlowz,\n\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Cherry_Pie\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nThank you all greatly for reading! The Journalist team hopes that you have had and will have a great week. \n\nWritten by @CyZozz, and @Gomi\nCherry Pie\nThe Cherry Pie is an event item that could be purchased at Fancy Furnishings for $3141 Money, as a part of the 2024 Thanksgiving Event. It was located at the kitchen showcase area at the corner of...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Cherry_Pie"},{"number":"169","title":"Lumber News #169 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2026-06-01","author":"@Nameless✨💢, @CyZozz, and @Voidsend17","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1510937934629437501","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #169 — Weekly Recap!__ **\n@News Ping We're happy to announce this week's articles. We had many delays regarding news and we are completely sorry for that, but we're happy to be working on articles again with our team members! We hope all of you enjoy it, and we hope to continue from now on working on articles as a team week by week.\n\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\n\nThere were no staff birthdays this week!\n\n\n** __Lumber Games Recap__ **\n\nWe had no Lumber games this week, and as many of you might know or don't, we won't be having Lumber games until the community can obtain it back from roblox.\n\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\n\nWe're happy to announce the boosters of this week, their support keeps the community thriving.\n\n@Yiridium\n @WeisserAdler4\n @Foxy ඞ \n@rennykwh\nWe are grateful to all of you! \n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nMay 12th \n@Ethxn ⌁\nRoles: Elite carpenter \nMay 15th\n@ImMrJakob\nRoles: The craftsmanship role.\nMay 17th\n@WeisserAdler4\nRoles: Experienced lumberjack, lumberjack merchant, Electrician & carpenter\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nhappiest birthdays, wishing you infinite happiness our dear members:\n \n‎may 31:\n‎@dutchpro, and @thecoolgaming678\nJune 02 : \n@unoski1667,and @xranoxxd\nJune 03 :\n@CharacterDevelopment\nJune 04 :\n@BanGoodLuc BEST MAN, @fafcru12, and @sanic_power604\nJune 05 :\n@AlonePlayer78, and @natez200\nJune 06 :\n@JCBunss, and @sixisalso9\nJune 07 :\n@ms.cher4911\n\n** __Wiki Fact Of The Week — Spicy Turkey Edition__ **\n\nThe Spicy Turkey was a limited-time item added in 2021 on November 24th for a Thanksgiving event.\nThough it was intended to be added in 2020 as Thanksgiving.\nIt could be found on different places in Wood R Us such as on a pole, shelf, and floor.\nThe Spicy Turkey can be cooked in Volcano, for it to get cooked at its fullest, it requires 20 minutes, and for minimum it only takes 5 minutes with 14 stages from raw to burnt. It shares the same model as the other turkeys, it is a crimson red colored meat, sharing the same box model as its previous counterparts with a few differences in the image orientation and size.\n\nThe ** Spicy Turkey ** was made by the wiki user ** __SMALLSOPE42__ **\nSource: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Spicy_Turkey\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nWe're thankful and grateful for your attention, we all hope you enjoyed this article and we hope to see you well next week as well!\n\nWritten by:\n@Nameless✨💢, @CyZozz, and @Voidsend17"},{"number":"171","title":"Lumber News #171 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2026-06-15","author":"@CyZozz, and @Nameless✨💢","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1516151763940544524","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #171 — Weekly Recap!__ **\n@News Ping\nHello dear members, we are happy to share this week’s news with all of you.\n\n** __New Boosters__ **\nWe really appreciate the support of all of our lovely boosters, now including @Prestonboy1312 and @vusqar!\n\n** __Rank Ups!__ **\nRecently, we have had three members rank up! Firstly, on June 10th, @Frostsmainacc earned Experienced Lumberjack. As well, on June 11th, @kolophardos0 got Electrician, Carpenter, and Lumberjack Merchant\n\n You can also obtain new roles by making a base review ticket in https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1350790386926485514 \n\n** __Upcoming Birthdays__ **\nA super happy birthday to each of the following members!\nJune 15th:\n@Youtuber_Lorenz23\nJune 16th: \n@cedrikwood3 and @stefanec101\nJune 17th: \n@Screw_Around\nJune 18th: \n@babyNathaniel101\nJune 19th: \n@123Will890,  @devout22, and @devshurikeno"},{"number":"87","title":"Wednesday Interview #87","category":"Interview","date":"2026-06-25","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1519497613987020851","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Wednesday Interview #87__**\n\n@News Ping  Hello lumberjacks, this week we're interviewing our dear lovely member @Nelex  We hope you enjoy the interview!!\n‎\n‎Q1: Tell us about your self, and how do you spend your time!\n‎\n‎A1: I like to play some games, play football and go meet friends, my only free time is on Thursdays in school years or the full summer in summer i play games then travel then meet my friends every week or 2.\n‎\n‎Q2:  Was there any difficulties or problems in your life that made you change but forward not backward?\n‎\n‎A2: Yes, i had issues with other classmates in my old school because they did things i don't like doing and would bully or hate on me for not being like them but thankfully i changed schools and became happier and my grades got much better than last year\n‎\n‎Q3: Is there anything in your life you don't like and you wish it gets better\n‎\n‎A3: It would be that everything's expensive in my country i think if it wasnt this hard everything would be easier\n‎\n‎Q4: Do you think people are defined more by their struggles or success?(from your opinion!)\n‎\n‎A4: Most people are defined by success like if a famous athlete got alot of money from how good he is and dedicates everything to his father you can kind of guess that his father spent everything to get him to this level that's how you may be able to define someone from their success\n‎\n‎Q6: Who told you about LT2 so you started playing it!?\n‎\n‎A6: I remember finding the game on my own in my old account then I found a friend he was British and his name was Jake and we used to play together everyday for 2 years until I lost my account\n‎\n‎Q7: What made you love the game? (What attracted you)?\n‎\n‎A7: The logics and electronic appliances and specifically the community was very nice to me, also the free building and roaming to the game just expanded my creativity and made me build what ever i think of even if it's useless and nobody used to judge me\n‎\n‎Q8: Is there any advice or tip you'd give to all the new LT2 players?\n‎\n‎A8: Don't beg unless you got a good reason just grind frost wood it's not hard and try to understand logics, logic builds earn alot of money in the marketplace channel\n‎\n‎Q9: If LT2 gave you a chance to add one thing to the game, what would you like to add?\n\nA9: A statue to defaultio with 2 many axes in both his hands chopping a sinister tree\n‎\n‎Interviewer: @Nameless✨💢"},{"number":"172, 173, 174, 175, 176","title":"Lumber News #172, #173, #174, #175, #176 — Weekly Recaps!","category":"Article","date":"2026-07-14","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1526408464652435517","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #172, #173, #174, #175, #176 — Weekly Recaps!__ **\n@News Ping\nHello, it's good to have you all back! We hope you had a wonderful week! Let’s get right into the news.\n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\nOn June 19th we had the birthday of @devshurikeno, a retired/hiatus member of the community, but also a member of the community that achieved awesome ranks.\n-# “Shuri has been a tremendous friend and will always be a part of what this server is.”\n – @cesargeronimo\n\nOn June 25th we had the birthday of @Hunter, one of our senior supervisor's birthdays. We hope he had a very Happy Birthday! \n\nJuly 4th was @\"Henry\"’s birthday, and we hope it was a great one!\n\n On the 10th July @endervene had their birthday, and we sure hope it was swell.\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nThanks so much to the following boosters, who help make our server a better place with their contributions!\nHuge thanks to @goodgodmannowey6, @plsctrlurmind, @byte.giga, @plsctrlurmind, @yelv, @tomm1987, and @LumberMonies67.\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nIn the past month or so, we have had 11 rankups.\n\nCongrats to @AquraPlayz, @therudehorses2, @Spooky, @IGA★, and @nory the hedgehog for obtaining Experienced Lumberjack; @tanqrrqq, @Robloxmaker1100000, and @mslowinski for achieving Lumberjack Merchant;   @tanqrrqq for getting Electrician Specialist; @darkpoolplaya for being awarded Carpenter Specialist; and @IGA★ for showing great skills and getting Carpenter!\n\n\nYou can also obtain new roles by showing your skills in a base review in <#1350790386926485514>!\n\n** __Community Birthday List__ **\nWe hope that all of you had or will have some great birthdays!\nJune 22th: @Juan_manuel93, and @Official_MarleyPlayz\nJune 23th: @LumberFan13, and @Mikamali\nJune 24th:\n@maokku28,and @reidsmomiscool\nJune 25th: @Ganker25, @Hunter, @kain, and @MaverickLovesSchnitzel\nJune 26th: @bohenlol, and @GURKE_FLEX\nJune 27th: @FwoofieFurry\nJune 28th: @Jayy\nJune 29th: @JaeDev_03, @theonlybayani, and @Marley🍓 | CST\nJuly 2nd: @anonymous_girl1\nJuly 3rd: @ZeziC5\nJuly 4th: @Henry and @unknown\nJuly 5th: @_bbb1_ and @lukas_gamer1122\nJuly 6th: @StormLovesBeans \nJuly 8th: @Janjiaxian2011\nJuly 9th @Charlie67611, @Happygamer1983 and @Shikishima \nJuly 11th: @girard0711\nJuly 13th: @M23, @Official_roblox1926, @papuszka5537, @qs_cle, and @TheBlusteryBearGames\nJuly 14th: @freak5275, @Honey, and @starbass12\nJuly 15th: @creeplord476, @dog_atack, and @KevinAlvesYT\nJuly 16th: @FaceOfDeath0, @Time9578, and @zhanperson\nJuly 17th: @LoadFunction, @M4_SOPM0DII, and @Mario⭐ #2 chat stalker\nJuly 18th: @iconixau"},{"number":"176, 177, 178, 179, 180, 181","title":"Lumber News #176/#177/#178/179/180/181 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2026-08-24","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1541513090196308090","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Lumber News #176/#177/#178/179/180/181 — Weekly Recap!__**\n@News Ping We're happy to have all of you back here, we have another combined article. So let's get into it!\n\n**__July 17, 2026 Roblox Announcement__**\nRoblox is announcing their new **Build**AI-feature that lets users create games by describing them in plain language. The feature allows members to create games from their mobile device, not just Roblox Studio.\n\nFor further information check <#332295148778029067>, or Roblox's post on X.\n\n**__Media Forums Opening__**\n<#1520868401537613854> is a new channel to post all sorts of media in, and is now open. You can share your creations with others, find new building ideas, or just admire other members' work.\n\nGive it a look and maybe share your own awesome creations!\n\n**__Journalist Application Results__**\nThe results were released on July 26, and the following got accepted to the Journalist department: @Arioso, @NotThatGood0fADev, @DucksIscool10, @YBRGhostDev, and @Mario⭐ #2 chat stalker. \n\nGive a big congratulations to all of our new journalists!\n\n**__Base Review Applications__**\nThe Base Review department released applications recently, and the following users won a spot on the team: @Duck Lord :3, @Axpxr_xy, @ImMrJakob, @Dynesh, @kdroblox4, @Leuannpot, @Officer_wolf515, and @qwer050505. Huge congrats to all of the new members, and thank you to everyone who applied!\n\n**__QOTD Applications__**\nQOTD released applications recently, and the following users won a spot on the team: @Silly Dixin 🎃, @sanic_power604, and @ImMrJakob. Huge congrats to all of the new members, and thank you to everyone who applied!\n\n**__Summer Story Competition__**\nRecently, we hosted a Summer Story Competition. Thanks a lot to everyone who submitted, and, without further ado, here are the writers who won: @Lost one, @StormLovesBeans, and @Cli_ck, in first, second, and third, respectively. Big congrats to the winners!\n\n**__Partnership announcement__**\nRecently, the partnership between the LT2 Fan Group Server and the Coffee Lovers Community was announced! We partnered with the Coffee Lovers Community on August 3rd, and you can now find more info about the Coffee Lovers Community by going to <#1464344752521613312>. Check them out if you are looking for a new community to hang out in!\n\n**__Server Boosters Appreciation__**\nWe're very thankful to the following members for boosting the server and supporting the community:\n @AdorableKunie, @commandobot3, @Duck Lord :3, @Jackson27- OJ!!💵, @Spooky, @ActualVin, @exayixconner2, and @chrisimperative. \nYour support means a lot to the community!\n\n**__New Rank Ups__**\nWe want to congratulate the following members on their great new roles!\n\n@Wickedlarva for obtaining the Lumberjack Merchant role.\n@Spooky for obtaining the Carpenter role.\n@adamnoah_7 for obtaining the Lumberjack Merchant and the Experienced Lumberjack roles.\n@XJru for obtaining the Electrician role.\n@Duck Lord :3 for obtaining the Experienced Lumberjack and the Bob the Builder roles.\n@marktheturd3 for obtaining the Experienced Lumberjack and the Carpenter roles.\n@Spooky for obtaining the Carpenter Specialist role.\n@Reli for obtaining the Bob the Builder role.\n@Insane Lecario™ for obtaining the Lumberjack Artist and the Elite Carpenter roles.\n\nAgain, congratulations to all of the members who got new roles, and thank you to the Base Review department for their hard work.\n\nWe're hoping to see our members continuing to show their skill and prowess by obtaining many more new roles in the future!"},{"number":"182","title":"Weekly Recap-#182","category":"Article","date":"2026-08-31","author":"","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1544082692327481374","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"**__Weekly Recap-#182__**\n\n@News Ping Hello lumberjacks! We hope you enjoy this weeks weekly recap!\n\nAs of the 28th of August, @cesargeronimo has retired from Group Leader, and is handing the group to Sirred90, a Co-Owner of the server. Cesar did a lot for the server and will always be remembered for his amazing accomplishments. Even though he is stepping down from Group Leader, Cesar will still have a special role to do events with the community. In a few days he will do a community gathering but the date isn't planned yet. Say your goodbyes to CesarGeronimo and welcome our new owner Sirred!\n\n**__Staff Birthday Spotlight__**\nIt was one of our supervisor's birthday, so please say Happy birthday to @Clipz ඞ - OJ!!!!\n\n__**Server booster appreciation**__\nWe truly all appreciate all boosts to the server as it helps the community grow. Boosts give more perks in the Discord so if you want to boost with some cool perks, it would be really good! \n\n@moosegoose9\n\n__**Community Birthdays**__\nWish an amazing birthday to these following members!\n\nSeptember 1st: @buddy43877\n\nSeptember 2nd: @BrayxGamer17 , @iiadapter\n\nSeptember 3rd: @bananawith5cats , @Voidsend17\n\nSeptember 5th: @bacon_hero191 , @sneakysnakegh\n\n**__ Rank ups__**\nThere were no rank ups this week.\nYou can get roles by creating a base review ticket\n\n**__ Wiki fact of the week - Antithetical Gift of Opposites__**\nThe **Antithetical Gift of Opposites** or **The Gift of Opposites**, was for sale at Wood R Us for 23,583$ during the 2025 christmas event.\nThe gift contains the **Inverse Axe**. The **Inverse Axe** does -1 damage which causes it to undo cuts.\n\nSource:  https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Antithetical_Gift_of_Opposites\n\n**__ Final words:__** On behalf of the Journalist team, thank you for reading this week's article! Also expect a voice interview coming soon.\n\n**__ Written by:__** @hayatk and @Mario⭐ #2 chat stalker\nAntithetical Gift of Opposites\nThe Antithetical Gift of Opposites, or Gift of Opposites, is a gift that was purchasable from Wood R Us for $23,583 Money during the 2025 Christmas Event, added on December 14th. When opened, it...\nhttps://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Antithetical_Gift_of_Opposites"},{"number":"190","title":"Lumber News #190 — Weekly Recap!","category":"Article","date":"2026-11-08","author":"@Dr.Bloodsaw🥼👻, @Mario🍓 but spooky, and @Cookies","url":"https://discord.com/channels/720963468760711188/759078973246013460/1569079530583367692","googleDocsUrl":"","body":"** __Lumber News #190 — Weekly Recap!__ **\n\n@News Ping\n\nHello, hope y'all are doing well! How's the holiday preparation going with you? Are you preparing for the pumpkin pie? Anyways, let's get started with our article!\n\n**__Updates__**\nOn November 3rd a new feature was discovered, allowing frozen items to grow if they are taken and left at the Taiga Peak for a while. A few days later, on November 5th, a data corruption in the game was found. This corruption has led to wiped bases, so if your base was affected, make sure to fill in the revert form in https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/332295148778029067/1567929160410603594. The message also explains some manners in which you can check whether your save was affected. \n\n**__Events__**\nThe Spooky story writing contents ended and on November 5th the winners were revealed. Congratulations to @Gobbling Joyc 🦃, @BOBLOXISROBLOXWHAT, and @yellobello9005 for winning the 1st, 2nd and 3rd place of the competition, respectively!\nThe 2026 Halloween building competition is still in full swing with its deadline approaching next week. Be sure to submit any spooky builds you have if you’re looking to participate in https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1558622408418795621. \n\n** __Staff Birthday Spotlight__ **\nThere were no staff birthdays this week. However, on November 4th we wished @cesargeronimo a very happy birthday and more to come!\n\n** __Upcoming Community Birthday List__ **\nHappy birthday, we wish you the best in your next chapter of life!\nNov 9th : , @Jaden 🎄 & @Kenuosyy\nNov 10th: @weepercreep8 & @ylj1235467\nNov 11th: @sUpErbOy_pRO1566\nNov 12th: @DANBATMAN123321\nNov 13th: @egehankralby & @Official_roblox1926\nNov 14th: @Reli\nNov 15th: @br0ken_micr0wave, @TheWeirdoPlayer & @thedogeman2342\n\n** __Server Boosters Appreciation__ **\nA huge thanks for every booster. We really appreciate your support! Thank you @hakansledsagare, @FallenCrew, and @Brownwood_alt.\n\n** __Applications __**\nOn November 7th the newest addition to the Lumber News team was hired following the close of Journalist applications on November 3rd. Congrats @wizzzy!\n\n** __New Rank Ups!__ **\nCongratulations to the following members on their new rankups!\n@kylvx12, @yellobello9005, @wizzzy, and @BryanAtnoic all earned the Experienced Lumberjack role. @Probabil1tyy obtained the Carpenter and Lumberjack Merchant rank. Finally, @FallenCrew ranked up to both Lumberjack Merchant and Experienced Lumberjack. \nIf you wish to obtain new roles don't waste any more time and make a base review ticket at https://discord.com/channels/324303995147386882/1350790386926485514.\n\n**__Wiki fact of the week - Maple wood Edition__**\n**Maple wood** was added on the 1st of November 2026. It spawns in the Mainland, Cherry Meadow, Mountainside and Safari.\nIts hardness is 9.5.\nThe growth time is 6 minutes.\n** Money per unit:** __Log__ 8.25$. __Plank__ 16$.\n*Source: https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Maple_Wood*\n\n** __Final Words__ **\nWe really hope you liked this week's article! See y'all next week with more news, stay safe and take care!\n\nWritten by:\n@Dr.Bloodsaw🥼👻, @Mario🍓 but spooky, and @Cookies"}];
